#: ../../source/api/adapters.rst:104
msgid "``map_format`` on :class:`~habit.adapters.DirectoryResultWriter` (and on :meth:`~habit.recipes.StudyResult.save`) selects the label-map container: ``nrrd`` (default), ``nii``, ``nii.gz``, ``mha``, or ``mhd``. The directory is created on the first write, so constructing a writer you end up not using leaves nothing behind. Implement the same four methods elsewhere to send results to an object store or an in-memory sink instead."
msgstr ""
"``map_format`` 用于 :class:`~habit.adapters.DirectoryResultWriter` （以及 :meth:`~habit.recipes.StudyResult.save` ）以选择标签图容器： ``nrrd`` （默认）、 ``nii`` 、 ``nii.gz`` 、 ``mha`` 或 ``mhd`` 。目录在首次写入时创建，因此构造了最终未使用的 writer 也不会留下任何内容。在其他位置实现相同的四个方法，可将结果发送到对象存储或内存接收端。"
#: ../../source/api/combiners.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`habit.combiners`: compose feature trees"
msgstr ":mod:`habit.combiners` ：组合特征树"
#: ../../../habit/combiners/__init__.py:docstring of habit.combiners:1
msgid "Built-in feature block combiners and their registry."
msgstr "内置特征块组合器及其注册表。"
#: ../../../habit/combiners/__init__.py:docstring of habit.combiners:3
msgid "Combiners are the internal nodes of a feature composition tree: they merge the column blocks their sibling nodes produced and never touch images, subjects, or the filesystem. The same combiner implementations serve every granularity (voxel, supervoxel, habitat), because the tree wrappers hand them plain ``DataFrame`` blocks with positionally aligned rows."
msgstr ""
"组合器是特征组合树的内部节点：它们合并兄弟节点产生的列块，且从不接触图像、受试者或文件系统。相同的组合器实现服务于各粒度（体素、超体素、生境），因为树包装器交给它们行位置对齐的普通 ``DataFrame`` 块。"
#: ../../source/api/combiners.rst:11
msgid "**User guide:** :doc:`domain_habitat`. Component names: :doc:`../how_to/habitat_components`."
msgstr "**用户指南：** :doc:`domain_habitat` 。组件名称： :doc:`../how_to/habitat_components` 。"
#: ../../source/api/combiners.rst:14
msgid "Concat, ratio, kinetic, and expression trees over extractors (``concat(raw(\"T1\"), voxel_radiomics(\"T2\"))``)."
msgstr ""
"在提取器上构建 concat、ratio、kinetic 与 expression 树（ ``concat(raw(\"T1\"), voxel_radiomics(\"T2\"))`` ）。"
#: ../../source/api/combiners.rst:33:<autosummary>:1
msgid ":py:obj:`Combiner <habit.combiners.Combiner>`"
msgstr ":py:obj:`组合器 <habit.combiners.Combiner>`"
#: ../../source/api/combiners.rst:33:<autosummary>:1
msgid "Merge the feature blocks produced by sibling nodes of a feature tree."
msgstr "Merge the 特征 blocks produced by sibling nodes of a 特征 tree."
