#: ../../source/api/domain.rst:192
msgid "Composing features: trees, combiners, and statistics"
msgstr "组合特征：树、组合器与统计量"
#: ../../source/api/domain.rst:194
msgid "Every extraction stage accepts one **node** abstraction — a recursive ``Spec`` tree built from two shapes:"
msgstr "每个提取阶段接受一个 **节点** 抽象——由两种形状构建的递归 ``Spec`` 树："
#: ../../source/api/domain.rst:197
msgid "**Leaf** — one extraction form over one or more modalities. The single-modality form takes ``modality=\"T1\"``; the multi-modality stacking form keeps ``modalities=[...]`` (``raw`` only)."
msgstr ""
"**叶节点** — 一种或多种模态上的一种提取形式。单模态形式使用 ``modality=\"T1\"`` ；多模态堆叠形式保留 ``modalities=[...]`` （仅 ``raw`` ）。"
#: ../../source/api/domain.rst:200
msgid "**Combiner node** — a ``Combiner`` implementation with child nodes under ``params[\"children\"]``. Combiners merge child blocks **column-wise** and know nothing about ``Subject`` or files, which keeps them trivially testable and reusable at any level."
msgstr ""
"**Combiner 节点** — 在 ``Combiner`` 下带子节点的 ``params[\"children\"]`` 实现。Combiner **按列** 合并子块，且不了解 ``Subject`` 或文件，因而易于测试并在任意层级复用。"
#: ../../source/api/domain.rst:219
msgid "``build_voxel_extractor`` / ``build_supervoxel_extractor`` / ``build_habitat_extractor`` route a plain leaf ``Spec`` to the registry and a tree ``Spec`` to a wrapper that implements the stage's protocol — the pipeline consumes both transparently. ``SubjectPipeline`` binds the working and original voxel fields to supervoxel extractors that declare ``bind_fields`` (the statistics extractors ``mean`` / ``std`` / ``percentile`` aggregate one modality's voxel signal per supervoxel; ``source=\"original\"`` selects the pre-preprocessing signal)."
msgstr ""
"``build_voxel_extractor`` / ``build_supervoxel_extractor`` / ``build_habitat_extractor`` 将叶子 ``Spec`` 路由到注册表，将树形 ``Spec`` 路由到实现该阶段协议的包装器——流水线对两者透明消费。 ``SubjectPipeline`` 将工作体素场与原始体素场绑定到声明 ``bind_fields`` 的超体素提取器（统计提取器 ``mean`` / ``std`` / ``percentile`` 按模态聚合每个超体素内的体素信号； ``source=\"original\"`` 选择预处理前信号）。"
#: ../../source/api/domain.rst:228
msgid "Built-in combiners: ``concat``, ``weighted_concat`` / ``average`` (per-child ``weights``), ``ratio`` / ``difference`` (exactly two children), ``kinetic`` (DCE slope pairs), ``expression`` (dataframe arithmetic). Column naming: single-column nodes keep their source label (``modality`` > ``as_`` > name); ``as_`` renames only single-output nodes. See :doc:`/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor` for a runnable tour."
msgstr ""
"内置组合器： ``concat`` 、 ``weighted_concat`` / ``average`` （每子节点 ``weights`` ）、 ``ratio`` / ``difference`` （恰好两个子节点）、 ``kinetic`` （DCE 斜率对）、 ``expression`` （dataframe 算术）。列命名：单列节点保留源标签（ ``modality`` > ``as_`` > name）； ``as_`` 仅重命名单输出节点。可运行示例见 :doc:`/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor` 。"
#: ../../source/api/domain.rst:236
msgid "Precision screen: perturbations and precise features"
msgstr "精度筛选：扰动与精确特征"
#: ../../source/api/domain.rst:238
msgid "Precision screening *compares* voxel-texture maps; it does not extract them. Maps come from :func:`~habit.voxel_features.extract_voxel_texture` or :class:`~habit.voxel_features.VoxelRadiomicsFeatures` (see Voxel feature extractors). :func:`~habit.precision.perturb_image` builds the simulated retest. Neither atom needs a :class:`~habit.contracts.subject.Cohort` or YAML."
msgstr ""
"Precision screening *compares* 体素-texture maps; it does not extract them. Maps come from :func:`~habit.voxel_features.extract_voxel_texture` or :class:`~habit.voxel_features.VoxelRadiomicsFeatures` (see 体素 特征 extractors). :func:`~habit.precision.perturb_image` builds the simulated retest. Neither atom needs a :class:`~habit.contracts.subject.Cohort` or YAML."
#: ../../source/api/domain.rst:257
msgid "``perturb_image`` wraps the registered ``image_perturbation`` methods that return a perturbed **intensity** volume (``gaussian_noise``, ``translation``, ``rotation``, ``rigid``, ``bspline_deform``). Mask-only contour methods (``morphological``, ``gradient_weighted``, ``slice_extent``) must be called on a :class:`~habit.contracts.subject.Subject` via :class:`~habit.precision.ImagePerturbationRegistry` — see :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features`. ``extract_voxel_texture`` is one voxel-radiomics pass; paper combinations are repeated calls (R1 vs R3, B12 vs B25, original vs perturbed). Then compose ICC panels:"
msgstr ""
"``perturb_image`` 包装已注册的 ``image_perturbation`` 方法，返回扰动后的 **强度** 体（ ``gaussian_noise`` 、 ``translation`` 、 ``rotation`` 、 ``rigid`` 、 ``bspline_deform`` ）。仅掩膜的轮廓方法（ ``morphological`` 、 ``gradient_weighted`` 、 ``slice_extent`` ）须通过 :class:`~habit.contracts.subject.Subject` 在 :class:`~habit.precision.ImagePerturbationRegistry` 上调用 — 见 :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features` 。 ``extract_voxel_texture`` 为一次体素放射组学 pass；论文组合为重复调用（R1 对 R3、B12 对 B25、原始对扰动）。然后组合 ICC 面板："
#: ../../source/api/domain.rst:286
msgid "The ninth protocol, ``ImagePerturbation``, is the Subject-level form of the same methods (``component(subject, rng=...)``). The paper default chain is :func:`~habit.precision.prior2024_retest_perturbation` (Appendix S2 / MIRP 1.2.0). Optional ``bspline_deform`` (MONAI ``Rand3DElastic``; extra ``monai``) is **not** in that chain."
msgstr ""
"第九个协议 ``ImagePerturbation`` 是相同方法的受试者级形式（ ``component(subject, rng=...)`` ）。论文默认链为 :func:`~habit.precision.prior2024_retest_perturbation` （附录 S2 / MIRP 1.2.0）。可选 ``bspline_deform`` （MONAI ``Rand3DElastic`` ；额外 ``monai`` ） **不在** 该链中。"
#: ../../source/api/domain.rst:292
msgid "``PreciseFeatureSet.preprocessor()`` returns a ``FeatureWhitelist``. The one-call recipe is :func:`habit.recipes.identify_precise_voxel_features`; the runnable tour is :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features`."
msgstr ""
"``PreciseFeatureSet.preprocessor()`` 返回 ``FeatureWhitelist`` 。一键配方为 :func:`habit.recipes.identify_precise_voxel_features` ；可运行导览见 :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features` 。"
