#: ../../source/api/domain_table.rst:181
msgid "Since v1.1 ``TablePipeline`` **inherits** ``sklearn.pipeline.Pipeline``, so ``clone``, ``get_params`` / ``set_params``, nested parameter addressing and the whole ``sklearn.model_selection`` family work on it directly. Two things follow:"
