#: ../../source/api/domain_table.rst:186
msgid "``pipe.steps`` has scikit-learn's meaning -- ``[(name, estimator), ...]``, where the estimators are the interop adapters. The HABIT components are read from ``pipe.components`` (transformation steps, in execution order) and ``pipe.model`` (the terminal one)."
msgstr ""
"``pipe.steps`` 沿用 scikit-learn 含义—— ``[(name, estimator), ...]`` ，其中 estimator 为互操作适配器。HABIT 组件从 ``pipe.components`` （按执行顺序的变换步骤）与 ``pipe.model`` （终端步骤）读取。"
#: ../../source/api/domain_table.rst:190
msgid "The step list always begins with a ``FrameToTable`` head named ``\"frame_to_table\"`` and ends with the outcome-model adapter named ``\"model\"``; intermediate steps take their component's registered name."
msgstr ""
"步骤列表始终以名为 ``FrameToTable`` 的 ``\"frame_to_table\"`` 头开始，以名为 ``\"model\"`` 的 outcome 模型适配器结束；中间步骤采用组件的注册名。"
#: ../../source/api/domain_table.rst:206
msgid "Hyperparameter search needs one extra thing: scikit-learn's cross-validation drivers slice ``X`` **by row**, and a ``FeatureTable`` is a frozen dataclass that deliberately is not row-indexable. So pass the raw frame as ``X`` and let the ``FrameToTable`` head rebuild the table from a declared column schema:"
msgstr ""
"超参数搜索需要额外的一件事：scikit-learn 的交叉验证驱动程序按行切片 ``X`` ，而 ``FeatureTable`` 是一个冻结的数据类，故意不能按行索引。因此，将原始数据框作为 ``X`` 传递，并让 ``FrameToTable`` 头根据声明的列模式重建表格："
#: ../../source/api/domain_table.rst:224
msgid "An already-built pipeline can be given the schema afterwards, the sklearn way::"
msgstr "已构建的流水线可事后赋予 schema，方式与 sklearn 相同::"
#: ../../source/api/domain_table.rst:228
msgid "Calling ``pipe.fit(train_table)`` with a ``FeatureTable`` needs no schema at all: the head passes tables straight through, with no frame round-trip and therefore no dtype promotion that could shift a later z-score."
msgstr ""
"对 ``pipe.fit(train_table)`` 调用 ``FeatureTable`` 完全不需要 schema：头部直接将表格原样传递，不经 DataFrame 往返，因此不会发生可能偏移后续 z-score 的 dtype 提升。"
