msgstr "检查点存储 CheckpointStore"
#: ../../source/api/execution.rst:253
msgid "Recorded terminal failures are skipped on resume (v0.1 rule) unless ``retry_failed_subjects=True``. Successful subjects restore ``from_cache=True``. Pass the same store to :meth:`~habit.recipes.Study.fit_predict` together with a :class:`~habit.report.Report` so one-step product files (maps, models, figures) are rewritten from cached payloads on resume (:doc:`/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject`)."
msgstr "resume 时跳过已记录的终态失败（v0.1 规则），除非 ``retry_failed_subjects=True`` 。成功的受试者恢复 ``from_cache=True`` 。将同一 store 传给 :meth:`~habit.recipes.Study.fit_predict` ，并与 :class:`~habit.report.Report` 一起使用，以便 resume 时从缓存载荷重写一步法产物文件（生境图、模型、图）（ :doc:`/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject` ）。"
#: ../../source/api/execution.rst:260
msgid "On the v1 habitat CLI path, cache keys embed the spec fingerprint, and the store is also bound to ``run_fingerprint.json``. With ``strict_checkpoint_hash=True``, an incompatible fingerprint raises :class:`~habit.exceptions.CompatibilityError` (v0.1 ``CheckpointConfigHashError`` parity). With ``strict=False``, mismatches are warned and left unreachable."
msgstr ""
"在 v1 生境 CLI 路径上，缓存键嵌入 spec 指纹，且存储亦绑定 ``run_fingerprint.json`` 。 ``strict_checkpoint_hash=True`` 时，不兼容的指纹会抛出 :class:`~habit.exceptions.CompatibilityError` （与 v0.1 ``CheckpointConfigHashError`` 一致）。 ``strict=False`` 时，不匹配仅警告且不可达。"
#: ../../source/api/execution.rst:267
msgid "A legacy v0.1 ``manifest.json`` / ``subjects/`` tree is **auto-migrated** on store open (:func:`~habit.execution.migrate_v01_checkpoint_if_needed`): failed subject IDs become v1 ``.failed`` records under fingerprint-scoped recipe keys; completed pickles are converted to :class:`~habit.contracts.Supervoxelization` when geometry and labels are present, otherwise those subjects are logged and recomputed. The legacy tree is moved under ``.v01_legacy_archive/``. Corrupt/unreadable ``manifest.json`` still raises :class:`~habit.exceptions.CompatibilityError`."
msgstr "旧版 v0.1 ``manifest.json`` / ``subjects/`` 树在打开存储时 **自动迁移** （ :func:`~habit.execution.migrate_v01_checkpoint_if_needed` ）：失败受试者 ID 变为指纹作用域 recipe 键下的 v1 ``.failed`` 记录；完成的 pickle 在有几何与标签时转为 :class:`~habit.contracts.Supervoxelization` ，否则记录并重新计算。旧树移至 ``.v01_legacy_archive/`` 。损坏/不可读的 ``manifest.json`` 仍抛出 :class:`~habit.exceptions.CompatibilityError` 。"
#: ../../source/api/execution.rst:276
msgid "Exports: ``SerialBackend``, ``ProcessPoolBackend``, ``CheckpointStore``, ``LegacyCheckpointMigrationReport``, ``is_v01_checkpoint_layout``, ``migrate_v01_checkpoint_if_needed``, ``SubjectTimeoutError``, ``backend_from_policy``, ``should_use_process_pool``."
msgstr ""
"导出： ``SerialBackend`` 、 ``ProcessPoolBackend`` 、 ``CheckpointStore`` 、 ``LegacyCheckpointMigrationReport`` 、 ``is_v01_checkpoint_layout`` 、 ``migrate_v01_checkpoint_if_needed`` 、 ``SubjectTimeoutError`` 、 ``backend_from_policy`` 、 ``should_use_process_pool`` 。"
