msgstr ":mod:`habit.feature_preprocessing`: scale voxel-feature matrices"
#: ../../../habit/feature_preprocessing/__init__.py:docstring of habit.feature_preprocessing:1
msgid "Feature preprocessing for clustering inputs (voxel and supervoxel)."
msgstr "聚类输入（体素与超体素）的特征预处理。"
#: ../../../habit/feature_preprocessing/__init__.py:docstring of habit.feature_preprocessing:3
msgid "Two chains over one shared set of methods. The chains differ by whether their state crosses subject boundaries, not by what they process:"
msgstr "两套链共享同一组方法。链的差别在于状态是否跨受试者边界，而非处理对象："
#: ../../../habit/feature_preprocessing/__init__.py:docstring of habit.feature_preprocessing:6
msgid ":class:`SubjectPreprocessingChain` -- stateless, per subject, usable at either granularity, removes between-subject variation."
msgstr ":class:`SubjectPreprocessingChain` — 无状态、按受试者、可在任一粒度使用，消除受试者间差异。"
#: ../../../habit/feature_preprocessing/__init__.py:docstring of habit.feature_preprocessing:8
msgid ":class:`CohortPreprocessingChain` -- stateful, fitted on the training cohort, makes subjects comparable, state travels in the habitat model."
msgstr ""
":class:`CohortPreprocessingChain` -- stateful, fitted on the training 队列, makes 受试者 comparable, state travels in the 生境 model."
#: ../../../habit/feature_preprocessing/__init__.py:docstring of habit.feature_preprocessing:11
msgid "Distinguish this domain from ``table_preprocessor``: that one preprocesses the MODELLING table (one row per subject, with identifier and outcome columns) on the way to an outcome model. This one preprocesses the CLUSTERING input (one row per voxel or supervoxel) on the way to a habitat definition."
msgstr ""
"本域与 ``table_preprocessor`` 不同：后者预处理建模表（每受试者一行，含标识与结局列）以供结局模型；本域预处理聚类输入（每体素或超体素一行）以供生境定义。"
#: ../../../habit/feature_preprocessing/__init__.py:docstring of habit.feature_preprocessing:16
msgid "Chains speak plain ``DataFrame``. The bridge to the typed contracts is the symmetric pair ``feature_frame()`` / ``with_feature_frame()`` carried by both :class:`~habit.contracts.habitat.VoxelFeatureField` and :class:`~habit.contracts.habitat.Supervoxelization`, so a chain never needs to know which one it is processing."
msgstr ""
"链使用普通 ``DataFrame`` 。与类型化契约的桥梁是对称的 ``feature_frame()`` / ``with_feature_frame()`` ，由 :class:`~habit.contracts.habitat.VoxelFeatureField` 与 :class:`~habit.contracts.habitat.Supervoxelization` 共同提供，链无需区分正在处理哪一种。"
#: ../../source/api/feature_preprocessing.rst:11
msgid "**User guide:** Habitat Guide :doc:`../auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_02_subject_preprocess` · :doc:`domain_habitat`. Component names: :doc:`../how_to/habitat_components`."
msgstr "**用户指南：** 生境指南 :doc:`../auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_02_subject_preprocess` · :doc:`domain_habitat` 。组件名称： :doc:`../how_to/habitat_components` 。"
#: ../../source/api/feature_preprocessing.rst:16
msgid "Subject-level and cohort-level preprocessing of voxel / supervoxel feature matrices, composable into chains. This is **not** image preprocessing (:doc:`image_preprocessing`) and **not** table-ML preprocessing (:doc:`table_ml`)."
msgstr ""
"受试者-level and 队列级 preprocessing of 体素 / 超体素 特征 matrices, composable into chains. This is **not** image preprocessing (:doc:`image_preprocessing`) and **not** table-ML preprocessing (:doc:`table_ml`)."
