#: ../../../habit/precision/__init__.py:docstring of habit.precision:3
msgid "Voxel-wise radiomics is noisy; clustering features that do not survive a simulated re-acquisition produces habitats nobody can reproduce. This package implements the precision screen of Prior et al. (Radiol Artif Intell 2024;6(2):e230118) as composable domain components:"
