#: ../../../habit/precision/__init__.py:docstring of habit.precision:11
msgid ":func:`precision_panel` / :func:`aggregate_panels` computing per-subject and cohort-level ICC tables on voxel feature fields;"
msgstr ""
":func:`precision_panel` / :func:`aggregate_panels` 在体素特征场上计算每个受试者与队列级 ICC 表；"
#: ../../../habit/precision/__init__.py:docstring of habit.precision:13
msgid ":func:`identify_precise_features` applying the LCL screen across experiments and returning the serialisable :class:`PreciseFeatureSet`;"
msgstr ""
":func:`identify_precise_features` applying the LCL screen across experiments and returning the serialisable :class:`PreciseFeatureSet`;"
#: ../../../habit/precision/__init__.py:docstring of habit.precision:15
msgid ":func:`habitat_stability` scoring habitat maps under perturbation;"
msgstr ":func:`habitat_stability` 在扰动下对生境图评分；"
#: ../../../habit/precision/__init__.py:docstring of habit.precision:16
msgid ":func:`align_habitat_map` remapping independently clustered labels of the same voxels onto a reference (overlap Hungarian);"
msgstr ":func:`align_habitat_map` 将同一体素上独立聚类标签重映射到参考（重叠 Hungarian）；"
#: ../../../habit/precision/__init__.py:docstring of habit.precision:18
msgid ":func:`align_habitat_maps_to_prototypes` naming habitats across subjects by iterative matching to shared (or frozen) prototypes."
msgstr ":func:`align_habitat_maps_to_prototypes` 通过与共享（或冻结）原型迭代匹配，跨受试者命名生境。"
#: ../../source/api/precision.rst:11
msgid "**User guide:** Habitat Guide :doc:`../auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features` · :doc:`../auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_02_match_same_subject` · :doc:`../auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_03_match_two_subjects` · :doc:`../auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_04_match_group`. Recipe wrapper: :func:`~habit.recipes.identify_precise_voxel_features`."
msgstr "**用户指南：** 生境指南 :doc:`../auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features` · :doc:`../auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_02_match_same_subject` · :doc:`../auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_03_match_two_subjects` · :doc:`../auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_04_match_group` 。配方包装： :func:`~habit.recipes.identify_precise_voxel_features` 。"
