#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:26
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:26
msgid "**Background.** A tumour is not uniform: some parts enhance strongly, some wash out, some are necrotic. Habitat analysis splits the ROI into a few sub-regions (habitats) whose voxels behave alike across the DCE phases, using one definition shared by every patient, and then describes each patient by how much of each habitat they have and how the habitats are arranged."
msgstr "**背景。** 肿瘤并非均匀：有的区域强化明显，有的廓清较快，有的坏死。生境分析将 ROI 划分为若干子区域（生境），这些子区域中的体素在各 DCE 时相上表现相近；所有患者共用同一套定义，再以各生境所占比例及其空间排布来描述每一位患者。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:33
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:33
msgid "**Purpose.** You will fit habitats on two demo patients with the two-step design, pick the number of habitats with HABIT ``elbow`` (Kneedle on inertia; see the caveat in the \"How many habitats\" cell), view the habitat maps, get a one-row-per-patient feature table (volume fractions, MSI, ITH, graph), save the model as a ``.habitatmodel`` file, and label a third patient with it."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 你将用两步法设计在两名演示患者上拟合生境，用 HABIT ``elbow`` （inertia 上 Kneedle；见“How many habitats”单元中的说明）选择生境数，查看生境图，得到每患者一行的特征表（体积分数、MSI、ITH、图），将模型保存为 ``.habitatmodel`` 文件，并用其为第三名患者打标签。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:40
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:40
msgid "**When to use.** This is the default study design: you want habitat ids that mean the same thing in every patient, so volume fractions and other habitat features can be compared across a cohort."
msgstr "**何时使用。** 这是默认研究设计：希望生境 id 在每位患者中含义相同，以便比较队列中的体积分数等生境特征。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:44
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:44
msgid "**Analysis definition.** This page defines the reference analysis that the other pages of this section reuse: four DCE phases, ROI ``LAP``; subject-level winsorize (1 % / 1 %) then z-score; 30 k-means supervoxels per tumour; pool; no cohort-level preprocessing; k-means habitats with 2..10 candidates and the elbow rule; nearest centroid assignment; seed 0."
msgstr "**分析定义。** 本页定义本节其他页面复用的参考分析：四个 DCE 期相、ROI ``LAP`` ；受试者级 winsorize（1% / 1%）再 z-score；每肿瘤 30 个 k-means 超体素；池化；无队列级预处理；k-means 生境，候选 2..10 与肘部法则；最近质心分配；种子 0。"
