#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:53
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:53
msgid "**subject-level normalization** -- each patient's voxel features are rescaled with that patient's own statistics (here: clip the extreme 1 % at each end, then min-max to 0..1). MR intensities are arbitrary units, so without this step a darker scan lands in one habitat."
msgstr ""
"**受试者级归一化** ——各患者体素特征用该患者自身统计量重标（此处：两端各截断极端 1%，再 min-max 到 0..1）。MR 强度为任意单位，无此步骤时较暗扫描会落入某一生境。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:57
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:57
msgid "**supervoxel** -- a small patch of similar neighbouring voxels, clustered inside each patient first so the cohort model has fewer, less noisy rows."
msgstr "**supervoxel** — 相似邻近体素组成的小块；先在每位患者内聚类，使队列模型行更少、噪声更低。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:60
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:60
msgid "**cohort-level preprocessing** -- a transform learned once on the pooled training rows (here: 10 equal-width bins per feature), saved inside the model, and reused unchanged on new patients."
msgstr "**队列级预处理** — 在池化训练行上学习一次的变换（此处：每特征 10 个等宽分箱），保存在模型内，并在新患者上原样复用。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:63
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:63
msgid "**pool / fit / assign** -- stack all patients' supervoxels, learn the habitat centroids once, then give every voxel the id of its nearest centroid."
msgstr "**pool / fit / assign** —— 堆叠所有患者的超体素，一次学习生境质心，再为每个体素赋予最近质心的 id。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:66
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:66
msgid "**MSI** -- how often each pair of habitats touch; **ITH score** -- how fragmented the habitats are (0 = one blob each)."
msgstr "**MSI** — 各对生境接触频率； **ITH score** — 生境碎片化程度（0 = 各为单连通块）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:68
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:68
msgid "**.habitatmodel** -- the saved habitat definition; loading it labels new patients without refitting."
msgstr "**.habitatmodel** — 已保存的生境定义；加载即可标注新患者而无需重拟合。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:71
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:71
msgid "One :class:`~habit.spec.HabitatSpec` declares the whole study. One ``fit_predict`` runs it. The same stage list is used by :doc:`/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python` (fitted there on four patients instead of two)."
msgstr "一个 :class:`~habit.spec.HabitatSpec` 声明整项研究。一次 ``fit_predict`` 运行它。 :doc:`/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python` 使用相同阶段列表（在那里用四名而非两名患者拟合）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:78
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:78
msgid "Two training patients are enough to show every step, but they are a demo, not a cohort. A real study fits the habitat model on tens of patients so that the centroids describe the population."
msgstr "两名训练患者足以展示各步，但只是演示，不是队列。真实研究在数十名患者上拟合生境模型，使质心描述群体。"
