msgid "Declare every stage"
msgstr "声明每个阶段"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:187
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:187
msgid "``Stage``'s first argument is a label you choose. ``Spec`` names a registered component and its parameters. ``random_seed`` seeds every stochastic stage (partition and fit), so a rerun paints the same map."
msgstr ""
"``Stage`` 的第一个参数是您选择的标签。 ``Spec`` 命名注册组件及其参数。 ``random_seed`` 为每个随机阶段（partition 与 fit）设种子，重跑得到相同图。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:191
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:191
msgid "Where a preprocessing stage sits decides what it does. Before ``pool`` it is **subject-level**: it runs on one patient at a time with that patient's own statistics, stores no state, and cannot leak information between patients. After ``pool`` it is **cohort-level**: it is learned once on the pooled training supervoxels, saved inside the ``.habitatmodel``, and applied unchanged to every new patient (it is never refitted on the new patient)."
msgstr ""
"预处理阶段的位置决定其作用。 ``pool`` 之前为 **受试者级** ：逐患者运行并使用该患者自身统计，不存状态，不会在患者间泄漏信息。 ``pool`` 之后为 **队列级** ：在池化训练超体素上学习一次，保存在 ``.habitatmodel`` 内，并无改动地用于每位新患者（不会在新患者上重拟合）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:199
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:199
msgid "Drop ``partition`` and ``pool`` and each subject is clustered alone (:doc:`/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject`). Drop only ``partition`` and voxels of all patients are clustered together (:doc:`/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_03_pooled_voxels`)."
msgstr "去掉 ``partition`` 与 ``pool`` ，则每名受试者单独聚类（ :doc:`/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject` ）。只去掉 ``partition`` ，则所有患者的体素一起聚类（ :doc:`/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_03_pooled_voxels` ）。"
