msgid "Volume fractions (columns ``habitat_<i>_volume_fraction``) sum to 1 per patient. Because the ids are shared, a column can be compared across rows: in this run habitat 1 covers 0.225 of subj001 and 0.439 of subj002."
msgstr ""
"体积分数（列 ``habitat_<i>_volume_fraction`` ）每名患者求和为 1。因 id 共享，列可跨行比较：本次运行生境 1 占 subj001 的 0.225、subj002 的 0.439。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:532
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:532
msgid "The ITH score is high for both (0.952 and 0.897): at the voxel scale each habitat is split into many pieces."
msgstr "ITH 分数对两者都很高（0.952 与 0.897）：在体素尺度上每个生境被拆成许多碎片。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:534
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:534
msgid "``graph_num_nodes_total`` (481 vs 135) grows with tumour size as well as with fragmentation: subj001 has 34 694 ROI voxels, subj002 9 858. Compare it between patients only with that in mind."
msgstr ""
"``graph_num_nodes_total`` （481 对 135）随肿瘤大小与碎片化程度增长：subj001 有 34 694 个体素 ROI，subj002 有 9 858。跨患者比较时须牢记这一点。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:537
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:537
