msgstr "保存模型并为新患者打标签"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:623
msgid "The ``.habitatmodel`` file is the habitat definition. Loading it does not refit. The new patient is normalized with its OWN statistics (subject-level winsorize 1% + z-score), then given the training centroids. No cohort-level bin edges are stored in the default design."
msgstr "``.habitatmodel`` 文件即生境定义。加载它不会重新拟合。新患者用其 **自身** 统计量归一化（受试者级 winsorize 1% + z-score），再分配到训练质心。默认设计中不存储队列级分箱边界。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step.rst:675
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec.rst:675
