#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject.rst:24
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_03_inside_each_subject_spec.rst:24
msgid "*A per-patient heterogeneity score.*"
msgstr "*逐患者异质性评分。*"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject.rst:26
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_03_inside_each_subject_spec.rst:26
msgid "**Background.** Some questions are about each tumour on its own: *how heterogeneous is this lesion?* For that you do not need a habitat definition shared by the cohort. Each tumour can be split into its own habitats (the one-step design), and the patient is then described by numbers that do not depend on which habitat got which id: how many habitats it needed and how fragmented they are."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** 有些问题针对每个肿瘤本身： *该病灶有多异质？* 此时不需要队列共享的生境定义。每个肿瘤可拆成自有生境（一步法设计），患者随后用不依赖生境 id 编号的数字描述：需要多少生境及碎片化程度。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject.rst:33
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_03_inside_each_subject_spec.rst:33
msgid "**Purpose.** You will cluster each of the five demo patients alone, let the elbow rule pick the number of habitats per patient, and build a one-row-per-patient table of label-free heterogeneity summaries: number of habitats, ITH score and MSI energy, with a bar chart of the ITH score."
msgstr "**目的。** 你将单独对五名演示患者各自聚类，由肘部法则为每名患者选定生境数，并构建每人一行、无标签的异质性汇总表：生境数、ITH 分数与 MSI energy，以及 ITH 分数的条形图。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject.rst:39
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_03_inside_each_subject_spec.rst:39
msgid "**When to use.** Use one-step when your question is a per-patient heterogeneity score, when patients are too different for one shared definition to make sense, or when you have a single patient. Do not use it if you need to compare *habitat 2* across patients (e.g. \"the fraction of the enhancing habitat\"): use the two-step design of :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec`, or match the per-patient habitats first (:doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_04_match_group`)."
msgstr "**何时使用。** 当问题是逐患者异质性评分、患者差异过大不宜共用定义，或仅有一名患者时，用一步法。若需跨患者比较 *生境 2* （如“增强生境占比”），勿用一步法：请用 :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 的两步法，或先匹配逐患者生境（ :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_04_match_group` ）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject.rst:48
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_03_inside_each_subject_spec.rst:48
msgid "**Analysis definition.** The reference analysis of :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` with three stages removed: no ``partition`` (voxels are clustered directly), no ``pool`` (each subject is fitted alone) and therefore no cohort-level ``binning`` (there are no pooled rows to learn bin edges from). The subject-level winsorize + z-score stages, the k-means fitter (2..10 candidates, elbow, ``n_init=10``) and seed 0 are unchanged. The graph family is left out to keep the page fast."
msgstr ""
"**分析定义。** 参考分析见 :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` ，但去掉三阶段：无 ``partition`` （直接对体素聚类）、无 ``pool`` （各受试者单独拟合），因而无队列级 ``binning`` （无池化行可学习 bin 边界）。受试者级 winsorize + z-score、k-means 拟合器（2..10 候选、elbow、 ``n_init=10`` ）与 seed 0 不变。为加快页面省略 graph 族。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject.rst:59
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_03_inside_each_subject_spec.rst:59
msgid "**one-step** -- ``fit`` and ``assign`` run inside each subject on its own voxels; there is no ``partition`` and no ``pool``, so every patient gets a private model with its own centroids."
msgstr ""
"**one-step** — ``fit`` 与 ``assign`` 在每位受试者自己的体素上运行；无 ``partition`` 与 ``pool`` ，每位患者有私有模型与各自质心。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject.rst:62
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_03_inside_each_subject_spec.rst:62
msgid "**label switching** -- two independent clusterings number similar tissue differently, so habitat 1 of one patient is not habitat 1 of another. Ids must be matched before patients are compared by habitat."
msgstr "**标签切换** — 两次独立聚类对相似组织编号不同，于是一名患者的生境 1 不是另一名的生境 1。按生境比较患者前必须匹配 id。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject.rst:65
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_03_inside_each_subject_spec.rst:65
msgid "**label-free summary** -- a number that stays the same if the habitat ids of a patient are renumbered (e.g. 1<->3). Only those can be compared across patients here."
msgstr "**与标签无关的汇总** —— 若某患者的生境编号被重排（例如 1↔3）仍保持不变的数值。此处只有这类量才能跨患者比较。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject.rst:68
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_03_inside_each_subject_spec.rst:68
msgid "**ITH score** -- how fragmented the habitats are: ``1 - (1 / S_total) * sum_i(S_i,max / n_i)`` with ``S_i,max`` the largest connected piece of habitat ``i`` and ``n_i`` its number of pieces; 0 = every habitat is one blob."
msgstr ""
"**ITH score** — 生境碎片化： ``1 - (1 / S_total) * sum_i(S_i,max / n_i)`` ， ``S_i,max`` 为生境 ``i`` 的最大连通片， ``n_i`` 为其片数；0 = 每个生境为单块。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject.rst:72
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_03_inside_each_subject_spec.rst:72
msgid "**MSI energy** -- a sum of squares over the habitat-contact matrix (MSI = how often each pair of habitats, and each habitat with itself, touch). Renumbering the ids only permutes the matrix entries, so the sum does not change."
msgstr ""
"**MSI energy** — 生境接触矩阵上的平方和（MSI = 各对生境及生境与自身接触频率）。重编号 id 仅置换矩阵元素，故和不变。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject.rst:79
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_03_inside_each_subject_spec.rst:79
msgid "The demo has no clinical outcomes. In your own study the table at the end is what you join to outcomes (by the ``subject`` column); this page stops at the table."
msgstr "演示数据没有临床结局。在你自己的研究中，文末的表正是按 ``subject`` 列与结局对接的那张表；本页止于该表。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject.rst:87
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_03_inside_each_subject_spec.rst:87
msgid "All five demo patients, four DCE phases. No patient is held out: nothing is learned across patients, so there is nothing to validate on a new one. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 2"
msgstr ""
"所有五个演示患者，四个 DCE 阶段。没有患者被排除在外：各患者之间没有学习，所以无法在新患者上进行验证。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 2"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject.rst:155
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_03_inside_each_subject_spec.rst:155
msgid "Declare the one-step analysis"
msgstr "声明一步法分析"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject.rst:156
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_03_inside_each_subject_spec.rst:156
msgid "The stage list has no ``partition`` and no ``pool``. Without ``pool``, ``fit`` runs once per subject on that subject's voxels, and the elbow rule picks the number of habitats separately for every patient."
msgstr ""
"阶段列表无 ``partition`` 且无 ``pool`` 。无 ``pool`` 时， ``fit`` 在各受试者体素上逐受试者运行一次，elbow 规则为每位患者分别选生境数。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject.rst:160
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_03_inside_each_subject_spec.rst:160
msgid "The two subject-level stages are valid here: they use only the patient's own statistics. A cohort-level stage (``binning`` after ``pool`` in the two-step page) does not apply: it is learned on the pooled training rows, and in this design nothing is pooled."
msgstr ""
"此处两个受试者级阶段有效：仅用患者自身统计。队列级阶段（两步法页 ``binning`` 后的 ``pool`` ）不适用：它在池化训练行上学习，而本设计无池化。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject.rst:240
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_03_inside_each_subject_spec.rst:240
msgid "Each patient picks its own number of habitats"
msgstr "各患者自行选择生境数量"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject.rst:241
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_03_inside_each_subject_spec.rst:241
msgid "Every private model keeps its own elbow/Kneedle report. Here is the first patient's curve. Maps keep that patient's Kneedle K. HABIT validation ``elbow`` is the same rule as ``kneedle``. It runs ``KneeLocator`` on k-means inertia (within-cluster sum of squares), curve convex, direction decreasing (Satopaa, Albrecht, Irwin, and Raghavan, 2011, Finding a \"Kneedle\" in a Haystack, IEEE ICDCS). Normalize k and inertia to the unit square, draw the chord from the first point to the last, and take the k farthest from that chord; a smooth curve often places this knee to the right of the bend a person sees. Literature \"elbow\" means inspecting within-cluster dispersion versus k (Thorndike RL, 1953, Who belongs in the family?, Psychometrika 18(4):267-276) — not a second-difference formula. The discrete-curvature elbow (visual elbow, computed) maximizes the second difference of inertia (HABIT pre-v1.0 elbow); it is not a Thorndike formula. The habitat map keeps the Kneedle K; other Ks are only in the table below. Full comparison: :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm`."
msgstr "每个私有模型保留各自的 elbow/Kneedle 报告。以下为第一名患者的曲线。图保留该患者的 Kneedle K。HABIT 验证 ``elbow`` 与 ``kneedle`` 规则相同：对 k-means 惯性（簇内平方和）运行 ``KneeLocator`` ，曲线凸、方向递减（Satopaa 等，2011，IEEE ICDCS）。将 k 与惯性归一化到单位正方形，连接首尾点弦，取距弦最远的 k；平滑曲线常使该膝点偏右于肉眼弯曲处。文献中 “elbow” 指观察簇内离散度随 k 变化（Thorndike RL，1953，Psychometrika 18(4):267-276）— 非二阶差分公式。离散曲率 elbow（视觉 elbow，可计算）最大化惯性二阶差（HABIT v1.0 前 elbow）；非 Thorndike 公式。生境图保留 Kneedle K；其他 K 仅在下表。完整对比： :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject.rst:368
