msgstr ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_00_introductory_tutorials_plot_03_pooled_voxels.py>` 以下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_03_pooled_voxels.rst:24
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_05_pooled_voxels_spec.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** The two-step design first cuts every tumour into supervoxels and clusters those. The pooled-voxel design (also called direct pooling) skips that step: every ROI voxel of every training patient goes into one matrix, and one cohort model is fitted on it. Habitat ids are still shared across patients."
msgstr "**背景。** 两步法设计先把每个肿瘤切成超体素再对其聚类。池化体素设计（亦称直接池化）跳过该步：所有训练患者的每个 ROI 体素进入一个矩阵，并在其上拟合一个队列模型。生境 id 仍在患者间共享。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_03_pooled_voxels.rst:30
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_05_pooled_voxels_spec.rst:30
msgid "**Purpose.** You will fit one shared habitat model on the voxels of two demo patients, let the elbow rule pick the number of habitats, view a habitat map per patient, compare volume fractions across patients, and look at the arterial-phase intensities inside each habitat."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 你将在两名演示患者的体素上拟合一个共享生境模型，用 elbow 规则选择生境数，查看每位患者的生境图，比较患者间体积分数，并查看各生境内动脉期强度。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_03_pooled_voxels.rst:35
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_05_pooled_voxels_spec.rst:35
msgid "**When to use.** You want shared ids without the supervoxel step (for example because supervoxel boundaries are themselves a modelling choice you want to avoid), and the pooled voxel matrix is small enough to cluster: it grows with every voxel of every patient, here 44 552 rows for two patients instead of 60 supervoxels. For large cohorts the two-step design (:doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec`) clusters far fewer rows."
msgstr "**何时使用。** 需要共享 id 且跳过超体素（例如避免超体素边界这一建模选择），且池化体素矩阵足够小可聚类：其规模随每位患者每个体素增长，此处两患者为 44 552 行而非 60 个超体素。大队列请用两步法（ :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` ），聚类行数少得多。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_03_pooled_voxels.rst:44
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_05_pooled_voxels_spec.rst:44
msgid "**Analysis definition.** The reference analysis of :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` with one stage removed: no ``partition``. Subject-level winsorize + z-score run on each patient's voxels BEFORE ``pool``; the cohort-level 10-bin uniform binning is learned on the pooled training voxels AFTER ``pool`` and stored in the model. Fitter (k-means, 2..10, elbow, ``n_init=10``), assigner, feature families and seed 0 are unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**分析定义。** :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 参考分析去掉一阶段：无 ``partition`` 。每名患者体素在 ``pool`` **前** 做受试者级 winsorize + z-score； ``pool`` **后** 在池化训练体素上学队列级 10-bin 均匀分箱并存入模型。拟合器（k-means，2..10，肘部， ``n_init=10`` ）、assigner、特征族与 seed 0 不变。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_03_pooled_voxels.rst:54
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_05_pooled_voxels_spec.rst:54
msgid "**pooled voxels / direct pooling** -- ``pool`` then ``fit`` with no ``partition``; each voxel is its own clustering unit."
msgstr ""
"**池化 体素 / 直接池化** -- ``pool`` then ``fit`` with no ``partition``; each 体素 is its own 聚类 unit."
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_03_pooled_voxels.rst:56
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_05_pooled_voxels_spec.rst:56
msgid "**pool** -- stack every training patient's rows into one matrix, so one model (one set of centroids) is learned for the cohort."
msgstr "**pool** — 将每位训练患者行堆入一个矩阵，从而为队列学习一个模型（一组质心）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_03_pooled_voxels.rst:58
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_05_pooled_voxels_spec.rst:58
msgid "**subject-level vs cohort-level preprocessing** -- before ``pool`` a stage uses one patient's own statistics; after ``pool`` it is learned once on the training rows and saved inside the model."
msgstr ""
"**subject-level vs cohort-level preprocessing** — ``pool`` 前阶段用该患者自身统计； ``pool`` 后在训练行上学习一次并保存在模型内。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_03_pooled_voxels.rst:66
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_05_pooled_voxels_spec.rst:66
msgid "Two training patients, as on the two-step page, so the two designs can be compared on the same data. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 2"
msgstr "两个训练患者，如同在两步页面上，这样可以在相同的数据上比较这两种设计。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 2"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_03_pooled_voxels.rst:133
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_05_pooled_voxels_spec.rst:133
msgid "Declare the pooled-voxel analysis"
msgstr "声明池化体素分析"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_03_pooled_voxels.rst:134
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_05_pooled_voxels_spec.rst:134
msgid "No ``partition``: each ROI voxel is its own clustering unit. ``pool`` stacks the voxels of every patient and one model is fitted on them. The preprocessing stages keep their meaning from their position: before ``pool`` they are subject-level, after it cohort-level."
msgstr ""
"无 ``partition`` ：每个 ROI 体素自身为聚类单元。 ``pool`` 堆叠每位患者体素并拟合一个模型。预处理阶段含义仍由位置决定： ``pool`` 前为受试者级，之后为队列级。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_03_pooled_voxels.rst:232
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_05_pooled_voxels_spec.rst:232
msgid "HABIT validation ``elbow`` is the same rule as ``kneedle``. It runs ``KneeLocator`` on k-means inertia (within-cluster sum of squares), curve convex, direction decreasing (Satopaa, Albrecht, Irwin, and Raghavan, 2011, Finding a \"Kneedle\" in a Haystack, IEEE ICDCS). Normalize k and inertia to the unit square, draw the chord from the first point to the last, and take the k farthest from that chord; a smooth curve often places this knee to the right of the bend a person sees. Literature \"elbow\" means inspecting within-cluster dispersion versus k (Thorndike RL, 1953, Who belongs in the family?, Psychometrika 18(4):267-276) — not a second-difference formula. The discrete-curvature elbow (visual elbow, computed) maximizes the second difference of inertia (HABIT pre-v1.0 elbow); it is not a Thorndike formula. The habitat map keeps the Kneedle K; other Ks are only in the table below. Full comparison: :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm`. The same HABIT elbow/Kneedle rule as on the two-step page, now scored on every pooled voxel instead of on 60 supervoxels."
msgstr "HABIT 验证中的 ``elbow`` 与 ``kneedle`` 是同一规则。它对 k-means 惯性（簇内平方和）运行 ``KneeLocator`` ，曲线凸、方向递减（Satopaa, Albrecht, Irwin, and Raghavan, 2011, Finding a \"Kneedle\" in a Haystack, IEEE ICDCS）。将 k 与惯性归一化到单位正方形，画出首末点弦线，取离该弦最远的 k；光滑曲线上该拐点常落在肉眼所见弯折的右侧。文献中的 \"elbow\" 指观察簇内离散度随 k 的变化（Thorndike RL, 1953, Who belongs in the family?, Psychometrika 18(4):267-276）——并非二阶差分公式。离散曲率肘部（视觉肘部、计算得到）最大化惯性的二阶差分（HABIT pre-v1.0 elbow）；它不是 Thorndike 公式。生境图保留 Kneedle 的 K；其他 K 仅见于下表。完整对照： :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm` 。与两步法页相同的 HABIT elbow/Kneedle 规则，现对每个池化体素计分，而非对 60 个超体素。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_03_pooled_voxels.rst:348
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_05_pooled_voxels_spec.rst:348
msgid "One overlay per patient"
msgstr "每位患者一张叠加图"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_03_pooled_voxels.rst:349
msgid "Ids are shared, so the same colour is the same habitat in both maps."
msgstr "Id 共享，故两图中同色为同一生境。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_03_pooled_voxels.rst:402
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_05_pooled_voxels_spec.rst:403
msgid "One row per patient. Pooled-voxel fits assign labels from one shared model, so habitat ids are already comparable across subjects and do not need matching (matching is for separate fits / one-step)."
msgstr "每位患者一行。池化体素拟合由一个共享模型分配标签，因此生境编号在受试者间已可比较，无需匹配（匹配用于分别拟合 / 一步法）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_03_pooled_voxels.rst:438
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_05_pooled_voxels_spec.rst:439
msgid "Arterial-phase intensity inside each habitat"
msgstr "各生境内的动脉期强度"
