#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:22
msgid "Two-step habitats from atomic components"
msgstr "由原子组件构建两步法生境"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` declares a whole habitat study in one :class:`~habit.spec.HabitatSpec` and runs it with one ``Study(spec).fit_predict(...)`` call (serial ``RunPolicy``, continue on subject failure). Behind that call sit a handful of ordinary Python objects: a voxel feature extractor, two preprocessing chains, a supervoxelizer, a habitat model fitter, an assigner and four habitat feature extractors. Each of them is public and can be called on one subject, in memory, without a spec, a YAML file or an output folder."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 在一个 :class:`~habit.spec.HabitatSpec` 中声明整项生境研究，并用一次 ``Study(spec).fit_predict(...)`` 运行（串行 ``RunPolicy`` ，受试者失败时 continue）。该调用背后是一组普通 Python 对象：体素特征提取器、两条预处理链、超体素化器、生境模型拟合器、分配器与四个生境特征提取器。它们均为公开 API，可在单受试者、内存中调用，无需 spec、YAML 或输出文件夹。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:34
msgid "**Purpose.** You will rebuild the approved two-step analysis of :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` (two training patients, four DCE phases, ROI ``LAP``, seed 0) from those components, as a plain per-subject loop. Then ``Study`` runs the same spec, and the page checks that both paths give the same habitat labels voxel for voxel, the same model id and the same feature table. Finally the atomic path labels a third, new patient, and the atomic model is handed to ``Study.from_model`` to label the same patient again."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 你将用组件重建 :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 的已批准两步法分析（两名训练患者、四个 DCE 期、ROI ``LAP`` 、seed 0），以 plain 逐受试者循环实现。然后 ``Study`` 运行相同 spec，页面检查两路径体素级生境标签、model id 与特征表一致。最后 atomic 路径标注第三名新患者，并将 atomic 模型交给 ``Study.from_model`` 再次标注同一患者。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:43
msgid "**When to use.** When you want to see what ``Study`` does inside, or when you need a single step in your own pipeline -- a MONAI transform chain, a notebook, a service -- and do not want HABIT's orchestration around it. For a normal study, ``Study`` is shorter and records the run manifest for you."
msgstr ""
"**何时使用。** 想看清 ``Study`` 内部，或只需在自有流水线（MONAI 变换链、notebook、服务）中单步执行且不要 HABIT 编排时。常规研究用 ``Study`` 更短且会记录运行清单。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:49
msgid "**Analysis definition.** The approved two-step definition, unchanged: raw intensities of four phases, subject-level winsorize + z-score, 30 k-means supervoxels, cohort-level 10-bin uniform binning, k-means with 2..10 habitats chosen by the elbow rule, nearest-centroid assignment, then volume, MSI, ITH and graph features. Nothing is varied; only the way the steps are called changes."
msgstr "**分析定义。** 经审定的两步法定义保持不变：四个时相的原始强度、受试者级 winsorize + z-score、30 个 k-means 超体素、队列级 10 箱均匀分箱、按肘部法则在 2..10 个生境中选择的 k-means、最近质心分配，随后提取体积、MSI、ITH 与图特征。定义本身不变；变化的只是各步骤的调用方式。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:58
msgid "**voxel field** -- the table of voxel features of one subject (one row per ROI voxel, one column per feature), plus where each voxel sits in the image."
msgstr "**体素场** — 单受试者体素特征表（每 ROI 体素一行、每特征一列），以及各体素在图像中的位置。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:61
msgid "**subject-level chain** -- preprocessing that uses each patient's own statistics; it has no fitted state, so it is simply called."
msgstr "**subject-level chain** — 使用各患者自身统计的预处理；无拟合状态，直接调用。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:63
msgid "**supervoxelization** -- the supervoxel label map of one subject and one feature row per supervoxel."
msgstr "**supervoxelization** — 单受试者的超体素标签图及每超体素一行特征。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:65
msgid "**cohort-level chain** -- preprocessing fitted once on the pooled training rows; its fitted state must be stored with the model."
msgstr "**队列级链** —— 在池化训练行上拟合一次的预处理；拟合状态须与模型一并存储。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:67
msgid "**fitter / model / assigner** -- the fitter learns centroids from the pooled rows and returns a ``HabitatModel``; the model's assigner paints habitat ids onto one subject."
msgstr ""
"**fitter / model / assigner** — 拟合器从池化行学习质心并返回 ``HabitatModel`` ；模型的 assigner 将生境 id 绘制到单受试者。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:70
msgid "**habitat feature extractor** -- turns one subject's habitat map into one row of the feature table."
msgstr "**habitat feature extractor** — 将单受试者生境图变为特征表的一行。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:73
msgid "Two things ``Study`` does for you are also done here, just less visibly. First, it aligns each ROI mask onto the image grid; the raw voxel feature extractor does that itself (the demo masks have a different origin and direction from their images), so calling the extractor directly gets the same aligned voxels. Second, ``Study`` seeds every stochastic component with ``spec.random_seed``; below the same seed is passed to each component with ``set_random_state(0)``, which is why the two paths can agree bit for bit."
msgstr ""
"``Study`` 为你做的两件事此处也会做，只是不那么显眼。其一，将每个 ROI 掩膜对齐到图像网格；原始体素特征提取器自行完成（演示掩膜与图像 origin/direction 不同），直接调用提取器得到相同对齐体素。其二， ``Study`` 用 ``spec.random_seed`` 为每个随机组件设种子；下文对每个组件 ``set_random_state(0)`` ，故两路径可比特一致。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:86
msgid "Same data, same split as the Spec page: two training patients (subj001, subj002) and one new patient (subj003). sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
msgstr "与 Spec 页相同的数据与划分：两名训练患者（subj001、subj002）与一名新患者（subj003）。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:169
msgid "Build the components"
msgstr "构建组件"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:170
msgid "Each object below is the Python twin of one stage in the spec of :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec`. Nothing is computed yet: the objects only hold their settings."
msgstr ""
"下列各对象是 :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 规范中某阶段的 Python 对应物。尚未计算：对象仅保存设置。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:229
msgid "Step 1: per-subject features and supervoxels"
msgstr "步骤 1：受试者级特征与超体素"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:230
msgid "An explicit loop over subjects. Every call takes ONE subject (or one subject's result) and returns an in-memory object, so any line of this loop can be lifted into another pipeline on its own."
msgstr "显式循环受试者。每次调用处理 **一个** 受试者（或一个受试者结果）并返回内存对象，因此本循环任一行可单独嵌入其他流水线。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:234
msgid "``with_feature_frame`` swaps the feature table of the voxel field for the preprocessed one and records which step produced it (the ``produced_by`` label and the chain's spec fingerprint go into the provenance of everything computed afterwards)."
msgstr ""
"``with_feature_frame`` 将体素场的特征表换为预处理后表，并记录由哪一步产生（ ``produced_by`` 标签与链的 spec 指纹进入此后一切计算的溯源）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:274
msgid "Step 2: pool the subject-normalized supervoxels"
msgstr "步骤 2： pool the 受试者-normalized 超体素"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:275
msgid "``pool`` is just a concatenation of every training subject's supervoxel rows. After per-feature per-subject z-score there is no cohort-level binning or cohort z-score by default."
msgstr "``pool`` 只是拼接每位训练受试者的超体素行。逐特征逐受试者 z-score 后，默认无队列级分箱或队列 z-score。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:303
msgid "Step 3: fit the habitat model and assign labels"
msgstr "步骤 3：拟合生境模型并分配标签"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:304
msgid "The fitter clusters the subject-normalized supervoxel rows once for the whole training cohort and returns a ``HabitatModel`` (the centroids). New patients recompute their own subject z-score, then meet these centroids — training mean/std are never applied to them."
msgstr "拟合器对受试者归一化后的超体素行在整个训练队列上聚类一次，并返回 ``HabitatModel`` （质心）。新患者先重算自己的受试者 z-score，再与这些质心相遇——训练均值/标准差从不作用于他们。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:341
msgid "How many habitats (elbow / Kneedle caveat)"
msgstr "生境数量（elbow / Kneedle 说明）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:342
msgid "HABIT validation ``elbow`` is the same rule as ``kneedle``. It runs ``KneeLocator`` on k-means inertia (within-cluster sum of squares), curve convex, direction decreasing (Satopaa, Albrecht, Irwin, and Raghavan, 2011, Finding a \"Kneedle\" in a Haystack, IEEE ICDCS). Normalize k and inertia to the unit square, draw the chord from the first point to the last, and take the k farthest from that chord; a smooth curve often places this knee to the right of the bend a person sees. Literature \"elbow\" means inspecting within-cluster dispersion versus k (Thorndike RL, 1953, Who belongs in the family?, Psychometrika 18(4):267-276) — not a second-difference formula. The discrete-curvature elbow (visual elbow, computed) maximizes the second difference of inertia (HABIT pre-v1.0 elbow); it is not a Thorndike formula. Habitat maps below keep the Kneedle K. See :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm`."
msgstr ""
"HABIT 验证 ``elbow`` 与 ``kneedle`` 规则相同：对 k-means 惯性运行 ``KneeLocator`` ，曲线凸、方向递减（Satopaa 等，2011，IEEE ICDCS）。归一化 k 与惯性到单位正方形，连首尾弦，取距弦最远 k；平滑曲线常使膝点偏右。文献 “elbow” 指观察簇内离散度随 k（Thorndike RL，1953）— 非二阶差分。离散曲率 elbow 最大化惯性二阶差（HABIT v1.0 前 elbow）；非 Thorndike 公式。下文生境图保留 Kneedle K。见 :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:426
msgid "Step 4: the feature table"
msgstr "步骤 4：特征表"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:427
msgid "Every habitat feature extractor is called as ``extractor(subject, habitat_map)`` and returns a one-row table. ``join`` glues the four families side by side; ``concat`` stacks the subjects."
msgstr ""
"每个生境特征提取器调用为 ``extractor(subject, habitat_map)`` 并返回单行表。 ``join`` 将四族并排； ``concat`` 堆叠受试者。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:464
msgid "Check against Study"
msgstr "与 Study 对照"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:465
msgid "The approved spec, run with ``Study``. Same data, same seed, so the labels must match voxel for voxel and the model id (a digest of the fitter settings and the training subjects) must be the same. Each check prints True or False."
msgstr ""
"经批准的规范，用 ``Study`` 运行。相同数据、相同种子，标签须逐体素一致，model id（拟合器设置与训练受试者的摘要）须相同。每项检查打印 True 或 False。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:542
msgid "Label a new patient with the atomic path"
msgstr "用原子路径标记新患者"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:543
msgid "A new patient goes through the same per-subject steps (its OWN winsorize 1% + z-score, its own 30 supervoxels), then the TRAINING centroids. Nothing is refitted; no cohort bin edges are applied."
msgstr "新患者走相同的受试者级步骤（其 **自身的** winsorize 1% + z-score，以及自身的 30 个超体素），再使用 **训练** 质心。不重新拟合；也不应用队列箱边界。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:604
msgid "Hand the atomic model to Study"
msgstr "将原子模型交给 Study"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:605
msgid "The model built above can also drive ``Study.predict``. A model fitted directly with ``fitter.fit(...)`` holds the centroids and the cohort bin edges, but not the upstream stages (which voxel features, which subject-level scaling, how many supervoxels). ``spec=spec`` supplies them, so ``Study`` puts the new patient through the same stages before the stored bin edges and centroids are applied."
msgstr ""
"上述模型也可驱动 ``Study.predict`` 。直接用 ``fitter.fit(...)`` 拟合的模型持有质心与队列分箱边界，但不含上游阶段（哪些体素特征、受试者级缩放、多少超体素）。 ``spec=spec`` 提供它们，故 ``Study`` 在应用存储的分箱边界与质心前让新患者走相同阶段。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:652
msgid "When this page was built, the atomic path produced:"
msgstr "构建本页时，原子路径产出："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:654
msgid "30 supervoxels per training patient (34694 ROI voxels in subj001, 9858 in subj002), 60 pooled rows with 4 feature columns."
msgstr "每名训练患者 30 个超体素（subj001 34694 ROI 体素，subj002 9858），60 行池化、4 特征列。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:656
msgid "K = 4 habitats chosen by the elbow rule, and the same model id as ``Study`` (``same model id: True``)."
msgstr "K = 4 个生境由肘部规则选定，与 ``Study`` 相同 model id（ ``same model id: True`` ）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:658
msgid "Every \"identical\" / \"allclose\" check above printed ``True``: the label maps of both training patients, the 453-column feature table, and the new patient's map from the atomic path, ``Study.predict`` and ``Study.from_model(model, spec=spec)``."
msgstr "上面每一项 “identical” / “allclose” 检查均打印 ``True`` ：两名训练患者的标签图、453 列特征表，以及原子路径、 ``Study.predict`` 与 ``Study.from_model(model, spec=spec)`` 为新患者得到的图。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:662
msgid "The new patient (subj003) uses all four habitats, with ROI fractions 0.191, 0.321, 0.396 and 0.092 for habitats 1 to 4."
msgstr ""
"The new patient (subj003) uses all four 生境, with ROI fractions 0.191, 0.321, 0.396 and 0.092 for 生境 1 to 4."
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:665
msgid "The checks show that the components reproduce ``Study`` exactly on this data and seed. They say nothing about whether K = 4 is a good habitat definition; two patients are a demo, not a cohort."
msgstr "检查表明组件在此数据与 seed 上精确复现 ``Study`` 。它们不说明 K = 4 是否是好生境定义；两名患者只是演示，不是队列。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step.rst:673
msgid "The other two designs (inside each subject, pooled voxels) built from components: :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_04_atomic_inside_each_subject`."
msgstr "另两种设计（受试者内、池化体素）由组件构建： :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_04_atomic_inside_each_subject` 。"
