msgstr ":ref:`转到文末 <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_01_building_habitat_maps_plot_07_quality_control.py>` 可下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:22
msgid "Quality control of habitat maps"
msgstr "栖息地地图的质量控制"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** A habitat model always returns a map, even when the definition behind it is poor. Two failure patterns are common and easy to miss if you only read the feature table: a **one-block** map, where most of a tumour falls into a single habitat (often because the scan is globally brighter or darker than the training scans), and a **fragmented** map, where habitats break into many tiny specks that no reader would call a region. Both still produce volume fractions, MSI and ITH numbers, so they must be caught by looking and by simple checks."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** 生境模型总返回一张图，即使背后定义很差。若只读特征表，两种常见且易漏的失败模式： **单块** 图——肿瘤大部分落入单一生境（常因扫描整体比训练更亮/更暗）； **碎片化** 图——生境裂成许多读者不会称为区域的小点。两者仍产生体积分数、MSI 与 ITH，须靠目视与简单检查发现。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:33
msgid "**Purpose.** You will run a short QC checklist on the approved analysis definition: overlays on several slices and all three axes, the supervoxel / habitat triptych, the elbow curve that chose the number of habitats, per-habitat volume fractions per subject, and three numeric flags per map (one-block, missing habitat, fragmented). Then you will run a deliberately poor definition next to it and print the same flags for both."
msgstr "**目的。** 你将对经审定的分析定义运行一份简短 QC 清单：若干切片与三个轴向上的叠加图、超体素/生境三联图、用于选择生境数的肘部曲线、每位受试者的各生境体积分数，以及每张图的三个数值标志（单块、缺失生境、碎片化）。随后再并排运行一个刻意较差的定义，并打印两者的相同标志。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:41
msgid "**When to use.** After every fit and every prediction on new patients, before the feature table goes into statistics. The flags are cheap; the figures are for the maps the flags point at."
msgstr "**何时使用。** 每次拟合与对新患者的每次预测之后、特征表进入统计之前。标志位代价低；图用于标志所指的生境图。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:47
msgid "**analysis definition** -- the approved two-step stage list of :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec`, fitted on subj001 + subj002; subj003..subj005 are labelled with the saved model."
msgstr "**分析定义** —— :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 中已批准的两步法阶段列表，在 subj001 + subj002 上拟合；subj003..subj005 用已保存模型打标签。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:50
msgid "**one-block flag** -- the largest habitat covers more than 60 % of the ROI. The 60 % is a threshold chosen for this page, not a published cut-off; set your own from your cohort."
msgstr "**单块标志** ——最大生境覆盖 ROI 超过 60 %。60 % 为本页所选阈值，非发表截断值；请按队列自定。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:53
msgid "**missing-habitat flag** -- fewer habitats are present in the map than the model has."
msgstr "**missing-habitat 标志** — 图中生境数少于模型生境数。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:55
msgid "**fragmented flag** -- more than 5 % of ROI voxels sit in connected pieces smaller than 10 voxels (face connectivity, the same connectivity the ITH score uses). Both numbers are page choices."
msgstr ""
"**fragmented flag** — ROI 体素超过 5% 位于小于 10 体素的面连通碎块中（与 ITH 相同连通性）。两数为页面设定。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:58
msgid "**ITH score** -- 0 when every habitat is one blob, close to 1 when habitats split into many pieces; printed next to the flags."
msgstr "**ITH 分数** —— 每个生境都是一整块时为 0，生境碎成许多块时接近 1；打印在标志旁。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:61
msgid "**What varies.** Only subject-level normalization. The \"poor\" definition is the approved stage list with the two subject-level stages (winsorize, min-max) removed; every other stage, parameter and seed is the same. Because the elbow rule then runs on different features, it may keep a different number of habitats; that is part of the result."
msgstr ""
"**变化项。** 仅受试者级归一化。“较差”定义为批准阶段列表去掉两个受试者级阶段（winsorize、min-max）；其余阶段、参数与 seed 相同。elbow 在不同特征上运行可能保留不同生境数；属结果一部分。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:69
msgid "The demo has five patients: two train the model here and three are new. These are demo checks of mechanics, not a validated QC protocol."
msgstr "演示有五名患者：此处两名训练模型，三名是新患者。这些是机制演示检查，非经验证的 QC 方案。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:72
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_08_cleaning_maps.rst:65
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:64
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:79
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:78
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:74
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_07_postprocess.rst:65
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:60
msgid "Change ``DATA`` / ``MODALITIES`` / ``ROI`` to your preprocessed tree."
msgstr "将 ``DATA`` / ``MODALITIES`` / ``ROI`` 改为您的预处理树。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:77
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:79
msgid "Load the cohort and split it"
msgstr "加载队列并划分"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:78
msgid "subj001 and subj002 define the habitats; subj003..subj005 are new patients labelled with the saved model. This is the 5-subject demo cohort split in two. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 4"
msgstr ""
"subj001 与 subj002 定义生境；subj003..subj005 为用已保存模型标注的新患者。这是拆成两部分的 5 受试者演示队列。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 4"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:157
msgid "Two definitions that differ in one factor"
msgstr "仅差一个因素的两种定义"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:158
msgid "``build_spec`` returns the approved stage list. With ``normalize=False`` it drops the two subject-level stages and changes nothing else, so any difference between the two runs comes from per-patient normalization alone."
msgstr ""
"``build_spec`` 返回批准的阶段列表。 ``normalize=False`` 时去掉两个受试者级阶段且其余不变，故两运行差异仅来自逐患者归一化。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:223
msgid "Fit the approved definition and label the new patients"
msgstr "符合批准的定义并标记新患者"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:224
msgid "``fit_predict`` learns the habitats on the two training patients. ``Study.from_model(...).predict`` labels the new patients with those centroids and the stored bin edges, without refitting."
msgstr ""
"``fit_predict`` 在两名训练患者上学习生境。 ``Study.from_model(...).predict`` 用这些质心与存储 bin 边界标注新患者，不重拟合。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:284
msgid "Check 1: the number of habitats"
msgstr "检查1：栖息地数量"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:285
msgid "The elbow curve should have a visible bend at the kept count. A curve with no bend means the count is a guess; look at neighbouring counts before trusting the maps."
msgstr "elbow 曲线在保留的 K 处应有可见拐点。无拐点表示 K 是猜测；信任生境图前应查看邻近 K。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:396
msgid "Check 2: supervoxels and habitats on one slice"
msgstr "Check 2: 超体素 and 生境 on one slice"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:397
msgid "The triptych shows whether habitats follow the supervoxel patches and the anatomy. Habitats that cut straight through uniform tissue, or supervoxels that ignore visible edges, are worth a second look."
msgstr "三联图显示生境是否贴合超体素斑块与解剖结构。若生境径直切开均匀组织，或超体素无视可见边界，都值得再看一眼。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:433
msgid "Check 3: overlays on all three axes and several slices"
msgstr "检查 3：在所有三个轴和几个切片上的叠加"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:434
msgid "The default overlay draws the three orthogonal planes (each at its densest habitat slice). One slice can hide a one-block or speckled region, so two more axial slices are drawn near the top and bottom quarter of the tumour."
msgstr "默认叠加绘制三个正交平面（各取生境最密层）。单层可掩盖单块或斑点区，故在肿瘤上下四分之一附近再绘两幅轴位层。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:514
msgid "Check 4: numeric flags for every map"
msgstr "检查 4：每张图的数值标志"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:515
msgid "``qc_flags`` reads only the label array. It reports the fraction of each habitat, how many of the model's habitats are present, how many connected pieces there are, the share of voxels in tiny pieces and the ITH score, and turns three of them into True / False flags."
msgstr ""
"``qc_flags`` 只读标签数组。报告各生境占比、模型生境出现数、连通片数、小片体素占比与 ITH 分数，并将其中三项转为 True/False 标志。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:628
msgid "Check 5: volume fractions per subject"
msgstr "检查 5：各受试者体积分数"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:629
msgid "One bar chart per new patient. A healthy map spreads its voxels over several habitats; one tall bar is the one-block pattern."
msgstr "每位新患者一张柱状图。健康的生境图把体素分散到多个生境；一根很高的柱表示单块模式。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:678
msgid "A deliberately poor definition"
msgstr "故意较差的一种定义"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:679
msgid "Same stages without the subject-level normalization. MR intensities are in arbitrary units, so a new patient whose scan is globally darker or brighter than the training scans is pushed towards the centroids nearest its overall intensity level."
msgstr "去掉受试者级归一化的相同阶段。MR 强度为任意单位，扫描整体较训练集更暗或更亮的新患者会被推向与其整体强度水平最近的质心。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:748
msgid "The flags side by side"
msgstr "标志并排对比"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:749
msgid "One row per subject and definition; only the flag columns and the numbers they are based on."
msgstr "每名受试者与定义各一行；仅标志列及其依据的数字。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:789
msgid "Look at the worst map under both definitions"
msgstr "在两种定义下查看最差图"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:790
msgid "The new patient with the largest single-habitat fraction under the poor definition, drawn under both definitions with the same crop window so the two figures show the same anatomy."
msgstr "在较差定义下单生境占比最大的新患者，用相同裁剪窗在两种定义下绘制，使两图解剖一致。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:876
msgid "Measured on this run (approved definition: K = 4 on subj001 + subj002; poor definition without subject-level winsorize / z-score: K = 5):"
msgstr ""
"Measured on this run (approved definition: K = 4 on subj001 + subj002; poor definition without 受试者-level winsorize / z-score: K = 5):"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:879
msgid "Approved maps for all five patients: no one-block, no missing habitat, no fragmented flag. Largest habitat 33--48 % of the ROI; tiny-piece share 0.5--1.4 %; ITH 0.84--0.98."
msgstr ""
"五名患者均已批准图：无单块、无缺失生境、无 fragmented 标志。最大生境占 ROI 33–48%；小碎块占比 0.5–1.4%；ITH 0.84–0.98。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:882
msgid "Without subject-level normalization, held-out subj004 and subj005 raised the one-block flag (largest habitat 61 % and 67 %) and both missed two of the five habitats. Training patients stayed clear of those flags but the elbow kept a different K."
msgstr "若不做受试者级归一化，留出的 subj004 与 subj005 会触发单块标志（最大生境占 61% 与 67%），且二者都缺失五个生境中的两个。训练患者未出现这些标志，但肘部法则保留了不同的 K。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:886
msgid "Volume-stage fractions matched the label-array fractions in both runs (cross-check True)."
msgstr "体积阶段分数与两次运行的标签数组分数一致（交叉检查 True）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:889
msgid "The 60 % / 5 % / 10-voxel thresholds are page choices. Set your own from your cohort before treating a flag as a reject rule."
msgstr "60 % / 5 % / 10 体素阈值为页面选择。在将标志当作剔除规则前请按队列自定。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:896
msgid "The approved analysis these checks run on: :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec`."
msgstr "这些检查所依据的已批准分析： :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:898
msgid "Remove tiny pieces from a map that the fragmented flag points at: :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_08_cleaning_maps`."
msgstr "从碎片化标志所指向的生境图中去掉细小碎块： :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_08_cleaning_maps` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:900
msgid "How the maps react to a slightly larger or smaller ROI: :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features`."
msgstr "地图对略大或略小 ROI 的反应： :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:902
msgid "Choosing the number of habitats with other criteria: :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm`."
msgstr "用其他准则选择生境数量： :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:904
msgid "The volume fraction and ITH definitions: :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_01_volume_fractions` and :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_03_ith`."
msgstr "体积分数与 ITH 定义： :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_01_volume_fractions` 与 :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_03_ith` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_07_quality_control.rst:911
msgid "**Total running time of the script:** (0 minutes 46.979 seconds)"
msgstr "**脚本总运行时间：** （0 分 46.979 秒）"
