msgid ":download:`Download zipped: plot_07_quality_control.zip <plot_07_quality_control.zip>`"
msgstr ""
":download:`Download zipped: plot_07_quality_control.zip <plot_07_quality_control.zip>`"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_08_cleaning_maps.rst:13
msgid ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_01_building_habitat_maps_plot_08_cleaning_maps.py>` to download the full example code."
msgstr ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_01_building_habitat_maps_plot_08_cleaning_maps.py>` 以下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_08_cleaning_maps.rst:22
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_07_postprocess.rst:22
msgid "Cleaning habitat maps (connected components)"
msgstr "清理生境图（连通分量）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_08_cleaning_maps.rst:24
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_07_postprocess.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** Habitat assignment paints every ROI voxel with a nearest centroid id. That can leave tiny islands of a few voxels that no reader would call a region, and that inflate ITH and graph metrics. Connected- component cleanup drops islands smaller than a size cut-off and fills those voxels with neighbouring habitat ids, so the map stays the same definition with less speck."
msgstr "**背景。** 生境分配用最近质心 id 给 ROI 内每个体素着色。这可能留下仅含几个体素、读者不会当作区域的小岛屿，并抬高 ITH 与图指标。连通域清理会丢弃小于尺寸阈值的岛屿，并用邻近生境 id 填充这些体素，使生境图在定义不变的前提下减少斑点。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_08_cleaning_maps.rst:31
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_07_postprocess.rst:31
msgid "**Purpose.** You will run the approved two-step analysis twice on the same two training patients: once without cleanup, once with a connected- component stage after assignment. You will count the pieces and the share of voxels in tiny islands before and after, overlay both maps on the same slice, and see that volume fractions change only by the voxels that were reassigned."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 在同一两名训练患者上运行批准的两步法两次：一次无清理，一次在分配后加连通分量阶段。统计清理前后片数与小岛体素占比，在同一层切片叠加两图，并看到体积分数仅因重分配体素而变。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_08_cleaning_maps.rst:38
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_07_postprocess.rst:38
msgid "**When to use.** When QC or a reader flags fragmented maps, or when you have decided in advance that habitats smaller than a few dozen voxels are not biologically meaningful for your study. Cleanup is part of the analysis definition: report the size cut-off with the methods."
msgstr ""
"**何时使用。** QC 或阅片者标记碎片化地图时，或事先决定小于数十体素的生境对本研究无生物学意义时。清理属于分析定义：方法中报告尺寸截断。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_08_cleaning_maps.rst:45
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_07_postprocess.rst:45
msgid "**analysis definition** -- the approved two-step stage list of :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` (subject-level winsorize 1 % / 1 % + min-max, 30 k-means supervoxels, cohort-level 10-bin uniform binning, k-means 2..10 by elbow, nearest centroid)."
msgstr ""
"**分析定义** — :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 的已批准两步法阶段列表（受试者级 winsorize 1 % / 1 % + min-max，30 个 k-means 超体素，队列级 10 箱均匀分箱，k-means 2..10 由 elbow 选择，最近质心）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_08_cleaning_maps.rst:49
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_07_postprocess.rst:49
msgid "**what varies** -- only the optional ``postprocess_habitat`` stage after ``assign``. Everything else, including the seed, is identical."
msgstr ""
"**what varies** — 仅 ``postprocess_habitat`` 后可选 ``assign`` 阶段。其余含 seed 完全相同。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_08_cleaning_maps.rst:51
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_07_postprocess.rst:51
msgid "**connected component** -- a maximal set of face-adjacent voxels that share the same habitat id (connectivity 1 = 6-neighbourhood in 3-D)."
msgstr "**连通分量** ——共享同一生境 id 的面邻接体素极大集（connectivity 1 = 三维 6 邻域）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_08_cleaning_maps.rst:53
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_07_postprocess.rst:53
msgid "**min_component_size** -- islands with fewer voxels than this are removed and refilled by a neighbour vote (``neighbor_vote``)."
msgstr "**min_component_size** —— 体素数少于此的岛被移除并由邻域投票（ ``neighbor_vote`` ）重填。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_08_cleaning_maps.rst:55
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_07_postprocess.rst:55
