#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:22
msgid "Habitats from a single sequence"
msgstr "来自单一序列的栖息地"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** Many studies have only one usable MR sequence, for example a single post-contrast series. Habitat analysis still works, but with one feature column the habitats mean something narrower: they are intensity strata inside the tumour, not enhancement-kinetics patterns (which need several phases)."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** 许多研究仅有一条可用 MR 序列，例如单期 post-contrast。生境分析仍可行，但单列特征下生境含义更窄：为肿瘤内强度分层，而非增强动力学模式（需多期）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:30
msgid "**Purpose.** You will run the approved two-step analysis of :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` on the arterial-phase (LAP) image alone, look at the number of habitats the elbow rule picks, view the habitat maps of a training patient and of a new patient labelled with the fitted model, and check what each habitat means by its LAP intensity distribution."
msgstr "**目的。** 你将在单独的动脉期（LAP）图像上运行 :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 中经审定的两步法分析，查看肘部法则选出的生境数，查看一位训练患者以及用拟合模型标注的新患者的生境图，并通过各生境的 LAP 强度分布核对每个生境的含义。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:37
msgid "**When to use.** Only one sequence is available, or you want a single-sequence baseline to compare with a multi-phase definition."
msgstr "**何时使用。** 仅有一种序列可用，或需要单序列基线与多期定义对比。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:40
msgid "**Analysis definition.** The approved two-step definition with one deviation: ``MODALITIES`` holds only ``\"LAP\"`` instead of the four DCE phases. Every other stage, the seed, and the training / new-patient split (subj001 + subj002 train, subj003 is new) are the same as on the Spec page."
msgstr ""
"**分析定义。** 已批准两步法定义，唯一偏差： ``MODALITIES`` 仅 ``\"LAP\"`` 而非四 DCE 期。其余阶段、seed、训练/新患者划分（subj001 + subj002 训练，subj003 为新）与 Spec 页相同。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:48
msgid "**intensity stratum** -- with one feature, each habitat is a band of normalized intensity inside the tumour (for example \"darkest third\")."
msgstr "**intensity stratum** — 单特征时，各生境为肿瘤内归一化强度带（例如「最暗三分之一」）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:50
msgid "**subject-level normalization** -- winsorize and min-max with each patient's own statistics. With one sequence this makes habitats *relative within each tumour*: the brightest habitat is the brightest part of that tumour, whatever its absolute signal."
msgstr "**受试者级归一化** —— 用每位患者自身的统计量做 winsorize 与 min-max。仅有一个序列时，这使生境成为 *各肿瘤内部的相对划分* ：最亮的生境是该肿瘤中最亮的部分，与其绝对信号无关。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:54
msgid "**cohort-level preprocessing** -- 10 equal-width bins learned on the pooled training supervoxels, stored in the model, reused on new patients."
msgstr "**队列级预处理** — 在池化训练超体素上学 10 等宽 bin，存入模型，新患者复用。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:60
msgid "Two training patients are a demo, not a cohort. A single-sequence habitat says nothing about wash-in or wash-out; do not interpret it as a perfusion pattern."
msgstr "两名训练患者是演示，不是队列。单序列生境不代表灌注进出；勿解读为灌注模式。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:69
msgid "Load one sequence"
msgstr "加载一个序列"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:70
msgid "``MODALITIES`` has one entry, so every voxel has one feature: its LAP intensity. Two patients train the model and the third is a new patient, exactly as on the four-phase Spec page. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 2"
msgstr ""
"``MODALITIES`` 仅一项，故每体素一个特征：LAP 强度。两患者训练、第三名为新患者，与四阶段 Spec 页相同。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 2"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:140
msgid "The same stages, one column"
msgstr "相同阶段，一列"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:141
msgid "Only ``MODALITIES`` changed. Winsorize and min-max still run per patient (subject-level); binning still runs once on the pooled training supervoxels (cohort-level) and is stored in the model. With one column, binning turns each supervoxel into one of 10 intensity levels, so the fitter clusters at most 10 distinct values."
msgstr "仅改变了 ``MODALITIES`` 。Winsorize 与 min-max 仍按患者运行（受试者级）；分箱仍在池化的训练超体素上运行一次（队列级）并存储于模型。只有一列时，分箱把每个超体素变成 10 个强度等级之一，因此拟合器最多对 10 个不同值聚类。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:228
msgid "HABIT validation ``elbow`` is the same rule as ``kneedle``. It runs ``KneeLocator`` on k-means inertia (within-cluster sum of squares), curve convex, direction decreasing (Satopaa, Albrecht, Irwin, and Raghavan, 2011, Finding a \"Kneedle\" in a Haystack, IEEE ICDCS). Normalize k and inertia to the unit square, draw the chord from the first point to the last, and take the k farthest from that chord; a smooth curve often places this knee to the right of the bend a person sees. Literature \"elbow\" means inspecting within-cluster dispersion versus k (Thorndike RL, 1953, Who belongs in the family?, Psychometrika 18(4):267-276) — not a second-difference formula. The discrete-curvature elbow (visual elbow, computed) maximizes the second difference of inertia (HABIT pre-v1.0 elbow); it is not a Thorndike formula. The habitat map keeps the Kneedle K; other Ks are only in the table below. Full comparison: :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm`. With one feature the Kneedle knee can sit at a different count than the four-phase analysis. Read K from the model rather than assuming it."
msgstr "HABIT 验证 ``elbow`` 与 ``kneedle`` 同规则。对 k-means inertia（簇内平方和）运行 ``KneeLocator`` ，曲线 convex、方向 decreasing（Satopaa 等，2011，IEEE ICDCS）。将 k 与 inertia 归一化到单位正方形，连首尾点弦，取距弦最远 k；平滑曲线常使膝点偏右于肉眼弯曲。文献“elbow”指观察簇内离散度随 k 变化（Thorndike RL，1953，Psychometrika 18(4):267-276）——非二阶差分公式。离散曲率 elbow（可视 elbow，计算）最大化 inertia 二阶差（HABIT v1.0 前 elbow）；非 Thorndike 公式。生境图保留 Kneedle 的 K；其他 K 仅在下表。完整对比： :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm` 。单特征时 Kneedle 膝点可与四期分析不同。应从模型读取 K 而非假设。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:340
msgid "A training patient"
msgstr "一名训练患者"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:379
msgid "A new patient from the fitted model"
msgstr "来自拟合模型的新患者"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:380
msgid "The new patient is normalized with its own statistics, binned with the training bin edges stored in the model, and given the training centroids. Nothing is refitted."
msgstr "新患者用自身统计归一化，用模型中训练 bin 边界分箱，赋予训练质心。不重拟合。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:436
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_02_texture_feature_maps.rst:1148
msgid "What each habitat means"
msgstr "各生境含义"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:437
msgid "Plot the raw LAP intensity of the voxels in each habitat for the training patient. With one sequence the habitats are adjacent intensity bands. The habitat ids are arbitrary names, not a ranking: sort by the printed medians to read them from darkest to brightest."
msgstr "绘制训练患者各生境 raw LAP 强度。单序列时生境为相邻强度带。生境 id 为任意名非排序：按打印中位数从最暗到最亮阅读。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:486
msgid "When this page was built, the LAP-only analysis gave:"
msgstr "构建本页时，仅 LAP 分析给出："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:488
msgid "K = 4 habitats by the elbow rule on subj001 + subj002 (the same count as the four-phase definition on the Spec page, but these are not the same habitats: each one is now an intensity band)."
msgstr "在 subj001 + subj002 上按肘部法则得到 K = 4 个生境（与 Spec 页四期相定义的个数相同，但并非同一组生境：此处每个生境是一个强度带）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:491
msgid "In subj001 the median raw LAP intensity per habitat was 639 (habitat 2), 781 (habitat 4), 924 (habitat 1) and 1068 (habitat 3): four ordered bands, with ids that are names, not ranks."
msgstr ""
"subj001 各生境 LAP 强度中位数为 639（生境 2）、781（生境 4）、924（生境 1）、1068（生境 3）：四档有序带，id 为名称而非秩。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:494
msgid "The new patient subj003 had ROI fractions 0.325, 0.156, 0.145 and 0.374 for habitats 1 to 4, so every band is present in it."
msgstr "新患者 subj003 的生境 1–4 ROI 分数为 0.325、0.156、0.145、0.374，故各带均存在。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:497
msgid "The histograms overlap because habitats are assigned per supervoxel (a patch of voxels), not per voxel, and because normalization is per patient. Nothing here says how these bands relate to perfusion."
msgstr "直方图重叠是因为生境按超体素（体素 patch）而非逐体素分配，且归一化逐患者进行。此处未说明这些带与灌注的关系。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:505
msgid "The four-phase analysis this page reduces to one column: :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec`."
msgstr "本页将四期分析缩减为一列： :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:507
msgid "Add texture so one sequence gives more than intensity strata: :doc:`/auto_examples/02_features/plot_02_texture_feature_maps`."
msgstr "为单序列增加纹理以超越强度分层： :doc:`/auto_examples/02_features/plot_02_texture_feature_maps` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:509
msgid "Choosing the preprocessing: :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_02_subject_preprocess`."
msgstr "选择预处理： :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_02_subject_preprocess` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities.rst:515
msgid "**Total running time of the script:** (0 minutes 10.367 seconds)"
msgstr "**脚本的总运行时间：** （0 分 10.367 秒）"
