#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_04_combining_features.rst:22
msgid "Voxel features"
msgstr "体素特征"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_04_combining_features.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** The ``extract`` stage decides which numbers describe each voxel; habitats can only separate what those columns show. The simplest choice is the image intensities themselves."
msgstr "**背景。** ``extract`` 阶段决定每体素用哪些数描述；生境只能分离这些列所呈现的内容。最简单选择即图像强度本身。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_04_combining_features.rst:28
msgid "**Purpose.** You see the voxel-feature table and matrix that clustering receives with ``raw``, a habitat overlay fitted on it, and how ``concat`` joins two extractors into one wider table."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 展示 ``raw`` 下聚类收到的体素特征表与矩阵、其上拟合的生境叠加，以及 ``concat`` 如何将两提取器合并为更宽表。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_04_combining_features.rst:34
msgid "**voxel feature** / **extract** -- see :doc:`/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities`."
msgstr ""
"**体素特征** / **extract** -- see :doc:`/auto_examples/02_features/plot_01_multi_sequence_intensities`."
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_04_combining_features.rst:36
msgid "**raw** -- one column per listed modality, the intensities unchanged."
msgstr "**raw** —— 每个列出模态一列，强度不变。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_04_combining_features.rst:37
msgid "**concat** -- runs several extractors on the same ROI voxels and joins their columns side by side."
msgstr "**concat** — 在同一 ROI 体素上运行多个提取器并将列横向拼接。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_04_combining_features.rst:40
msgid "Clustering uses the voxel field you define — not a fixed T1 image. This page is the intensity pair: ``raw`` (concatenate modality intensities inside the ROI) and ``concat`` (join families column-wise)."
msgstr ""
"聚类使用您定义的体素场 — 非固定 T1。本页为强度对： ``raw`` （ROI 内拼接模态强度）与 ``concat`` （按列拼接族）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_04_combining_features.rst:44
msgid "Custom formulas and plugins live on the next page. Texture maps follow that. This page is only ``raw`` vs ``concat``."
msgstr "自定义公式与插件在下一页。纹理图在那之后。本页只讲 ``raw`` 与 ``concat`` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_04_combining_features.rst:49
msgid "Load two demo subjects. ``raw`` concatenates LAP and PVP intensities inside the ROI."
msgstr "加载两名演示受试者。 ``raw`` 在 ROI 内拼接 LAP 与 PVP 强度。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_04_combining_features.rst:113
msgid "``raw(modalities)``: one column per series. Print the first voxel rows so you can see the intensities clustering will use (before any feature preprocessor)."
msgstr "``raw(modalities)`` ：每个序列一列。打印前几行体素，以便查看聚类将使用的强度（在任何特征预处理器之前）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_04_combining_features.rst:226
msgid "The matrix clustering sees: one row per ROI voxel, one column per modality (rows subsampled so the heatmap stays legible)."
msgstr "聚类所见矩阵：每 ROI 体素一行，每模态一列（行下采样以保持热图可读）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_04_combining_features.rst:261
msgid "Fit the ``raw`` route and overlay habitats. fit_predict runs every stage of the spec on both subjects: partition, pooled fit (elbow over 2..3 habitats), assign, then the feature stages."
msgstr ""
"拟合 ``raw`` 路径并叠加生境。fit_predict 对两受试者运行 spec 各阶段：partition、池化拟合（elbow 2..3 生境）、assign，再特征阶段。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_04_combining_features.rst:326
msgid "``concat`` joins two ``raw`` extractors column-wise. The head() table should show the same number of rows and more columns."
msgstr "``concat`` 按列连接两个 ``raw`` 提取器。head() 表应行数相同、列更多。"
