#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:13
msgid ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_02_features_plot_05_own_feature_extractor.py>` to download the full example code."
msgstr ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_02_features_plot_05_own_feature_extractor.py>` 以下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:22
msgid "Your own feature extractor as a plugin"
msgstr "将自定义特征提取器作为插件"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** Built-in voxel extractors cover intensities, formulas, kinetics and texture. When your study needs its own voxel-level computation (here, liver DCE enhancement and wash-out ratios), you write a small extractor class, register it under a name, and use that name in a ``Spec`` exactly like a built-in one. The same class can later be shipped as a pip-installable package, so other groups use it by name without copying code or editing HABIT."
msgstr "**背景。** 内置体素提取器覆盖强度、公式、动力学与纹理。当研究需要自定义体素级计算时（此处为肝脏 DCE 强化与廓清比值），可编写小型提取器类，以某个名称注册，并像内置名称一样在 ``Spec`` 中使用。同一类随后也可作为可 pip 安装的包发布，使其他组按名称使用，无需复制代码或修改 HABIT。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:32
msgid "**Purpose.** You will write a ``dce_hemodynamics`` extractor, register it, call it on one subject to see an enhancement map, run the two-step analysis with it as the ``extract`` stage, and see how to declare it as an entry point so that HABIT finds it after ``pip install``."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 你将编写 ``dce_hemodynamics`` 提取器、注册、在单受试者调用查看增强图、以其为 ``extract`` 阶段运行两步法分析，并了解如何通过 entry point 声明以便 ``pip install`` 后 HABIT 发现。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:37
msgid "**When to use.** When the columns you want are not a built-in extractor and a formula string (:doc:`/auto_examples/02_features/plot_03_enhancement_patterns`) is not enough, or when you want to share a feature definition as a package."
msgstr "**何时使用。** 当所需列不是内置提取器且公式字符串（ :doc:`/auto_examples/02_features/plot_03_enhancement_patterns` ）不够，或要将特征定义作为包共享时。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:42
msgid "**Analysis definition.** The approved two-step definition with one deviation: the ``extract`` stage is the custom ``dce_hemodynamics`` extractor (three ratio maps from the four DCE phases) instead of the four raw intensities. Subject-level winsorize + z-score, 30 k-means supervoxels, cohort-level 10-bin binning, k-means 2..10 habitats by elbow, nearest-centroid assignment and seed 0 are unchanged; the page fits on subj001 + subj002 and keeps only the ``volume`` quantify stage."
msgstr ""
"**分析定义。** 经批准两步法，唯一偏差： ``extract`` 为自定义 ``dce_hemodynamics`` （四期 DCE 三幅比值图）而非四列原始强度。受试者级 winsorize + z-score、30 个 k-means 超体素、队列级 10 分箱、k-means 2..10 生境 elbow、最近质心分配与 seed 0 不变；页面在 subj001 + subj002 上拟合且仅保留 ``volume`` quantify 阶段。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:52
msgid "**voxel feature extractor** -- an object with a ``spec`` property and a ``__call__(subject)`` that returns one row per ROI voxel, one column per feature (a :class:`~habit.contracts.VoxelFeatureField`)."
msgstr "**体素特征提取器** — 带 ``spec`` 属性且 ``__call__(subject)`` 返回每 ROI 体素一行、每特征一列（ :class:`~habit.contracts.VoxelFeatureField` ）的对象。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:55
msgid "**registry** -- HABIT's lookup table from a name (``\"dce_hemodynamics\"``) to a component class; ``Spec(\"dce_hemodynamics\", ...)`` finds the class through it."
msgstr ""
"**registry** —— HABIT 从名称（ ``\"dce_hemodynamics\"`` ）到组件类的查找表； ``Spec(\"dce_hemodynamics\", ...)`` 经其找到类。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:58
msgid "**entry point** -- a standard Python packaging hook: your package's ``pyproject.toml`` names a module under a group, and HABIT imports it on request, which runs your registration decorator."
msgstr ""
"**入口点** —— 一个标准的 Python 打包钩子：你的包的 ``pyproject.toml`` 在一个组下命名一个模块，而 HABIT 在请求时导入它，从而运行你的注册装饰器。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:61
msgid "**relative enhancement / wash-out** -- signal gain over the unenhanced phase, and signal loss after the arterial phase, each as a ratio."
msgstr "**相对增强 / 洗出** — 相对未增强期信号增益，以及动脉期后信号损失，均为比值。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:69
msgid "Four DCE phases, ROI ``LAP``. Two subjects define the habitats. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
msgstr "四个 DCE 期相，ROI ``LAP`` 。两名受试者定义生境。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:147
msgid "Write and register the extractor"
msgstr "编写并注册提取器"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:148
msgid "The class needs two things: a ``spec`` property (name + parameters, recorded in the provenance of every result built on it) and a ``__call__`` that takes ONE subject and returns a voxel feature field. The decorator puts the class in the voxel feature registry under the name ``\"dce_hemodynamics\"``; from then on a ``Spec`` can refer to it."
msgstr ""
"类需要两样： ``spec`` 属性（名称+参数，记入基于它的每个结果的溯源）以及接受 **一个** 受试者并返回体素特征场的 ``__call__`` 。装饰器将类注册到体素特征注册表名 ``\"dce_hemodynamics\"`` ；之后 ``Spec`` 可引用它。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:154
msgid "Three public helpers do the bookkeeping:"
msgstr "三个公共助理负责记账："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:156
msgid "``roi_voxels`` -- the ROI mask on the image grid (it resamples the mask when mask and image geometry differ, as in the demo), the in-ROI selector and the voxel coordinates."
msgstr "``roi_voxels`` — 图像网格上的 ROI 掩膜（掩膜与图像几何不同时会重采样，如演示），ROI 内选择器与体素坐标。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:159
msgid "``aligned_image`` -- one phase read on that same grid."
msgstr "``aligned_image`` — 同一网格上读取的一期。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:160
msgid "``build_voxel_field`` -- wraps the value matrix with its grid positions and the spec, so the result can be drawn back into the image and traced."
msgstr "``build_voxel_field`` —— 用网格位置与 spec 包装值矩阵，以便画回图像并溯源。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:258
msgid "Call it on one subject"
msgstr "在一个主题上提出"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:259
msgid "The extractor is an ordinary object: build it by name through the registry (the same lookup a ``Spec`` uses) and call it on one subject."
msgstr "提取器为普通对象：经注册表按名构建（与 ``Spec`` 相同查找）并在单受试者调用。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:316
msgid "Use it by name in a Spec"
msgstr "在 Spec 中按名称使用它"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:317
msgid "Only the ``extract`` stage names the new component. The ratios can have long tails (a small arterial gain in the denominator), so the subject-level winsorize step matters here: it clips each column to the patient's own 1st..99th percentile before min-max puts the three columns on the same 0..1 scale."
msgstr ""
"仅 ``extract`` 阶段命名新组件。比值可有长尾（动脉增益作分母很小），故受试者级 winsorize 重要：每列裁至该患者 1..99 分位，再 min-max 三列至 0..1。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:484
msgid "Habitat maps and what they mean"
msgstr "栖息地地图及其含义"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:485
msgid "The centroid columns are the extractor's feature names, in bin units 0..9 (after subject-level scaling and cohort-level binning)."
msgstr "质心列为提取器的特征名，单位为分箱 0..9（经受试者级缩放与队列级分箱之后）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:556
msgid "Ship it as a package"
msgstr "作为包发布"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:557
msgid "Registering in a script works for your own runs. To let others use ``Spec(\"dce_hemodynamics\", ...)`` without copying the class, put it in a package (say ``my_dce_pkg/features.py``) and declare the module under the registry's entry-point group in that package's ``pyproject.toml``. The group name is ``\"habit.\" + <registry domain>``; ask the registry rather than typing it:"
msgstr "在脚本里注册只适合你自己的运行。若要让他人无需复制类就能使用 ``Spec(\"dce_hemodynamics\", ...)`` ，请把类放进一个包（例如 ``my_dce_pkg/features.py`` ），并在该包的 ``pyproject.toml`` 中把该模块声明到对应注册表的 entry-point 组下。组名为 ``\"habit.\" + <registry domain>`` ；应向注册表查询，而不是手写："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:586
msgid "Declare the entry point and load it"
msgstr "声明 entry point 并加载"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:587
msgid "The declaration in your package's ``pyproject.toml`` is then:"
msgstr "随后在包的 ``pyproject.toml`` 中声明为："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:594
msgid "The entry point names a module; importing it runs the ``@VoxelFeatureExtractorRegistry.register(\"dce_hemodynamics\")`` decorator. After ``pip install my-dce-pkg``, a user calls ``load_plugins()`` once before building the spec. It imports every installed HABIT entry point and reports what it loaded; here no such package is installed, so the list is empty."
msgstr ""
"entry point 命名模块；导入时运行 ``@VoxelFeatureExtractorRegistry.register(\"dce_hemodynamics\")`` 装饰器。 ``pip install my-dce-pkg`` 后，用户在构建 spec 前调用 ``load_plugins()`` 一次。它导入每个已安装 HABIT entry point 并报告加载项；此处未安装此类包，列表为空。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:625
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:451
msgid "When this page was built:"
msgstr "本页构建时："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:627
msgid "After registration, ``dce_hemodynamics`` appeared in the registry next to the built-in names, and ``Spec(\"dce_hemodynamics\", ...)`` ran through ``Study`` like any built-in extractor."
msgstr ""
"注册后 ``dce_hemodynamics`` 与内置名并列出现在注册表， ``Spec(\"dce_hemodynamics\", ...)`` 经 ``Study`` 运行如任何内置提取器。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:630
msgid "In subj001 (34694 ROI voxels) the arterial relative enhancement had median 1.33 (IQR 1.05-1.61). The two wash-out ratios had long tails (min -20.7 / -22.4, max 43.4 / 54.4) where the arterial gain in the denominator is small; their medians were 0.17 and 0.35. That is why winsorizing before min-max matters for this feature set."
msgstr ""
"subj001（34694 ROI 体素）动脉相对增强中位数 1.33（IQR 1.05-1.61）。两个 wash-out 比值长尾（min -20.7 / -22.4，max 43.4 / 54.4），因分母动脉增益小；中位数 0.17 与 0.35。故 min-max 前 winsorize 对该特征集很重要。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:635
msgid "The elbow rule kept K = 5. Centroids in bin units (enhancement, PVP wash-out, delayed wash-out): habitat 3 (7.4, 8.5, 8.5) is strong enhancement with strong wash-out, habitat 1 (0.8, 1.6, 1.0) weak enhancement with little wash-out; the others sit in between."
msgstr ""
"elbow 规则保留 K = 5。分箱单位质心（增强、PVP 洗出、延迟洗出）：生境 3（7.4, 8.5, 8.5）强增强强洗出，生境 1（0.8, 1.6, 1.0）弱增强少洗出；其余居中。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:639
msgid "Volume fractions: subj001 0.125 / 0.300 / 0.284 / 0.158 / 0.133 and subj002 0.102 / 0.375 / 0.454 / 0.000 / 0.068 for habitats 1 to 5; habitat 4 is absent from subj002."
msgstr ""
"Volume fractions: subj001 0.125 / 0.300 / 0.284 / 0.158 / 0.133 and subj002 0.102 / 0.375 / 0.454 / 0.000 / 0.068 for 生境 1 to 5; 生境 4 is absent from subj002."
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:642
msgid "The entry-point group printed ``habit.voxel_feature_extractor`` and ``load_plugins()`` loaded nothing, because no plugin package is installed in this environment."
msgstr "入口点组打印为 ``habit.voxel_feature_extractor`` ，且 ``load_plugins()`` 未加载任何内容，因为当前环境未安装插件包。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:646
msgid "These ratios are illustrative formulas on two demo patients, not a validated perfusion model."
msgstr "这些比率为两名演示患者上的示例公式，非经校验的灌注模型。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/02_features/plot_05_own_feature_extractor.rst:653
msgid "Formula-only features without a class: :doc:`/auto_examples/02_features/plot_03_enhancement_patterns`."
msgstr "无类的仅公式特征： :doc:`/auto_examples/02_features/plot_03_enhancement_patterns` 。"
