msgid "The approved analysis with raw intensities: :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec`."
msgstr "含 raw 强度的已批准分析： :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 。"
