#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:13
msgid ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_03_clustering_plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.py>` to download the full example code."
msgstr ":ref:`转到文末 <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_03_clustering_plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.py>` 可下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:22
msgid "Supervoxel method and count"
msgstr "超体素方法与数量"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** In the two-step design every tumour is first cut into supervoxels, and only those supervoxels are clustered into habitats. The supervoxel step therefore decides which voxels always travel together: two voxels in the same supervoxel can never end up in different habitats. Changing the supervoxel method or their number can move habitat borders, change the number of habitats the elbow picks, and change every downstream feature."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** 两步法中肿瘤先切超体素，仅超体素聚类为生境。超体素步决定哪些体素始终同行：同超体素两体素不能分属不同生境。改超体素方法或数量可移动生境边界、改变 elbow 所选生境数及所有下游特征。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:32
msgid "**Purpose.** Starting from the analysis of :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec`, you will change ONLY the ``partition`` stage and measure what moves:"
msgstr "**目的。** 从 :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 的分析出发，你将只改动 ``partition`` 阶段，并测量哪些结果发生变化："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:36
msgid "the supervoxel **method** (k-means, SLIC, Gaussian mixture), each with 30 supervoxels per tumour;"
msgstr ""
"the 超体素 **method** (k-means, SLIC, Gaussian mixture), each with 30 超体素 per tumour;"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:38
msgid "the supervoxel **count** (15, 30, 60) with k-means."
msgstr "超体素 **数量** （15、30、60）与 k-means。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:40
msgid "For every variant the page prints the number of habitats the elbow picks, the per-patient volume fractions, and how well the habitat map agrees with the reference (30 k-means supervoxels)."
msgstr "每个变体打印 elbow 所选生境数、逐患者体积分数，以及与参考（30 k-means 超体素）生境图的一致程度。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:53
msgid "**When to use.** Before you freeze a habitat definition for a study, or when a reviewer asks whether your habitats depend on the supervoxel settings. A definition whose maps change completely with a small change of settings needs a justification in the paper."
msgstr "**何时使用。** 冻结研究生境定义前，或审稿人问生境是否依赖超体素设置时。定义随设置小变而图全变，须在论文中说明理由。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:60
msgid "**supervoxel** -- a small patch of similar neighbouring voxels found inside one tumour. ``kmeans`` groups voxels by feature values only; ``slic`` also weighs spatial closeness, so its patches are compact and connected; ``gmm`` fits a Gaussian mixture to the feature values."
msgstr ""
"**超体素** — 肿瘤内相似邻近体素的小 patch。 ``kmeans`` 仅按特征值分组； ``slic`` 还权衡空间邻近，patch 紧凑连通； ``gmm`` 对特征值拟合高斯混合。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:64
msgid "**reference definition** -- the analysis of the complete-analysis page: four DCE phases, per-patient winsorize + z-score, 30 k-means supervoxels, pooled, 10 equal-width bins, k-means fit with 2..10 habitats chosen by the elbow, nearest-centroid assignment."
msgstr ""
"**reference definition** — 完整分析页的分析：四相 DCE、逐患者 winsorize + z-score、30 个 k-means 超体素、池化、10 等宽 bin、k-means 拟合 2..10 生境由 elbow 选择、最近质心分配。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:68
msgid "**adjusted Rand index (ARI)** -- agreement of two label maps over the same ROI voxels. 1 = the same partition, about 0 = no more agreement than chance. It ignores the label numbers themselves, which matters here: two independent fits may call the same region habitat 2 and habitat 4. It also works when the two maps have a different number of habitats."
msgstr "**调整兰德指数（ARI）** —— 同一 ROI 体素上两张标签图的一致性。1 = 相同划分，约 0 = 不优于随机。它忽略标签编号本身，这在此处很重要：两次独立拟合可能把同一区域叫作生境 2 与生境 4。当两图生境数不同时同样适用。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:75
msgid "The page builds each variant from the atomic components (the same objects and the same seed as :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step`, which checks that this path reproduces ``Study`` voxel for voxel). The voxel features are computed once and reused, so only the supervoxel step and what follows it are recomputed. In a :class:`~habit.spec.HabitatSpec` each variant is a one-line change of the ``partition`` stage, for example ``Stage(\"partition\", Spec(\"slic\", {\"n_supervoxels\": 30}))``."
msgstr ""
"本页从原子组件构建各变体（与 :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step` 相同对象与 seed，验证该路径逐体素复现 ``Study`` ）。体素特征只算一次并复用，仅重算超体素及之后步骤。在 :class:`~habit.spec.HabitatSpec` 中各变体只需改 ``partition`` 阶段一行，例如 ``Stage(\"partition\", Spec(\"slic\", {\"n_supervoxels\": 30}))`` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:87
msgid "Two training patients are a demo, not a study. The numbers below show how to run the check, not how sensitive habitats are in general. Run the same check on your own cohort."
msgstr "两名训练患者只是演示，不是一项研究。下方数字说明如何运行该检查，并不代表生境在一般情况下有多敏感。请在你自己的队列上做同样检查。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:94
msgid "Load the cohort and compute the voxel features once"
msgstr "加载队列并计算一次体素特征"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:95
msgid "The first two demo patients are the training cohort, as on the complete-analysis page. Extraction and the per-patient normalization do not depend on the supervoxel settings, so they run once here and every variant below starts from the same normalized voxel fields. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 2"
msgstr ""
"前两名演示患者为训练队列，与完整分析页相同。提取与逐患者归一化不依赖超体素设置，故此处只运行一次，以下各变体从相同归一化体素场开始。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 2"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:190
msgid "One function = everything after the partition stage"
msgstr "一个函数 = 分区阶段之后的全部"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:191
msgid "``habitats_for`` takes one supervoxelizer and runs the rest of the reference definition unchanged: pool the supervoxels of both patients, learn 10 equal-width bins on the pooled rows, fit k-means with 2..10 habitats chosen by the elbow, and assign every voxel to the nearest centroid. Keeping this part fixed is what makes the comparison a one-factor comparison."
msgstr ""
"``habitats_for`` 取一个 supervoxelizer，其余参考定义不变：池化两患者超体素，在池化行上学 10 个等宽 bin，拟合 k-means 2..10  habitats 由肘部选择，每个体素赋最近质心 id。固定这部分使比较为单因素比较。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:277
msgid "Factor 1: the supervoxel method"
msgstr "因素 1：超体素方法"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:278
msgid "Three supervoxelizers, each asked for 30 supervoxels per tumour."
msgstr "Three 超体素izers, each asked for 30 超体素 per 肿瘤."
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:280
msgid "``KMeansSupervoxelizer`` -- the reference (10 restarts, the default)."
msgstr "``KMeansSupervoxelizer`` ——参考（10 次重启，默认）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:281
msgid "``SlicSupervoxelizer`` -- default ``compactness=10`` and ``enforce_connectivity=True``: every supervoxel is one connected patch. It runs on the full image grid, so it is the slowest here."
msgstr ""
"``SlicSupervoxelizer`` — 默认 ``compactness=10`` 与 ``enforce_connectivity=True`` ：每个超体素为一片连通 patch。在全图像网格运行，此处最慢。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:284
msgid "``GmmSupervoxelizer`` -- the registry default is full covariance with 10 restarts; on these two tumours that took about three minutes on the machine that built this page, too slow for a documentation page. Here it uses diagonal covariance and one start. That is a valid Gaussian mixture, but it is a different setting from the default: report the exact parameters (they are in the spec) if you use it."
msgstr "``GmmSupervoxelizer`` —— 注册表默认是全协方差与 10 次重启；在构建本页的机器上，对这两例肿瘤约需三分钟，对文档页来说太慢。此处改用对角协方差与单次启动。这仍是有效的高斯混合，但与默认设置不同：若使用，请报告确切参数（它们写在 spec 中）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:360
msgid "Factor 2: the number of supervoxels"
msgstr "因素 2：超体素数量"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:361
msgid "Back to k-means supervoxels, now with half and double the reference count. The 30-supervoxel run is the reference computed above."
msgstr "回到 k-means 超体素，数量为参考一半与双倍。30 超体素 run 为上述参考。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:419
msgid "The numbers"
msgstr "数值"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:420
msgid "One row per variant: supervoxels actually produced per patient, the habitat count the elbow picked, and the ARI of each patient's habitat map against the reference. Then the volume fractions per patient."
msgstr "每变体一行：每患者实际超体素数、elbow 所选生境数、各患者生境图相对参考的 ARI。随后逐患者体积分数。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:424
msgid "Volume-fraction columns are only comparable WITHIN a variant: habitat 2 of one fit is not habitat 2 of another fit. That is exactly why the agreement is measured with the ARI and not by comparing columns."
msgstr "体积分数列仅在同一变体内可比较：一次拟合的生境 2 并非另一次拟合的生境 2。这正是用 ARI 度量一致性、而不是直接比较各列的原因。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:469
msgid "Elbow / Kneedle caveat and criterion table (reference supervoxels)"
msgstr "Elbow / Kneedle 说明与准则表（参考超体素）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:558
msgid "On the build machine, with these two demo patients:"
msgstr "在构建机器上，用这两名演示患者："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:560
msgid "The elbow picked K = 4 with the reference (30 k-means supervoxels) and with 15 k-means supervoxels, and K = 5 with SLIC, with the diagonal Gaussian mixture and with 60 k-means supervoxels."
msgstr ""
"elbow 在参考（30 k-means 超体素）与 15 k-means 超体素时选 K = 4，在 SLIC、对角 GMM 与 60 k-means 超体素时选 K = 5。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:563
msgid "ARI against the reference (subj001 / subj002): SLIC 0.22 / 0.25, Gaussian mixture 0.53 / 0.43, 15 k-means supervoxels 0.67 / 0.57, 60 k-means supervoxels 0.46 / 0.53. None is close to 1. A different supervoxel method or count does not just relabel the same regions: it redraws habitat borders and can change the number of habitats. Of the settings tried, the method (SLIC) moved the maps the most."
msgstr ""
"相对参考的 ARI（subj001 / subj002）：SLIC 0.22 / 0.25，Gaussian mixture 0.53 / 0.43，15 k-means 超体素 0.67 / 0.57，60 k-means 超体素 0.46 / 0.53。均远离 1。不同超体素方法或数量不仅重标同一区域：会重画生境边界并可能改变生境数。所试设置中方法（SLIC）对地图移动最大。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:569
msgid "With SLIC, habitat 2 is absent from subj001 (volume fraction 0): the model is fitted on both patients, so a habitat can exist in the cohort and still be missing in one patient."
msgstr "SLIC 下 subj001 无生境 2（体积分数 0）：模型在两患者上拟合，故生境可在队列存在而某患者缺失。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:573
msgid "What to do with this in a real study:"
msgstr "真实研究中如何处理："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:575
msgid "Fix the supervoxel method and count before looking at outcomes, and report them (they are in the spec and in ``describe_methods()``)."
msgstr "在查看结局前固定超体素方法与数量并报告（它们在 spec 与 ``describe_methods()`` 中）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:577
msgid "Report the ARI (or another label-invariant agreement) of your final definition against at least one neighbouring setting, e.g. half and double the supervoxel count, on your own cohort."
msgstr "在自有队列上报告最终定义相对至少一种邻近设置（如超体素数减半与加倍）的 ARI（或其他标签不变一致度）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:580
msgid "If the downstream conclusion changes with the supervoxel setting, say so; do not choose the setting that gives the best result."
msgstr "若下游结论随超体素设置而变，应如实说明；勿选结果最好的设置。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count.rst:587
