#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_02_what_supervoxel_summarizes.rst:22
msgid "Supervoxel feature extraction and acceleration"
msgstr "超体素特征提取与加速"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_02_what_supervoxel_summarizes.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** The cohort model clusters supervoxels, not voxels, so each supervoxel needs its own row of numbers. That row can be a simple summary of its voxels (mean, median, SD) or radiomics texture computed on the supervoxel as a small ROI."
msgstr "**背景。** 队列模型聚类的是超体素而非体素，因此每个超体素需要自己的一行数值。该行可以是其体素的简单汇总（均值、中位数、标准差），或是把超体素当作小型 ROI 计算的放射组学纹理。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_02_what_supervoxel_summarizes.rst:29
msgid "**Purpose.** You get 24 SLIC supervoxels of one subject, a table of their mean / median / SD intensity, and a timing plus value-by-value comparison of HABIT's C-extension texture path against PyRadiomics ``execute()``."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 得到单受试者 24 个 SLIC 超体素、其 mean / median / SD 强度表，以及 HABIT C 扩展纹理路径与 PyRadiomics ``execute()`` 的计时与逐值对比。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_02_what_supervoxel_summarizes.rst:36
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit.rst:35
msgid "**supervoxel** -- see :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_03_supervoxels`."
msgstr "**超体素** — 见 :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_03_supervoxels` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_02_what_supervoxel_summarizes.rst:37
msgid "**supervoxel feature** -- one value per supervoxel, summarising the voxels inside it; one column per feature."
msgstr "**超体素特征** —— 每个超体素一个值，汇总其内体素；每特征一列。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_02_what_supervoxel_summarizes.rst:39
msgid "**parity** -- whether two implementations give the same numbers; here measured as the maximum absolute difference per feature."
msgstr "**一致性** ——指两个实现是否给出相同的数值；在这里测量为每个特征的最大绝对差值。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_02_what_supervoxel_summarizes.rst:42
msgid "In two-step habitat analysis, the tumor ROI is first partitioned into supervoxels. Each supervoxel must then be summarized into a quantitative feature vector before cohort pooling and clustering."
msgstr "两步法生境分析中，肿瘤 ROI 先划分为超体素。池化与聚类前须将每个超体素汇总为定量特征向量。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_02_what_supervoxel_summarizes.rst:46
msgid "HABIT supports two primary approaches for supervoxel feature extraction:"
msgstr "HABIT 支持两种主要的超体素特征提取方式："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_02_what_supervoxel_summarizes.rst:48
msgid "**Statistical aggregations**: reducing the per-voxel signals inside each supervoxel (e.g. :class:`~habit.supervoxel.MeanSupervoxelFeatures`, median/percentiles via :class:`~habit.supervoxel.PercentileSupervoxelFeatures`, and standard deviation via :class:`~habit.supervoxel.StdSupervoxelFeatures`)."
msgstr "**统计聚合** ：缩减每个超体素内逐体素信号（例如 :class:`~habit.supervoxel.MeanSupervoxelFeatures` ， :class:`~habit.supervoxel.PercentileSupervoxelFeatures` 的中位数/分位数， :class:`~habit.supervoxel.StdSupervoxelFeatures` 的标准差）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_02_what_supervoxel_summarizes.rst:52
msgid "**Supervoxel radiomics texture**: extracting full IBSI-compliant radiomics features for every individual supervoxel (:class:`~habit.supervoxel.SupervoxelRadiomicsFeatures`)."
msgstr "**超体素放射组学纹理** ：为每个超体素提取完整 IBSI 合规放射组学特征（ :class:`~habit.supervoxel.SupervoxelRadiomicsFeatures` ）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_02_what_supervoxel_summarizes.rst:56
msgid "High-throughput acceleration vs PyRadiomics parity"
msgstr "高通量加速 vs PyRadiomics 一致性"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_02_what_supervoxel_summarizes.rst:57
msgid "Extracting texture features for dozens of supervoxels sequentially using standard PyRadiomics ``execute()`` incurs high overhead (repeated mask hashing, bounding-box cropping, and Python loop costs). HABIT enables an accelerated native C-extension engine by default (``use_supervoxel_cext=True``), running directly on CPU without GPU overhead. Furthermore, HABIT sets GPU and backend calculation precision to double precision ``float64`` by default, guaranteeing exact numerical parity within machine epsilon against official PyRadiomics without single-precision (``float32``) quantization error. This page benchmarks extraction time, confirms multi-fold speedup, and proves exact numerical parity against PyRadiomics."
msgstr ""
"使用标准的 Py放射组学 ``execute()`` 对数十个超体素依次提取纹理特征会产生高开销（重复的掩码哈希、边界框裁剪以及 Python 循环开销）。HABIT 默认启用加速的原生 C 扩展引擎（ ``use_supervoxel_cext=True`` ），可直接在 CPU 上运行，无 GPU 开销。此外，HABIT 默认将 GPU 和后端计算精度设置为双精度 ``float64`` ，保证与官方 Py放射组学 在机器精度范围内完全数值一致，而不会出现单精度 (``float32``) 量化误差。本页面对提取时间进行了基准测试，确认了多倍加速，并证明了与 Py放射组学 的完全数值一致性。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_02_what_supervoxel_summarizes.rst:70
msgid "Load one demo subject and generate SLIC supervoxels. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
msgstr "加载一名演示受试者并生成 SLIC 超体素。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_02_what_supervoxel_summarizes.rst:171
msgid "Approach 1: Statistical feature extraction (Mean, Median, Std). Each extractor binds the voxel field and aggregates voxel intensities within each parcel."
msgstr "方法 1：统计特征提取（Mean、Median、Std）。各提取器绑定体素场并在每个 parcel 内聚合体素强度。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_02_what_supervoxel_summarizes.rst:291
msgid "Approach 2: Supervoxel Radiomics texture and high-throughput acceleration. Compare HABIT native C-extension against PyRadiomics for time and numerical parity. Same PyRadiomics settings for both paths; normalize=False keeps the intensities as stored (no PyRadiomics intensity normalisation)."
msgstr ""
"方法 2：超体素放射组学纹理与高吞吐加速。比较 HABIT 原生 C 扩展与 PyRadiomics 的时间与数值一致性。两路径 PyRadiomics 设置相同；normalize=False 保持存储强度（无 PyRadiomics 强度归一化）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_02_what_supervoxel_summarizes.rst:394
msgid "Visual comparison: execution time and numerical parity correlation."
msgstr "视觉对比：运行时间与数值 parity 相关。"
