msgid ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_03_clustering_plot_03_clustering_algorithm.py>` to download the full example code."
msgstr ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_03_clustering_plot_03_clustering_algorithm.py>` 以下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:22
msgid "Clustering algorithm and number of habitats"
msgstr "聚类算法与生境数"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** The ``fit`` stage clusters the pooled supervoxels of the training patients into habitats. Two choices are made there: the clustering **algorithm** (k-means or a Gaussian mixture) and the **number of habitats** K. HABIT tries every K in a range and keeps the one a validation criterion prefers. Different criteria measure different things, so on the same data they can pick different Ks."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** ``fit`` 阶段将训练患者池化超体素聚类为生境。需做两选择：聚类 **算法** （k-means 或高斯混合）与 **生境数** K。HABIT 在范围内尝试每个 K 并保留验证准则偏好者。不同准则衡量不同方面，同一数据可能选不同 K。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:31
msgid "**Elbow / Kneedle caveat.** HABIT validation ``elbow`` is Kneedle on inertia (Satopaa et al. 2011). The visual elbow is the discrete-curvature reading associated with Thorndike 1953, not a formula Thorndike published."
msgstr ""
"**Elbow / Kneedle 说明。** HABIT 验证 ``elbow`` 为 inertia 上的 Kneedle（Satopaa et al. 2011）。视觉 elbow 为与 Thorndike 1953 关联的离散曲率读法，非 Thorndike 发表的公式。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:33
msgid "**Purpose.** Starting from the analysis of :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec`, you will change ONLY the ``fit`` stage, on the SAME pooled supervoxels:"
msgstr "**目的。** 从 :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 的分析出发，你将在 **同一批** 池化超体素上只改动 ``fit`` 阶段："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:37
msgid "every k-means criterion, then every Gaussian-mixture criterion, and the K each one picks, with the score curves drawn by :func:`~habit.viz.plot_cluster_validation_from_report`;"
msgstr ""
"每种 k-means 准则、每种高斯混合准则及各自选择的 K，分数曲线由 :func:`~habit.viz.plot_cluster_validation_from_report` 绘制；"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:40
msgid "the random seed (0, 1, 2) of the whole analysis: the K picked and the agreement of the habitat maps between seeds."
msgstr "整分析随机 seed（0、1、2）：所选 K 及 seed 间生境图一致程度。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:43
msgid "**When to use.** Before you freeze the habitat count of a study, and whenever you have to justify \"why K habitats\" in a methods section."
msgstr "**何时使用。** 冻结研究生境数量前，以及方法学中需说明“为何 K 个生境”时。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:48
msgid "**validation criterion** -- a score computed for every candidate K. k-means: ``elbow`` / ``kneedle`` (Kneedle knee of inertia; maximize distance to the chord), ``silhouette`` and ``calinski_harabasz`` (higher is better), ``davies_bouldin`` (lower is better), ``gap`` (gap statistic, higher is better). Gaussian mixture: ``bic`` / ``aic`` (lower is better), ``bic_elbow`` (Prior 2024 BIC-slope rule), plus the same four label-based scores."
msgstr "**验证准则** —— 对每个候选 K 计算的分数。k-means： ``elbow`` / ``kneedle`` （惯性的 Kneedle 拐点；最大化到弦的距离）、 ``silhouette`` 与 ``calinski_harabasz`` （越高越好）、 ``davies_bouldin`` （越低越好）、 ``gap`` （gap 统计量，越高越好）。高斯混合： ``bic`` / ``aic`` （越低越好）、 ``bic_elbow`` （Prior 2024 BIC 斜率规则），以及上述四种基于标签的分数。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:55
msgid "**discrete-curvature elbow** -- ``argmax`` of the second difference of inertia (pre-v1.0 HABIT ``elbow``); reported beside Kneedle, not used to paint the habitat maps on this page."
msgstr ""
"**discrete-curvature elbow** — 惯性二阶差 ``argmax`` （v1.0 前 HABIT ``elbow`` ）；与 Kneedle 并列报告，不用于本页生境图着色。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:58
msgid "**vote** -- ``validation=[...]`` with several criteria: each criterion casts one vote and the most voted K is kept."
msgstr "**vote** — ``validation=[...]`` 多准则：每准则一票，保留得票最多的 K。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:60
msgid "**adjusted Rand index (ARI)** -- agreement of two label maps over the same ROI voxels (1 = same partition, about 0 = chance). It ignores label numbers, so it is safe when two fits number the same region differently."
msgstr ""
"**调整 Rand 指数（ARI）** — 同一 ROI 体素上两标签图一致度（1 = 相同划分，约 0 = 随机）。忽略标签编号，两拟合同区编号不同时仍安全。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:65
msgid "The criteria comparison reuses the pooled supervoxels of one ``Study`` run and refits only the fitter, so every criterion sees exactly the same rows. The page checks first that refitting the reference fitter on those rows reproduces the ``Study`` maps. The habitat map keeps the reference ``elbow`` / Kneedle K; other K values are shown only in the table and markers."
msgstr ""
"准则比较复用一次 ``Study`` 运行的池化超体素且仅重拟合 fitter，故各准则看到完全相同行。页面首先验证在这些行上重拟合参考 fitter 可复现 ``Study`` 生境图。生境图保留参考 ``elbow`` / Kneedle K；其他 K 仅在表与标记中显示。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:74
msgid "Two training patients (60 pooled supervoxels) are a demo, not a study. With so few rows the criteria disagree easily; the point of the page is how to run and report the comparison."
msgstr "两名训练患者（60 个池化超体素）是演示，不是研究。行数少时准则易分歧；本页要点是如何运行并报告比较。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:81
msgid "The reference analysis"
msgstr "参考分析"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:82
msgid "The Spec of the complete-analysis page, with only the ``volume`` quantify stage (the other feature families are not needed here). ``make_spec`` exists so the seed can be changed later without touching anything else. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
msgstr ""
"完整分析页的 Spec，仅 ``volume`` quantify 阶段（此处不需要其他特征族）。 ``make_spec`` 便于稍后改种子而不动其余。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:212
msgid "Check: refitting the reference fitter reproduces Study"
msgstr "检查：重拟合参考拟合器应复现 Study"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:213
msgid "Same rows, same settings, same seed. If the labels are identical, the criteria comparison below really compares criteria on the reference data and nothing else."
msgstr "相同行、设置、seed。若标签一致，下列准则比较才仅比较参考数据上的准则。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:267
msgid "k-means: K selected by each criterion"
msgstr "k-means：各准则所选 K"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:268
msgid "One fitter per criterion, each with the reference settings (2..10 habitats, 10 restarts, seed 0). A candidate K is fitted with the same seed whatever the criterion, so all curves describe the same k-means solutions; only the rule that reads them changes. Directions: elbow/kneedle = Kneedle knee; silhouette, calinski_harabasz, gap = maximize; davies_bouldin = minimize. Gap is included here because this page already compares every supported criterion."
msgstr ""
"每准则一个 fitter，均用参考设置（2..10 生境，10 次重启，seed 0）。同一 seed 拟合候选 K，故各曲线描述相同 k-means 解；仅读曲线的规则不同。方向：elbow/kneedle = Kneedle 膝；silhouette、calinski_harabasz、gap = 最大化；davies_bouldin = 最小化。本页已比较所有支持准则，故包含 Gap。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:385
msgid "Gaussian mixture: K selected by each criterion"
msgstr "Gaussian mixture：各准则所选 K"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:386
msgid "The same rows with ``GmmHabitatModelFitter`` (full covariance, the default; ``n_init=10`` as for k-means instead of the default 50, to keep the page fast). Its own default criterion is ``bic``."
msgstr ""
"相同的行使用 ``GmmHabitatModelFitter`` （全协方差，默认； ``n_init=10`` 用于 k-means 而不是默认的 50，以保持页面快速）。它自己的默认标准是 ``bic`` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:433
msgid "Same K, different algorithm"
msgstr "相同 K，不同算法"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:434
msgid "When the two algorithms end up with the same K, are the habitats the same regions? Compare the reference k-means map (Kneedle elbow K) with the Gaussian mixture chosen by ``bic_elbow``, if that picked the same K."
msgstr ""
"两算法最终 K 相同时，生境是否为同一区域？将参考 k-means 图（Kneedle elbow K）与 ``bic_elbow`` 所选 Gaussian mixture 比较（若 K 相同）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:476
msgid "Seed stability"
msgstr "种子稳定性"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:477
msgid "``random_seed`` seeds the k-means supervoxels AND the k-means fit. A robust definition should give similar maps for any seed. Rerun the whole Spec with seeds 1 and 2 and compare with seed 0."
msgstr ""
"``random_seed`` 同时种子化 k-means 超体素与 k-means 拟合。稳健定义应对任意 seed 给出相似图。用 seed 1、2 重跑整个 Spec 并与 seed 0 比较。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:531
msgid "On the build machine, with these two demo patients (60 pooled supervoxels), criteria disagree — that is the point of the page:"
msgstr "在构建机上，对这两名演示患者（60 个池化超体素），各准则并不一致——这正是本页要点："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:534
msgid "HABIT ``elbow`` / ``kneedle`` (Kneedle on inertia) and the discrete-curvature elbow (second difference of inertia) often pick different Ks; the habitat map above keeps the Kneedle K only."
msgstr ""
"HABIT ``elbow`` / ``kneedle`` （inertia 上 Kneedle）与离散曲率肘部（inertia 二阶差）常选不同 K；上图仅保留 Kneedle K。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:537
msgid "``silhouette`` and ``calinski_harabasz`` (maximize) often prefer a small K; ``davies_bouldin`` (minimize) may agree with Kneedle or not; ``gap`` (maximize) can run to the top of the range on few rows."
msgstr ""
"``silhouette`` 与 ``calinski_harabasz`` （最大化）常偏好小 K； ``davies_bouldin`` （最小化）或与 Kneedle 一致或否； ``gap`` （最大化）在少行时可达范围上限。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:540
msgid "Gaussian mixture: ``bic`` / ``aic`` (minimize) and ``bic_elbow`` need not match k-means Kneedle. A pick at the edge of the range means \"the criterion did not find an optimum here\", not \"that K is right\"."
msgstr ""
"高斯混合： ``bic`` / ``aic`` （最小化）与 ``bic_elbow`` 不必与 k-means Kneedle 一致。在范围边缘的选取表示“准则在此未找到最优”，而非“该 K 正确”。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:543
msgid "The seed-stability lines above show whether the K and the maps survive a different random start on these data."
msgstr "上面的种子稳定性曲线显示了 K 和地图在这些数据上是否能在不同的随机起点下存活。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:546
msgid "Guidance for a study:"
msgstr "研究建议："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:548
msgid "Choose the criterion (and the K range) before looking at outcomes and report it; ``describe_methods()`` records it with the spec."
msgstr "在查看结果之前选定准则（及 K 范围）并报告； ``describe_methods()`` 会随 spec 一并记录。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:550
msgid "Prefer a criterion whose pick is inside the range; widen the range or change the criterion if it sits on the edge."
msgstr "优先选择落在范围内的准则；若在边界则扩范围或换准则。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:552
msgid "Show the curves (the figures above) in the supplement, report the seed stability, and, if habitats are interpreted biologically, check that neighbouring Ks tell the same story."
msgstr "在补充材料展示曲线（上图），报告种子稳定性；若生境有生物学解释，检查邻近 K 是否叙述一致。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:560
msgid "Consensus clustering (stability of K; GPL-3.0-or-later component): :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering`."
msgstr "共识聚类（K 稳定性；GPL-3.0-or-later 组件）： :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:562
msgid "The supervoxel step before the fit: :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count`."
msgstr "拟合前超体素步： :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_01_supervoxel_method_and_count` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:564
msgid "Fitting and assigning on their own pages: :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit`, :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_06_assign`."
msgstr "在它们各自的页面上安装和分配： :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit` ， :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_06_assign` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:567
msgid "Matching habitat numbers between two fits: :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_02_match_same_subject`."
msgstr "两拟合间生境编号匹配： :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_02_match_same_subject` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:569
msgid "Cleaning the final maps: :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_08_cleaning_maps`."
msgstr "最终图清理： :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_08_cleaning_maps` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:575
msgid "**Total running time of the script:** (0 minutes 40.867 seconds)"
msgstr "**脚本总运行时间：** （0 分 40.867 秒）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:586
msgid ":download:`Download Jupyter notebook: plot_03_clustering_algorithm.ipynb <plot_03_clustering_algorithm.ipynb>`"
msgstr ""
":download:`Download Jupyter notebook: plot_03_clustering_algorithm.ipynb <plot_03_clustering_algorithm.ipynb>`"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:590
msgid ":download:`Download Python source code: plot_03_clustering_algorithm.py <plot_03_clustering_algorithm.py>`"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm.rst:594
msgid ":download:`Download zipped: plot_03_clustering_algorithm.zip <plot_03_clustering_algorithm.zip>`"
msgstr ""
":download:`Download zipped: plot_03_聚类_algorithm.zip <plot_03_clustering_algorithm.zip>`"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:13
msgid ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_03_clustering_plot_04_consensus_clustering.py>` to download the full example code."
msgstr ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_03_clustering_plot_04_consensus_clustering.py>` 以下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:22
msgid "Consensus clustering of habitats"
msgstr "生境共识聚类"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** K-means and a Gaussian mixture pick a habitat count from a score curve (inertia, BIC, silhouette, ...). Consensus clustering (Monti et al., 2003) asks a different question: across many resamples of the same supervoxels, which pairs keep landing in the same cluster, and for which count K is that co-clustering stable?"
msgstr ""
"**背景。** K-means 与高斯混合从分数曲线（inertia、BIC、silhouette 等）选生境数。共识聚类（Monti et al., 2003）问不同问题：对同一超体素多次重采样，哪些对在多次聚类中仍同簇，哪个 K 下共簇最稳定？"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:30
msgid "**License.** The numerical step is the InMoose port of Žiga Sajovic's implementation, vendored at ``habit/third_party/inmoose/`` under **GPL-3.0-or-later**. The rest of HABIT stays Apache-2.0. Using ``Spec(\"consensus\")`` or :class:`~habit.habitat_model.ConsensusHabitatModelFitter` uses that GPL component. The GPL text is ``habit/third_party/inmoose/LICENSE``."
msgstr "**许可证。** 数值步骤是 InMoose 对 Žiga Sajovic 实现的移植，以 **GPL-3.0-or-later** 存放于 ``habit/third_party/inmoose/`` 。HABIT 其余部分仍为 Apache-2.0。使用 ``Spec(\"consensus\")`` 或 :class:`~habit.habitat_model.ConsensusHabitatModelFitter` 即使用该 GPL 组件。GPL 文本见 ``habit/third_party/inmoose/LICENSE`` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:37
msgid "**What this page runs.** The same two-step analysis as :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm`, with only the ``fit`` stage changed. Pooled supervoxels are the items. The vendored algorithm resamples **items only** (not features), at the InMoose default fraction 0.5. This page uses 20 resamples and K from 2 to 6 so the figures stay readable; the class default is 50 resamples and K from 2 to 10. ``bestK`` is their relative change in area under the consensus-index CDF. That curve stops at ``max_habitats - 1``: the top of the range is never selected. This is not Bioconductor ConsensusClusterPlus (no PAC, no feature resampling)."
msgstr "**本页运行内容。** 与 :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm` 相同的两步法分析，仅改动 ``fit`` 阶段。池化后的超体素是条目。自带算法仅对 **条目** 重采样（不对特征），采用 InMoose 默认比例 0.5。本页使用 20 次重采样、K 从 2 到 6 以便图可读；类默认是 50 次重采样、K 从 2 到 10。 ``bestK`` 来自它们在一致性指数 CDF 下面积的相对变化。该曲线止于 ``max_habitats - 1`` ：范围上端永不被选中。这不是 Bioconductor ConsensusClusterPlus（无 PAC、无特征重采样）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:48
msgid "The consensus cut labels only the fitted supervoxels. HABIT stores the mean feature vector of each consensus group as a centroid, then paints the map with nearest-centroid assignment so a later subject can be labelled without rebuilding the ``n x n`` matrix."
msgstr ""
"共识切分仅标注已拟合超体素。HABIT 将各共识组均值特征向量存为质心，再用最近质心分配绘制地图，以便后续受试者无需重建 ``n x n`` 矩阵即可标注。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:53
msgid "**When to use.** When you need a stability argument for K on a few dozen to a few hundred supervoxels. Do not point it at a voxel-level matrix: each candidate K keeps an ``n x n`` consensus matrix."
msgstr "**何时使用。** 需在几十到几百超体素上对 K 做稳定性论证时。勿用于体素级矩阵：每个候选 K 保留 ``n x n`` 共识矩阵。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:59
msgid "``habit/third_party/inmoose/`` is GPL-3.0-or-later. HABIT's Apache-2.0 license does not replace that license."
msgstr ""
"``habit/third_party/inmoose/`` 为 GPL-3.0-or-later。HABIT 的 Apache-2.0 许可证不替代该许可证。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:65
msgid "Fit habitats with consensus clustering"
msgstr "用共识聚类拟合生境"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:66
msgid "Change ``DATA`` / ``MODALITIES`` / ``ROI`` to your preprocessed layout. The ``fit`` stage is the only one that differs from a k-means two-step run. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 3"
msgstr ""
"将 ``DATA`` / ``MODALITIES`` / ``ROI`` 改为你的预处理布局。 ``fit`` 是唯一与 k-means 两步运行不同的阶段。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 3"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:201
msgid "Delta(k): where the consensus distribution changes most"
msgstr "Delta(k)：共识分布变化最大处"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:202
msgid "The marked point is ``bestK`` from the vendored rule. Read a flat tail as \"more clusters do not make the consensus much sharper\", not as a p-value."
msgstr "标记点为 vendored 规则的 ``bestK`` 。平坦尾部读作“更多簇并未使共识明显更锐”，非 p 值。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:228
msgid "CDF of the consensus index"
msgstr "共识指数 CDF"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:229
msgid "A useful K pushes the CDF toward a step: pairs are either almost always together (index near 1) or almost never (index near 0). The thick line is the selected K. Diagonal entries are 1, as in the vendored area calculation."
msgstr ""
"有用的 K 使 CDF 近阶跃：成对体几乎总在一起（指数近 1）或几乎不（近 0）。粗线为所选 K。对角元为 1，与 vendored 面积计算一致。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:256
msgid "Consensus matrix at the selected K"
msgstr "所选 K 的共识矩阵"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:257
msgid "Each cell is the fraction of resamples in which the two supervoxels were both drawn and placed in the same cluster. Rows are ordered by average linkage on ``1 - consensus`` so stable groups form blocks."
msgstr ""
"每个单元格表示在重复抽样中，两个超级体素都被抽取并放置在同一簇中的比例。行按照 ``1 - consensus`` 的平均连接排序，因此稳定的群体形成区块。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:284
msgid "Consensus matrix at every candidate K"
msgstr "每个候选 K 的共识矩阵"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:309
msgid "Cluster consensus"
msgstr "簇共识"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:310
msgid "For each cluster, the mean consensus index among its member pairs. A bar near 1 is a stable habitat; a gap is a singleton, which this implementation records as NaN."
msgstr "对每个簇，其成员对的平均共识指数。柱近 1 为稳定生境；缺口为 singleton，本实现记 NaN。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:339
msgid "Item consensus"
msgstr "项共识"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:340
msgid "How tightly each supervoxel agrees with each cluster at the selected K. Rows are sorted by the consensus label."
msgstr "所选 K 下各超体素与各簇一致程度。行按共识标签排序。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:366
msgid "Supervoxels in the consensus partition"
msgstr "共识划分中的超体素"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:367
msgid "Points are pooled supervoxels. Colours are the consensus labels (shown from 1, matching habitat ids when every cluster is occupied). Crosses are the centroids written into the habitat model."
msgstr "点为池化超体素。颜色为共识标签（从 1 显示，占满簇时与生境 id 一致）。叉为写入生境模型的质心。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:408
msgid "Habitat map on the image"
msgstr "图像上的生境图"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:409
msgid "Nearest centroid of the consensus groups, on the first training patient. This is the map a new subject would receive from the saved model."
msgstr "共识组最近质心，作用于第一名训练患者。这是新受试者从保存模型得到的图。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:449
msgid "Prefer a selected K whose CDF is closer to a step and whose consensus matrix shows a few dark blocks, and whose cluster-consensus bars sit well above 0.5."
msgstr "优先选择 CDF 更接近阶跃、共识矩阵有少量暗块、簇共识条远高于 0.5 的 K。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:452
msgid "A pick on the last delta point (``max_habitats - 1``) means the range was too narrow for this rule. Widen ``max_habitats`` and rerun."
msgstr ""
"在最后 delta 点（ ``max_habitats - 1`` ）选中表示该规则下范围过窄。扩大 ``max_habitats`` 并重跑。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering.rst:454
msgid "The overlay can disagree slightly with the consensus labels: assignment is Euclidean nearest centroid, and a consensus group need not be a sphere in feature space. Say which of the two you interpret."
