#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_01_volume_fractions.rst:22
msgid "Volume and fractions"
msgstr "体积与分数"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_01_volume_fractions.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** The simplest habitat number is how much of the tumour each habitat occupies. Volume fractions let you ask, for example, whether a larger share of one habitat goes with a worse outcome."
msgstr "**背景。** 最简单的生境数量指标是肿瘤中各生境占比。体积分数可问例如某生境更大份额是否与更差结局相关。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_01_volume_fractions.rst:28
msgid "**Purpose.** You get a table with one row per habitat (volume fraction, number of separate pieces, size of the largest piece), an overlay of the habitat map, and a bar chart of the fractions."
msgstr "**目的。** 得到每生境一行表（体积分数、独立片数、最大片尺寸）、生境图叠加与分数柱状图。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_01_volume_fractions.rst:34
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_06_assign.rst:36
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:34
msgid "**habitat** -- a sub-region inside the tumour (the ROI) whose voxels behave alike across the input images; HABIT paints each ROI voxel with a habitat id (1, 2, 3, ...)."
msgstr ""
"**habitat** —— 肿瘤（ROI）内体素在输入图像上行为相似的子区域；HABIT 为每个 ROI 体素涂上生境 id（1、2、3…）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_01_volume_fractions.rst:37
msgid "**volume fraction** -- voxels of one habitat divided by all non-background voxels of the map; fractions sum to 1."
msgstr "**体积分数** ——某生境体素数除以图中所有非背景体素；分数之和为 1。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_01_volume_fractions.rst:39
msgid "**region** -- one face-connected piece of a habitat; ``num_regions`` counts the pieces and ``largest_region_voxels`` is the size of the biggest one."
msgstr "**region** —— 某一生境中面连通的一块； ``num_regions`` 统计块数， ``largest_region_voxels`` 为最大一块的体素数。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_01_volume_fractions.rst:41
msgid "**one-step habitats** -- clustered inside this one subject; see :doc:`/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject`."
msgstr ""
"**一步法生境** — 在该受试者内聚类；见 :doc:`/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_01_volume_fractions.rst:44
msgid "Atomic volume metrics from a habitat label map: :func:`~habit.kernels.habitat_volume_fractions` and :func:`~habit.kernels.habitat_region_stats`."
msgstr "由生境标签图得到的原子体积指标： :func:`~habit.kernels.habitat_volume_fractions` 与 :func:`~habit.kernels.habitat_region_stats` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_01_volume_fractions.rst:50
msgid "One-step habitats give a map to quantify. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 2"
msgstr "一步法生境给出可量化的图。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 2"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_01_volume_fractions.rst:118
msgid "Volume fractions and connected-component stats per habitat id. Collect the non-background ids actually present in this map."
msgstr "各生境 id 的体积分数与连通域统计。收集本图实际存在的非背景 id。"
