msgid ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_04_quantifying_habitats_plot_02_msi.py>` to download the full example code."
msgstr ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_04_quantifying_habitats_plot_02_msi.py>` 以下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_02_msi.rst:22
msgid "Multiregional spatial interaction (MSI)"
msgstr "多区域空间交互 (MSI)"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_02_msi.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** Two tumours can have the same habitat fractions but a different spatial arrangement: habitats mixed together, or kept apart. MSI measures that arrangement by counting which habitats touch which."
msgstr "**背景。** 两个肿瘤可有相同生境占比但空间排布不同：生境混在一起或彼此分离。MSI 通过统计哪些生境与哪些接触来度量该排布。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_02_msi.rst:28
msgid "**Purpose.** You get the MSI matrix as a table and heatmap, plus a dictionary of scalar MSI features (one value per name) ready to use as columns in a statistics or model table."
msgstr "**目的。** 得到 MSI 矩阵的表格与热图，以及标量 MSI 特征字典（每个名称一个值），可直接用作统计或模型表中的列。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_02_msi.rst:34
msgid "**MSI** (multiregional spatial interaction, Wu et al. 2018) -- counts how often voxels of each habitat touch voxels of each other habitat (face neighbours), describing how habitats are arranged in space."
msgstr ""
"**MSI** (multiregional spatial interaction, Wu et al. 2018) -- counts how often 体素 of each 生境 touch 体素 of each other 生境 (face neighbours), describing how 生境 are arranged in space."
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_02_msi.rst:37
msgid "**MSI matrix** -- entry ``[i, j]`` is the number of face-neighbour voxel pairs labelled ``i`` and ``j``; row/column 0 is background, so it records how much of each habitat lies on the tumour border."
msgstr ""
"**MSI 矩阵** —— ``[i, j]`` 为标签 ``i`` 与 ``j`` 的面邻接体素对数；行/列 0 为背景，记录各生境在肿瘤边界的占比。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_02_msi.rst:40
msgid "**MSI scalars** -- ``firstorder_*`` are the matrix entries (raw and normalised); ``contrast`` / ``homogeneity`` / ``correlation`` / ``energy`` are texture-style summaries of the normalised matrix."
msgstr ""
"**MSI 标量** —— ``firstorder_*`` 为矩阵元（原始与归一化）； ``contrast`` / ``homogeneity`` / ``correlation`` / ``energy`` 为归一化矩阵的纹理式摘要。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_02_msi.rst:44
msgid "Atomic MSI from a habitat label map (Wu et al., *Radiology* 2018): :func:`~habit.kernels.spatial_interaction_matrix` and :func:`~habit.kernels.msi_features_from_matrix`."
msgstr "由生境标签图的原子 MSI（Wu 等， *Radiology* 2018）： :func:`~habit.kernels.spatial_interaction_matrix` 与 :func:`~habit.kernels.msi_features_from_matrix` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_02_msi.rst:50
msgid "Build a habitat map, then compute the MSI matrix and scalar summaries. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
msgstr "构建生境图，再计算 MSI 矩阵与标量摘要。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_02_msi.rst:121
msgid "MSI matrix (background row/column 0) and derived scalar features."
msgstr "MSI 矩阵（背景行/列 0）与导出标量特征。"
