msgid ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_04_quantifying_habitats_plot_03_ith.py>` to download the full example code."
msgstr ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_04_quantifying_habitats_plot_03_ith.py>` 以下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_03_ith.rst:22
msgid "Intratumoral heterogeneity (ITH)"
msgstr "瘤内异质性（ITH）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_03_ith.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** Intratumoral heterogeneity (ITH) describes how mixed a tumour is. Here it is measured from the habitat map as fragmentation: do habitats form a few compact blobs, or many scattered pieces?"
msgstr "**背景。** 瘤内异质性（ITH）描述肿瘤混合程度。此处从生境图以碎片化度量：生境为少数紧凑块还是许多分散碎块。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_03_ith.rst:28
msgid "**Purpose.** You get one ITH score for the whole tumour plus one dispersion value per habitat, as a table and a summary figure."
msgstr "**目的。** 得到全肿瘤一个 ITH 分数及每生境一个离散度值，表与摘要图。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_03_ith.rst:33
msgid "**ITH score** -- intratumoral heterogeneity as fragmentation: 0 when each habitat is one connected blob, approaching 1 when habitats break into many small pieces. Formula: ``1 - sum_i(S_i,max / n_i) / S_total``, with ``S_i,max`` the largest piece of habitat ``i``, ``n_i`` its number of face-connected pieces and ``S_total`` all non-background voxels."
msgstr ""
"**ITH score** — 瘤内异质性即碎片化：各生境为单连通块时为 0，碎成许多小块时趋近 1。公式： ``1 - sum_i(S_i,max / n_i) / S_total`` ， ``S_i,max`` 为生境 ``i`` 最大片， ``n_i`` 为面连通片数， ``S_total`` 为非背景体素总数。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_03_ith.rst:38
msgid "**per-habitat dispersion** -- the same idea for one habitat, ``1 - (S_i,max / n_i) / S_i``; the ITH score is their volume-weighted mean."
msgstr "**逐生境离散度** — 单个生境的同一思想， ``1 - (S_i,max / n_i) / S_i`` ；ITH 分数为其体积加权均值。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_03_ith.rst:41
msgid "Atomic ITH metrics from a habitat label map: :func:`~habit.kernels.ith_score` and :func:`~habit.kernels.habitat_ith_dispersion`."
msgstr "由生境标签图计算的原子 ITH 指标： :func:`~habit.kernels.ith_score` 与 :func:`~habit.kernels.habitat_ith_dispersion` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_03_ith.rst:48
msgid "One-step habitats"
msgstr "一步法 生境"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_03_ith.rst:49
msgid "Same idea as the complete analysis, without partition or pool, so one subject is enough. ``one_step_habitat`` builds these stages: extract ``Spec(\"raw\")``, fit ``Spec(\"kmeans\", {\"n_habitats\": 3})``, assign ``Spec(\"nearest_centroid\")``. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
msgstr "思路与完整分析相同，但不含 ``partition`` 或 ``pool`` ，因此一名受试者即可。 ``one_step_habitat`` 构建这些阶段：extract ``Spec(\"raw\")`` 、fit ``Spec(\"kmeans\", {\"n_habitats\": 3})`` 、assign ``Spec(\"nearest_centroid\")`` 。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_03_ith.rst:120
msgid "ITH score and per-habitat dispersion"
msgstr "ITH 评分和每栖息地分布"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_03_ith.rst:121
msgid "One tumour-level number, then one value per habitat id (same formula)."
msgstr "一个肿瘤级数值，再按生境 id 各一值（同公式）。"
