msgid ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_04_quantifying_habitats_plot_04_graph_network_features.py>` to download the full example code."
msgstr ":ref:`转到文末 <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_04_quantifying_habitats_plot_04_graph_network_features.py>` 可下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:22
msgid "Habitat graph network features"
msgstr "生境 graph network 特征"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** Volume fractions say how much of each habitat a tumour has; they do not say how the habitat is arranged. The same 30 % of a habitat can be one compact mass or a scatter of small islands. HABIT's graph family turns the habitat map into a network and measures that arrangement with standard network statistics."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** 体积分数说明肿瘤各生境占比，不说明空间排布。同一 30 % 生境可以是紧凑块或散布小岛。HABIT 图族将生境图转为网络并用标准网络统计度量排布。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:30
msgid "**Purpose.** You will fit the approved two-step analysis on two demo patients, label all five demo patients with the saved definition, print a short table of graph metrics with a one-line meaning for each column, draw the lattice and the network on one slice, and see how the numbers change when nodes and edges are built another way."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 在两名演示患者上拟合批准的两步法分析，用已保存定义为五名演示患者贴标签，打印图指标简表并附每列一行含义，在一层切片上绘制 lattice 与网络，并观察换节点/边构建方式时数字如何变化。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:36
msgid "**When to use.** When your question is about spatial organisation -- fragmented versus compact habitats, habitats that interleave versus habitats that sit side by side -- rather than only about how much of each habitat there is."
msgstr "**何时使用。** 问题关于空间组织——碎片化 vs 紧凑生境、交错 vs 并列——而非仅各生境占比。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:43
msgid "**node (default, ``node_method=\"uniform_grid\"``)** -- the tumour bounding box is cut into cubes of ``block_size=8`` voxels per side. A cube is kept only when more than 20 % of it lies inside the tumour (``block_min_coverage=0.2``). Inside each kept cube, every connected piece of one habitat becomes one node, placed at that piece's centroid. A cube that holds two habitats therefore gives at least two nodes."
msgstr ""
"**node（默认 ``node_method=\"uniform_grid\"`` ）** — 肿瘤包围盒切成边长 ``block_size=8`` 体素的立方体。仅当立方体 >20 % 在肿瘤内（ ``block_min_coverage=0.2`` ）才保留。每个保留立方体内，同一生境的每个连通片成为一个节点，位于该片质心。含两种生境的立方体因此至少两个节点。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:49
msgid "**edge (default, ``edge_method=\"min_distance\"``)** -- two nodes are linked when their closest voxels are at most ``distance_threshold=5`` voxels apart. The unit is voxels, not millimetres. Pieces that touch across a cube face are linked; two pieces with a whole empty cube between them are about 8 voxels apart and are not."
msgstr "**边（默认， ``edge_method=\"min_distance\"`` ）** —— 当两节点最近体素至多相距 ``distance_threshold=5`` 个体素时相连。单位是体素，不是毫米。隔着立方体面相触的碎片会相连；中间隔着一整块空立方体的两块碎片约相距 8 个体素，则不相连。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:54
msgid "**single-habitat graph (``single_h<i>_*`` columns)** -- only the nodes of habitat ``i`` and the edges between them. It describes how that one habitat hangs together."
msgstr "**单生境图（ ``single_h<i>_*`` 列）** — 仅生境 ``i`` 的节点及其间边。描述该生境如何连成一体。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:57
msgid "**pair graph (``pair_h<i>_h<j>_*`` columns)** -- the nodes of habitats ``i`` and ``j`` together. Cross-habitat edges describe how the two habitats touch and interleave."
msgstr "**成对图（ ``pair_h<i>_h<j>_*`` 列）** —— 同时包含生境 ``i`` 与 ``j`` 的节点。跨生境边描述这两种生境如何接触与交错。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:60
msgid "**extended metrics (``include_extended_metrics``)** -- extra columns per graph: global and local efficiency, a small-world coefficient, a rich-club coefficient, and betweenness / degree / local-efficiency distribution summaries."
msgstr ""
"**extended metrics（ ``include_extended_metrics`` ）** — 每图额外列：全局/局部效率、小世界系数、rich-club 系数及 betweenness/度/local-efficiency 分布摘要。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:65
msgid "**Analysis definition.** The page uses the approved two-step definition (four DCE phases, subject-level winsorize + z-score, 30 k-means supervoxels, pool, 10-bin cohort binning, k-means 2..10 habitats by elbow, nearest-centroid assignment) with graph extended metrics off. The comparison at the end varies ONE factor: how nodes and edges are built (``node_method=\"component\"`` with ``edge_method=\"adjacency\"``)."
msgstr ""
"**分析定义。** 本页用已批准两步法（四 DCE 期、受试者级 winsorize + z-score、30 k-means 超体素、pool、10-bin 队列分箱、k-means 2..10 生境 elbow、最近质心分配），graph 扩展指标关闭。末尾比较只变一因子：节点与边如何构建（ ``node_method=\"component\"`` 与 ``edge_method=\"adjacency\"`` ）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:74
msgid "The habitat definition is fitted on two patients and applied to the other three. That is a demo of the mechanics on the 5-subject demo cohort, not a study. Graph metrics are computed on the full 3-D habitat map; the network figure shows one 2-D slice for display only."
msgstr "生境定义在两名患者上拟合，再应用到另外三名。这是在 5 受试者演示队列上展示机制，并非一项研究。图指标在完整 3-D 生境图上计算；网络图仅为显示而展示一个 2-D 切片。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:85
msgid "The first two demo patients define the habitats; all five get a graph row. The demo pack is cached after the first download. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 2"
msgstr "前两名演示患者定义生境；五名均有图行。演示包首次下载后缓存。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 2"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:159
msgid "Fit the habitats and label every patient"
msgstr "适合栖息地并标记每位患者"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:160
msgid "The approved definition. The ``graph`` stage is the last quantify stage; its parameters are the ``GraphHabitatFeatures`` constructor arguments. Everything not listed keeps the library default (uniform-grid nodes, 8-voxel cubes, closest-voxel edges within 5)."
msgstr ""
"批准的定义。 ``graph`` 阶段为最后 quantify 阶段；其参数为 ``GraphHabitatFeatures`` 构造参数。未列出的项保持库默认（均匀网格节点、8 体素立方、5 内最近体素边）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:336
msgid "A curated metrics table"
msgstr "精选指标表"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:337
msgid "The graph family writes several hundred columns (every metric for every habitat and every habitat pair, plus size-normalised companions ending in ``_norm`` / ``_per_habitat_volume``). A study picks the few that answer its question. The ten below illustrate the family on habitat 1 and the habitat 1 / habitat 2 pair; the same metrics exist for every other habitat id and pair."
msgstr ""
"图族写入数百列（每个生境与每对生境的每个指标，及以 ``_norm`` / ``_per_habitat_volume`` 结尾的规模归一化伴生列）。研究只选回答问题的少数列。下列十列在生境 1 与生境 1/2 对上示例该族；其他 id 与对亦有相同指标。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:403
msgid "The lattice and the network on one slice"
msgstr "一片上的晶格和网络"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:404
msgid "``plot_habitat_graph_slice`` draws the habitat labels with the 8-voxel lattice on top: every dashed square is one cube. The network figure rebuilds the graphs with the same node and edge rules on that one 2-D slice, for display only: the first row has one panel per habitat (white dots = nodes, white lines = edges inside that habitat), the following rows one panel per habitat pair (only the cross-habitat edges are drawn). Its ``n`` / ``e`` counts are for the slice, not the 3-D table. Both functions take the label array of the full 3-D map and choose the slice with the largest cross-section."
msgstr ""
"``plot_habitat_graph_slice`` 在生境标签上叠加 8 体素格子：每个虚线方格为一立方。网络图在该 2-D 层按相同节点/边规则重建图，仅用于展示：首行每生境一 panel（白点=节点，白线=生境内边），后续行每生境对一 panel（仅跨生境边）。其 ``n`` / ``e`` 为层内计数，非三维表。两函数取完整三维标签数组并选最大截面层。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:456
msgid "All patients at a glance"
msgstr "所有患者一览"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:457
msgid "``plot_graph_feature_heatmap`` z-scores each column across the rows (here: the five demo patients) and keeps the ``n_features`` columns with the largest variance among the single-habitat metrics. With five patients this is a way to look at the table, not a statistical result."
msgstr ""
"``plot_graph_feature_heatmap`` 对行（此处五名演示患者）逐列 z-score，并在单生境指标中保留方差最大的 ``n_features`` 列。五名患者时这只是查看表格的方式，非统计结果。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:491
msgid "Another node and edge rule"
msgstr "另一节点与边规则"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:492
msgid "ONE factor changes: nodes become whole connected pieces of a habitat (``node_method=\"component\"``; pieces larger than ``subdivide_region_voxels=1000`` voxels are still cut into 8-voxel cubes), and two nodes are linked only when they touch in at least ``adjacency_min_voxels=10`` neighbouring voxel pairs (``edge_method=\"adjacency\"``, 26-neighbourhood). The habitat maps are the same; only the graph built on them differs. The extractor is the same component the ``graph`` stage uses, called as ``extractor(subject, habitat_map)``."
msgstr "只改一个因素：节点变为生境的整块连通片段（ ``node_method=\"component\"`` ；大于 ``subdivide_region_voxels=1000`` 个体素的片段仍会被切成 8 体素立方体），且仅当两个节点在至少 ``adjacency_min_voxels=10`` 对相邻体素上接触时才连边（ ``edge_method=\"adjacency\"`` ，26 邻域）。生境图相同；不同的只是在其上构建的图。提取器与 ``graph`` 阶段所用组件相同，以 ``extractor(subject, habitat_map)`` 调用。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:557
msgid "What the extended metrics add"
msgstr "扩展指标新增内容"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:558
msgid "``include_extended_metrics=True`` (the constructor default) adds, per single and pair graph, global and local efficiency, the small-world coefficient (Humphries' analytic Erdos-Renyi comparison by default, ``graph_null_sampler=\"analytic\"``), a rich-club coefficient against one configuration-model random graph, and betweenness / degree-skewness / node local-efficiency summaries. They are computed on the largest connected piece of each graph, and small-world is reported only for graphs with at least ``extended_min_nodes=10`` nodes (0 otherwise). The extra all-pairs path and per-node neighbourhood computations are why it takes longer; ``graph_null_sampler=\"config\"`` or ``\"rewire\"`` replaces the small-world column with a 100-graph degree-preserving ensemble and is slower still. Timing below is for one small patient on the machine that built this page. The extended call is timed twice: the first call in a Python process also pays a one-time setup cost."
msgstr ""
"``include_extended_metrics=True`` （构造函数默认）为每个单图与对图增加全局/局部效率、小世界系数（默认 Humphries 解析 Erdos-Renyi 比较， ``graph_null_sampler=\"analytic\"`` ）、相对一个 configuration-model 随机图的 rich-club 系数，以及 betweenness / 度偏度 / 节点局部效率摘要。在各图最大连通片上计算；小世界仅报告至少 ``extended_min_nodes=10`` 节点图（否则 0）。额外全对路径与逐节点邻域计算更慢； ``graph_null_sampler=\"config\"`` 或 ``\"rewire\"`` 以 100 图保度 ensemble 替换小世界列且更慢。下述计时为本页构建机器上小患者一次。扩展调用计时两次：Python 进程首次调用亦付一次性 setup。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:612
msgid "Measured on this page (K = 4 by the elbow rule on subj001 + subj002; habitat ids 1..4):"
msgstr "本页测量（subj001 + subj002 elbow 得 K = 4；生境 id 1..4）："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:615
msgid "Graph size follows tumour size: ``graph_num_nodes_total`` was 481, 135, 105, 124 and 779 for subj001..subj005 (ROI 34694, 9858, 6156, 5840 and 80084 voxels). Compare raw counts only between tumours of similar size, or use the ``*_norm`` / ``*_per_habitat_volume`` companions."
msgstr "图规模随肿瘤大小变化：subj001..subj005 的 ``graph_num_nodes_total`` 分别为 481、135、105、124 与 779（ROI 体素数 34694、9858、6156、5840 与 80084）。仅在相似大小的肿瘤之间比较原始计数，或使用 ``*_norm`` / ``*_per_habitat_volume`` 配套列。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:620
msgid "Habitat 1 formed one linked network in subj002, subj003 and subj004 (``single_h1_connected_components`` = 1) and two groups in subj001 and subj005, with the largest group holding about 99 % of the nodes."
msgstr ""
"生境 1 在 subj002、subj003、subj004 形成单一连通网络（ ``single_h1_connected_components`` = 1），在 subj001、subj005 为两组，最大组约 99% 节点。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:623
msgid "``pair_h1_h2_habitat_assortativity`` was close to zero (about -0.03 to 0.07): in this graph habitat 1 and habitat 2 nodes link to each other almost as often as to their own habitat."
msgstr ""
"``pair_h1_h2_habitat_assortativity`` 近零（约 -0.03 至 0.07）：本图中生境 1 与 2 节点互连频率几乎与各自生境内相当。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:626
msgid "The component / adjacency rule builds far fewer nodes and edges on the same maps (subj001: 185 instead of 481 nodes, 52 instead of 737 habitat-1 edges). The two rules are different graph definitions: do not mix their columns in one analysis, and report which one you used (the rule is stored in the stage ``Spec`` and in the run manifest)."
msgstr ""
"component / adjacency 规则在同一图上构建远更少节点与边（subj001：185 而非 481 节点，52 而非 737 条生境-1 边）。两规则是不同图定义：勿在同一分析中混用其列，并报告所用规则（规则存于阶段 ``Spec`` 与运行清单）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:631
msgid "Extended metrics added 140 columns (412 -> 552 for four habitats)."
msgstr "扩展指标新增 140 列（四生境时 412 → 552）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:633
msgid "These are five demo patients; the numbers show what the columns contain, not how they relate to any clinical outcome."
msgstr "这是五名演示患者；数字展示列含义，非与任何临床结局的关系。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:640
msgid "The graph family step by step, including one-step maps and label matching: :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features`."
msgstr "逐步讲解图特征族，含一步法生境图与标签匹配： :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:642
msgid "The other habitat feature families in one table: :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics`."
msgstr "其他生境特征族一表汇总： :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:644
msgid "The analysis definition used here: :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec`."
msgstr "此处使用的分析定义： :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:646
msgid "Export the table and the methods text: :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results`."
msgstr "导出表格和方法文本： :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features.rst:652
msgid "**Total running time of the script:** (0 minutes 31.201 seconds)"
msgstr "**脚本总运行时间：** (0 minutes 31.201 seconds)"
