msgstr ""
":download:`下载压缩包：plot_04_graph_network_features.zip <plot_04_graph_network_features.zip>`"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:13
msgid ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_04_quantifying_habitats_plot_05_habitat_radiomics.py>` to download the full example code."
msgstr ":ref:`转到文末 <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_04_quantifying_habitats_plot_05_habitat_radiomics.py>` 可下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:22
msgid "Habitat radiomics with volume, MSI and ITH"
msgstr "含 volume、MSI、ITH 的生境放射组学"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** Once every voxel has a habitat id, a patient can be described in several complementary ways: how much of each habitat there is (volume), how the habitats border each other (MSI), how fragmented they are (ITH score), and what the image intensities look like inside each habitat (per-habitat radiomics). A statistics tool needs all of them as columns of one table, one row per patient."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** 每体素有生境 id 后，可从多互补角度描述患者：各生境体量（体积）、生境邻接（MSI）、碎片化（ITH）、生境内强度（逐生境放射组学）。统计工具需全部作为一表列，每患者一行。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:31
msgid "**Purpose.** You will add two PyRadiomics families to the quantify stages of the approved two-step analysis, label all five demo patients, get one combined feature table, see which column family each column belongs to, check one relation between the per-habitat and whole-ROI columns, and write the table as a CSV file."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 向批准两步法分析的 quantify 阶段添加两个 PyRadiomics 族，为五名演示患者贴标签，得到合并特征表，查看每列所属族，检查 per-habitat 与 whole-ROI 列间一种关系，并将表写为 CSV。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:37
msgid "**When to use.** Whenever the habitat analysis feeds a downstream statistical or modelling step that expects a flat patient-by-feature table."
msgstr "**适用场景。** 当生境分析的结果要进入下游统计或建模步骤，且该步骤需要扁平的「患者 × 特征」表时。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:43
msgid "**volume** -- ``habitat_<id>_voxel_count`` and ``habitat_<id>_volume_fraction`` for every habitat id of the model."
msgstr ""
"**体积** -- ``habitat_<id>_voxel_count`` and ``habitat_<id>_volume_fraction`` for every 生境 id of the model."
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:45
msgid "**MSI** (multiregional spatial interaction) -- counts of face-connected voxel pairs between habitat classes (``firstorder_<i>_and_<j>``, and the same counts normalised, ``firstorder_normalized_<i>_and_<j>``), plus second-order summaries of that matrix (``contrast``, ``homogeneity``, ``correlation``, ``energy``). Compare them only between patients labelled by the same cohort model."
msgstr ""
"**MSI** （多区域空间交互）— 生境类间面连通体素对计数（ ``firstorder_<i>_and_<j>`` 及归一化 ``firstorder_normalized_<i>_and_<j>`` ），及该矩阵的二阶摘要（ ``contrast`` 、 ``homogeneity`` 、 ``correlation`` 、 ``energy`` ）。仅在同一队列模型标签的患者间比较。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:51
msgid "**ITH score** -- ``ith_score``, 0 when every habitat is one connected piece and closer to 1 the more fragmented the habitats are."
msgstr "**ITH 分数** —— ``ith_score`` ，每个生境都是一个连通块时为 0，生境越破碎越接近 1。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:53
msgid "**per-habitat radiomics** (``each_habitat``) -- PyRadiomics features of each original image inside each habitat, one column per habitat, feature and modality: ``habitat_<id>_<feature>_of_<modality>``, plus ``has_habitat_<id>`` (1 when the habitat is present). A habitat absent from a patient gives ``NaN``, not 0."
msgstr ""
"**逐生境放射组学** （ ``each_habitat`` ）——各生境内各原始图像的 PyRadiomics 特征，按生境、特征与模态分列： ``habitat_<id>_<feature>_of_<modality>`` ，及 ``has_habitat_<id>`` （存在时为 1）。患者缺失某生境为 ``NaN`` ，非 0。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:58
msgid "**whole-ROI radiomics** (``traditional``) -- the same PyRadiomics features inside the whole ROI (all habitats together), named ``<feature>_of_<modality>``: the classic radiomics reference."
msgstr ""
"**whole-ROI 放射组学** (``traditional``) -- the same Py放射组学 特征 inside the whole ROI (all 生境 together), named ``<feature>_of_<modality>``: the classic 放射组学 reference."
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:61
msgid "**first-order features** -- statistics of the voxel intensities alone (mean, percentiles, energy, entropy, ...), no texture."
msgstr "**一阶特征** — 仅体素强度的统计（均值、分位数、energy、entropy 等），无纹理。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:64
msgid "**Analysis definition.** The approved two-step definition (four DCE phases, subject-level winsorize + z-score, 30 k-means supervoxels, pool, 10-bin cohort binning, k-means 2..10 by elbow, nearest centroid). One deviation: the ``graph`` stage is left out to keep the page fast; it is covered in :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features`. PyRadiomics is limited to the first-order class to stay fast, and the whole-ROI family to the ``LAP`` phase."
msgstr "**分析定义。** 经审定的两步法定义（四个 DCE 时相、受试者级 winsorize + z-score、30 个 k-means 超体素、池化、10 箱队列分箱、按肘部在 2..10 中选择的 k-means、最近质心）。一处偏离：省略 ``graph`` 阶段以保持页面速度；该内容见 :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features` 。PyRadiomics 仅限一阶类以保持速度，全 ROI 族仅限 ``LAP`` 时相。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:74
msgid "The habitat definition is fitted on two patients and applied to the other three of the 5-subject demo cohort. Five rows are enough to show the table, not to analyse it."
msgstr "生境定义在两名患者上拟合并应用于 5 人演示队列另三人。五行够展示表，不足以分析。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:84
msgid "The first two demo patients define the habitats; all five get a row. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
msgstr "前两个演示患者定义栖息地；所有五个都占一行。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:153
msgid "PyRadiomics settings"
msgstr "PyRadiomics 设置"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:154
msgid "A PyRadiomics parameter mapping, exactly as in a PyRadiomics YAML file. ``\"firstorder\": []`` enables every first-order feature (18 of them) and nothing else. ``binWidth`` only matters for the two bin-based first-order features (Entropy, Uniformity). The features are computed on the ORIGINAL images: the winsorize / z-score stages above only prepare the clustering features and do not change what PyRadiomics reads. MR intensities are in arbitrary units, so intensity features such as Mean or Energy are only comparable between patients whose images were intensity-harmonised before HABIT."
msgstr ""
"PyRadiomics 参数映射，与 PyRadiomics YAML 文件相同。 ``\"firstorder\": []`` 启用全部一阶特征（18 个）且无其他。 ``binWidth`` 仅影响两个基于 bin 的一阶特征（Entropy、Uniformity）。特征在 **原始** 图像上计算：上文 winsorize/z-score 仅服务聚类特征，不改变 PyRadiomics 读取内容。MR 强度为任意单位，Mean 或 Energy 等强度特征仅在强度已协调的患者间可比。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:184
msgid "Declare the analysis with every quantify family"
msgstr "用每个 quantify 族声明分析"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:185
msgid "Each quantify stage adds its columns to the same one-row-per-patient table. The stage label (first argument) is free text; the ``Spec`` name picks the registered habitat feature extractor."
msgstr "每个 quantify 阶段向同一每患者一行表追加列。阶段标签（第一参数）为自由文本； ``Spec`` 名称选择已注册生境特征提取器。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:399
msgid "Column families"
msgstr "列族"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:400
msgid "The prefix / suffix of a column name tells which family produced it. The helper below only sorts names; it computes nothing."
msgstr "列名前缀/后缀表明产出特征族。下方 helper 仅排序名称，不做计算。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:464
msgid "A first look at the label-map families"
msgstr "初探标签-映射家族"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:465
msgid "Volume fractions and ITH per patient. The MSI columns are in the table and exported, but their values are not interpreted on this page."
msgstr "各患者体积分数与 ITH。MSI 列在表与导出中，本页不解读其值。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:497
msgid "Per-habitat versus whole-ROI radiomics"
msgstr "逐生境与全 ROI 放射组学"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:498
msgid "The habitats split the ROI without overlap, so the whole-ROI mean LAP intensity must equal the voxel-count-weighted average of the per-habitat mean LAP intensities. This is a consistency check between three families of the same table (volume, each_habitat, traditional)."
msgstr "各生境无重叠地划分 ROI，因此整 ROI 的平均 LAP 强度必须等于各生境平均 LAP 强度按体素数加权的平均。这是同一表中三类（volume、each_habitat、traditional）之间的一致性检查。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:552
msgid "Mean LAP intensity inside each habitat"
msgstr "各生境内 LAP 平均强度"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:553
msgid "One bar group per patient, one bar per habitat, from the ``habitat_<id>_original_firstorder_Mean_of_LAP`` columns."
msgstr "每名患者一组柱，每生境一柱，来自 ``habitat_<id>_original_firstorder_Mean_of_LAP`` 列。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:594
msgid "Export for statistics"
msgstr "导出供统计分析"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:595
msgid "One CSV, one row per patient, the ``subject`` column first. Any statistics tool can read it. Reading it back checks that nothing was lost on the way."
msgstr "一 CSV，每患者一行， ``subject`` 列在前。任意统计工具可读。读回可检查无丢失。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:631
msgid "Measured on this page (K = 4 by the elbow rule on subj001 + subj002; habitat ids 1..4; five patients):"
msgstr "本页测量（subj001 + subj002 上 elbow 得 K = 4；生境 id 1..4；五患者）："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:634
msgid "The combined table has 5 rows and 352 columns including ``subject``: 8 volume, 4 habitat-presence, 288 per-habitat radiomics (4 habitats x 18 first-order features x 4 phases), 18 whole-ROI radiomics (18 features x LAP), 32 MSI and 1 ITH column."
msgstr ""
"合并表 5 行 352 列（含 ``subject`` ）：8 体积、4 生境存在、288 逐生境放射组学（4 生境 x 18 一阶 x 4 期）、18 整 ROI 放射组学（18 x LAP）、32 MSI 与 1 ITH 列。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:638
msgid "ITH scores ranged from 0.84 (subj003) to 0.98 (subj005): in every patient the habitats are split into many pieces rather than one blob each."
msgstr "ITH 分数从 0.84（subj003）到 0.98（subj005）：每名患者生境均裂成多块而非单 blob。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:641
msgid "The whole-ROI mean LAP intensity equalled the voxel-weighted average of the per-habitat means in every patient: the families describe the same voxels, split differently."
msgstr "全 ROI 平均 LAP 强度在每位患者等于按生境均值体素加权平均：各特征族描述相同体素，划分不同。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:644
msgid "Every habitat was present in all five patients here, so the per-habitat columns contain no ``NaN``. In your data an absent habitat leaves ``NaN`` in its columns; decide explicitly how your statistics handle it."
msgstr "此处每个生境在全部五名患者中都出现，因此按生境分列不含 ``NaN`` 。在你的数据中，缺失的生境会在其列中留下 ``NaN`` ；请明确决定统计如何处理。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:648
msgid "Several hundred columns for five patients is the usual radiomics situation of many more features than patients: feature selection and correction for multiple testing belong to the statistics step."
msgstr "五患者数百列是放射组学常见“特征远多于患者”情形：特征选择与多重检验校正属于统计步骤。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics.rst:656
msgid "Each family on its own: :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_01_volume_fractions`, :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_02_msi`, :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_03_ith`, :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics`, and the habitat map itself as the image in :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics`."
msgstr "各特征族单独说明： :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_01_volume_fractions` 、 :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_02_msi` 、 :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_03_ith` 、 :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics` ，以及在 :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics` 中把生境图本身当作图像的用法。"
