#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:22
msgid "Train, save, and predict new patients"
msgstr "训练、保存并预测新患者"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** A habitat study usually has a training set, where the habitat definition is learned, and new patients, where that definition is only applied. The new patients must never influence the definition: no refitted centroids, no refitted bin edges. The ``.habitatmodel`` file is what carries the definition from one side to the other, so a later cohort (or a colleague) gets habitat ids that mean the same thing as in the training set."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** 生境研究通常有训练集（学习定义）与新患者（仅应用定义）。新患者绝不可影响定义：不重拟合质心、不重拟合分箱边界。 ``.habitatmodel`` 文件将定义从一侧带到另一侧，使后续队列（或同事）获得与训练集含义相同的生境 id。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:32
msgid "**Purpose.** You will fit the analysis of :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` on three training patients, save it, look at what the file contains, reload it into a fresh object, label two held-out patients without refitting anything, check that the model was not changed by labelling, repeat the labelling in a separate Python process to show that the file alone is enough, and export the held-out feature table as a CSV."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 在三名训练患者上拟合 :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 的分析，保存，查看文件内容，重载到新对象，不重拟合地为两名 held-out 患者贴标签，检查贴标签未改模型，在独立 Python 进程中重复贴标签以证明仅文件即可，并导出 held-out 特征表 CSV。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:40
msgid "**When to use.** Any study with a train / held-out split, a cohort that grows after the model was fixed, or a colleague who should label their own patients with your habitat definition."
msgstr "**适用场景。** 任何含训练/留出划分的研究、模型固定后仍会扩充的队列，或需要用你的生境定义给自己患者打标签的同事。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:46
msgid "**held-out patient** -- a patient that is labelled with the saved model but was not used to fit it."
msgstr "**held-out patient** — 用已保存模型标注、未参与拟合的患者。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:48
msgid "**fit vs. predict** -- ``fit_predict`` learns the definition and labels the training patients; ``predict`` only labels patients with an existing definition."
msgstr ""
"**fit 与 predict** —— ``fit_predict`` 学习定义并标注训练患者； ``predict`` 仅用已有定义标注患者。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:51
msgid "**subject-level normalization** -- winsorize and min-max with the patient's own statistics. It is recomputed for every patient, training or held-out, and stores no state."
msgstr ""
"**subject-level normalization** — winsorize 与 min-max 用患者自身统计。每位患者（训练或 held-out）重算，不存状态。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:54
msgid "**cohort-level preprocessing** -- the 10-bin discretization learned on the pooled training supervoxels. Its bin edges are stored in the model and reused unchanged on held-out patients."
msgstr "**队列级预处理** —— 在池化后的训练超体素上学习的 10 箱离散化。箱边界存入模型，并在留出患者上原样复用。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:57
msgid "**.habitatmodel** -- the saved habitat definition: centroids, the cohort-level state, the spec, and a non-identifying description of the training cohort."
msgstr "**.habitatmodel** — 保存的生境定义：质心、队列级状态、spec 及训练队列非识别描述。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:61
msgid "The page uses the approved analysis definition unchanged; only the training set differs from the reference page (three patients instead of two)."
msgstr "本页分析定义不变；仅训练集与参考页不同（三名而非两名患者）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:67
msgid "This is not external validation. The held-out patients (subj004, subj005) come from the same 5-subject demo cohort as the training patients, not from another centre or scanner, and three training patients are a demo, not a cohort. The page demonstrates the mechanics of a train / held-out split; nothing on it is evidence of generalization."
msgstr ""
"这不是外部验证。留出患者（subj004、subj005）与训练患者同属 5 受试者演示队列，非另一中心或 scanner；三名训练患者是演示而非队列。页面展示 train / held-out 划分机制；无任何泛化证据。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:80
msgid "The first three demo patients are the training set; the last two are held out and only ever labelled with the saved model. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 2"
msgstr ""
"前三位演示患者为训练集；后两位 held-out，仅用已保存模型打标签。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 2"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:153
msgid "Fit on the training patients"
msgstr "适用于训练患者"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:154
msgid "The same stage list as the reference page. Stages before ``pool`` are subject-level; ``preprocess_cohort`` after ``pool`` is cohort-level and is stored in the model."
msgstr "与参考页相同的阶段列表。 ``pool`` 之前的阶段为受试者级； ``pool`` 之后的 ``preprocess_cohort`` 为队列级，并保存在模型中。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:243
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:176
msgid "HABIT validation elbow is Kneedle on inertia (Satopaa et al. 2011). The visual elbow is the discrete-curvature reading associated with Thorndike 1953, not a formula Thorndike published."
msgstr ""
"HABIT 验证的拐点是在惯性上的 Kneedle（Satopaa 等人，2011）。视觉拐点是与 Thorndike 1953 年相关的离散曲率读数，而不是 Thorndike 发表的公式。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:360
msgid "The methods paragraph of the training run"
msgstr "训练运行的 methods 段落"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:361
msgid "The run manifest records every executed step, its parameters, the seeds and the software versions. ``describe_methods()`` turns that record into a draft methods paragraph. It states only steps that actually ran; you still edit it for your manuscript."
msgstr ""
"运行清单记录每步执行、参数、种子与软件版本。 ``describe_methods()`` 将其转为方法学草稿。仅陈述实际运行步骤；稿件仍须编辑。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:388
msgid "Save the model and look inside the file"
msgstr "保存模型并查看文件内容"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:389
msgid "``result.save`` writes the model plus the training tables; ``write_maps=True`` also writes the training habitat maps as NRRD. The ``.habitatmodel`` file is a plain ZIP archive: a JSON manifest (every scalar field, the spec, the cohort-level state and a format version) and the centroid matrix as ``.npy``. No pickle, so any Python -- or any language with ZIP and JSON -- can read it, and a future HABIT can refuse an incompatible file with a clear message."
msgstr ""
"``result.save`` 写入模型与训练表； ``write_maps=True`` 亦将训练生境图写为 NRRD。 ``.habitatmodel`` 为 plain ZIP：JSON manifest（各标量、spec、队列级状态与 format version）与质心矩阵 ``.npy`` 。无 pickle，任意 Python——或任意支持 ZIP 与 JSON 的语言——可读，未来 HABIT 可对不兼容文件明确拒绝。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:424
msgid "Reload into a fresh object"
msgstr "重新加载到新对象"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:425
msgid "``HabitatModel.load`` builds a new object from the file alone. The model carries an id and a non-identifying description of the cohort that defined it (number of subjects, modalities, a digest of the subject ids), so a shared file says where its definition came from."
msgstr "``HabitatModel.load`` 仅凭文件构建新对象。模型携带一个 id，以及对定义它的队列的非识别性描述（受试者数量、模态、受试者 id 的摘要），因此共享文件能说明其定义从何而来。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:470
msgid "Label the held-out patients"
msgstr "为 held-out 患者打标签"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:471
msgid "``predict`` never refits. Each held-out patient is winsorized and min-max scaled with its OWN statistics (subject-level), split into its own supervoxels, binned with the TRAINING bin edges from the model (cohort-level), and given the training centroids."
msgstr "``predict`` 从不重新拟合。每位留出患者用其 **自身** 统计量（受试者级）做 winsorize 与 min-max，再切成自己的超体素，用模型中的 **训练** 分箱边界（队列级）分箱，并分配到训练质心。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:476
msgid "``spec=spec`` states the analysis the new patients go through; its upstream stages (extract, preprocess, partition) must be the ones the model was trained with. Without ``spec=``, the spec stored in the model is used."
msgstr ""
"``spec=spec`` 声明新患者所经分析；其上游阶段（extract、preprocess、partition）须与训练模型一致。无 ``spec=`` 时使用模型内存储的 spec。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:535
msgid "Check that labelling did not change the definition"
msgstr "检查贴标签未改变定义"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:536
msgid "Three checks a reviewer can ask for: the centroids are bit-identical after ``predict``, every held-out map carries the id of the model that labelled it (so maps from different definitions cannot be mixed silently), and no held-out map uses an id the model does not have."
msgstr ""
"审稿人可能要求的三项检查： ``predict`` 后质心逐位相同；每个 held-out 图携带标注它的模型 id（不同定义的图不能静默混用）；held-out 图不使用模型没有的 id。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:568
msgid "Same labels from a fresh Python process"
msgstr "全新 Python 进程中相同标签"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:569
msgid "To show that the file alone is enough, a separate Python process loads the ``.habitatmodel``, labels the same held-out patients, and saves the label arrays. The child script uses absolute paths and does not import this page, so it shares nothing with the objects above. It uses the spec stored in the model, so it also shows that the file carries the analysis, not only the centroids."
msgstr ""
"为说明仅文件即可，独立 Python 进程加载 ``.habitatmodel`` 、标注相同留出患者并保存标签数组。子脚本用绝对路径且不导入本页，与上文对象无共享。它使用模型内 spec，表明文件携带完整分析而非仅质心。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:628
msgid "Hand the feature table to your statistics tool"
msgstr "将特征表交给统计工具"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:629
msgid "One row per held-out patient: volume fractions, MSI, ITH and graph columns. This CSV is where HABIT stops; outcome modelling or statistics happen in the tool of your choice. No model is built here."
msgstr ""
"每名 held-out 患者一行：体积分数、MSI、ITH 与 graph 列。HABIT 止于该 CSV；结局建模或统计由所选工具完成。此处不建模型。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:659
msgid "Measured on this run:"
msgstr "本次运行测得："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:661
msgid "The elbow rule chose K = 4 habitats on subj001-subj003."
msgstr "肘部规则在 subj001–subj003 上选择 K = 4 个生境。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:662
msgid "The archive holds two members (``manifest.json`` and ``arrays/centroids.npy``, 3.6 kB in total); reloading it gave the same centroids and model id as the in-memory model (both True)."
msgstr ""
"归档含两个成员（ ``manifest.json`` 与 ``arrays/centroids.npy`` ，共 3.6 kB）；重载与内存模型质心及 model id 相同（均为 True）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:666
msgid "After labelling subj004 and subj005 the centroids were bit-identical, both maps carried the model id, and only the model's ids appeared (all True): prediction applied the definition without touching it."
msgstr ""
"在标记了 subj004 和 subj005 之后，质心是位相同的，两个地图都携带了模型 ID，并且只出现了模型的 ID（全为 True）：预测在不修改定义的情况下应用了定义。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:669
msgid "The fresh Python process produced identical label arrays for both held-out patients (True, True), using only the file and the demo images."
msgstr "全新的 Python 进程仅用该文件与演示图像，为两名留出患者生成了相同的标签数组（True, True）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:673
msgid "None of this says the habitats are clinically meaningful or that they transfer to another centre; that needs an independent cohort."
msgstr "这些均不说明生境有临床意义或能外推至其他中心；需独立队列。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:680
msgid "The reference analysis this page reuses: :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec`."
msgstr "本页复用的参考分析： :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict.rst:682
msgid "Receive someone else's ``.habitatmodel`` and check it before use (format version, required modalities): :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model`."
msgstr "接收他人的 ``.habitatmodel`` 并在使用前检查（格式版本、所需模态）： :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model` 。"
