#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:24
msgid "Voxel texture features that flip under a simulated re-acquisition make unstable habitats. Prior et al. (Radiol Artif Intell 2024;6(2):e230118) screen features in two stages:"
msgstr ""
"模拟复采下翻转的体素纹理特征会导致不稳定生境。Prior 等（Radiol Artif Intell 2024;6(2):e230118）分两阶段筛选特征："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:28
