#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:30
msgid "**Per-lesion Spearman** immediately before habitat computation: drop highly correlated features at signed r > 0.7 and P < .001 (``select_precise_correlation_columns`` / ``precise_correlation_filter``; keep the later column). Surviving columns differ by lesion; there is no published global post-Spearman list of 26."
msgstr ""
"**逐病灶 Spearman** — 生境计算前立即执行：在 signed r > 0.7 且 P < .001 时丢弃高相关特征（ ``select_precise_correlation_columns`` / ``precise_correlation_filter`` ；保留后列）。存活列因病灶而异；无公开发表的全局 Spearman 后 26 列列表。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:37
msgid "This page has two separate parts:"
msgstr "这一页有两个独立的部分："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:39
msgid "**Self-screen demo only** (5 demo subjects): ICC LCL then Spearman with the library default ``p_threshold=0.001``. ``n=5`` is too small, so that whitelist is unstable and is **not** used for habitat maps."
msgstr "**仅作自筛选演示** （5 名演示受试者）：先 ICC LCL，再以库默认 ``p_threshold=0.001`` 做 Spearman。 ``n=5`` 过小，该白名单不稳定，且 **不** 用于生境图。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:42
msgid "**Habitat comparison** (all 5 subjects): original vs Appendix S2 perturbation, two arms that both apply **per-subject Spearman** after winsorize 1 % + z-score (no cohort z-score), then cluster:"
msgstr "**生境比较** （全部 5 名受试者）：原始 vs 附录 S2 扰动；两臂均在 winsorize 1% + z-score 后做 **受试者级 Spearman** （无队列 z-score），再聚类："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:46
msgid "all extracted textures → per-subject Spearman → habitats"
msgstr "全部提取纹理 → 逐受试者 Spearman → 生境"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:47
msgid "Table 3 precise 26 → per-subject Spearman → habitats"
msgstr "表 3 precise 26 → 逐受试者 Spearman → 生境"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:49
msgid "Fixed ``n_habitats=3``. Dice is per subject after Hungarian matching; the five-subject summary is the **median** (not the mean)."
msgstr "固定 ``n_habitats=3`` 。匈牙利匹配后逐受试者 Dice；五受试者汇总为 **中位数** （非均值）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:52
msgid "Intensity overlays use one subject only so the page stays readable."
msgstr "强度叠加仅用单受试者以保持页面可读。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:57
msgid "Load the full demo cohort"
msgstr "加载完整演示队列"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:58
msgid "sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 4 Habitats and the self-screen demo both use every subject. Only the raw intensity pair below is limited to the first subject for readability."
msgstr ""
"sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 4 生境与自筛演示均用全部受试者。下列原始强度对仅为可读性限第一名受试者。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:152
msgid "Appendix S2 retest on every subject"
msgstr "附录 S2 各受试者重测"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:153
msgid "Paper defaults: Chang-estimated Gaussian noise, then sub-voxel translation (shift_fraction=0.5), then 0.5 deg in-plane rotation. Masks stay on the original grid (warp_masks=False), matching the Prior 2024 GitHub pairing (perturbed CT + original ROI)."
msgstr ""
"论文默认：Chang 估计高斯噪声，亚体素平移（shift_fraction=0.5），面内旋转 0.5°。掩膜保持原网格（warp_masks=False），与 Prior 2024 GitHub 配对（扰动 CT + 原 ROI）一致。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:197
msgid "Original vs perturbed image (example subject only)"
msgstr "原始 vs 扰动图像（仅示例受试者）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:198
msgid "Display one subject so the page stays readable. Habitats below use all five subjects."
msgstr "显示单受试者以保持可读。下文生境用全部五名受试者。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:253
msgid "Part 1 — Self-screen demo (ICC LCL + Spearman; not for habitats)"
msgstr "第 1 部分——自筛演示（ICC LCL + Spearman；非生境用）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:254
msgid "Same three experiments as the paper (repeatability, kernel radius, bin width). Then Prior-style Spearman on one subject's LCL survivors: signed r > 0.7 and p < 0.001 (HABIT default) drops the *earlier* column and keeps the later one (``PreciseCorrelationFilter`` / ``select_precise_correlation_columns``). Caveat: n=5 is too small; do NOT use this whitelist for habitats below."
msgstr "与论文相同的三项实验（可重复性、核半径、分箱宽度）。随后在一位受试者的 LCL 幸存者上做 Prior 式 Spearman：有符号 r > 0.7 且 p < 0.001（HABIT 默认）时丢弃 *较早* 的列并保留较晚的列（ ``PreciseCorrelationFilter`` / ``select_precise_correlation_columns`` ）。注意：n=5 过小；下面的生境 **不要** 使用这份白名单。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:3660
msgid "Self-screen Spearman (demo only; default p=0.001)"
msgstr "自我筛选斯皮尔曼（仅演示；默认 p=0.001）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:3661
msgid "Library default matches Prior paper P < .001. This whitelist is NOT used to draw habitats below."
msgstr "库默认对齐 Prior 论文 P < .001。下列白名单 **不** 用于下方绘制生境。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:3699
msgid "Part 2 — Table 3 precise parent set (ICC LCL list, before Spearman)"
msgstr "第 2 部分 — 表 3 精确父集（ICC LCL 列表，Spearman 之前）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:3700
msgid "Fixed list from Prior et al. 2024 Table 3 liver (ICC LCL >= 0.50) plus Coarseness — 26 names **before** per-lesion Spearman. Same stems appear as ``robust_names`` in radiomicsgroup/precise-habitats ``habitat_computation.py``. HABIT columns use the ``original_`` prefix. Missing names are reported; they are not replaced with other features."
msgstr "来自 Prior et al. 2024 Table 3 肝脏（ICC LCL >= 0.50）外加 Coarseness 的固定列表——在逐病灶 Spearman 之前共 26 个名称。相同词干作为 ``robust_names`` 出现在 radiomicsgroup/precise-habitats 的 ``habitat_computation.py`` 中。HABIT 列使用 ``original_`` 前缀。缺失名称会报告，不会用其他特征替换。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:3776
msgid "Habitat Spec helpers (winsorize → z-score → per-lesion Spearman)"
msgstr "栖息地 Spec 辅助工具（温莎化 → Z 分数 → 每病灶 Spearman）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:3777
msgid "Clustering is subject-level only (no cohort z-score). Both arms run Spearman on the **scaled** matrix that enters clustering (after winsorize 1 % and per-feature z-score). Do not cluster the raw 26 without this per-lesion step; do not use the n=5 self-screen whitelist."
msgstr ""
"聚类仅受试者级（无队列 z-score）。两臂在 **进入聚类的缩放矩阵** 上（winsorize 1% 与逐特征 z-score 后）做 Spearman。勿对原始 26 维无逐病灶步骤聚类；勿用 n=5 自筛白名单。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:3909
msgid "All-features arm: extract → scale → per-subject Spearman → habitats"
msgstr "全特征臂：extract → scale → 逐受试者 Spearman → 生境"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:3910
msgid "Parent set = every extracted texture. Spearman is per subject on that subject's own voxel rows (pooling=\"none\"). Counts below are after Spearman — not a universal feature count."
msgstr ""
"父集 = 全部提取纹理。Spearman 在每受试者自己的体素行上 per subject（pooling=\"none\"）。下列计数为 Spearman 之后——非通用特征数。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:5634
msgid "Per-subject Spearman kept-column counts (all-features arm)"
msgstr "Per-受试者 Spearman kept-column counts (all-特征 arm)"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:5635
msgid "Different subjects may keep different columns (paper: per-lesion step)."
msgstr "不同受试者可保留不同列（论文：per-lesion 步骤）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:5672
msgid "All-features habitats: original vs perturbed (all 5 subjects)"
msgstr "全特征生境：原始 vs 扰动（全部 5 名受试者）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:5833
msgid "Table-3 arm: whitelist 26 → scale → per-subject Spearman → habitats"
msgstr "Table-3 臂：白名单 26 → scale → 逐受试者 Spearman → 生境"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:5834
msgid "Parent set = Table 3 ICC-LCL list (before Spearman). Still run per-lesion Spearman before clustering — do not cluster the raw 26."
msgstr "父集合 = 表 3 ICC-LCL 列表（在斯皮尔曼之前）。在聚类之前仍然对每个病灶运行斯皮尔曼——不要对原始 26 进行聚类。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:7547
msgid "Per-subject Spearman kept-column counts (Table-3 arm)"
msgstr "逐受试者 Spearman 保留列数（表 3 分支）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:7586
msgid "Table-3 + Spearman habitats: original vs perturbed (all 5 subjects)"
msgstr "表 3 + Spearman 生境：原始 vs 扰动（全部 5 名受试者）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:7746
msgid "Dice summary (median across subjects; no overclaim)"
msgstr "Dice 摘要（跨受试者中位数；不过度宣称）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:7801
msgid "**Total running time of the script:** (4 minutes 19.732 seconds)"
msgstr "**脚本总运行时间：** （4 分 19.732 秒）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:7812
msgid ":download:`Download Jupyter notebook: plot_05_precise_features.ipynb <plot_05_precise_features.ipynb>`"
msgstr ""
":download:`下载 Jupyter notebook：plot_05_precise_features.ipynb <plot_05_precise_features.ipynb>`"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:7816
msgid ":download:`Download Python source code: plot_05_precise_features.py <plot_05_precise_features.py>`"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features.rst:7820
msgid ":download:`Download zipped: plot_05_precise_features.zip <plot_05_precise_features.zip>`"
msgstr ""
":download:`Download zipped: plot_05_precise_features.zip <plot_05_precise_features.zip>`"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:13
msgid ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_05_validation_and_reuse_plot_06_reuse_published_model.py>` to download the full example code."
msgstr ":ref:`转到文末 <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_05_validation_and_reuse_plot_06_reuse_published_model.py>` 可下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:22
msgid "Reuse a published habitat model"
msgstr "复用已发表生境模型"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** A habitat definition published with a paper is a ``.habitatmodel`` file. Whoever receives it should be able to see what it declares (which images, which features, how many habitats, how it was trained), know that their HABIT can read it, check that their own data can enter its feature space, and then label their patients with it -- without refitting anything and without the authors' code."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** 论文发表的生境定义是 ``.habitatmodel`` 文件。接收者应能查看其声明（哪些图像、哪些特征、多少生境、如何训练），确认其 HABIT 可读，确认自有数据可进入其特征空间，再用其为患者打标签 — 无需重拟合、无需作者代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:31
msgid "**Purpose.** You will simulate receiving such a file: train and save a model in ``out/``, then treat the file as a download. You will read what it declares, see the clear error HABIT gives for a file written by a newer format version, see the error for patient data that lacks a modality the model needs, and finally label a new patient with it."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 模拟收到此类文件：在 ``out/`` 训练保存模型，再视为下载。你将读其声明、见 HABIT 对更新 format version 写入文件的明确错误、见患者数据缺模型所需模态时的错误，最后用其为新患者打标签。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:37
msgid "**When to use.** Before applying anyone else's habitat model (or your own, months later) to a new cohort."
msgstr "**何时使用。** 将他人（或数月前自己的）生境模型用于新队列之前。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:42
msgid "**.habitatmodel** -- a ZIP archive with a JSON ``manifest.json`` (format name and version, model id, feature columns, spec, cohort fingerprint, cohort-level preprocessing state, provenance) and the centroid matrix as ``arrays/centroids.npy``. No pickle."
msgstr ""
"**.habitatmodel** —— 含 JSON ``manifest.json`` （格式名与版本、model id、特征列、spec、队列指纹、队列级预处理状态、溯源）与 ``arrays/centroids.npy`` 质心矩阵的 ZIP 归档。无 pickle。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:46
msgid "**format_version** -- the layout version of the archive. A HABIT reads files up to its own version and refuses newer ones with an explicit message."
msgstr "**format_version** ——归档布局版本。HABIT 可读不超过自身版本的文件，对更新版本明确拒绝。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:49
msgid "**feature space** -- the columns the centroids live in, here one subject-normalized and binned intensity per DCE phase. A new patient must provide every image the model's ``extract`` stage names."
msgstr "**特征空间** —— 质心所在的列；此处为每个 DCE 期相一列经受试者标准化并分箱的强度。新患者必须提供模型 ``extract`` 阶段所点名的每一幅图像。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:52
msgid "**cohort fingerprint** -- a non-identifying description of the training cohort (number of subjects, modalities, a digest of the subject ids)."
msgstr "**cohort fingerprint** — 训练队列的非可识别描述（受试者数、模态、受试者 id 摘要）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:56
msgid "The model uses the approved analysis definition, trained on subj001 + subj002 of the 5-subject demo cohort. In real use you skip the training cell and start from the downloaded file."
msgstr "模型采用已批准的分析定义，在 5 名受试者演示队列的 subj001 + subj002 上训练。实际使用时跳过训练单元格，从下载的文件开始。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:63
msgid "Stand-in for the download: train and save a model"
msgstr "下载的替代：训练并保存模型"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:64
msgid "In practice this cell is someone else's work; you receive only the file written at the end of it. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
msgstr "实践中该单元为他人工作；你仅收到其末尾写入的文件。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:175
msgid "Elbow / Kneedle caveat (authors' fit before publish)"
msgstr "Elbow / Kneedle 注意事项（作者发表前拟合）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:254
msgid "Load it and read what it declares"
msgstr "加载并阅读其声明"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:255
msgid "``HabitatModel.load`` reads the archive; nothing is fitted. The model card (``summary()``) and the attributes below are everything the authors declared. The spec travels in ``spec_payload``: it lists the stages a new patient goes through."
msgstr ""
"``HabitatModel.load`` 读取归档；无拟合。模型卡（ ``summary()`` ）与下列属性即作者声明的全部。spec 在 ``spec_payload`` 中：列出新患者经历的阶段。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:326
msgid "The format version lives in the manifest"
msgstr "格式版本存放在清单中"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:327
msgid "``format_version`` is not an attribute of the loaded object; it is a field of ``manifest.json`` and is checked during ``load``. Plain ``zipfile`` + ``json`` read it without HABIT."
msgstr ""
"``format_version`` 非加载对象属性；为 ``manifest.json`` 字段， ``load`` 时检查。plain ``zipfile`` + ``json`` 可不通过 HABIT 读取。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:361
msgid "A file from a newer HABIT is refused, not misread"
msgstr "较新 HABIT 的文件会被拒绝，不会误读"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:362
msgid "Simulate a file written by a future HABIT: copy the archive and raise ``format_version`` by one in its manifest (stdlib only; the library is untouched). Loading it raises ``CompatibilityError`` with an explicit message instead of returning a model that might be read wrongly."
msgstr ""
"模拟未来 HABIT 写的文件：复制归档并在其清单中将 ``format_version`` 提高一。只使用标准库；库本身不受影响。加载它会引发 ``CompatibilityError`` ，并显示明确消息，而不是返回可能被误读的模型。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:403
msgid "Your data must reach the model's feature space"
msgstr "你的数据必须进入该模型的特征空间"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:404
msgid "The model's ``extract`` stage names four DCE phases. Suppose your centre has no 3-minute delayed phase. First a cheap check before any computation: compare the modalities the model was trained on with the images your subject has. Then see what ``predict`` does anyway: it stops with an error naming the missing modality; it never fills in or drops a column silently."
msgstr ""
"模型的 ``extract`` 阶段命名四相 DCE。设您的中心无 3 分钟延迟相。先 cheap 检查：比较模型训练模态与受试者图像。再看 ``predict`` ：报错并点名缺失模态；从不静默填列或删列。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:447
msgid "Failure mode: habitats without subject z-score"
msgstr "失败模式：无受试者 z-score 的生境"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:448
msgid "MRI baselines differ between patients. If the published model (and its training) never z-scored each subject, a new patient whose intensities sit far from the training range can collapse into one habitat. Train a deliberately broken twin of the same design (no subject preprocess), predict the same new patient, and print the real volume fractions. Then compare with the fixed model below."
msgstr "不同患者的 MRI 基线水平不同。若已发表模型（及其训练）从未对每位受试者做 z-score，强度远偏离训练范围的新患者可能坍缩到单一生境。刻意训练一个相同设计但未做受试者预处理的“损坏”孪生模型，预测同一新患者并打印真实体积分数，再与下方修复后的模型对照。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:534
msgid "Label a new patient (fixed path: subject z-score)"
msgstr "标注新患者（固定路径：受试者 z-score）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:535
msgid "The received model embeds subject-level winsorize 1% + z-score. Each new patient recomputes THEIR OWN mean and std; training mean/std are never applied. subj003 was not in the training pair."
msgstr ""
"收到的模型嵌入受试者级 winsorize 1% + z-score。每位新患者 **自行** 重算均值与 std；从不应用训练均值/std。subj003 不在训练对中。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:593
msgid "Print the two fraction tables above side by side. If the broken model shows one habitat near 1.0 and the fixed model spreads mass across several habitats, you have measured the MRI baseline failure mode on this demo patient — not a toy number."
msgstr "并排打印上两表体积分数。若错误模型一生境近 1.0 而修复模型分散到多生境，则已在该演示患者上测得 MRI 基线失败模式 — 非玩具数。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:598
msgid "Format / missing-modality checks earlier still apply: a readable file with matching modalities is necessary but not sufficient; subject-level z-score is part of the definition that must travel with the model."
msgstr "仍适用格式/缺失模态检查：可读且模态匹配必要但不充分；受试者级 z-score 是必须随模型携带的定义部分。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model.rst:606
msgid "Train, save and label held-out patients yourself: :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict`."
msgstr "自行训练、保存并标注 held-out 患者： :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict` 。"
