#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory.rst:22
msgid "Load from directory"
msgstr "从目录加载"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** Before any habitat can be found, HABIT needs to know which images and which tumour mask belong to each patient. The simplest way is a fixed folder layout that HABIT reads in one call."
msgstr "**背景。** 在找到任何生境之前，HABIT 需知道每名患者对应哪些图像与肿瘤掩膜。最简单方式是 HABIT 一次读取的固定文件夹布局。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory.rst:28
msgid "**Purpose.** You get a :class:`~habit.contracts.Cohort` (printed), a summary figure of the loaded subject, and a greyscale slice with the ROI contour to check that image and mask line up."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 得到 :class:`~habit.contracts.Cohort` （打印）、加载受试者摘要图及带 ROI 轮廓的灰度切片以核对图像与掩膜对齐。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory.rst:32
msgid "**When to use.** Use this when your preprocessed files already follow the HABIT folder layout (the official demo pack does). For loose files or arrays, see the other pages in this section."
msgstr "**何时使用。** 预处理文件已遵循 HABIT 文件夹布局时（官方演示包即如此）。松散文件或数组见本节其他页。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory.rst:38
msgid "**cohort** -- HABIT's list of subjects (``Cohort``), each with its images and ROI mask; this is what ``fit`` / ``fit_predict`` take."
msgstr ""
"**cohort** —— HABIT 的受试者列表（ ``Cohort`` ），每人含图像与 ROI 掩膜； ``fit`` / ``fit_predict`` 接受此对象。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory.rst:40
msgid "**subject** -- one patient (``Subject``): an id plus a dictionary of images and a dictionary of masks."
msgstr "**subject** —— 一名患者（ ``Subject`` ）：一个 id，外加图像字典与掩膜字典。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory.rst:42
msgid "**series / modality** -- one image of that patient, such as the arterial (``LAP``) or portal-venous (``PVP``) phase; the folder name under ``images/<subject>/`` is the name you pass in ``modalities=``."
msgstr ""
"**series / modality** — 该患者的一幅图像，如动脉期（ ``LAP`` ）或门静脉期（ ``PVP`` ）； ``images/<subject>/`` 下文件夹名即 ``modalities=`` 传入名。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory.rst:45
msgid "**ROI / mask** -- the region of interest, usually the whole tumour, stored as an integer mask; only voxels inside it are analysed (0 = background). The folder name under ``masks/<subject>/`` is the name you pass in ``roi=``."
msgstr ""
"**ROI / mask** — 感兴趣区，通常为整个肿瘤，存为整数掩膜；仅其内体素被分析（0 = 背景）。 ``masks/<subject>/`` 下文件夹名即 ``roi=`` 传入名。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory.rst:50
msgid "Build a :class:`~habit.contracts.Cohort` from a folder tree with :func:`~habit.contracts.cohort_from_directory`. The tree is ``images/<subject>/<series>/<one file>`` and ``masks/<subject>/<roi>/<one file>``. Below: several people from the tree, then one person taken from that cohort."
msgstr "用 :func:`~habit.contracts.cohort_from_directory` 从文件夹树构建 :class:`~habit.contracts.Cohort` 。树结构为 ``images/<subject>/<series>/<one file>`` 与 ``masks/<subject>/<roi>/<one file>`` 。下文：从树中取若干人，再从该队列中取一人。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory.rst:59
msgid "Directory layout"
msgstr "目录布局"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory.rst:60
msgid ":func:`~habit.datasets.fetch_demo` prints the absolute path and an inventory. That printed tree is what your own ``DATA`` must match."
msgstr ""
":func:`~habit.datasets.fetch_demo` 打印绝对路径与清单。打印的树即您自己的 ``DATA`` 须匹配的结构。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory.rst:147
msgid "Visual summary of this route: the directory tree becomes plottable Subjects (right panel zooms to the ROI; badge colours: folder / image / mask)."
msgstr "本路径的直观概览：目录树变为可绘图的受试者（右侧面板放大到 ROI；徽章颜色：文件夹 / 图像 / 掩膜）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory.rst:182
msgid "Anatomy check: greyscale LAP slice of the first subject, with the ROI contour. Pass the :class:`~habit.image.ImageVolume` (not ``.data``)."
msgstr ""
"解剖检查：首名受试者灰度 LAP 切片与 ROI 轮廓。传入 :class:`~habit.image.ImageVolume` （非 ``.data`` ）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory.rst:219
msgid "Several series share one mask folder. ``modalities`` are image folders. ``roi`` is the mask folder. The names can differ. DICOM is :doc:`/how_to/preprocess`. Loose files are :doc:`/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_02_nifti`."
msgstr ""
"多序列共用一个掩膜文件夹。 ``modalities`` 为图像文件夹。 ``roi`` 为掩膜文件夹。名称可不同。DICOM 见 :doc:`/how_to/preprocess` 。松散文件见 :doc:`/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_02_nifti` 。"
