msgid ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_06_manipulating_images_plot_02_nifti.py>` to download the full example code."
msgstr ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_06_manipulating_images_plot_02_nifti.py>` 以下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_02_nifti.rst:22
msgid "Load from NIfTI files"
msgstr "从 NIfTI 文件加载"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_02_nifti.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** Images and masks often sit as loose files (NIfTI, NRRD, MetaImage) rather than in the HABIT folder layout. HABIT can point at each file directly and reads the voxels only when a stage needs them."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** 图像与掩膜常为 loose 文件（NIfTI、NRRD、MetaImage）而非 HABIT 文件夹布局。HABIT 可直接指向各文件，仅在阶段需要时读体素。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_02_nifti.rst:28
msgid "**Purpose.** You get a geometry report that says whether image and mask grids agree, a :class:`~habit.contracts.Cohort` built from file paths, and a figure of the loaded pair."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 得到图像与掩膜网格是否一致的几何报告、由文件路径构建的 :class:`~habit.contracts.Cohort` ，以及已加载对的图。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_02_nifti.rst:32
msgid "**When to use.** Use this when your files are scattered or named freely; you choose the series and ROI names yourself. The demo pack happens to use ``.nrrd``; ``.nii`` / ``.nii.gz`` work the same way."
msgstr "**适用场景。** 当文件分散或命名随意时使用；序列名与 ROI 名由你自定。演示包恰好使用 ``.nrrd`` ； ``.nii`` / ``.nii.gz`` 用法相同。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_02_nifti.rst:38
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_03_simpleitk.rst:39
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_04_numpy.rst:39
msgid "**cohort / subject / ROI** -- see :doc:`/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory`."
msgstr ""
"**cohort / subject / ROI** — 见 :doc:`/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_02_nifti.rst:40
msgid "**geometry check** -- compares shape, spacing, origin and direction of image and mask; ``validate_geometry`` only reports, it changes nothing."
msgstr ""
"**几何检查** — 比较图像与掩膜的 shape、spacing、origin、direction； ``validate_geometry`` 仅报告，不改动。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_02_nifti.rst:43
msgid "Point at one image file and one mask file (``.nii``, ``.nii.gz``, ``.nrrd``, ``.mha``, ``.mhd``). Change the paths below to your own files. One person and several people are each a :class:`~habit.contracts.Cohort`."
msgstr "指向一个图像文件与一个掩膜文件（ ``.nii`` 、 ``.nii.gz`` 、 ``.nrrd`` 、 ``.mha`` 、 ``.mhd`` ）。把下方路径改成你自己的文件。一人或多人都是一个 :class:`~habit.contracts.Cohort` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_02_nifti.rst:49
msgid "One person. ``role_name`` is the series or ROI name stored on the volume. Use the same string as the dictionary key."
msgstr "一个人。 ``role_name`` 是存储在卷上的系列或 ROI 名称。使用相同的字符串作为字典键。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_02_nifti.rst:145
msgid "Visual summary of this route: the image/mask file pair becomes a plottable Subject (right panel zooms to the ROI). Pass the :class:`~habit.image.ImageVolume` (not ``.data``)."
msgstr "本路径的直观概览：图像/掩膜文件对变为可绘图的受试者（右侧面板放大到 ROI）。请传入 :class:`~habit.image.ImageVolume` （不要传 ``.data`` ）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_02_nifti.rst:179
msgid "Several people. One :class:`~habit.contracts.Subject` per person, then one cohort. ``subject_id`` values must be unique. Pass ``many`` to ``fit_predict``, not a list."
msgstr ""
"多人。每人一个 :class:`~habit.contracts.Subject` ，再组成队列。 ``subject_id`` 须唯一。向 ``many`` 传 ``fit_predict`` ，非 list。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_02_nifti.rst:212
msgid "**Total running time of the script:** (0 minutes 1.554 seconds)"
msgstr "**脚本总运行时间：** （0 分 1.554 秒）"
