msgid ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_06_manipulating_images_plot_03_simpleitk.py>` to download the full example code."
msgstr ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_06_manipulating_images_plot_03_simpleitk.py>` 以下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_03_simpleitk.rst:22
msgid "Load from SimpleITK"
msgstr "从 SimpleITK 加载"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_03_simpleitk.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** Many imaging scripts already hold images as SimpleITK objects. HABIT can wrap those objects directly, keeping their spacing, origin and direction, so no files have to be rearranged."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** 许多成像脚本已持有 SimpleITK 图像。HABIT 可直接包装这些对象，保留 spacing、origin、direction，无需重排文件。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_03_simpleitk.rst:28
msgid "**Purpose.** You get a :class:`~habit.contracts.Cohort` built from SimpleITK images, plus a quick one-step habitat map on one patient to show the cohort is usable."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 从 SimpleITK 图像构建 :class:`~habit.contracts.Cohort` ，并对一名患者做快速一步法生境图以证明队列可用。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_03_simpleitk.rst:32
msgid "**When to use.** Use this when your code already calls ``sitk.ReadImage`` or produces SimpleITK images; if your files follow the HABIT folder layout, :doc:`/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory` is shorter."
msgstr "**何时使用。** 代码已调用 ``sitk.ReadImage`` 或产出 SimpleITK 图像时；若文件符合 HABIT 目录布局， :doc:`/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory` 更短。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_03_simpleitk.rst:41
msgid "**one-step habitats** -- habitats clustered inside one subject only; see :doc:`/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject`."
msgstr ""
"**一步法 生境** -- 生境 clustered inside one 受试者 only; see :doc:`/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_02_inside_each_subject`."
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_03_simpleitk.rst:44
msgid "Read an image file and a mask file with SimpleITK, then put the volumes on a :class:`~habit.contracts.Subject`. ``modality=`` is the series or ROI name. One person and several people are each a :class:`~habit.contracts.Cohort`."
msgstr ""
"用 SimpleITK 读取图像与掩膜文件，再放到 :class:`~habit.contracts.Subject` 上。 ``modality=`` 为序列或 ROI 名。一人与多人各自为 :class:`~habit.contracts.Cohort` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_03_simpleitk.rst:51
msgid "One person. Change the two paths to your files."
msgstr "一人。将两路径改为您的文件。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_03_simpleitk.rst:119
msgid "One-step habitats on this one person, then overlay. This only proves the cohort works end to end; habitat stages are explained in :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/index`."
msgstr "在这一名受试者上做一步法生境，再叠加显示。这只证明队列端到端可用；生境各阶段见 :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/index` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_03_simpleitk.rst:185
msgid "Several people. Same construction, one Subject per person."
msgstr "几个人。相同的结构，每个人一个主语。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_03_simpleitk.rst:218
msgid "**Total running time of the script:** (0 minutes 3.394 seconds)"
msgstr "**脚本总运行时间：** （0 分 3.394 秒）"
