msgid ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_06_manipulating_images_plot_04_numpy.py>` to download the full example code."
msgstr ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_06_manipulating_images_plot_04_numpy.py>` 以下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_04_numpy.rst:22
msgid "Load from NumPy arrays"
msgstr "从 NumPy 数组加载"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_04_numpy.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** Deep-learning and custom pipelines often hold images as NumPy arrays (or tensors converted to NumPy). An array has no voxel size or position, so HABIT pairs it with a :class:`~habit.contracts.Geometry` that records spacing, origin and direction."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** 深度学习与自定义流水线常以 NumPy 数组（或 tensor 转 NumPy）存图像。数组无体素大小与位置，HABIT 将其与记录 spacing、origin、direction 的 :class:`~habit.contracts.Geometry` 配对。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_04_numpy.rst:29
msgid "**Purpose.** You get a :class:`~habit.contracts.Cohort` built from arrays, the first rows of its raw voxel-feature table, and a figure showing the array become a plottable subject."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 由数组构建 :class:`~habit.contracts.Cohort` 、其 raw 体素特征表前几行，以及数组变为可绘制受试者的图。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_04_numpy.rst:33
msgid "**When to use.** Use this when your data is already in memory as arrays; skip it if you have files in the HABIT folder layout (:doc:`/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory`)."
msgstr "**何时使用。** 当您的数据已经以数组形式存在内存中时使用；如果您的文件位于 HABIT 文件夹布局（ :doc:`/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory` ），请跳过此步骤。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_04_numpy.rst:41
msgid "**geometry** -- spacing, origin and direction that place an array in physical space; here the image and its mask share one geometry."
msgstr "**geometry** — spacing、origin、direction 将数组置于物理空间；此处图像与其掩膜共享几何。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_04_numpy.rst:43
msgid "**voxel feature** -- the numbers that describe one voxel (here, its LAP intensity); one column per feature."
msgstr "**voxel feature** — 描述单个体素的数（此处为 LAP 强度）；每特征一列。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_04_numpy.rst:46
msgid "Arrays use axis order ``(z, y, x)``. The mask is integer labels, ``0`` = background. One person and several people are each a :class:`~habit.contracts.Cohort`."
msgstr ""
"数组轴顺序 ``(z, y, x)`` 。掩膜为整数标签， ``0`` = 背景。一人与多人各自是一个 :class:`~habit.contracts.Cohort` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_04_numpy.rst:52
msgid "One person. Change the two paths to your files, then keep the arrays."
msgstr "一名受试者。将两条路径改成你的文件，然后保留数组。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_04_numpy.rst:188
msgid "Visual summary of this route: the array itself (left, as a colour matrix) becomes a plottable Subject (right, zoomed to the ROI)."
msgstr "本路径可视化摘要：数组本身（左，颜色矩阵）变为可绘 Subject（右，缩至 ROI）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_04_numpy.rst:217
msgid "Several people. One Subject per person, then one cohort."
msgstr "Several people. One 受试者 per person, then one 队列."
