msgid "Named masks"
msgstr "命名面具"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_05_named_masks.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** Habitat analysis needs a region of interest (ROI). The ROI is often the tumour, but studies also use a user-drawn peritumoral ring or other named mask that already exists on disk."
msgstr "**背景。** 生境分析需要 ROI。ROI 常为肿瘤，亦可用磁盘上已有的用户绘制瘤周环或其他命名掩膜。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_05_named_masks.rst:28
msgid "**Purpose.** You will load a subject that carries more than one mask key, select a named mask as the ROI, and confirm the ROI voxel count."
msgstr "**目的。** 你将加载带有多个掩膜键的受试者，选择命名掩膜作为 ROI，并确认 ROI 体素数。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_05_named_masks.rst:31
msgid "**When to use.** When your preprocessed tree already stores a peritumoral (or other) mask you drew yourself — HABIT does not generate that mask on this page."
msgstr "**何时使用。** 当你的预处理树已存自绘瘤周（或其他）掩膜时 — 本页不生成该掩膜。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_05_named_masks.rst:37
msgid "**mask key / ROI name** -- the folder name under ``masks/<subject>/``."
msgstr "**掩膜 key / ROI name** -- the folder name under ``masks/<subject>/``."
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_05_named_masks.rst:38
msgid "**named mask** -- any mask you supply; HABIT only reads it."
msgstr "**named mask** — 你提供的任意掩膜；HABIT 只读取。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_05_named_masks.rst:43
msgid "Load one subject and list mask keys"
msgstr "加载单受试者并列出掩膜键"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_05_named_masks.rst:44
msgid "Change DATA / MODALITIES / ROI to your preprocessed layout. The demo pack stores one mask per DCE phase; use those keys as stand-ins for any named mask you would add (for example ``peritumoral``). sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
msgstr ""
"将 DATA / MODALITIES / ROI 改为你的预处理布局。演示包每期 DCE 一个掩膜；可用这些键代表你将添加的命名掩膜（如 ``peritumoral`` ）。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_05_named_masks.rst:115
msgid "Show the named mask on the anatomy"
msgstr "在解剖上显示命名掩膜"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_05_named_masks.rst:154
msgid "The mask key is just a name. Put your peritumoral (or other) mask under ``masks/<subject_id>/<your_name>/`` and set ``ROI = \"your_name\"``."
msgstr ""
"掩膜键仅为名称。将瘤周（或其他）掩膜放在 ``masks/<subject_id>/<your_name>/`` 并设 ``ROI = \"your_name\"`` 。"
