#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_01_extract.rst:22
msgid "Extracting voxel intensities"
msgstr "提取体素强度"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_01_extract.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** Habitat analysis clusters voxels by what they look like across the input images. The first stage, ``extract``, turns each voxel inside the ROI into a row of numbers that later stages can cluster."
msgstr "**背景。** 生境分析按输入图像外观对体素聚类。首阶段 ``extract`` 将 ROI 内每体素变为可聚类的数字行。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_01_extract.rst:28
msgid "**Purpose.** You get the voxel-feature table of one subject (one row per ROI voxel, one column per DCE phase) and a slice of the arterial phase with the ROI outline, so you can check which voxels enter the analysis."
msgstr "**目的。** 得到一名受试者的体素特征表（每个 ROI 体素一行、每个 DCE 期相一列），以及带 ROI 轮廓的动脉期切片，以便检查哪些体素进入分析。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_01_extract.rst:34
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:37
msgid "**ROI / mask** -- the region of interest, usually the whole tumour, stored as an integer mask; only voxels inside it are analysed (0 = background)."
msgstr "**ROI / 掩膜** — 感兴趣区，通常为整瘤，存为整数掩膜；仅分析其内体素（0 = 背景）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_01_extract.rst:37
msgid "**voxel feature** -- the numbers that describe one voxel (for example its intensity in each DCE phase, or a local texture value); one column per feature."
msgstr "**体素特征** —— 描述单个体素的数值（例如各 DCE 期相的强度，或局部纹理值）；每个特征一列。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_01_extract.rst:40
msgid "**extract** stage -- turns images + ROI into a voxel-feature table. ``raw`` is the simplest extractor: it copies the intensities unchanged."
msgstr "**extract** 阶段 — 将图像 + ROI 转为体素特征表。 ``raw`` 为最简提取器：原样复制强度。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_01_extract.rst:43
msgid "Input: one :class:`~habit.contracts.Subject`. Output: a :class:`~habit.contracts.VoxelFeatureField`. Stage: ``extract_voxel_features`` with ``raw``."
msgstr "输入：一个 :class:`~habit.contracts.Subject` 。输出： :class:`~habit.contracts.VoxelFeatureField` 。阶段： ``extract_voxel_features`` 与 ``raw`` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_01_extract.rst:51
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_03_supervoxels.rst:53
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit.rst:63
msgid "Change ``DATA`` / ``MODALITIES`` / ``ROI`` to your preprocessed layout. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
msgstr ""
"将 ``DATA`` / ``MODALITIES`` / ``ROI`` 改为您的预处理布局。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_01_extract.rst:114
msgid "Read one row per ROI voxel"
msgstr "读取每个 ROI 体素一行"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_01_extract.rst:115
msgid "``RawVoxelFeatures`` returns a field with one column per phase, plus the grid position of every row so the field can be drawn back into the image. The extractor is built once with its parameters, then called on the subject; this is the same component as Spec(\"raw\", {...}) in a stage list."
msgstr ""
"``RawVoxelFeatures`` 返回每期一列的场，及每行网格位置以便画回图像。提取器按参数构建一次再对受试者调用；与阶段列表中 Spec(\"raw\", {...}) 为同一组件。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_01_extract.rst:212
msgid "Arterial-phase slice"
msgstr "动脉期切片"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_01_extract.rst:213
msgid "The table above has one column per phase: pre_contrast, LAP, and PVP."
msgstr "上表每相一列：pre_contrast、LAP、PVP。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_01_extract.rst:252
msgid "**Total running time of the script:** (0 minutes 1.734 seconds)"
msgstr "**脚本总运行时间：** （0 分 1.734 秒）"
