msgid ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_07_advanced_plot_02_subject_preprocess.py>` to download the full example code."
msgstr ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_07_advanced_plot_02_subject_preprocess.py>` 以下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_02_subject_preprocess.rst:22
msgid "Subject-level preprocessing"
msgstr "受试者级预处理"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_02_subject_preprocess.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** Raw intensities differ in range between phases and contain a few extreme voxels. Before clustering, each patient's feature columns are winsorized (1%) and z-scored with **that patient's** own statistics so a darker scan does not collapse into one habitat."
msgstr "**背景。** 原始强度在各期相之间量程不同，并含少量极端体素。聚类前，用 **该患者自身** 的统计量对每位患者的特征列做 winsorize（1%）与 z-score，以免偏暗扫描塌缩成单一生境。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_02_subject_preprocess.rst:29
msgid "**Purpose.** You see one column's histogram before and after subject-level winsorize + z-score, then a small habitat map built from the scaled field."
msgstr "**目的。** 查看受试者级 winsorize + z-score 前后单列直方图，再由缩放场构建小生境图。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_02_subject_preprocess.rst:32
msgid "**When to use.** Always, for MR intensity habitats. New patients recompute their own mean/std; training statistics are not applied to them."
msgstr "**何时使用。** MR 强度生境始终适用。新患者重算自身 mean/std；训练统计不用于他们。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_02_subject_preprocess.rst:37
msgid "**winsorize** -- clip each column at the 1st / 99th percentile."
msgstr "**winsorize** — 每列裁至第 1 / 99 分位。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_02_subject_preprocess.rst:38
msgid "**z-score** -- subtract the patient's mean and divide by the patient's std."
msgstr "**z-score** — 减去患者均值并除以患者 std。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_02_subject_preprocess.rst:43
msgid "Load one subject and extract raw intensities"
msgstr "加载单受试者并提取 raw 强度"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_02_subject_preprocess.rst:44
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_04_pooling.rst:43
msgid "sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
msgstr "sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_02_subject_preprocess.rst:139
msgid "Histogram of the first feature before and after"
msgstr "Histogram of the first 特征 before and after"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_02_subject_preprocess.rst:169
msgid "Habitats on the scaled field (one subject)"
msgstr "缩放场上的生境（单受试者）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_02_subject_preprocess.rst:229
msgid "After z-score, each column is centred near 0 with unit scale **inside this patient**. Cohort z-score is unnecessary once that is done."
msgstr "z-score 后每列在该患者内近 0 均值、单位尺度。 **受试者内** 已足够，无需队列 z-score。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_02_subject_preprocess.rst:236
msgid "Supervoxels: :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_03_supervoxels`."
msgstr "超体素： :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_03_supervoxels` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_02_subject_preprocess.rst:237
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_04_pooling.rst:142
msgid "Two-step tutorial: :doc:`/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/plot_01_two_step`."
