#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_03_supervoxels.rst:22
msgid "Partitioning a ROI into supervoxels"
msgstr "将 ROI 划分为超体素"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_03_supervoxels.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** A tumour has tens of thousands of voxels. The two-step design first groups them, inside each subject, into small patches of similar voxels, so the cohort model later clusters a few rows per subject instead of every voxel."
msgstr "**背景。** 肿瘤有数万体素。两步法先在每个受试者内将其分组为相似体素小 patch，以便队列模型之后每个受试者聚类少量行而非全体素。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_03_supervoxels.rst:29
msgid "**Purpose.** You get about 100 supervoxels for one subject, a table with one mean feature vector per supervoxel, and an overlay showing the patches on the arterial image."
msgstr "**目的。** 得到一名受试者约 100 个超体素、一张每个超体素一行均值特征向量的表，以及动脉期图像上超体素斑块的叠加显示。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_03_supervoxels.rst:35
msgid "**supervoxel** -- a small patch of neighbouring voxels with similar features, clustered inside one subject first (``partition``), so the cohort model clusters tens of rows per subject instead of every voxel, which is faster and less noisy."
msgstr ""
"**超体素** — 特征相似邻近体素小 patch，先在单受试者内聚类（ ``partition`` ），使队列模型聚类每受试者数十行而非每体素，更快更稳。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_03_supervoxels.rst:39
msgid "**partition** stage -- the stage that builds supervoxels; ``slic`` and ``kmeans`` are two registered partitioners."
msgstr ""
"**partition** 阶段 —— 构建超体素的阶段； ``slic`` 与 ``kmeans`` 为两种已注册 partitioner。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_03_supervoxels.rst:41
msgid "**SLIC** (simple linear iterative clustering) -- grows supervoxels from a regular grid of seeds; ``compactness`` trades feature similarity against spatial closeness (higher gives rounder, more regular patches)."
msgstr ""
"**SLIC** （simple linear iterative clustering）— 从规则网格种子生长超体素； ``compactness`` 权衡特征相似与空间邻近（更高则更圆、更规则）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_03_supervoxels.rst:45
msgid "Input: a :class:`~habit.contracts.VoxelFeatureField`. Output: a :class:`~habit.contracts.Supervoxelization`. Stage: ``partition`` with ``slic``."
msgstr "输入： :class:`~habit.contracts.VoxelFeatureField` 。输出： :class:`~habit.contracts.Supervoxelization` 。阶段： ``partition`` 与 ``slic`` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_03_supervoxels.rst:115
msgid "Read intensities, then partition"
msgstr "读取强度，然后划分"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_03_supervoxels.rst:116
msgid "SLIC groups nearby voxels with similar intensity. Each row of ``units.features`` is the mean vector of one supervoxel."
msgstr "SLIC 将邻近相似强度体素分组。 ``units.features`` 每行为一个超体素的均值向量。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_03_supervoxels.rst:155
msgid "Supervoxel overlay"
msgstr "超体素叠加"
