#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_04_pooling.rst:22
msgid "Pooling"
msgstr "池化"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_04_pooling.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** After each subject has been turned into clustering units (supervoxels or voxels), ``pool`` stacks those rows into one matrix so a single cohort model can be fitted."
msgstr "**背景。** 各受试者变为聚类单元（超体素或体素）后， ``pool`` 将这些行堆叠成一张矩阵以便拟合单一队列模型。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_04_pooling.rst:28
msgid "**Purpose.** You will build subject-level units for two patients, pool them, and print the pooled shape."
msgstr "**目的。** 为两患者构建受试者级单元、池化并打印池化形状。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_04_pooling.rst:31
msgid "**When to use.** Two-step and pooled-voxel designs. Inside-each-subject designs omit ``pool``."
msgstr "**何时使用。** 两步法 and 池化体素 designs. Inside-each-受试者 designs omit ``pool``."
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_04_pooling.rst:36
msgid "**pool** -- concatenate per-subject unit tables; no transform."
msgstr "**pool** -- 合并每个受试者的单元表格；不进行转换。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_04_pooling.rst:37
msgid "**cohort model** -- centroids learned once on the pooled matrix."
msgstr "**cohort model** — 在池化矩阵上学习一次的质心。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_04_pooling.rst:42
msgid "Build units for two subjects, then pool"
msgstr "为两名受试者构建单元后池化"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_04_pooling.rst:133
msgid "Pooling only stacks rows. Subject z-score already put each column on a common scale inside each patient, so cohort z-score is not required by default."
msgstr "池化只是把行堆叠起来。受试者级 z-score 已在每位患者内部把各列放到同一尺度，因此默认不需要队列级 z-score。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_04_pooling.rst:141
msgid "Fit: :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit`."
msgstr "拟合： :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit` 。"
