#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit.rst:22
msgid "Fitting a cohort habitat model"
msgstr "拟合队列生境模型"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** After every subject is cut into supervoxels, ``fit`` learns one habitat definition from all of them together. Because the same model labels every patient, habitat 2 means the same feature profile in each subject."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** 各受试者切为超体素后， ``fit`` 从全部一起学习一个生境定义。同一模型标注每位患者，故生境 2 在各受试者含义相同特征轮廓。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit.rst:29
msgid "**Purpose.** You get a fitted :class:`~habit.contracts.HabitatModel` with three habitats, its printed summary, and a bar chart of the first feature of each centroid (what each habitat looks like on average)."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 得到拟合的 :class:`~habit.contracts.HabitatModel` （三个生境）、打印摘要，以及各质心第一特征的条形图（各生境平均外观）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit.rst:36
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:48
msgid "**pool** -- stacks every training subject's rows into one matrix so one model is fitted to the whole cohort and habitat ids mean the same thing in every patient."
msgstr "**pool** — 堆叠每位训练受试者行为一矩阵，拟合一个队列模型，生境 id 在每位患者含义相同。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit.rst:39
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:51
msgid "**fit** -- learns the habitat definition (for k-means: the number of habitats and their centroids)."
msgstr ""
"**fit** -- learns the 生境 definition (for k-means: the number of 生境 and their centroids)."
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit.rst:41
msgid "**centroid** -- the mean feature vector of one habitat; new rows are labelled by the centroid they are closest to."
msgstr "**centroid** — 一生境的平均特征向量；新行按最近质心打标签。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit.rst:43
msgid "**elbow** -- HABIT ``validation=\"elbow\"`` is Kneedle on inertia (Satopaa et al., 2011), not Thorndike's (1953) informal elbow and not the pre-v1.0 discrete-curvature rule; see :doc:`/user_guide/building_habitat_maps`. This page fixes ``n_habitats=3``, so no selection runs; pages that auto-select pass ``min_habitats`` / ``max_habitats`` with ``validation=\"elbow\"`` instead."
msgstr ""
"**elbow** — HABIT ``validation=\"elbow\"`` 为 inertia 上的 Kneedle（Satopaa et al., 2011），非 Thorndike（1953）非正式 elbow，也非 v1.0 前离散曲率规则；见 :doc:`/user_guide/building_habitat_maps` 。本页固定 ``n_habitats=3`` ，故不运行选择；自动选择页应传 ``min_habitats`` / ``max_habitats`` 与 ``validation=\"elbow\"`` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit.rst:50
msgid "The ``fit`` stage of :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec`. Input: one :class:`~habit.contracts.Supervoxelization` per subject. Output: a :class:`~habit.contracts.HabitatModel`."
msgstr ":doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 的 ``fit`` 阶段。输入：每受试者一个 :class:`~habit.contracts.Supervoxelization` 。输出： :class:`~habit.contracts.HabitatModel` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit.rst:55
msgid "The calls below are that stage without a ``HabitatSpec``. Inside a spec they are ``Stage(\"partition\", Spec(\"slic\", {\"n_supervoxels\": 100}))`` then ``Stage(\"fit\", Spec(\"kmeans\", {\"n_habitats\": 3, \"n_init\": 3}))``."
msgstr "下方调用即该阶段、但不使用 ``HabitatSpec`` 。在 spec 内它们是 ``Stage(\"partition\", Spec(\"slic\", {\"n_supervoxels\": 100}))`` ，然后 ``Stage(\"fit\", Spec(\"kmeans\", {\"n_habitats\": 3, \"n_init\": 3}))`` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit.rst:125
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_06_assign.rst:118
msgid "Partition each subject"
msgstr "划分每个主题"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit.rst:126
msgid "Each element of ``units`` is one subject's supervoxels. These rows are what the cohort model fits on."
msgstr "``units`` 的每个元素是一名受试者的超体素。这些行正是队列模型拟合所用的数据。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit.rst:156
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_06_assign.rst:147
msgid "Fit one shared model"
msgstr "拟合一个共享模型"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit.rst:157
msgid "The fitter pools every subject's units and learns one set of centroids. n_habitats=3 fixes the count; n_init=3 restarts k-means three times and keeps the run with the lowest within-cluster spread (inertia)."
msgstr ""
"拟合器池化各受试者单元并学习一组质心。n_habitats=3 固定数量；n_init=3 将 k-means 重启三次并保留簇内离散度（inertia）最低的一次。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit.rst:196
msgid "First feature of each centroid"
msgstr "每个质心的第一个特征"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit.rst:225
msgid "**Total running time of the script:** (0 minutes 46.487 seconds)"
msgstr "**脚本总运行时间：** （0 分 46.487 秒）"
