#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_06_assign.rst:22
msgid "Assigning habitat labels"
msgstr "分配生境标签"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_06_assign.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** A fitted model only stores centroids. ``assign`` turns that into a picture: every supervoxel of a subject gets the id of its nearest centroid, and every voxel inherits the id of its supervoxel."
msgstr "**背景。** 拟合模型仅存质心。 ``assign`` 成图：每超体素得最近质心 id，每体素继承其超体素 id。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_06_assign.rst:28
msgid "**Purpose.** You get a :class:`~habit.contracts.HabitatMap` for one subject, an overlay of the habitats on the arterial image, and the number of voxels in each habitat."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 得到单受试者的 :class:`~habit.contracts.HabitatMap` 、生境在动脉图像上的叠加，以及各生境体素数。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_06_assign.rst:34
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:53
msgid "**assign** -- gives every supervoxel / voxel the id of its nearest centroid, producing the habitat map."
msgstr "**assign** ——为每个超体素/体素赋予最近质心 id，得到生境图。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_06_assign.rst:39
msgid "**fit** / **centroid** -- see :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit`."
msgstr "**拟合** / **质心** -- 见 :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_05_fit` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_06_assign.rst:42
msgid "Input: a fitted :class:`~habit.contracts.HabitatModel` and one :class:`~habit.contracts.Supervoxelization`. Output: a :class:`~habit.contracts.HabitatMap`. Stage: ``assign`` with ``nearest_centroid``."
msgstr "输入：拟合的 :class:`~habit.contracts.HabitatModel` 与一个 :class:`~habit.contracts.Supervoxelization` 。输出： :class:`~habit.contracts.HabitatMap` 。阶段： ``assign`` 与 ``nearest_centroid`` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_06_assign.rst:51
msgid "Change ``DATA`` / ``MODALITIES`` / ``ROI`` to your preprocessed layout. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 2"
msgstr "将 ``DATA`` / ``MODALITIES`` / ``ROI`` 改成你的预处理目录布局。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 2"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_06_assign.rst:148
msgid "Same fit as the previous page: three habitats, fixed seed, both subjects."
msgstr "与上一页相同的拟合：三个生境、固定随机种子、两名受试者。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_06_assign.rst:184
msgid "Assign the first subject"
msgstr "分配第一名受试者"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_06_assign.rst:185
msgid "``assigner`` maps one subject's units to a habitat map by the nearest centroid. The second subject's units were used only to fit."
msgstr "``assigner`` 用最近质心将一名受试者的单元映射为生境图。第二名受试者的单元仅用于拟合。"
