msgstr "执行后端上的原子组件"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** ``Study`` never loops over patients itself. It hands each subject-level step to an *execution backend*, which calls the step once per subject and returns one result slot per subject. The backends are public, so the same machinery runs any per-subject function you write from HABIT's atomic components: ``backend.map(function, cohort)``."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** ``Study`` 从不自行循环患者。它将每个受试者级步骤交给 *执行后端* ，每受试者调用一次并返回每受试者一个结果槽。后端公开，故相同机制可运行您用 HABIT 原子组件写的任意 per-subject 函数： ``backend.map(function, cohort)`` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:30
msgid "**Purpose.** You will write one per-subject function from three atomic components (voxel features, subject-level normalization, 30 k-means supervoxels) and run it over four demo patients plus one deliberately broken copy. You will:"
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 你将用三原子组件（体素特征、受试者级归一化、30 k-means 超体素）编写逐受试者函数，并在四名演示患者加一份故意损坏副本上运行。你将："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:35
msgid "run it with ``SerialBackend().map(...)`` and see the broken copy isolated in its own result slot while the others succeed;"
msgstr "用 ``SerialBackend().map(...)`` 运行，可见失败副本隔离在单独结果槽而其余成功；"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:37
msgid "rerun it from a ``CheckpointStore`` so finished subjects are loaded, not recomputed;"
msgstr "从 ``CheckpointStore`` 重跑，已完成受试者加载而非重算；"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:39
msgid "run the same components in two worker processes and check that the supervoxel maps equal the serial ones voxel for voxel;"
msgstr "在两个工作进程中运行相同组件，并逐体素检查超体素图是否与串行结果一致；"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:41
msgid "measure what the worker processes cost on this small cohort."
msgstr "测量 worker 进程在本小队列上的成本。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:43
msgid "**When to use.** When you build your own per-subject step (a custom feature, a QC check, a MONAI transform chain around HABIT components) and want HABIT's failure isolation, checkpoints and worker processes without writing a ``HabitatSpec``."
msgstr ""
"**何时使用。** 当你构建自有逐受试者步骤（自定义特征、QC、围绕 HABIT 组件的 MONAI 变换链）并想要 HABIT 的失败隔离、检查点与 worker，而无需写 ``HabitatSpec`` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:50
msgid "**per-subject function** -- any callable that takes ONE ``Subject`` and returns one result. It must not depend on other subjects."
msgstr ""
"**per-subject function** —— 接受 **一个** ``Subject`` 并返回一个结果的可调用对象。不得依赖其他受试者。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:52
msgid "**SubjectResult** -- the slot a backend returns for each subject: ``subject_id``, ``value`` (the result, or ``None``), ``error`` (the captured exception, or ``None``) and ``from_cache`` (loaded from a checkpoint instead of computed)."
msgstr ""
"**SubjectResult** — 后端每受试者返回槽： ``subject_id`` 、 ``value`` （结果或 ``None`` ）、 ``error`` （捕获异常或 ``None`` ）、 ``from_cache`` （从检查点加载而非计算）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:56
msgid "**SerialBackend** -- one subject after another in this Python process, in input order."
msgstr "**SerialBackend** — 本 Python 进程中按输入顺序逐受试者执行。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:58
msgid "**process backend** -- ``backend_from_policy(RunPolicy(backend=\"process\"))`` returns a ``ProcessPoolBackend``: subjects run in worker processes and results arrive in completion order."
msgstr "**进程后端** —— ``backend_from_policy(RunPolicy(backend=\"process\"))`` 返回 ``ProcessPoolBackend`` ：受试者在工作进程中运行，结果按完成顺序返回。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:61
msgid "**checkpoint** -- each finished subject stored on disk under a key, so a rerun with the same store skips it."
msgstr "**检查点** —— 每个完成的主题都会以一个键存储在磁盘上，因此再次运行时，如果存储相同，将会跳过它。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:64
msgid "The analysis definition is the first four stages of the two-step definition used on :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec`: ``extract`` (raw intensities of the four DCE phases inside ROI ``LAP``), ``preprocess`` (winsorize 1 % at each end, per subject), ``preprocess2`` (min-max to 0..1, per subject) and ``partition`` (k-means, 30 supervoxels, seed 0). Pooling, cohort binning, the habitat fit and the habitat features are cohort-level or come later; they are on :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step`."
msgstr ""
"分析定义即 :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 所用两步法的前四阶段： ``extract`` （ROI ``LAP`` 内四期 DCE 原始强度）、 ``preprocess`` （逐受试者两端各 winsorize 1 %）、 ``preprocess2`` （逐受试者 min-max 到 0..1）、 ``partition`` （k-means，30 超体素，seed 0）。池化、队列分箱、生境拟合与生境特征为队列级或更后；见 :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:75
msgid "A process pool sends the function to each worker by *name*: the worker re-imports the module the function was defined in. On Windows (``spawn``) that works when the function lives in a ``.py`` file the worker can import -- your own module (``from my_steps import supervoxels_of_one_subject``) or a script started with ``python page.py``. It does **not** work for a function typed in a Jupyter notebook or in this rendered page, because the worker cannot import those. The process cell below therefore sends HABIT's own composition of the same three components (``SubjectPipeline(...).units``), which every worker can import, and checks it against the serial run of your function."
msgstr "进程池按 *名称* 把函数发给每个 worker：worker 会重新导入定义该函数的模块。在 Windows（ ``spawn`` ）上，当函数位于 worker 可导入的 ``.py`` 文件中时可用——你自己的模块（ ``from my_steps import supervoxels_of_one_subject`` ）或以 ``python page.py`` 启动的脚本。对在 Jupyter notebook 或本渲染页中键入的函数 **无效** ，因为 worker 无法导入它们。因此下方进程单元发送 HABIT 自有的、由相同三个组件组成的组合（ ``SubjectPipeline(...).units`` ），每个 worker 都能导入，并与你的函数的串行运行对照。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:87
msgid "On Windows a process pool must start under ``if __name__ == \"__main__\":`` (each worker re-imports the main file), so every cell that uses the cohort is written that way and can be copied as is."
msgstr ""
"Windows 上进程池须在 ``if __name__ == \"__main__\":`` 下启动（各 worker 重新 import 主文件），故使用队列的单元均如此编写，可直接复制。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:94
msgid "Load the cohort and build the components"
msgstr "加载队列并构建组件"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:95
msgid "The three components are the Python twins of the first four stages of the two-step spec. They are built at module level (outside the ``__main__`` guard): building them reads no data, and a function that uses them can then be moved into your own module unchanged. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
msgstr ""
"三个组件是两步 spec 前四阶段的 Python 对应物。它们在模块级构建（ ``__main__`` 外）：构建不读数据，使用它们的函数可原样移入您自己的模块。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:185
msgid "The per-subject function"
msgstr "逐受试者函数"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:186
msgid "One subject in, one ``Supervoxelization`` out (the supervoxel label map plus one mean-feature row per supervoxel). This is exactly what the cohort-level pooling step needs from each subject, so its output can go straight into ``pd.concat`` + a habitat fitter (:doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step`)."
msgstr "一进一出 ``Supervoxelization`` （超体素标签图 + 每超体素一行均值特征）。正是队列级池化步所需，输出可直接 ``pd.concat`` + 生境拟合器（ :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step` ）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:231
msgid "Serial backend, with one broken subject"
msgstr "串行后端，含一个失败受试者"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:232
msgid "A copy of the fourth demo patient is added without its portal-venous series, so ``extract`` cannot find ``PVP`` for it. With ``on_subject_failure=\"continue\"`` (the default) the backend catches that exception, puts it in the copy's ``SubjectResult.error`` and moves on; the other subjects are unaffected."
msgstr ""
"加入第四名演示患者的副本但无门静脉期序列，故 ``extract`` 找不到其 ``PVP`` 。 ``on_subject_failure=\"continue\"`` （默认）时后端捕获异常，写入副本的 ``SubjectResult.error`` 并继续；其他受试者不受影响。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:238
msgid "``checkpoint=store`` also writes every finished subject (and the failure) to a checkpoint folder; the next cell reruns from it. The store is a fresh temporary folder so this run really starts from nothing; in a study you would point it at a folder you keep."
msgstr ""
"``checkpoint=store`` 还会将每个完成的主题（以及失败的主题）写入检查点文件夹；下一单元格会从中重新运行。存储是一个新的临时文件夹，因此这次运行确实是从零开始；在一个研究中，你会将它指向你保存的文件夹。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:300
msgid "Rerun from a checkpoint store"
msgstr "从检查点存储重跑"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:301
msgid "The serial run above wrote every finished subject to ``store``; a second call with the same store loads them (``from_cache=True``) instead of recomputing. The failure is stored too, so the rerun does not try the broken copy again unless the backend is built with ``retry_failed_subjects=True``."
msgstr "上面的串行运行已将每个完成的受试者写入 ``store`` ；用同一 store 再次调用时会加载它们（ ``from_cache=True`` ）而不重算。失败也会被存储，因此重跑不会再尝试损坏的副本，除非后端以 ``retry_failed_subjects=True`` 构建。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:307
msgid "A plain function has no ``cache_key`` method, so the backend keys it by the callable's *type* and the subject id (printed below). The key does not name your function or its parameters: keep one store folder per function and per parameter set, or old results are reused for a different computation. HABIT's own components add their spec fingerprint to the key, so a changed parameter is recomputed."
msgstr ""
"普通函数无 ``cache_key`` 方法，后端按可调用 *类型* 与受试者 id 键（见下打印）。键不含函数名或参数：每个函数与参数集单独存文件夹，否则旧结果会被不同计算复用。HABIT 组件将 spec 指纹加入键，参数变则重算。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:352
msgid "The same components in worker processes"
msgstr "相同组件在 worker 进程中"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:353
msgid "``RunPolicy`` collects the scheduling settings and ``backend_from_policy`` turns them into a backend:"
msgstr "``RunPolicy`` 收集调度设置， ``backend_from_policy`` 将其转为后端："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:356
msgid "``backend=\"process\", workers=2`` -- two worker processes."
msgstr "``backend=\"process\", workers=2`` — 两个 worker 进程。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:357
msgid "``on_subject_failure=\"continue\"`` -- a failure is recorded, not raised."
msgstr "``on_subject_failure=\"continue\"`` — 记录失败，不抛出。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:358
msgid "``auto_retry_rounds=0`` -- the process backend normally retries a failed subject twice (worth it for a worker that ran out of memory); a missing file will not appear on retry, so retries are switched off."
msgstr ""
"``auto_retry_rounds=0`` — 进程后端通常对失败受试者重试两次（对 OOM worker 有用）；缺失文件重试不会出现，故关闭重试。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:362
msgid "The function sent to the workers is ``SubjectPipeline(...).units``: HABIT's composition of the same three component objects, which a worker can import (see the note at the top). ``units`` runs extract -> subject preprocessing -> supervoxels and stops before habitat assignment. Results arrive in completion order, so they are matched to the serial run by ``subject_id``."
msgstr ""
"发往 worker 的函数是 ``SubjectPipeline(...).units`` ：HABIT 对相同三个组件对象的组合，worker 可导入（见顶部说明）。 ``units`` 运行 extract → 受试者预处理 → 超体素，在生境分配前停止。结果按完成顺序到达，故按 ``subject_id`` 与串行运行对齐。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:419
msgid "What the worker processes cost here"
msgstr "本页 worker 进程在此的开销"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:420
msgid "To separate the cost of the process machinery from the work itself, the same backend maps ``operator.attrgetter(\"subject_id\")`` -- a function that does no image work at all -- over the same subjects. Its time is start-up only: on Windows each worker is a new Python interpreter that imports HABIT and its dependencies (``spawn``), and each subject is pickled and sent to a worker."
msgstr "为把进程机制本身的开销与真正计算分开，同一后端对相同受试者映射 ``operator.attrgetter(\"subject_id\")``——该函数完全不做图像工作。其耗时只有启动：在 Windows 上每个 worker 都是新的 Python 解释器，需导入 HABIT 及其依赖（ ``spawn`` ），并且每个受试者都要被 pickle 后发送到 worker。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:427
msgid "A second cost is threading. The serial run lets numpy / scikit-learn use every CPU core for k-means. Each worker is capped to ONE BLAS/OpenMP thread (environment variable ``HABIT_WORKER_THREADS``, default 1) so that ``workers x threads`` cannot oversubscribe the machine. Two single-threaded workers can therefore be slower than one multi-threaded serial run. Workers pay off when there are many more subjects than workers and the per-subject work does not already use all cores."
msgstr ""
"第二成本是线程。串行运行让 numpy / scikit-learn 用满 CPU 核做 k-means。每 worker 限 ONE BLAS/OpenMP 线程（环境变量 ``HABIT_WORKER_THREADS`` ，默认 1），使 ``workers x threads`` 不超订。故两个单线程 worker 可能慢于一个多线程串行。worker 在受试者远多于 worker 且每受试者工作未占满核时更划算。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:483
msgid "In the reference run of this page (Windows, 2 workers):"
msgstr "本页参考运行（Windows，2 worker）："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:485
msgid "the four demo patients each got 30 supervoxels; the copy without ``PVP`` failed with ``KeyError`` in its own ``SubjectResult`` and did not stop the others; ``fail_fast`` raised the same error;"
msgstr "四名演示患者各得到 30 个超体素；去掉 ``PVP`` 的那份在其自身的 ``SubjectResult`` 中以 ``KeyError`` 失败，且未中断其余患者； ``fail_fast`` 抛出相同错误；"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:488
msgid "the checkpoint rerun loaded all five results (four successes and the recorded failure) in under a second, versus about 24 s for the first serial run, and printed ``checkpoint rerun == serial: True``;"
msgstr ""
"检查点重跑在 1 秒内加载全部五个结果（四次成功与记录失败），而首次串行约 24 s，并打印 ``checkpoint rerun == serial: True`` ；"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:491
msgid "every successful subject printed ``process == serial: True``: the worker processes produce the same supervoxel maps as the serial run;"
msgstr "每个成功受试者打印 ``process == serial: True`` ：worker 产生与串行相同超体素图；"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:493
msgid "the two-worker run was slower than serial here (about 70 s versus 24 s). The no-work map alone took about 14 s, so start-up is part of it; the rest is two single-threaded workers against one multi-threaded serial run. The exact seconds are printed above; they depend on the machine and on what else it is running."
msgstr ""
"两 worker 运行此处慢于串行（约 70 s 对 24 s）。仅空 map 约 14 s，启动占一部分；其余为两单线程 worker 对一多线程串行。精确秒数见上打印；取决于机器与负载。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:499
msgid "Scheduling changes speed and failure handling only. The supervoxels, and everything computed from them, are the same."
msgstr "调度只改变速度与失败处理。超体素及由其计算的一切相同。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:506
msgid "Pool these supervoxels, fit the habitat model and assign labels: :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step`."
msgstr "池化这些超体素、拟合生境模型并分配标签： :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:508
msgid "The whole spec on a backend, with resume, timeouts and timing: :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends`."
msgstr "在后端上运行完整 spec，含 resume、超时与计时： :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:510
msgid "Put HABIT steps inside your own pipeline: :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline`."
msgstr "将 HABIT 步骤嵌入自有流水线： :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:512
msgid "Execution settings in detail: :doc:`/tutorial/execution`."
msgstr "执行设置详见： :doc:`/tutorial/execution` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:517
msgid "**Total running time of the script:** (0 minutes 30.871 seconds)"
msgstr "**脚本总运行时间：** （0 分 30.871 秒）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:528
msgid ":download:`Download Jupyter notebook: plot_08_backends.ipynb <plot_08_backends.ipynb>`"
msgstr ""
":download:`Download Jupyter notebook: plot_08_backends.ipynb <plot_08_backends.ipynb>`"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:532
msgid ":download:`Download Python source code: plot_08_backends.py <plot_08_backends.py>`"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends.rst:536
msgid ":download:`Download zipped: plot_08_backends.zip <plot_08_backends.zip>`"
msgstr ":download:`下载压缩包：plot_08_backends.zip <plot_08_backends.zip>`"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:13
msgid ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_07_advanced_plot_09_own_pipeline.py>` to download the full example code."
msgstr ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_07_advanced_plot_09_own_pipeline.py>` 以下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:22
msgid "HABIT inside your own pipeline"
msgstr "HABIT 嵌入自有流水线"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** Most imaging projects already have their own loader: a PACS export script, a MONAI dataset, a segmentation network that returns a NumPy mask. HABIT does not need its folder layout to run. Its analysis objects take images that are already in memory, and they give back a label array with the geometry of the input image, which you can turn into whatever image type your pipeline uses."
msgstr "**背景。** 多数影像项目已有自己的加载器：PACS 导出脚本、MONAI 数据集、返回 NumPy 掩膜的分割网络。HABIT 运行并不依赖其目录布局。分析对象接受已在内存中的图像，并返回与输入图像几何一致的标签数组，你可以再把它转成流水线所用的任意图像类型。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:31
msgid "**Purpose.** You will read the demo images yourself with SimpleITK (as your own loader would), keep the masks as plain NumPy arrays (as a segmentation network would hand them over), build the subjects and the cohort in memory, run the approved two-step ``Spec`` with ``Study``, and hand each habitat map back as a SimpleITK image on the input grid. A last check runs the same spec on the same patients loaded with ``cohort_from_directory`` and prints whether the maps are identical."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 你将用 SimpleITK 自行读取演示图像（如自有 loader），掩膜保持 NumPy 数组（如分割网络输出），在内存构建受试者与队列，用 ``Spec`` 运行已批准两步法 ``Study`` ，并将各生境图作为输入网格上的 SimpleITK 图像返回。最后检查：相同 spec 在 ``cohort_from_directory`` 加载的相同患者上运行并打印图是否相同。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:39
msgid "**When to use.** HABIT is one step of a larger pipeline and your images come from your own code, not from a ``DATA/images/<subject>/<modality>`` folder. If your files already follow that folder layout, :doc:`/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory` is shorter."
msgstr "**何时使用。** HABIT 是更大流水线的一步，图像来自您自己的代码而非 ``DATA/images/<subject>/<modality>`` 文件夹。若文件已遵循该布局， :doc:`/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_01_directory` 更短。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:44
msgid "**Analysis definition.** The approved two-step definition, unchanged (four DCE phases, ROI ``LAP``, fitted on subj001 + subj002, seed 0). Only the way the images reach HABIT changes."
msgstr ""
"**分析定义。** 已批准两步法定义不变（四 DCE 期、ROI ``LAP`` ，subj001 + subj002 拟合，seed 0）。仅图像进入 HABIT 的方式改变。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:50
msgid "**geometry** -- spacing, origin and direction that place an array in physical space. An array alone has none; it must be supplied with it."
msgstr "**geometry** ——将数组置于物理空间的 spacing、origin 与 direction。单独数组没有这些；必须一并提供。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:52
msgid "**ImageVolume / MaskVolume** -- an in-memory image or mask array plus its geometry; built here from a SimpleITK image and from a NumPy array."
msgstr "**ImageVolume / MaskVolume** —— 内存中的图像或掩膜数组及其几何信息；此处分别由 SimpleITK 图像与 NumPy 数组构建。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:55
msgid "**Subject / Cohort** -- one patient's named images and masks, and a list of subjects; both live in memory only."
msgstr "**Subject / Cohort** — 单患者具名图像与掩膜，及受试者列表；均仅内存。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:57
msgid "**HabitatMap** -- one subject's habitat label array (``0`` = background) plus the geometry it refers to."
msgstr "**HabitatMap** ——单受试者生境标签数组（ ``0`` = 背景）及其对应几何。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:63
msgid "Your own loader"
msgstr "自有加载器"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:64
msgid "Stand-in for the loader your project already has. It reads files with SimpleITK and returns SimpleITK images for the phases and the mask as a NumPy array with its geometry, the way a segmentation step often does. Nothing below depends on where these files live; replace the body with your own code. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
msgstr ""
"替代你项目已有加载器：用 SimpleITK 读文件，返回各期 SimpleITK 图像与带几何的 NumPy 掩膜，如分割步常见。下文不依赖文件位置；请替换为你自己的代码。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:158
msgid "Build subjects and the cohort in memory"
msgstr "在内存中构建受试者与队列"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:159
msgid "Images: ``ImageVolume.from_sitk`` keeps each image's spacing, origin and direction. Mask: ``MaskVolume.from_array`` needs the geometry to be passed explicitly, because a NumPy array has none; pass the geometry your segmentation step reports for it. In the demo the mask headers have a different origin and z direction from their images while the arrays have the same shape; HABIT then keeps the mask voxels as they are, index for index, and puts them on the image grid (it logs the mismatch). A mask of a different shape is never resampled silently: it raises an error that tells you to regrid it first."
msgstr ""
"图像： ``ImageVolume.from_sitk`` 保留 spacing、origin、direction。掩膜： ``MaskVolume.from_array`` 须显式传入几何，因 NumPy 数组无几何；传入分割步骤报告的几何。演示中掩膜头与图像 origin/z 方向不同而数组 shape 相同；HABIT 则 index 对 index 保留掩膜体素并放到图像网格（记录不匹配）。不同 shape 的掩膜不会静默重采样：会报错提示先 regrid。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:217
msgid "Run the approved spec"
msgstr "运行已批准的规格"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:218
msgid "The same ``HabitatSpec`` as :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec`. ``Study`` only sees the in-memory cohort; it neither reads nor writes any folder."
msgstr "与 :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 相同的 ``HabitatSpec`` 。 ``Study`` 只看到内存中的队列；既不读也不写任何文件夹。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:353
msgid "Hand the result back as SimpleITK images"
msgstr "以 SimpleITK 图像交还结果"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:354
msgid "``label_array`` is a NumPy array in ``(z, y, x)`` order, indexed like the input image array: voxel ``[z, y, x]`` of the map is voxel ``[z, y, x]`` of the LAP image. ``GetImageFromArray`` turns it into a SimpleITK image with default geometry; ``CopyInformation`` then gives it the spacing, origin and direction of the input LAP image (it raises if the sizes differ), so the map overlays that image in any viewer."
msgstr ""
"``label_array`` 为 ``(z, y, x)`` 序 NumPy 数组，与输入图像数组同索引：地图体素 ``[z, y, x]`` 即 LAP 图像 ``[z, y, x]`` 。 ``GetImageFromArray`` 转为默认几何 SimpleITK 图像； ``CopyInformation`` 赋予输入 LAP 的 spacing、origin、direction（尺寸不同则抛），地图可在任意 viewer 叠加该图像。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:362
msgid "Two checks print True or False: the label image has the size of the input image, and its labelled voxels are exactly the ROI voxels of the mask array your loader returned (every ROI voxel got a habitat, no voxel outside it did)."
msgstr ""
"两项检查打印 True 或 False：标签图尺寸与输入图像一致；有标签体素恰为加载器返回掩膜数组的 ROI 体素（每个 ROI 体素都有生境，ROI 外无）。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:401
msgid "Same result as the directory-loaded run"
msgstr "与目录加载运行相同结果"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:402
msgid "The same patients loaded with ``cohort_from_directory`` and the same spec. The in-memory route should change nothing but the loading, so the habitat maps must be identical voxel for voxel."
msgstr "相同患者用 ``cohort_from_directory`` 与相同 spec 加载。内存路径应只改加载方式，生境图须逐体素相同。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:453
msgid "The in-memory cohort of subj001 + subj002 gave K = 4 habitats, and each HabitatMap was a ``(200, 360, 360)`` label array with habitat ids 1..4."
msgstr "subj001 与 subj002 的内存队列得到 K = 4 个生境，每张 HabitatMap 都是形状为 ``(200, 360, 360)`` 、生境编号为 1..4 的标签数组。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:456
msgid "Both hand-back checks printed True for both patients: the SimpleITK label image has the input LAP image's size, and exactly the ROI voxels of the loader's mask array carry a habitat."
msgstr "两项回传检查对两名患者均打印 True：SimpleITK 标签图像与输入 LAP 图像尺寸一致，且加载器掩膜数组中恰好 ROI 体素携带生境标签。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:459
msgid "The directory-loaded run gave identical maps (``True`` for both patients) and the same number of habitats, so building the subjects yourself changes only how the data arrive, not the result."
msgstr "目录加载运行给出相同图（两名患者均为 ``True`` ）与相同生境数，故自行构建受试者只改变数据到达方式，不改变结果。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:463
msgid "Apart from the final cross-check, HABIT itself never read a folder: only ``my_loader`` touched files (here the demo files, in your project whatever your loader reads), and the ``.nrrd`` written to ``out/`` is just one way your pipeline could store the returned SimpleITK images."
msgstr "除最终交叉核对外，HABIT 本身从不读取文件夹：只有 ``my_loader`` 接触文件（此处为演示文件，在你的项目中则是你的加载器所读内容），写出到 ``out/`` 的 ``.nrrd`` 只是流水线存储所返回 SimpleITK 图像的一种方式。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:472
msgid "Loading from SimpleITK and from NumPy on their own: :doc:`/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_03_simpleitk` and :doc:`/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_04_numpy`."
msgstr "单独从 SimpleITK 与 NumPy 加载： :doc:`/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_03_simpleitk` 与 :doc:`/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/plot_04_numpy` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:475
msgid "Calling each analysis step yourself instead of ``Study``: :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step`."
msgstr "自己调用每个分析步骤，而不是 ``Study`` ： :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_02_atomic_two_step` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_09_own_pipeline.rst:477
msgid "Saving the model and labelling new patients from your own loader: :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict`."
msgstr "保存模型并用自有加载器标注新患者： :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict` 。"
