#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:13
msgid ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_07_advanced_plot_10_export_results.py>` to download the full example code."
msgstr ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_examples_07_advanced_plot_10_export_results.py>` 以下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:22
msgid "Export results and draft the methods paragraph"
msgstr "导出结果并起草方法段落"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** A finished habitat run leaves three things a paper or a collaborator needs: the habitat maps, a one-row-per-patient feature table, and a written description of what actually ran. HABIT stores the stage list, seeds and software versions in the run manifest; ``describe_methods()`` turns that record into a draft methods paragraph. ``StudyResult.save`` writes the conventional on-disk layout so nothing is left only in memory."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** 完成的生境运行留下论文或合作者需要的三样：生境图、每患者一行的特征表，以及实际运行的文字描述。HABIT 在运行清单中存阶段列表、种子与软件版本； ``describe_methods()`` 转为方法学草稿。 ``StudyResult.save`` 写入常规磁盘布局，避免仅存内存。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:32
msgid "**Purpose.** You will fit the approved two-step analysis on two demo patients, print the methods draft and the Spec fingerprint, save the study (model, maps, feature table, manifest), list what landed on disk, and write a CSV a statistics tool can open."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 在两名演示患者上拟合批准的两步法，打印方法学草稿与 Spec 指纹，保存研究（模型、图、特征表、manifest），列出磁盘内容，并写出统计工具可开的 CSV。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:37
msgid "**When to use.** At the end of every analysis you intend to report or share: before the manuscript methods section, before handing files to a statistician, and before archiving a run."
msgstr "**适用场景。** 在你打算报告或分享的每次分析结束时：写手稿方法部分之前、把文件交给统计人员之前，以及归档一次运行之前。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:43
msgid "**analysis definition** -- the approved two-step stage list of :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec`."
msgstr ""
"**analysis definition** ——:doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 经批准的两步法阶段列表。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:45
msgid "**RunManifest** -- the provenance record of one ``fit_predict`` / ``predict`` call: stages that ran, parameters, seeds, versions."
msgstr ""
"**RunManifest** -- 一个 ``fit_predict`` / ``predict`` 调用的来源记录：运行的阶段、参数、种子、版本。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:47
msgid "**describe_methods()** -- draft English methods text from the manifest (styles include ``radiology``); edit it for your journal."
msgstr ""
"**describe_methods()** ——从 manifest 起草英文方法文本（含 ``radiology`` 等风格）；请按期刊编辑。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:49
msgid "**fingerprint** -- short digest of the Spec; two Specs with the same fingerprint declare the same analysis."
msgstr "**fingerprint** — Spec 的短摘要；相同 fingerprint 的两个 Spec 声明同一分析。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:51
msgid "**StudyResult.save** -- writes ``habitat_model.habitatmodel``, habitat NRRD maps, the feature table and the manifest under one directory."
msgstr ""
"**StudyResult.save** — 在一目录下写入 ``habitat_model.habitatmodel`` 、生境 NRRD 地图、特征表与 manifest。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:56
msgid "Two demo patients are enough to show the export layout. The methods paragraph is a draft from what ran on this machine; you still edit it for inclusion criteria, scanners and clinical endpoints."
msgstr "两个演示患者足以展示导出布局。方法段落是从这台机器运行的内容草稿；你仍然需要修改它以包括纳入标准、扫描仪和临床终点。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:65
msgid "Fit the approved analysis"
msgstr "拟合经批准的分析"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:66
msgid "Same stage list as the reference page. Two patients define the habitats; volume / MSI / ITH / graph fill the feature table that will be exported. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
msgstr ""
"与参考页相同阶段列表。两名患者定义生境；volume / MSI / ITH / graph 填充将导出的特征表。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:252
msgid "Spec fingerprint and methods draft"
msgstr "Spec 指纹与方法草稿"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:253
msgid "The fingerprint is a digest of the declared Spec. The methods text comes from the **run** manifest: only stages that actually executed, with the parameters and seeds that were used. Print both styles so you can pick the tone closest to your journal."
msgstr ""
"指纹为声明 Spec 的摘要。methods 文本来自 **运行** manifest：仅实际执行阶段及所用参数与 seed。打印两种风格以选最接近期刊语气。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:297
msgid "Save the study directory"
msgstr "保存研究目录"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:298
msgid "``result.save`` writes the conventional layout: the ``.habitatmodel`` archive, habitat maps, the feature table and the run manifest. Set ``write_maps=False`` if you only need the table and the model."
msgstr ""
"``result.save`` 写入常规布局： ``.habitatmodel`` 归档、生境图、特征表与运行 manifest。仅需表与模型时设 ``write_maps=False`` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:337
msgid "Reload the model and reread the feature table"
msgstr "重新加载模型并读取特征表"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:338
msgid "A short round-trip check: the saved model reloads, and the CSV row count matches the in-memory feature table."
msgstr "简短往返检查：保存的模型可重载，CSV 行数与内存特征表一致。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:392
msgid "Manifest JSON (what the archive remembers)"
msgstr "Manifest JSON（归档记忆的内容）"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:393
msgid "The ``.habitatmodel`` is a ZIP. Its ``manifest.json`` holds the format version, model id, feature columns, Spec payload and cohort fingerprint without identifying patient data beyond a digest of subject ids."
msgstr "``.habitatmodel`` 是一个 ZIP。其 ``manifest.json`` 保存格式版本、模型 id、特征列、Spec 载荷与队列指纹；除受试者 id 的摘要外，不含可识别患者数据。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:430
msgid "Measured on this run (K = 4 by elbow on subj001 + subj002):"
msgstr "本运行实测（subj001 + subj002 上 elbow 得 K = 4）："
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:432
msgid "``describe_methods()`` drafted a methods paragraph naming every stage that ran (winsorize / z-score / 30 k-means supervoxels / 10-bin cohort binning / k-means elbow / nearest centroid / volume / MSI / ITH / graph), seed 0, HABIT 3.0.0 and the two subjects."
msgstr ""
"``describe_methods()`` 起草方法段，列出运行的各阶段（winsorize / z-score / 30 k-means 超体素 / 10-bin 队列分箱 / k-means 肘部 / 最近质心 / volume / MSI / ITH / graph），seed 0，HABIT 3.0.0 与两名受试者。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:436
msgid "``result.save`` wrote 8 files: ``habitat_model.habitatmodel``, ``habitat_features.csv`` (2 rows x hundreds of columns), ``habitats.csv`` (per-supervoxel units), ``run_manifest.json``, and NRRD habitat + supervoxel maps for both patients."
msgstr "``result.save`` 写出了 8 个文件： ``habitat_model.habitatmodel`` 、 ``habitat_features.csv`` （2 行 × 数百列）、 ``habitats.csv`` （按超体素单元）、 ``run_manifest.json`` ，以及两名患者的 NRRD 生境图与超体素图。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:440
msgid "Reloading the ``.habitatmodel`` recovered the same model id and bit-identical centroids."
msgstr "重新加载 ``.habitatmodel`` 恢复了相同的模型 ID 和位完全相同的质心。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:443
msgid "Edit the draft methods text for your journal (scanners, inclusion criteria, clinical endpoints). The fingerprint identifies the Spec; the manifest identifies what actually ran."
msgstr "为期刊编辑方法草稿（扫描仪、纳入标准、临床终点）。fingerprint 标识 Spec；manifest 标识实际运行内容。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:451
msgid "Train / save / predict with a held-out split: :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict`."
msgstr "训练/保存/预测与 held-out 划分： :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:453
msgid "Hand a published ``.habitatmodel`` to another site: :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model`."
msgstr "将已发表 ``.habitatmodel`` 交给另一站点： :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_06_reuse_published_model` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:455
msgid "The reference analysis this export came from: :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec`."
msgstr "本导出所依据的参考分析： :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_10_export_results.rst:457
msgid "Per-habitat radiomics columns in the same table: :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics`."
msgstr "同一表中的分生境放射组学列： :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_05_habitat_radiomics` 。"
