#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/index.rst:6
msgid "**Background.** A habitat map splits a tumour into sub-regions whose voxels behave alike across the input images. **Purpose.** Build your first habitat map and feature table from the demo pack, first in Python, then (briefly) from a YAML file and the ``habit`` command."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** 生境图将肿瘤分为输入图像间体素行为相似的子区。 **目的。** 从演示包构建首张生境图与特征表，先用 Python，再（简要）用 YAML 与 ``habit`` 命令。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/index.rst:12
msgid "Install HABIT first (:doc:`/tutorial/installation`). The Python page is the main walk-through; the YAML and CLI page runs the same analysis from a v1 YAML document and from the shell with ``config/habitat/config_habitat_quickstart_v1.yaml``. All routes fit the same four subjects with the same stages and seed, and give the same habitat maps voxel by voxel."
msgstr "请先安装 HABIT（ :doc:`/tutorial/installation` ）。Python 页是主要操作指南；YAML 与 CLI 页用 v1 YAML 文档及 shell 中的 ``config/habitat/config_habitat_quickstart_v1.yaml`` 运行同一分析。所有路径以相同阶段与种子拟合相同的四名受试者，并逐体素给出相同的生境图。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/index.rst:40
