#: ../../source/reference/cli.rst:38
msgid ":doc:`/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml`"
msgstr ":doc:`/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml`"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:13
msgid ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_quickstart_plot_quickstart_python.py>` to download the full example code."
msgstr ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_quickstart_plot_quickstart_python.py>` 以下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:22
msgid "Quickstart: Python API"
msgstr "快速开始：Python API"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** Habitat analysis splits a tumour into sub-regions that behave alike across the input images (here, DCE phases), then describes each tumour by how much of each sub-region it has and how they are arranged."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** 栖息地分析将肿瘤分割为在输入图像（此处为DCE期）中表现类似的亚区域，然后通过每个肿瘤包含的各亚区域的数量及其排列方式来描述每个肿瘤。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:28
msgid "**Purpose.** You get your first habitat maps, a per-subject feature table (volume fractions, MSI, ITH, graph), and a saved model that labels a new patient without refitting."
msgstr "**目的。** 得到首批生境图、逐受试者特征表（体积分数、MSI、ITH、图）及可在不重拟合下为新患者打标签的已保存模型。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:39
msgid "**voxel feature** -- the numbers that describe one voxel (here its intensity in each DCE phase); one column per feature."
msgstr "**体素特征** — 描述单个体素的数值（此处为各 DCE 期强度）；每特征一列。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:41
msgid "**subject-level normalization** -- each patient's features are rescaled with that patient's own statistics before clustering. MR intensities are arbitrary units, so a darker scan would otherwise fall into one habitat. See :doc:`/tutorial/concepts`."
msgstr ""
"**subject-level normalization** — 聚类前用各患者自身统计重缩放特征。MR 强度为任意单位，否则较暗扫描会落入单一生境。见 :doc:`/tutorial/concepts` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:45
msgid "**supervoxel** -- a small patch of neighbouring voxels with similar features, clustered inside one subject first (``partition``), so the cohort model clusters tens of rows per subject instead of every voxel."
msgstr ""
"**supervoxel** —— 特征相似邻域体素的小块，先在受试者内聚类（ ``partition`` ），使队列模型聚类每受试者数十行而非每个体素。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:55
msgid "**Stage / Spec / HabitatSpec** -- a ``Stage`` is one step with a label you choose; a ``Spec`` names a registered component and its parameters; a ``HabitatSpec`` is the ordered list of stages plus ``random_seed``, i.e. the whole study definition."
msgstr "**Stage / Spec / HabitatSpec** —— ``Stage`` 是带你所选标签的一步； ``Spec`` 命名已注册组件及其参数； ``HabitatSpec`` 是阶段的有序列表加上 ``random_seed`` ，即整项研究定义。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:59
msgid "**elbow** -- HABIT ``validation=\"elbow\"`` is Kneedle on inertia (Satopaa et al., 2011), not Thorndike's (1953) informal elbow and not the pre-v1.0 discrete-curvature second-difference rule; see :doc:`/user_guide/building_habitat_maps`."
msgstr ""
"**elbow** — HABIT ``validation=\"elbow\"`` 为 inertia 上 Kneedle（Satopaa 等，2011），非 Thorndike（1953）非正式 elbow，亦非 pre-v1.0 离散曲率二阶差规则；见 :doc:`/user_guide/building_habitat_maps` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:64
msgid "Every term is defined at more length on :doc:`/tutorial/concepts`."
msgstr "各术语详述见 :doc:`/tutorial/concepts` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:66
msgid "A short list of stages declares the analysis; one call fits it on a cohort. Everything after that is looking at the result: the habitat map, the per-habitat features a paper would report, and reusing the fitted model on a new patient. No YAML."
msgstr "短阶段列表声明分析；一次调用在队列上拟合。之后只看结果：生境图、论文会报的逐生境特征、在新患者上复用模型。无 YAML。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:71
msgid "Install first (:doc:`/tutorial/installation`). This page uses the official demo pack (five liver lesions, four DCE phases). Change ``DATA`` / ``MODALITIES`` / ``ROI`` to your own preprocessed tree."
msgstr "先安装（ :doc:`/tutorial/installation` ）。本页用官方演示包（五个肝病灶、四个 DCE 期）。将 ``DATA`` / ``MODALITIES`` / ``ROI`` 改为你的预处理树。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:78
msgid "Load the images"
msgstr "加载图像"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:79
msgid "Four subjects define the habitats; the fifth plays a new patient later. The downloaded pack is cached after the first run. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 4"
msgstr "四名受试者定义生境；第五名稍后扮演新患者。下载包首次运行后缓存。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 4"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:176
msgid "Build the analysis step by step"
msgstr "一步步建立分析"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:177
msgid "A habitat analysis is a list of stages. This is the two-step design: each tumour is normalized on its own scale, split into 30 supervoxels (``partition``), the supervoxels of all subjects are put together (``pool``) and clustered once (``fit``), so habitat 2 means the same enhancement pattern in every patient. Drop ``pool`` and every subject is clustered on its own (one-step); drop ``partition`` and voxels are clustered directly (direct pooling). The fitter tries 2 to 10 habitats and keeps the elbow."
msgstr ""
"生境分析是阶段列表。此为两步法：各肿瘤自有尺度归一化，切 30 超体素（ ``partition`` ），全体超体素合并（ ``pool`` ）并聚类一次（ ``fit`` ），故生境 2 在各患者含义相同增强模式。去掉 ``pool`` 则逐受试者聚类（一步法）；去掉 ``partition`` 则直接体素聚类（直接池化）。拟合器试 2–10 个生境并保留 elbow。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:268
msgid "How many habitats, and why"
msgstr "多少生境，以及为何"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:384
msgid "From supervoxels to habitats on one slice, then the habitat map of two patients. Same colour, same habitat, in both."
msgstr "从超体素到单层切片上的生境，再到两名患者的生境图。两图同色即同一生境。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:451
msgid "The feature table"
msgstr "特征表"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:452
msgid "One row per subject, ready for statistics: volume fractions, the MSI (how habitats touch each other), the ITH score (how fragmented the tumour is) and graph topology. A few of the columns:"
msgstr "每受试者一行，供统计：体积分数、MSI（生境如何接触）、ITH 分数（肿瘤碎片化程度）与图拓扑。部分列："
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:487
msgid "What those numbers look like for one subject"
msgstr "单受试者上这些数字的样子"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:488
msgid "Volume fractions come straight from the table. MSI and ITH are drawn from the same label map with the kernels the table uses."
msgstr "体积分数直接来自表。MSI 与 ITH 用表中相同的核对同一标签图计算。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:544
msgid "Graph network features: the habitat layout as a network"
msgstr "图网络特征：生境布局作为网络"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:545
msgid "Volume fractions say *how much* of each habitat a tumour has; they do not say how the habitats are laid out. The graph features are HABIT's own family for that. HABIT turns each habitat into a network and measures its shape:"
msgstr "体积分数说明肿瘤 *有多少* 各生境；不说明生境如何排布。图特征为 HABIT 自有的度量方式。HABIT 将每个生境转为网络并度量其形状："
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:550
msgid "**nodes** -- the ROI is covered by a lattice of 8 x 8 x 8-voxel cubes. Inside each cube, every connected piece of one habitat becomes one node, placed at that piece's centre."
msgstr "**nodes** — ROI 由 8×8×8 体素立方格点覆盖。每格内一生境的每个连通片成为一个节点，置于该片中心。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:553
msgid "**edges** -- two nodes are joined when their closest voxels are at most 5 voxels apart (distances in voxels, not millimetres)."
msgstr "**edges** —— 当两节点最近体素相距不超过 5 个体素时相连（距离以体素计，非毫米）。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:555
msgid "**single_h<i>_*** columns describe the network of habitat *i* alone (for example ``single_h1_connected_components`` counts separate islands of habitat 1; ``single_h1_n_nodes`` and ``single_h1_n_edges`` its size). **pair_h<i>_h<j>_*** columns describe how habitats *i* and *j* meet (for example ``pair_h1_h2_n_edges`` counts links between them). ``graph_num_nodes_total`` is the node count over all habitats."
msgstr ""
"**single_h<i>_** * 列描述单一生境 * i * 的网络（如 ``single_h1_connected_components`` 统计生境 1 的独立岛； ``single_h1_n_nodes`` 与 ``single_h1_n_edges`` 为其规模）。 **pair_h<i>_h<j>_** * 列描述生境 *i* 与 *j* 如何相接（如 ``pair_h1_h2_n_edges`` 统计其间链接）。 ``graph_num_nodes_total`` 为全部生境节点总数。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:562
msgid "``include_extended_metrics=False`` (set in the ``graph`` stage above) skips the efficiency, small-world and rich-club summaries, which need many random reference graphs and are much slower. Node and edge rules are options of the graph component (for example ``node_method=\"component\"`` and ``edge_method=\"adjacency\"``); more on :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features`."
msgstr ""
"``include_extended_metrics=False`` （上文 ``graph`` 阶段设置）跳过效率、小世界与 rich-club 摘要，需大量随机参考图且慢得多。节点与边规则为图组件选项（如 ``node_method=\"component\"`` 与 ``edge_method=\"adjacency\"`` ）；见 :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:637
msgid "How to read the graph features"
msgstr "如何解读图特征"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:638
msgid "More nodes for a habitat means it covers more lattice cubes; more ``connected_components`` for the same habitat means it is broken into separate islands rather than one compact region. Many ``pair`` edges between two habitats mean they interleave along a long shared border. Size-dependent columns also have ``*_norm`` / ``*_per_habitat_volume`` companions so tumours of different size can be compared."
msgstr ""
"某生境节点更多表示覆盖更多格子立方；同生境 ``connected_components`` 更多表示碎成多岛而非一片紧凑。两生境间 ``pair`` 边多表示沿长共享边界交错。尺寸相关列亦有 ``*_norm`` / ``*_per_habitat_volume`` 伴生以便不同大小肿瘤比较。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:648
msgid "Reuse the model on a new patient"
msgstr "在新患者上复用模型"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:649
msgid "The ``.habitatmodel`` file is the habitat definition: load it anywhere and the new patient gets the same habitat names. Nothing is refitted: the new patient is normalized with its own statistics, binned with the training bin edges stored in the model, and matched to the training centroids. save writes the model archive and result tables under out/quickstart, plus the habitat maps because write_maps=True."
msgstr "``.habitatmodel`` 文件即生境定义：在任意处加载后，新患者会得到相同的生境名称。不会重新拟合：新患者用自身统计量归一化，用模型中保存的训练分箱边界分箱，并匹配到训练质心。save 会在 out/quickstart 下写入模型归档与结果表；因 write_maps=True，还会写出生境图。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:701
msgid "The same analysis from a YAML file and from the shell with ``habit get-habitat --config config/habitat/config_habitat_quickstart_v1.yaml``: :doc:`/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml`. Both fit the same four subjects and give the same habitat maps as this page."
msgstr "同一分析也可从 YAML 文件与 shell 用 ``habit get-habitat --config config/habitat/config_habitat_quickstart_v1.yaml`` 运行： :doc:`/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml` 。两者对相同的四名受试者拟合，并给出与本页相同的生境图。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:705
msgid "Complete analyses, one research scenario per page: :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/index`; start with :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec`."
msgstr "完整分析，每页一个研究场景： :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/index` ；建议从 :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 开始。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:708
msgid "The graph features in depth: :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features`."
msgstr "图特征深入： :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/plot_04_graph_network_features` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:710
msgid "Terms (supervoxel, subject-level vs cohort-level): :doc:`/tutorial/concepts`."
msgstr "Terms (超体素, 受试者-level vs 队列-level): :doc:`/tutorial/concepts`."
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:712
msgid "Interactive 3-D view (``pip install \"habitat-analysis[view]\"``)::"
msgstr "交互式 3D 视图（ ``pip install \"habitat-analysis[view]\"`` ）::"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:720
msgid "**Total running time of the script:** (0 minutes 31.072 seconds)"
msgstr "**脚本总运行时间：** （0 分 31.072 秒）"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:731
msgid ":download:`Download Jupyter notebook: plot_quickstart_python.ipynb <plot_quickstart_python.ipynb>`"
msgstr ""
":download:`Download Jupyter notebook: plot_quickstart_python.ipynb <plot_quickstart_python.ipynb>`"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:735
msgid ":download:`Download Python source code: plot_quickstart_python.py <plot_quickstart_python.py>`"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python.rst:739
msgid ":download:`Download zipped: plot_quickstart_python.zip <plot_quickstart_python.zip>`"
msgstr ""
":download:`Download zipped: plot_quickstart_python.zip <plot_quickstart_python.zip>`"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml.rst:13
msgid ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_quickstart_plot_quickstart_yaml.py>` to download the full example code."
msgstr ":ref:`Go to the end <sphx_glr_download_auto_quickstart_plot_quickstart_yaml.py>` 以下载完整示例代码。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml.rst:22
msgid "Quickstart: YAML and CLI"
msgstr "快速开始：YAML 与 CLI"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml.rst:24
msgid "**Background.** A YAML file is a plain-text way to write the same stage list you would build in Python, so an analysis can be run from the shell with the ``habit`` command, shared, and kept next to the results."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** YAML 是以纯文本写出与 Python 相同阶段列表的方式，可用 ``habit`` 命令从 shell 运行、共享并与结果同存。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml.rst:28
msgid "**Purpose.** You get the two-step habitat maps and a volume-fraction / MSI / ITH / graph table from a YAML file, plus one habitat overlay. The last section runs the shipped quickstart config with ``habit get-habitat``."
msgstr ""
"**目的。** 从 YAML 获得两步法生境图及 volume-fraction / MSI / ITH / graph 表，外加一张生境叠加图。最后一节用 ``habit get-habitat`` 运行随附 quickstart 配置。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml.rst:34
msgid "**YAML config** -- a text file whose ``spec:`` block is a ``HabitatSpec`` (``name``, ``random_seed``, ``stages``), and whose ``data:`` / ``output:`` blocks say where to read subjects and write results."
msgstr "**YAML 配置** —— 文本文件，其 ``spec:`` 块是 ``HabitatSpec`` （ ``name`` 、 ``random_seed`` 、 ``stages`` ）， ``data:`` / ``output:`` 块指明从何处读取受试者、向何处写出结果。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml.rst:37
msgid "**Stage / Spec / HabitatSpec** -- see :doc:`/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python`; each YAML stage entry is one ``Stage``, and its ``component`` is the ``Spec``."
msgstr ""
"**Stage / Spec / HabitatSpec** —— 见 :doc:`/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python` ；每个 YAML 阶段条目为一个 ``Stage`` ，其 ``component`` 为 ``Spec`` 。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml.rst:40
msgid "**subject-level / cohort-level preprocessing** -- a ``preprocess`` entry before ``pool`` rescales each patient on its own; one after ``pool`` is learned on the training cohort and saved in the model (:doc:`/tutorial/concepts`)."
msgstr "**subject-level / cohort-level preprocessing** — ``preprocess`` 前的 ``pool`` 逐患者缩放； ``pool`` 后在训练队列学习并保存在模型中（ :doc:`/tutorial/concepts` ）。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml.rst:45
msgid "The same analysis as :doc:`plot_quickstart_python`, written as a YAML file: same stages, same seed, fitted on the same four subjects. It gives the same habitat maps and feature values as the Python page, and as ``habit get-habitat`` with ``config/habitat/config_habitat_quickstart_v1.yaml`` (last section of this page). ``habit get-habitat --config <file>`` runs a file like this from the shell; :func:`habit.recipes.run_from_yaml` is the Python call behind that command. The ``spec.stages`` list is the stage list of the Python page, one entry per stage."
msgstr "与 :doc:`plot_quickstart_python` 相同的分析，写成 YAML 文件：相同阶段、相同种子，在相同四位受试者上拟合。它给出与 Python 页相同的生境图与特征值，也与使用 ``config/habitat/config_habitat_quickstart_v1.yaml`` 的 ``habit get-habitat`` 一致（见本页最后一节）。 ``habit get-habitat --config <file>`` 可从 shell 运行此类文件； :func:`habit.recipes.run_from_yaml` 是该命令背后的 Python 调用。 ``spec.stages`` 列表即 Python 页的阶段列表，每阶段一条。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml.rst:54
msgid "Change ``DATA`` to your preprocessed root, ``SUBJECTS`` to your subject folders, and ``MODALITIES`` / ``ROI`` to your series names. Two details of the YAML loader:"
msgstr ""
"将 ``DATA`` 改为预处理根目录， ``SUBJECTS`` 改为受试者文件夹， ``MODALITIES`` / ``ROI`` 改为序列名。YAML 加载器两点细节："
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml.rst:58
msgid "``data.source`` is either a folder (every subject under it) or a **manifest** YAML that lists subjects and files. The manifest is how the four training subjects are chosen here; the fifth demo subject is the new patient of the Python page."
msgstr ""
"``data.source`` 为文件夹（其下所有受试者）或列出受试者与文件的 **manifest** YAML。manifest 即此处选择四名训练受试者的方式；第五演示受试者为 Python 页的新患者。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml.rst:62
msgid "The loader keys the ROI mask by the **first** modality, so ``LAP`` (the series the tumour was drawn on) is listed first. The Python page lists ``pre_contrast`` first; only the column order differs. Every preprocessing step works column by column, so the habitat maps do not change."
msgstr ""
"加载器以 **第一** 模态键 ROI 掩膜，故 ``LAP`` （勾画肿瘤序列）列首。Python 页列 ``pre_contrast`` 首；仅列序不同。每预处理步逐列工作，生境图不变。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml.rst:71
msgid "Write the files and run them"
msgstr "写入文件并运行"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml.rst:72
msgid "The manifest names the four subjects and their LAP masks; the YAML document names the stages. ``save=False`` keeps the result in memory instead of writing ``out_dir``. sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
msgstr ""
"manifest 命名四名受试者及其 LAP 掩膜；YAML 文档命名阶段。 ``save=False`` 将结果保留在内存而非写入 ``out_dir`` 。sphinx_gallery_thumbnail_number = 1"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml.rst:266
msgid "Look at one habitat map"
msgstr "查看一张生境图"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml.rst:267
msgid "The anatomy comes from the same folder the YAML named. The saved model (``save=True`` writes it under ``out_dir``) labels a new patient the way the Python page shows in its last section."
msgstr ""
"解剖来自 YAML 所命名文件夹。保存模型（ ``save=True`` 写入 ``out_dir`` ）标注新患者的方式与 Python 页最后一节相同。"
#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml.rst:309
