#: ../../source/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_yaml.rst:335
msgid "``subj001`` habitats written by ``habit get-habitat`` and drawn by the ``habit view`` command above."
msgstr "``subj001`` 生境由 ``habit get-habitat`` 写出，由上 ``habit view`` 命令绘制。"
