msgstr ""
"**Description** ：提取选项镜像 :class:`~habit.habitat_features.GraphHabitatFeatures` ；可视化字段仅 extract recipe 消费。 ``graph`` 为 **内置** 族——非私有插件。用 domain / API 路径；原 ``habit.compat.graph_plugin`` 垫片已在 v2.0.0 移除。"
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:127
msgid "**Key extraction fields** (defaults in parentheses):"
msgstr "**关键提取字段** （括号内为默认）："
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:129
msgid "``include_single_habitat_graph`` (``true``) / ``include_pairwise_habitat_graph`` (``true``)"
msgstr ""
"``include_single_habitat_graph`` （ ``true`` ）/ ``include_pairwise_habitat_graph`` （ ``true`` ）"
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:130
msgid "``edge_method``: ``min_distance`` (default), ``adjacency``, or ``centroid_distance``"
msgstr ""
"``edge_method`` ： ``min_distance`` （默认）、 ``adjacency`` 或 ``centroid_distance``"
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:131
msgid "``distance_threshold`` (``5.0``, voxel-index units) — used by ``centroid_distance`` and ``min_distance``. With default 8-voxel cubes, face-adjacent cubes connect; one empty lattice cell (closest-voxel distance about 8) stays disconnected."
msgstr ""
"``distance_threshold`` (``5.0``, 体素-index units) — used by ``centroid_distance`` and ``min_distance``. With default 8-体素 cubes, face-adjacent cubes connect; one empty lattice cell (closest-体素 distance about 8) stays disconnected."
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:132
msgid "``adjacency_connectivity`` (``corner``: 8-conn in 2D / 26-conn in 3D; ``face`` = 4/6 remains available) / ``adjacency_min_voxels`` (``10``) — used by ``adjacency``. An edge exists when two regions are adjacent and the contact voxel count is >= 10, measured on the habitat labels as drawn (default ``erosion_radius`` is ``0``)."
msgstr ""
"``adjacency_connectivity`` （ ``corner`` ：2D 8 连通 / 3D 26 连通； ``face`` = 4/6 仍可用）/ ``adjacency_min_voxels`` （ ``10`` ）— 供 ``adjacency`` 使用。两区域相邻且接触体素数 >= 10 时有边，在绘制的生境标签上测量（默认 ``erosion_radius`` 为 ``0`` ）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:133
msgid "``edge_weight``: ``none`` | ``distance`` | ``inverse_distance`` | ``contact_voxels``"
msgstr ""
"``edge_weight`` ： ``none`` | ``distance`` | ``inverse_distance`` | ``contact_voxels``"
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:134
msgid "``min_region_voxels`` (``1``), ``connectivity`` (default ``full``: 8-conn in 2D / 26-conn in 3D; ``face`` = 4/6 remains available)"
msgstr "``min_region_voxels`` （ ``1`` ）、 ``connectivity`` （默认 ``full`` ：二维 8 连通 / 三维 26 连通； ``face`` = 4/6 仍可用）"
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:135
msgid "``node_method`` (``uniform_grid`` default; ``component`` for connected-component nodes)"
msgstr "``node_method`` （默认 ``uniform_grid`` ； ``component`` 为连通分量节点）"
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:136
msgid "``erosion_radius`` (``0`` / off; set ``>= 1`` to shrink habitats before edges), ``subdivide_region_voxels`` (``1000``; used only by ``component``)"
msgstr ""
"``erosion_radius`` （ ``0`` 关闭； ``>= 1`` 在连边前收缩生境）， ``subdivide_region_voxels`` （ ``1000`` ；仅 ``component`` ）"
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:137
msgid "``block_size`` (``8`` voxels, not millimetres), ``block_min_coverage`` (``0.2``)"
msgstr "``block_size`` （ ``8`` 体素，非毫米）， ``block_min_coverage`` （ ``0.2`` ）"
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:138
msgid "``pairwise_include_intra_edges`` (``true``)"
msgstr "``pairwise_include_intra_edges`` （ ``true`` ）"
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:139
msgid "``include_extended_metrics`` (``true``; set ``false`` to omit), ``extended_min_nodes`` (``10``)"
msgstr ""
"``include_extended_metrics`` （ ``true`` ；设 ``false`` 省略）、 ``extended_min_nodes`` （ ``10`` ）"
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:140
msgid "``graph_null_sampler`` (``analytic``): one ``small_world_sigma`` column. ``analytic`` is Humphries *S* vs an Erdős–Rényi graph (same *n*, *m*; closed-form :math:`C_{rand}`, :math:`L_{rand}`). ``config`` is the configuration model; ``rewire`` is Maslov–Sneppen (NetworkX ``sigma``). The last two **replace** the analytic value with a degree-preserving ensemble (``small_world_nrand`` / ``small_world_niter``, default ``100``). See :doc:`../reference/features/graph`."
msgstr "``graph_null_sampler`` （ ``analytic`` ）：一列 ``small_world_sigma`` 。 ``analytic`` 为 Humphries *S* 对 Erdős–Rényi 图（同 *n* 、 *m* ；闭式 :math:`C_{rand}` 、 :math:`L_{rand}` ）。 ``config`` 为 configuration 模型； ``rewire`` 为 Maslov–Sneppen（NetworkX ``sigma`` ）。后两者 **替换** 解析值为保度 ensemble（ ``small_world_nrand`` / ``small_world_niter`` ，默认 ``100`` ）。见 :doc:`../reference/features/graph` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:141
msgid "``rich_club_q`` (``100``): mixing floor for ``rewire``; analytic rich-club uses one configuration-model graph"
msgstr "``rich_club_q`` （ ``100`` ）： ``rewire`` 的混合下限；解析 rich-club 用一张配置模型图"
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:142
msgid "``graph_null_device`` (``auto``)"
msgstr "``graph_null_device`` (``auto``)"
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:144
msgid "**Visualization fields** (recipe hook; not part of the extractor ``Spec``):"
msgstr "**可视化字段** （配方 hook；不属于提取器 ``Spec`` ）："
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:146
msgid "``visualize`` (``false``) → writes ``<out_dir>/visualizations/graph/``"
msgstr "``visualize`` （ ``false`` ）→ 写入 ``<out_dir>/visualizations/graph/``"
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:147
msgid "``visualization_format``: ``png`` | ``pdf`` | ``both`` (default)"
msgstr "``visualization_format`` ： ``png`` | ``pdf`` | ``both`` （默认）"
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:148
msgid "``visualization_dpi`` (``600``)"
msgstr "``visualization_dpi`` （ ``600`` ）"
#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:149
