#: ../../source/configuration/feature_extraction.rst:155
msgid "**Legacy keys** ``enabled`` / ``n_workers``: accepted, ignored (activation is ``feature_types``; figures run serially in the main process)"
msgstr ""
"**旧版密钥** ``enabled`` / ``n_workers`` ：已接受，已忽略（激活为 ``feature_types`` ；数字在主进程中顺序运行）"
