#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:7
msgid "This section covers **habitat analysis** configuration. CLI: ``habit get-habitat -c <yaml>``. Demo training: ``config/habitat/config_habitat_two_step.yaml``; prediction: ``config/habitat/config_habitat_two_step_predict.yaml``; SLIC supervoxel example: ``config/habitat/config_habitat_two_step_supervoxel_slic.yaml`` (parameter details in **\"habitat_segmentation.supervoxel — SLIC Superpixel Configuration\"** below)."
msgstr "本节介绍 **生境分析** 配置。CLI： ``habit get-habitat -c <yaml>`` 。演示训练： ``config/habitat/config_habitat_two_step.yaml`` ；预测： ``config/habitat/config_habitat_two_step_predict.yaml`` ；SLIC 超体素示例： ``config/habitat/config_habitat_two_step_supervoxel_slic.yaml`` （参数细节见下方 **\"habitat_segmentation.supervoxel — SLIC Superpixel Configuration\"** ）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:86
msgid "**run_mode**: Run mode"
msgstr "**run_mode** ：运行模式"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:90
msgid "**Default**: ``train``"
msgstr "**默认** ： ``train``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:91
msgid "**Allowed values**: ``train``, ``predict``"
msgstr "**Allowed values** ： ``train`` 、 ``predict``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:92
msgid "**Description**: ``train`` trains a new model; ``predict`` runs inference with a pretrained pipeline."
msgstr "**Description** ： ``train`` 训练新模型； ``predict`` 用预训练流水线推理。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:93
msgid "**Example**: ``train``"
msgstr "**示例** ： ``train``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:95
msgid "**pipeline_path**: Pipeline file path"
msgstr "**pipeline_path** ：流水线文件路径"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:98
msgid "**Required**: no (required in ``predict`` mode)"
msgstr "**必需** ：否（ ``predict`` 模式下必需）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:99
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:114
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:749
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:848
msgid "**Default**: ``null``"
msgstr "**默认** ： ``null``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:100
msgid "**Description**: Path to the trained pipeline file."
msgstr "**Description** ：已训练 pipeline 文件路径。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:101
msgid "**Example**: ``./results/habitat_pipeline.pkl``"
msgstr "**示例** ： ``./results/habitat_pipeline.pkl``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:103
msgid "**data_dir**/**out_dir** (habitat analysis top level)"
msgstr "**data_dir**/**out_dir** （生境分析顶层）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:108
msgid "**Description**: ``data_dir`` may be a directory **or** a manifest YAML (e.g. ``file_habitat.yaml``, or ``file_habitat_registered_single_roi.yaml`` when modalities are already co-registered and each subject has one ROI). Never a bare ``.nii.gz``. ``out_dir`` is the default parent directory for results and checkpoints. See :doc:`/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/index`."
msgstr "**说明** ： ``data_dir`` 可以是目录， **或** 清单 YAML（例如 ``file_habitat.yaml`` ；当各模态已共配准且每位受试者只有一个 ROI 时，可用 ``file_habitat_registered_single_roi.yaml`` ）。绝不能是裸的 ``.nii.gz`` 。 ``out_dir`` 是结果与检查点的默认父目录。参见 :doc:`/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/index` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:110
msgid "**feature_construction**: Feature extraction settings"
msgstr "**feature_construction** ：特征提取设置"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:112
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:544
msgid "**Type**: object"
msgstr "**类型** ：object"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:113
msgid "**Required**: required in ``train``; may be omitted in ``predict``"
msgstr "**必填** ：在 ``train`` 中为必填；在 ``predict`` 中可省略"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:115
msgid "**Description**: If unset, validation rejects the config or errors according to run mode. Sub-blocks ``voxel_level`` / ``supervoxel_level`` / ``preprocessing_*`` are documented below."
msgstr ""
"**说明** ：未设置时验证拒绝配置或按运行模式报错。子块 ``voxel_level`` / ``supervoxel_level`` / ``preprocessing_*`` 见下文。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:117
msgid "**YAML field naming in this workflow** (avoid confusing ``method`` / ``methods`` / ``algorithm``):"
msgstr "**本工作流 YAML 字段命名** （避免混淆 ``method`` / ``methods`` / ``algorithm`` ）："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:119
msgid "``feature_construction.*.method`` (singular): one **functional expression** string (``concat(voxel_radiomics(T2))``)."
msgstr ""
"``feature_construction.*.method`` （单数）：一条 **函数表达式** 字符串（ ``concat(voxel_radiomics(T2))`` ）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:120
msgid "``preprocessing_for_* .methods`` (plural): an **ordered list** of preprocessing steps; each item has its own ``method: winsorize`` step type."
msgstr "``preprocessing_for_* .methods`` （复数）：预处理步骤的 **有序列表** ；每一项都有各自的 ``method: winsorize`` 步骤类型。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:121
msgid "``habitat_segmentation.supervoxel.algorithm``: supervoxel partition algorithm (``slic``, ``kmeans``, ``gmm``)."
msgstr ""
"``habitat_segmentation.supervoxel.algorithm`` ：超体素划分算法（ ``slic`` 、 ``kmeans`` 、 ``gmm`` ）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:122
msgid "``habitat_segmentation.habitat.algorithm``: cohort habitat model fitter (``kmeans``, ``gmm``)."
msgstr ""
"``habitat_segmentation.habitat.algorithm`` ：队列生境模型拟合器（ ``kmeans`` 、 ``gmm`` ）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:123
msgid "``habitat_cluster_selection_method`` / ``selection_method``: cluster-count validation metric (``elbow``, ``silhouette``, …)."
msgstr ""
"``habitat_cluster_selection_method`` / ``selection_method`` ：聚类数量验证指标（ ``elbow`` 、 ``silhouette`` ，…）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:125
msgid "**voxel_level**: Voxel-level feature extraction"
msgstr "**voxel_level** ：体素级特征提取"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:127
msgid "``method``: Feature extraction method expression"
msgstr "``method`` ：特征提取方法 expression"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:132
msgid "**Description**: Supports functional syntax to combine multiple extractors."
msgstr "**Description** ：支持函数式语法组合多个提取器。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:133
msgid "**Expression conventions** (shared by ``voxel_level`` / ``supervoxel_level``):"
msgstr ""
"**Expression conventions** （ ``voxel_level`` / ``supervoxel_level`` 共用）："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:135
msgid "When extracting per modality (``raw``, ``voxel_radiomics``, ``supervoxel_radiomics``, etc.), **even for a single modality** wrap with an outer combiner such as ``concat(...)``; inner expressions are per-modality sub-expressions; the outer layer merges results across modalities."
msgstr ""
"按模态提取时（ ``raw`` 、 ``voxel_radiomics`` 、 ``supervoxel_radiomics`` 等）， **即使单模态** 也须用 ``concat(...)`` 等外层 combiner 包裹；内层表达式为每模态子表达式；外层跨模态合并结果。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:136
msgid "Comma-separated tokens inside parentheses are **parameter name placeholders** or **image modality names** (matching ``images/<subject>/<modality>/`` subdirectories), **not** Python keyword arguments; actual paths and numeric values go in a sibling ``params`` dict."
msgstr ""
"括号内逗号分隔 token 为 **参数名占位符** 或 **图像模态名** （匹配 ``images/<subject>/<modality>/`` 子目录）， **非** Python 关键字参数；实际路径与数值放在兄弟 ``params`` dict。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:137
msgid "**Binding rule**: a parameter binds to function ``F`` only when its name appears inside ``F(...)`` parentheses (modality names excepted). Keys in ``params`` that are not listed in any function's parentheses trigger a deprecation warning."
msgstr ""
"**绑定规则** ：参数仅当其名出现在 ``F`` 括号内才绑定到函数 ``F(...)`` （模态名除外）。 ``params`` 中未出现在任何函数括号内的键会触发弃用警告。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:138
msgid "**Defaults**: optional parameters omitted from both parentheses and ``params`` receive built-in defaults from each method's ``method_param_spec`` (see extractor classes under ``habit/compat/engines/habitat_analysis/clustering_features/``)."
msgstr "**默认值** ：圆括号与 ``params`` 中均未给出的可选参数，会采用各方法 ``method_param_spec`` 的内置默认（见 ``habit/compat/engines/habitat_analysis/clustering_features/`` 下的提取器类）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:139
msgid "**Bundled ``params_file``**: for ``voxel_radiomics`` / ``supervoxel_radiomics``, ``params_file`` is optional. When omitted, HABIT uses bundled presets shipped in ``habit/resources/radiomics/`` (CT R3B12 voxel preset; full-set supervoxel preset). The resolved absolute path is logged at runtime."
msgstr ""
"**内置 ``params_file``**：``voxel_radiomics`` / ``supervoxel_radiomics`` 的 ``params_file`` 可选。省略时 HABIT 使用 ``habit/resources/radiomics/`` 内置预设（CT R3B12 体素预设；超体素全集预设）。运行时记录解析后的绝对路径。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:140
msgid "Recommended minimal form: ``concat(voxel_radiomics(T2))`` with ``params: {}`` — uses bundled CT R3B12 ``params_file``, ``kernel_radius: 3``, ``voxel_batch: 1000``, ``use_torch_radiomics: auto``. List a name in parentheses only when overriding (e.g. ``concat(voxel_radiomics(T2, kernel_radius))`` with ``kernel_radius: 1`` for MRI)."
msgstr ""
"推荐最简形式： ``concat(voxel_radiomics(T2))`` 与 ``params: {}`` — 使用捆绑 CT R3B12 ``params_file`` 、 ``kernel_radius: 3`` 、 ``voxel_batch: 1000`` 、 ``use_torch_radiomics: auto`` 。仅覆盖时在括号中列名（如 ``concat(voxel_radiomics(T2, kernel_radius))`` 与 ``kernel_radius: 1`` 用于 MRI）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:141
msgid "**Strict quoted form (v1 feature trees)**: when the expression contains **quoted** modality strings, it is parsed by the strict v1 parser (:func:`~habit.spec.parse_feature_expression`) into a feature Spec tree instead of the permissive v0.1 mini-language. Rules: modalities are quoted (``raw(\"T1\")``), parameters are explicit ``key=value`` (``local_entropy(\"T2\", kernel_size=5)``), combiner children are nested calls (a bare quoted string among children is an implicit ``raw`` leaf), and ``as_=\"label\"`` renames a single-column node's output. Ambiguous input fails loudly instead of being guessed. Available combiners: ``concat``, ``weighted_concat`` (``weights=[...]``), ``average``, ``ratio`` / ``difference`` (two children), ``kinetic``, ``expression``. Example: ``concat(raw(\"LAP\"), ratio(raw(\"LAP\"), raw(\"PVP\"), as_=\"lap_over_pvp\"))``."
msgstr "**严格引号形式（v1 特征树）** ：当表达式含 **带引号** 的模态字符串时，由严格 v1 解析器（ :func:`~habit.spec.parse_feature_expression` ）解析为特征 Spec 树，而非宽松的 v0.1 迷你语言。规则：模态加引号（ ``raw(\"T1\")`` ），参数为显式 ``key=value`` （ ``local_entropy(\"T2\", kernel_size=5)`` ），组合器子项为嵌套调用（子项中的裸引号字符串是隐式 ``raw`` 叶节点）， ``as_=\"label\"`` 重命名单列节点的输出。歧义输入会明确失败，而非猜测。可用组合器： ``concat`` 、 ``weighted_concat`` （ ``weights=[...]`` ）、 ``average`` 、 ``ratio`` / ``difference`` （两个子项）、 ``kinetic`` 、 ``expression`` 。示例： ``concat(raw(\"LAP\"), ratio(raw(\"LAP\"), raw(\"PVP\"), as_=\"lap_over_pvp\"))`` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:143
msgid "``params``: Voxel-level extractor parameter dictionary"
msgstr "``params`` ：体素级提取器参数字典"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:147
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:252
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:355
msgid "**Default**: ``{}``"
msgstr "**默认** ： ``{}``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:148
msgid "**Description**: Key-value pairs passed to extractors referenced in ``method`` (e.g. ``params_file`` for ``voxel_radiomics`` may live in ``params`` depending on resolver behavior). Omit the entire ``params`` block when there are no extra parameters (defaults to empty dict)."
msgstr ""
"**说明** ：传给 ``method`` 所引用提取器的键值对（例如 ``params_file`` 的 ``voxel_radiomics`` 可能位于 ``params`` ，取决于解析器行为）。无额外参数时可省略整个 ``params`` 块（默认为空 dict）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:149
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:288
msgid "**Available methods and parameters**:"
msgstr "**可用的方法和参数** ："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:151
msgid "**raw(image_name)**:"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:153
msgid "**Description**: Extract raw image voxel values (most basic feature)"
msgstr "**Description**: Extract raw image 体素 values (most basic 特征)"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:154
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:293
msgid "**Parameters**: none"
msgstr "**Parameters** ：无"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:155
msgid "**Example**: ``raw(LAP)``"
msgstr "**Example** ： ``raw(LAP)``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:157
msgid "**concat(...)**:"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:159
msgid "**Description**: Concatenate multiple feature vectors"
msgstr "**Description** ：拼接多个特征向量"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:160
msgid "**Parameters**: accepts multiple feature extraction expressions"
msgstr "**Parameters** ：接受多个特征提取表达式"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:161
msgid "**Example**: ``concat(raw(pre_contrast), raw(LAP), raw(PVP), raw(delay_3min))``"
msgstr ""
"**Example** ： ``concat(raw(pre_contrast), raw(LAP), raw(PVP), raw(delay_3min))``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:163
msgid "**kinetic(...)**:"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:165
msgid "**Description**: Extract kinetic features (wash-in/wash-out slopes, etc.)"
msgstr "**描述** ：提取动力学特征（注入/洗出斜率等）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:166
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:181
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:191
msgid "**Parameters**:"
msgstr "**参数** ："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:168
msgid "``timestamps`` (str, required): path to timestamps file"
msgstr "``timestamps`` （str，required）：时间戳文件路径"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:169
msgid "accepts multiple ``raw(image_name)`` expressions"
msgstr "接受多个 ``raw(image_name)`` 表达式"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:171
msgid "**Example**: ``kinetic(raw(LAP), raw(PVP), raw(delay_3min), timestamps=...)``"
msgstr ""
"**Example** ： ``kinetic(raw(LAP), raw(PVP), raw(delay_3min), timestamps=...)``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:172
msgid "**Extracted features**:"
msgstr "**Extracted features** ："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:174
msgid "``wash_in_slope``: wash-in slope"
msgstr "``wash_in_slope`` ：wash-in 斜率"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:175
msgid "``wash_out_slope_lap_pvp``: wash-out slope from LAP to PVP"
msgstr "``wash_out_slope_lap_pvp`` ：LAP 到 PVP 廓清斜率"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:176
msgid "``wash_out_slope_pvp_dp``: wash-out slope from PVP to delay phase"
msgstr "``wash_out_slope_pvp_dp`` ：PVP 至延迟期洗出斜率"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:178
msgid "**local_entropy(...)**:"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:180
msgid "**Description**: Compute local entropy (local texture complexity)"
msgstr "**Description** ：计算局部熵（局部纹理复杂度）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:183
msgid "``kernel_size`` (int, default: ``3``): local neighborhood size"
msgstr "``kernel_size`` （整数，默认值： ``3`` ）：本地邻域大小"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:184
msgid "``bins`` (int, default: ``32``): histogram bin count"
msgstr "``bins`` （int，默认 ``32`` ）：直方图 bin 数"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:186
msgid "**Example**: ``local_entropy(raw(LAP), kernel_size=5, bins=32)``"
msgstr "**Example** ： ``local_entropy(raw(LAP), kernel_size=5, bins=32)``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:188
msgid "**voxel_radiomics(...)**:"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:190
msgid "**Description**: Extract voxel-level radiomics features"
msgstr "**Description** ：提取体素级放射组学特征"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:193
msgid "``params_file`` (str, optional): PyRadiomics parameter file path; omit for bundled CT R3B12 preset"
msgstr "``params_file`` （str，可选）：PyRadiomics 参数文件路径；省略则用 bundled CT R3B12 预设"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:194
msgid "``kernel_radius`` (int, default: ``3`` for CT R3B12 bundled preset; ``1`` = 3×3×3, ``3`` = 7×7×7): local neighborhood radius"
msgstr ""
"``kernel_radius`` （int，默认 CT R3B12 捆绑预设 ``3`` ； ``1`` = 3×3×3， ``3`` = 7×7×7）：局部邻域半径"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:195
msgid "``voxel_batch`` (int, default: ``1000``): voxel batch size; ``-1`` processes all ROI voxels at once (native PyRadiomics, no batching). Positive values limit memory (GPU or large ROI: ``512``–``1000`` recommended)"
msgstr ""
"``voxel_batch`` （int，默认 ``1000`` ）：体素 batch； ``-1`` 一次处理全部 ROI 体素（原生 PyRadiomics，无 batch）。正值限内存（GPU 或大 ROI 建议 ``512`` – ``1000`` ）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:196
msgid "``use_torch_radiomics`` (str, default: ``auto``): ``auto`` uses TorchRadiomics when torch is installed and CUDA is available, otherwise CPU PyRadiomics; ``true`` forces torch; ``false`` always CPU"
msgstr ""
"``use_torch_radiomics`` （str，默认 ``auto`` ）： ``auto`` 在已装 torch 且 CUDA 可用时用 TorchRadiomics，否则 CPU PyRadiomics； ``true`` 强制 torch； ``false`` 始终 CPU"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:197
msgid "``use_gpu_matrices`` (str, default: ``auto``): when TorchRadiomics is on, ``auto`` builds GLCM/GLDM/GLRLM/GLSZM/NGTDM on GPU (``habit.kernels.radiomics.gpumatrices``); ``false`` keeps the PyRadiomics ``cMatrices`` C extension (same counts). Upstream pytorchradiomics always uses C for this step. See :doc:`../how_to/voxel_texture`."
msgstr "``use_gpu_matrices`` （str，默认： ``auto`` ）：启用 TorchRadiomics 时， ``auto`` 在 GPU 上构建 GLCM/GLDM/GLRLM/GLSZM/NGTDM（ ``habit.kernels.radiomics.gpumatrices`` ）； ``false`` 保留 PyRadiomics ``cMatrices`` C 扩展（计数相同）。上游 pytorchradiomics 此步始终使用 C。见 :doc:`../how_to/voxel_texture` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:198
msgid "``class_progress`` (bool, default: ``false``): when ``true``, print and tqdm each PyRadiomics class (firstorder, glcm, ...). Default is quiet; ``Cohort.map`` still reports subjects."
msgstr ""
"``class_progress`` （bool，默认 ``false`` ）： ``true`` 时对每个 PyRadiomics 类（firstorder、glcm 等）打印并 tqdm。默认安静； ``Cohort.map`` 仍报告受试者。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:199
msgid "``torch_device`` (str, default: ``auto``): single GPU device when ``torch_gpus`` is unset"
msgstr "``torch_device`` （str，default： ``auto`` ）： ``torch_gpus`` 未设时的单 GPU 设备"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:200
msgid "``torch_gpus`` (list/int/str): allowed GPU indices, e.g. ``[0, 1, 2]`` or ``\"0,1,2\"``; overrides ``torch_device`` when set"
msgstr ""
"``torch_gpus`` （list/int/str）：允许的 GPU 索引，如 ``[0, 1, 2]`` 或 ``\"0,1,2\"`` ；设置时覆盖 ``torch_device``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:201
msgid "``torch_gpu_count`` (int, optional): use first N GPUs from ``torch_gpus``"
msgstr "``torch_gpu_count`` （int，optional）：使用 ``torch_gpus`` 中前 N 个 GPU"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:202
msgid "``torch_dtype`` (str, default: ``float32``): Torch compute dtype (``float32`` or ``float64``; ``float64`` closer to CPU PyRadiomics)"
msgstr ""
"``torch_dtype`` （str，默认 ``float32`` ）：Torch 计算 dtype（ ``float32`` 或 ``float64`` ； ``float64`` 更接近 CPU PyRadiomics）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:204
msgid "**Voxel GLCM note**: Use ``config/radiomics/params_voxel_radiomics.yaml`` (explicit list of 21 stable GLCM features). If ``params_file`` lists only ``glcm:`` without feature names, PyRadiomics computes all 24 GLCM features; in small neighborhoods with many uniform voxels, GLCM degenerates to 1×1 matrices and **MCC / Imc1 / Imc2** feature values or mutual information can crash or produce NaN on CUDA/MKL. HABIT auto-replaces with the 21 stable features and logs a warning when GLCM is unrestricted; if features are explicitly listed in ``params_file``, user configuration is respected."
msgstr "**体素 GLCM 说明** ：使用 ``config/radiomics/params_voxel_radiomics.yaml`` （显式列出 21 个稳定 GLCM 特征）。若 ``params_file`` 仅列出 ``glcm:`` 而无特征名，PyRadiomics 会计算全部 24 个 GLCM 特征；在均匀体素很多的小邻域中，GLCM 会退化成 1×1 矩阵， **MCC / Imc1 / Imc2** 特征值或互信息可能在 CUDA/MKL 上崩溃或产生 NaN。当 GLCM 未受限时，HABIT 会自动替换为 21 个稳定特征并记录警告；若 ``params_file`` 中显式列出了特征，则尊重用户配置。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:211
msgid "**CT voxel texture (R3B12)**: Literature recommends ``kernel_radius: 3`` and ``binWidth: 12`` HU (R3B12 configuration; better repeatability and robustness to kernel/binning than R1B25). Omit ``params_file`` to use bundled ``params_voxel_radiomics.yaml``; ``kernel_radius`` defaults to 3. Reference: Prior O, et al. *Radiol Artif Intell*. 2024;6(2):e230118. https://doi.org/10.1148/ryai.230118 The simulated-retest perturbation used to *define* those precise features is :func:`~habit.precision.prior2024_retest_perturbation` (MIRP 1.2.0 Appendix S2: noise + 0.5-voxel translation fraction + 0.5° z-rotation). See :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features`."
msgstr "**CT 体素纹理（R3B12）** ：文献建议 ``kernel_radius: 3`` 与 ``binWidth: 12`` HU（R3B12 配置；相对 R1B25，对核/分箱的可重复性与稳健性更好）。省略 ``params_file`` 即使用内置 ``params_voxel_radiomics.yaml`` ； ``kernel_radius`` 默认为 3。参考文献：Prior O, et al. *Radiol Artif Intell*. 2024;6(2):e230118. https://doi.org/10.1148/ryai.230118 用于 *定义* 那些精确特征的模拟重测扰动是 :func:`~habit.precision.prior2024_retest_perturbation` （MIRP 1.2.0 附录 S2：噪声 + 0.5 体素平移比例 + 0.5° z 轴旋转）。参见 :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_05_precise_features` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:220
msgid "**Example**: ``concat(voxel_radiomics(T2))`` with ``params: {}`` (CT R3B12 defaults); override example: ``concat(voxel_radiomics(T2, kernel_radius))`` with ``kernel_radius: 1`` in ``params``"
msgstr ""
"**Example** ： ``concat(voxel_radiomics(T2))`` 且 ``params: {}`` （CT R3B12 默认）；覆盖示例： ``concat(voxel_radiomics(T2, kernel_radius))`` 且在 ``kernel_radius: 1`` 中 ``params``"
