#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:290
msgid "**mean_voxel_features()**:"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:292
msgid "**Description**: Mean of voxel features within each supervoxel (most common)"
msgstr "**Description** ：各超体素内体素特征均值（最常见）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:294
msgid "**Use case**: Aggregate voxel-level features (from ``voxel_level``) to supervoxel level"
msgstr "**Use case** ：将体素级特征（来自 ``voxel_level`` ）聚合到超体素级"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:295
msgid "**Example**: ``mean_voxel_features()``"
msgstr "**Example** ： ``mean_voxel_features()``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:297
msgid "**mean(\"<modality>\") / std(\"<modality>\") / percentile(\"<modality>\", q=...)** (strict quoted form only):"
msgstr ""
"**mean(\\\"<modality>\\\") / std(\\\"<modality>\\\") / percentile(\\\"<modality>\\\", q=...)** （仅严格引号形式）："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:299
msgid "**Description**: Single-modality region statistics — aggregate one modality's voxel **image signal** (not the ``voxel_level`` features) per supervoxel: mean, standard deviation, or the ``q``-th percentile"
msgstr ""
"**说明** ： Single-模态 region statistics — aggregate one 模态's 体素 **image signal** (not the ``voxel_level`` 特征) per 超体素: mean, standard deviation, or the ``q`` -th percentile"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:300
msgid "**Parameters**: ``q`` (int/float, percentile only); ``source: \"working\" | \"original\"`` selects the post- vs pre-preprocessing signal; ``as_=\"label\"`` renames the output column"
msgstr ""
"**Parameters** ： ``q`` （int/float，仅 percentile）； ``source: \"working\" | \"original\"`` 选择预/后预处理信号； ``as_=\"label\"`` 重命名输出列"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:301
msgid "**Use case**: Compose per-modality statistics with combiners, e.g. ``concat(mean(\"T1\"), std(\"T1\", as_=\"t1_spread\"), percentile(\"T2\", q=90))``"
msgstr ""
"**用例** ：用组合器组合逐模态统计，例如 ``concat(mean(\"T1\"), std(\"T1\", as_=\"t1_spread\"), percentile(\"T2\", q=90))``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:303
msgid "**concat(supervoxel_radiomics(<modality>, params_file), ...)**:"
msgstr "**concat(supervoxel_radiomics(<modality>, params_file), ...)** ："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:305
msgid "**Description**: Per supervoxel label, extract **whole-ROI** radiomics texture (not voxel kernel neighborhoods). Must sit inside ``concat(...)`` (or another outer combiner); single-modality example: ``concat(supervoxel_radiomics(T2, params_file))``."
msgstr ""
"**Description** ：每超体素标签提取 **全 ROI** 放射组学纹理（非体素核邻域）。须放在 ``concat(...)`` （或另一外层 combiner）内；单模态示例： ``concat(supervoxel_radiomics(T2, params_file))`` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:306
msgid "**Discretization**: Per-label ``binWidth`` by default (``union_bin=false``), matching PyRadiomics ``execute()``. Set ``union_bin=true`` for one shared bin on the union mask (``sv_map > 0``), then per-label extract"
msgstr ""
"**Discretization** ：默认 per-label ``binWidth`` （ ``union_bin=false`` ），对齐 PyRadiomics ``execute()`` 。 ``union_bin=true`` 时在并集掩膜（ ``sv_map > 0`` ）上共用分箱，再 per-label 提取"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:307
msgid "**Matrix backend**: ``use_supervoxel_cext`` default ``auto``: use C extension batch matrix build when ``supervoxel_cext`` is compiled (``pip install -e .``); otherwise fallback Torch/PyRadiomics stacked matrix path. ``false`` **forces** Torch/PyRadiomics stacked matrices (``matrix_backend=torch_cmatrices``) even if C extension exists"
msgstr ""
"**Matrix backend** ： ``use_supervoxel_cext`` 默认 ``auto`` ：编译 ``supervoxel_cext`` 时用 C 扩展 batch 矩阵（ ``pip install -e .`` ）；否则回退 Torch/PyRadiomics 堆叠矩阵。 ``false`` **强制** Torch/PyRadiomics（ ``matrix_backend=torch_cmatrices`` ）即使存在 C 扩展"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:308
msgid "**Feature backend**: When ``use_torch_radiomics`` resolves to torch, TorchRadiomics (GPU/CPU torch); else CPU PyRadiomics (same semantics)"
msgstr ""
"**Feature backend** ： ``use_torch_radiomics`` 解析为 torch 时用 TorchRadiomics（GPU/CPU torch）；否则 CPU PyRadiomics（语义相同）"
