msgid "**Description**: Preprocess features at cohort level; often used for discretization to stabilize clustering."
msgstr "**说明** ：在队列级预处理特征；常用于离散化以稳定聚类。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:430
msgid "**Applicable modes**: ``two_step`` and ``direct_pooling`` only; ``one_step`` pipeline has no group step—configured group preprocessing has no effect."
msgstr ""
"**Applicable modes** ：仅 ``two_step`` 与 ``direct_pooling`` ； ``one_step`` 流水线无 group 步——配置的 group 预处理无效。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:433
msgid "**binning (feature discretization / binning)**:"
msgstr "**binning（特征离散化 / 分箱）** ："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:435
msgid "``n_bins`` (int, default: ``10``): number of bins"
msgstr "``n_bins`` （int，默认： ``10`` ）：bin 数"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:436
msgid "``bin_strategy`` (str, default: ``uniform``): binning strategy:"
msgstr "``bin_strategy`` （字符串，默认值： ``uniform`` ）：分箱策略："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:438
msgid "``uniform``: equal-width bins"
msgstr "``uniform`` ：等宽 bin"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:439
msgid "``quantile``: quantile (equal-frequency) bins"
msgstr "``quantile`` ：分位数（等频）分箱"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:440
msgid "``kmeans``: K-means cluster binning"
msgstr "``kmeans`` ：K均值聚类分箱"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:442
msgid "``global_normalize`` (bool, default: ``false``): global binning across features"
msgstr "``global_normalize`` （bool，默认 ``false`` ）：跨特征全局分 bin"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:449
msgid "**minmax / zscore / robust / log**:"
msgstr "**minmax / zscore / robust / log** ："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:451
msgid "Same as ``preprocessing_for_subject_level``, applied after group aggregation"
msgstr "与 ``preprocessing_for_subject_level`` 相同，在组级聚合之后应用"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:453
msgid "**variance_filter / correlation_filter (recommended at group level)**:"
msgstr "**variance_filter / correlation_filter（建议在群体级）** ："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:455
msgid "Column dropping for unsupervised feature selection; reduces noise and redundancy"
msgstr "无监督特征选择的删列；降噪声与冗余"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:456
msgid "``variance_filter`` parameter: ``variance_threshold``"
msgstr "``variance_filter`` 参数： ``variance_threshold``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:457
msgid "``correlation_filter`` parameters: ``corr_threshold``, ``corr_method``"
msgstr "``correlation_filter`` 参数： ``corr_threshold``, ``corr_method``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:458
msgid "Recommendation: fit column set during training; reuse same columns at prediction"
msgstr "建议：训练时拟合列集；预测时复用相同列"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:476
msgid "**YAML structure essentials**"
msgstr "**YAML 结构要点**"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:478
msgid "``preprocessing_for_*_level`` must contain a **single** ``methods:`` key whose value is a **list**; do not duplicate ``methods:`` or place list items outside the ``methods:`` block:"
msgstr ""
"``preprocessing_for_*_level`` 必须包含一个 **单一的** ``methods:`` 键，其值为 **列表** ；不要重复 ``methods:`` 或将列表项放在 ``methods:`` 块之外："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:497
msgid "**Preprocessing activation matrix by clustering_mode**"
msgstr "**按 clustering_mode 划分的预处理激活矩阵**"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:503
msgid "Preprocessing block"
msgstr "预处理块"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:507
msgid "``preprocessing_for_subject_level``"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:508
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:510
msgid "active"
msgstr "启用"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:509
msgid "active (``variance_filter`` / ``correlation_filter`` forbidden)"
msgstr "active（禁止 ``variance_filter`` / ``correlation_filter`` ）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:511
msgid "``preprocessing_for_group_level``"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:512
msgid "**inactive**"
msgstr "**未启用**"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:513
msgid "active (Stage 2 group level)"
msgstr "active（Stage 2 群体级）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:514
msgid "active (after pooling, group level)"
msgstr "active (after 池化, group level)"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:516
msgid "**Recommended pipeline (train → predict reuse)**"
msgstr "**推荐流水线（训练 → 预测复用）**"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:518
msgid "**two_step / direct_pooling (train)**: subject-level ``winsorize`` + ``minmax`` (or ``zscore``) → group-level ``binning`` (discretization aids clustering) → optional ``variance_filter`` / ``correlation_filter`` (column-dropping; ``fit`` caches column set during training)."
msgstr ""
"**two_step / direct_pooling（训练）** ：受试者级 ``winsorize`` + ``minmax`` （或 ``zscore`` ）→ 组级 ``binning`` （离散化助聚类）→ 可选 ``variance_filter`` / ``correlation_filter`` （删列； ``fit`` 缓存训练列集）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:519
msgid "**two_step / direct_pooling (predict)**: same ``methods`` order as training; ``PreprocessingState`` loaded from ``habitat_pipeline.pkl``—**do not change thresholds** on column-dropping methods to avoid column mismatch."
msgstr ""
"**two_step / direct_pooling（predict）** ： ``methods`` 顺序与训练相同； ``PreprocessingState`` 从 ``habitat_pipeline.pkl`` 加载— **勿改** 删列方法的阈值以免列不匹配。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:520
msgid "**one_step**: configure ``preprocessing_for_subject_level`` only; group block is ignored."
msgstr "**one_step** ：仅配置 ``preprocessing_for_subject_level`` ；group 块被忽略。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:522
msgid "**Habitat feature preprocessing implementation and extension**"
msgstr "**生境特征预处理实现与扩展**"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:524
msgid "**Unified interface**: Built-in and custom methods implement ``BaseFeaturePreprocessing``, registered via ``@PreprocessingMethodFactory.register``."
msgstr "**统一接口** ：内置与自定义方法均实现 ``BaseFeaturePreprocessing`` ，并通过 ``@PreprocessingMethodFactory.register`` 注册。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:526
msgid "**Execution path**: ``preprocessing_for_subject_level`` → stateless subject-level ``apply_stateless_preprocessing``; ``preprocessing_for_group_level`` → ``PreprocessingState.fit/transform`` (training caches ``baseline`` and per-step ``step_states``; prediction reuses)."
msgstr ""
"**Execution path** ： ``preprocessing_for_subject_level`` → 无状态受试者级 ``apply_stateless_preprocessing`` ； ``preprocessing_for_group_level`` → ``PreprocessingState.fit/transform`` （训练缓存 ``baseline`` 与逐步 ``step_states`` ；预测复用）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:530
msgid "**Column-dropping methods**: ``variance_filter``, ``correlation_filter`` set ``changes_columns=True``; ``two_step`` forbids them at subject level (see note above)."
msgstr ""
"**删列方法** ： ``variance_filter`` 、 ``correlation_filter`` 设 ``changes_columns=True`` ； ``two_step`` 禁止在受试者级使用（见上文说明）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:532
msgid "**Adding a method**:"
msgstr "**添加方法** ："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:534
msgid "See ``habit/compat/engines/habitat_analysis/feature_preprocessing/custom_preprocessing_template.py``"
msgstr "参见 ``habit/compat/engines/habitat_analysis/feature_preprocessing/custom_preprocessing_template.py``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:535
msgid "Register the method name in ``habit/schemas/workflows/habitat.py`` (``PreprocessingMethod.method`` Literal) or rely on schema extension hooks documented in :doc:`../customization/index`"
msgstr "在 ``habit/schemas/workflows/habitat.py`` （ ``PreprocessingMethod.method`` Literal）中注册方法名，或使用 :doc:`../customization/index` 中记载的 schema 扩展钩子"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:536
msgid "If column-dropping, update ``DROPPING_PREPROCESSING_METHODS``"
msgstr "若删列，更新 ``DROPPING_PREPROCESSING_METHODS``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:537
msgid "Ensure module import so registration decorator runs"
msgstr "确保模块导入以运行注册装饰器"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:539
msgid "**Compatibility**: YAML format unchanged; legacy ``habitat_pipeline.pkl`` with pre-refactor ``PreprocessingState`` requires re-train."
msgstr ""
"**Compatibility** ：YAML 格式不变；含重构前 ``habitat_pipeline.pkl`` 的旧 ``PreprocessingState`` 须重训。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:542
msgid "**habitat_segmentation**: Habitat segmentation settings"
msgstr "**habitat_segmentation** ：生境分割设置"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:545
msgid "**Required**: required in ``train``; recommended in ``predict`` (at least ``clustering_mode``)"
msgstr "**Required** ： ``train`` 必填； ``predict`` 建议（至少 ``clustering_mode`` ）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:546
msgid "**Default**: ``null`` (if fully omitted, Pydantic uses ``HabitatSegmentationConfig`` default sub-blocks; see table below)"
msgstr "**默认** ： ``null`` （若完全省略，Pydantic 使用 ``HabitatSegmentationConfig`` 的默认子块；见表）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:548
msgid "``clustering_mode``: Clustering strategy"
msgstr "``clustering_mode``: 聚类 strategy"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:552
msgid "**Default**: ``two_step``"
msgstr "**默认** ： ``two_step``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:553
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:807
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1119
msgid "**Allowed values**:"
msgstr "**允许值** ："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:555
msgid "``one_step``: cluster voxels directly."
msgstr "``one_step`` ：直接对体素聚类。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:556
msgid "``two_step``: build supervoxels first, then cluster supervoxels into habitats."
msgstr "``two_step``: build 超体素 first, then cluster 超体素 into 生境."
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:557
msgid "``direct_pooling``: pool voxels across all subjects then cluster (compute-heavy)."
msgstr "``direct_pooling`` ：跨所有受试者池化体素再聚类（计算量大）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:559
msgid "**Example**: ``two_step``"
msgstr "**示例** ： ``two_step``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:560
msgid "**v1 spec mapping**: translation turns this knob into an explicit dataflow declaration on the spec — ``one_step`` becomes ``pooling: none`` (``definition_level: subject``), while ``two_step`` / ``direct_pooling`` become ``pooling: cohort`` (the default, omitted from fingerprints). Native v1 documents may write ``pooling`` under ``spec:`` directly, or declare an explicit ``stages`` list. The Python API prefers :attr:`~habit.spec.HabitatSpec.stages` + :meth:`~habit.recipes.Study.fit_predict` (strategy inferred from the sequence); YAML ``clustering_mode`` / sugar ``pooling`` remain the CLI/YAML path. See :doc:`../api/spec`."
msgstr ""
"**v1 spec mapping** ：翻译将此旋钮变为 spec 上的显式数据流声明—— ``one_step`` 变为 ``pooling: none`` （ ``definition_level: subject`` ）， ``two_step`` / ``direct_pooling`` 变为 ``pooling: cohort`` （默认，指纹中省略）。原生 v1 文档可在 ``pooling`` 下直接写 ``spec:`` ，或声明显式 ``stages`` 列表。Python API 优先 :attr:`~habit.spec.HabitatSpec.stages` + :meth:`~habit.recipes.Study.fit_predict` （从序列推断策略）；YAML ``clustering_mode`` / 语法糖 ``pooling`` 仍为 CLI/YAML 路径。见 :doc:`../api/spec` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:571
msgid "**supervoxel**: Supervoxel clustering settings"
msgstr "**supervoxel** ：超体素聚类设置"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:573
msgid "**Applicable modes**:"
msgstr "**Applicable modes** ："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:575
msgid "``two_step``: this block configures **per-subject** voxel → supervoxel clustering (``algorithm``, ``n_clusters``, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"``two_step`` ：本块配置 **逐受试者** 体素→超体素聚类（ ``algorithm`` 、 ``n_clusters`` 等）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:576
msgid "``one_step``: ``algorithm`` and ``one_step_settings`` for **per-subject** voxel → habitat; ``n_clusters`` overridden when auto-selecting k."
msgstr ""
"``one_step`` ： ``algorithm`` 与 ``one_step_settings`` 用于 **每受试者** 体素 → 生境；自动选 k 时覆盖 ``n_clusters`` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:577
msgid "``direct_pooling``: supervoxel block not used for clustering (schema defaults may remain)."
msgstr "``direct_pooling`` ：超体素块不用于聚类（schema 默认可保留）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:579
msgid "``algorithm``: Clustering or segmentation algorithm"
msgstr "``algorithm`` ：聚类或分割算法"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:582
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:806
msgid "**Default**: ``kmeans``"
msgstr "**默认** ： ``kmeans``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:583
msgid "**Allowed values** (aligned with ``SupervoxelClusteringConfig``):"
msgstr "**允许值** （与 ``SupervoxelClusteringConfig`` 对齐）："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:585
msgid "``kmeans``: K-means; clusters by feature vectors only—supervoxels may be spatially scattered."
msgstr "``kmeans`` ：K-means；仅按特征向量聚类—超体素可能在空间上分散。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:586
msgid "``gmm``: Gaussian mixture; underlying default ``covariance_type='full'``; ``SupervoxelClusteringConfig`` **does not** expose this field—YAML may ignore it."
msgstr "``gmm`` ：高斯混合；底层默认 ``covariance_type='full'`` ； ``SupervoxelClusteringConfig`` **不** 暴露该字段——YAML 中写了也可能被忽略。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:587
msgid "``slic``: SLIC superpixels; joint multi-channel features and 3D coordinates for spatially compact supervoxels. **Dedicated parameters** (``compactness`` / ``sigma`` / ``enforce_connectivity`` and tuning) see :ref:`habitat_slic_config` below."
msgstr ""
"``slic`` ：SLIC 超像素；联合多通道特征与 3D 坐标得到空间紧凑超体素。 **专用参数** （ ``compactness`` / ``sigma`` / ``enforce_connectivity`` 及调参）见下文 :ref:`habitat_slic_config` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:589
msgid "``n_clusters``: Supervoxel count (or SLIC ``n_segments``)"
msgstr "``n_clusters`` ：超体素数量（或 SLIC ``n_segments`` ）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:592
msgid "**Default**: ``50``"
msgstr "**默认** ： ``50``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:595
msgid "``two_step``: fixed supervoxel count per subject; must be less than ROI voxel count. Typical **30–100**; small ROI **20–30**."
msgstr "``two_step`` ：每受试者固定超体素数；须小于 ROI 体素数。典型 **30–100** ；小 ROI **20–30** 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:596
msgid "``one_step`` with empty ``fixed_n_clusters``: upper bound for auto k search (see ``one_step_settings.max_clusters``), not the final fixed value."
msgstr ""
"``one_step`` 且 ``fixed_n_clusters`` 为空：自动 k 搜索上界（见 ``one_step_settings.max_clusters`` ），非最终固定值。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:598
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:695
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:851
msgid "``random_state``: Random seed"
msgstr "``random_state`` ：随机 seed"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:600
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:853
msgid "**Type**: integer or ``null``"
msgstr "**类型** ：整数或 ``null``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:601
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:854
msgid "**Default**: ``null`` (inherits ``HabitatAnalysisConfig.random_state``)"
msgstr "**Default** ： ``null`` （继承 ``HabitatAnalysisConfig.random_state`` ）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:603
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:857
msgid "``max_iter``: Maximum iterations"
msgstr "``max_iter`` ：最大迭代"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:606
msgid "**Default**: ``300``"
msgstr "**默认** ： ``300``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:607
msgid "**Description**: ``kmeans`` / ``gmm``: sklearn max iterations; ``slic`` differs—see :ref:`habitat_slic_config`."
msgstr ""
"**描述** ： ``kmeans`` / ``gmm`` ：sklearn 最大迭代次数； ``slic`` 不同—参见 :ref:`habitat_slic_config` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:609
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:689
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:862
msgid "``n_init``: Number of initializations"
msgstr "``n_init`` ：初始化次数"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:612
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:692
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:743
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:816
msgid "**Default**: ``10``"
msgstr "**默认** ： ``10``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:613
msgid "**Description**: ``kmeans`` / ``gmm``: sklearn ``n_init``; ``slic``: only in ``one_step`` auto k—see :ref:`habitat_slic_config`."
msgstr ""
"**说明** ： ``kmeans`` / ``gmm``: sklearn ``n_init``; ``slic``: only in ``one_step`` auto k—see :ref:`habitat_slic_config`."
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:615
msgid "``compactness`` / ``sigma`` / ``enforce_connectivity``: active only when ``algorithm: slic``—see :ref:`habitat_slic_config`."
msgstr ""
"``compactness`` / ``sigma`` / ``enforce_connectivity`` ：仅 ``algorithm: slic`` 时生效—见 :ref:`habitat_slic_config` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:617
msgid "``one_step_settings``: Nested one-step auto cluster count (see **one_step_settings** below). **Not used for per-subject supervoxel clustering in ``two_step``** (two-step always uses fixed ``n_clusters``)."
msgstr ""
"``one_step_settings`` ：嵌套一步法自动聚类数（见下文 **one_step_settings** ）。 **不用于** ``two_step`` 中逐受试者超体素聚类（两步法始终用固定 ``n_clusters`` ）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:619
msgid "**Full example** (K-Means supervoxels):"
msgstr "**完整示例** （K-Means 超体素）："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:633
msgid "habitat_segmentation.supervoxel — SLIC Superpixel Configuration"
msgstr "habitat_segmentation.supervoxel — SLIC 超像素配置"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:635
msgid "When ``habitat_segmentation.supervoxel.algorithm: slic``, habit calls ``skimage.segmentation.slic`` inside the ROI, jointly segmenting **multi-channel voxel features** (last dimension = feature channel) with **3D spatial coordinates** into ``n_clusters`` supervoxels. Anisotropic voxel spacing ``spacing`` is **read automatically** from the mask NIfTI header—**no** YAML entry required."
msgstr ""
"``habitat_segmentation.supervoxel.algorithm: slic`` 时，habit 在 ROI 内调用 ``skimage.segmentation.slic`` ，将 **多通道体素特征** （末维为特征通道）与 **3D 空间坐标** 联合分为 ``n_clusters`` 超体素。各向异性 ``spacing`` **自动** 从掩膜 NIfTI 头读取— **无需** YAML。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:640
msgid "**Use cases**"
msgstr "**适用场景**"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:642
msgid "Recommended for ``two_step`` stage 1: supervoxels are spatially coherent and local, unlike pure feature-space K-Means supervoxels."
msgstr "推荐用于 ``two_step`` 阶段 1：超体素空间连贯且局部，不同于纯特征空间 K-Means 超体素。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:643
msgid "SLIC partitions local anatomical subregions; cohort habitats are subsequently discovered by clustering pooled supervoxel feature vectors."
msgstr "SLIC 划分局部解剖亚区；随后通过对池化超体素特征向量聚类发现队列生境。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:644
msgid "High-dimensional ``voxel_radiomics`` features incur much higher compute and memory than ``raw`` / ``mean_voxel_features`` (builds ``[Z, Y, X, n_features]`` feature volume in ROI bbox)."
msgstr "高维 ``voxel_radiomics`` 特征比 ``raw`` / ``mean_voxel_features`` 消耗更多计算与内存（在 ROI 包围盒内构建 ``[Z, Y, X, n_features]`` 特征体）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:646
msgid "**YAML path**: keys under ``habitat_segmentation.supervoxel``; repo template ``config/habitat/config_habitat_two_step_supervoxel_slic.yaml``."
msgstr "**YAML 路径** ：键位于 ``habitat_segmentation.supervoxel`` 下；仓库模板为 ``config/habitat/config_habitat_two_step_supervoxel_slic.yaml`` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:649
msgid "**Parameter reference**"
msgstr "**参数参考**"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:651
msgid "``n_clusters``: Target supervoxel count (``n_segments``)"
msgstr "``n_clusters`` ：目标超体素数（ ``n_segments`` ）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:653
msgid "**Default**: ``50`` (shared with ``supervoxel`` block)"
msgstr "**Default** ： ``50`` （与 ``supervoxel`` 块共享）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:654
msgid "**Tuning**: small ROI **20–30**; finer texture **60–100**; must be **less than** total ROI voxels."
msgstr "**调参** ：小 ROI **20–30** ；更细纹理 **60–100** ；须 **小于** ROI 总体素数。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:656
msgid "``compactness``: Balance between feature similarity and spatial compactness"
msgstr "``compactness`` ：特征相似与空间紧凑的平衡"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:658
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:668
msgid "**Type**: float"
msgstr "**Type** ：float"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:659
msgid "**Default**: ``0.1``"
msgstr "**默认** ： ``0.1``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:660
msgid "**Description**: Passed to ``skimage.segmentation.slic``. Features are usually winsorized / minmax-normalized before SLIC, so **0.1** is a reasonable start (different scale from large compactness values common on RGB images)."
msgstr ""
"**Description** ：传给 ``skimage.segmentation.slic`` 。SLIC 前特征通常 winsorize/minmax 归一化，故 **0.1** 是合理起点（与 RGB 上常见大 compactness 尺度不同）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:661
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:671
msgid "**Tuning**:"
msgstr "**调参** ："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:663
msgid "**Increase** (``0.15``–``0.3``): more spatial grouping, smoother boundaries, fewer fragments."
msgstr "**增大** （ ``0.15`` – ``0.3`` ）：更强空间分组、更平滑边界、更少碎片。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:664
msgid "**Decrease** (``0.05``): follows feature differences more closely; boundaries track intensity/texture change but may fragment."
