msgstr "``selection_method`` ：自动选择指标"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:755
msgid "**Default**: ``elbow``"
msgstr "**默认** ： ``elbow``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:756
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:830
msgid "**Allowed values and meaning**:"
msgstr "**Allowed values and meaning** ："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:758
msgid "``elbow``: knee of the inertia curve, detected by the Kneedle rule (default)"
msgstr "``elbow`` ：惯性曲线膝点，Kneedle 规则检测（默认）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:759
msgid "``silhouette``: silhouette coefficient (-1 to 1; closer to 1 = tighter clusters)"
msgstr "``silhouette`` ：轮廓系数（-1 到 1；越接近 1 簇越紧）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:760
msgid "``calinski_harabasz``: Calinski-Harabasz index (higher = better)"
msgstr "``calinski_harabasz`` ：Calinski-Harabasz 指数（越高越好）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:761
msgid "``davies_bouldin``: Davies-Bouldin index (lower = better)"
msgstr "``davies_bouldin`` ：Davies-Bouldin 指数（越低越好）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:762
msgid "``inertia``: within-cluster sum of squares (lower = tighter; Kneedle elbow internally)"
msgstr "``inertia`` ：簇内平方和（越低 = 越紧密；Kneedle 内部肘部）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:763
msgid "``kneedle``: Kneedle on normalized inertia curve (max deviation point)"
msgstr "``kneedle`` ：归一化 inertia 曲线上的 Kneedle（最大偏离点）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:764
msgid "``gap``: gap statistic"
msgstr "``gap`` ：gap statistic"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:765
msgid "``aic`` / ``bic``: information criteria (gmm-oriented)"
msgstr "``aic`` / ``bic`` ：信息准则（面向 gmm）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:767
msgid "**Recommendation**: ``elbow`` (schema default) or ``silhouette`` for interpretability"
msgstr "**建议** ： ``elbow`` （schema 默认）或 ``silhouette`` 以便解释"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:771
msgid "**Breaking change in v1.0**: ``elbow`` and ``kneedle`` are now the same rule. HABIT ``elbow`` runs ``KneeLocator`` on k-means inertia (curve convex, direction decreasing) — the Kneedle algorithm of Satopaa, Albrecht, Irwin, and Raghavan (2011, *Finding a \"Kneedle\" in a Haystack*, IEEE ICDCS Workshops): normalize ``k`` and inertia to the unit square, draw the chord from the first point to the last, and take the ``k`` farthest from that chord. A smooth curve often places this knee to the right of the bend a person sees."
msgstr ""
"**v1.0 破坏性变更** ： ``elbow`` 与 ``kneedle`` 现为同一规则。HABIT ``elbow`` 在 k-means inertia 上运行 ``KneeLocator`` （曲线 convex、方向 decreasing）— Satopaa, Albrecht, Irwin, and Raghavan（2011， *Finding a \"Kneedle\" in a Haystack* ，IEEE ICDCS Workshops）：将 ``k`` 与 inertia 归一化到单位正方形，从首点到末点作弦，取离弦最远的 ``k`` 。平滑曲线常使 knee 位于人眼拐点右侧。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:780
msgid "In the clustering literature, *elbow* usually means inspecting within-cluster dispersion versus ``k`` (Thorndike RL, 1953, *Who belongs in the family?*, Psychometrika 18(4):267–276). Thorndike did **not** publish a second-difference formula. Up to v0.1.x, HABIT ``elbow`` used a **discrete-curvature elbow** (visual elbow, computed): ``argmax`` of the second difference of inertia. That is not the Thorndike citation and is not today’s default. Both ``elbow`` and ``kneedle`` now resolve to :func:`habit.kernels.cluster_selection.knee_index`, so a v0.1 configuration written with ``elbow`` remains valid but may select a different cluster count. Studies that must reproduce a published habitat count should set ``fixed_n_clusters`` to that count. See :doc:`/user_guide/building_habitat_maps` and :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm`."
msgstr "在聚类文献中， *elbow* 通常指观察簇内离散度随 ``k`` 的变化（Thorndike RL, 1953, *Who belongs in the family?* ，Psychometrika 18(4):267–276）。Thorndike **并未** 发表二阶差分公式。直到 v0.1.x，HABIT 的 ``elbow`` 使用 **离散曲率肘部** （视觉肘部、计算得到）：对惯性二阶差分取 ``argmax`` 。那不是 Thorndike 引用，也不是今日默认。 ``elbow`` 与 ``kneedle`` 现都解析到 :func:`habit.kernels.cluster_selection.knee_index` ，因此写有 ``elbow`` 的 v0.1 配置仍有效，但可能选出不同的聚类数。必须复现已发表生境数的研究应将该数设为 ``fixed_n_clusters`` 。参见 :doc:`/user_guide/building_habitat_maps` 与 :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_03_clustering_algorithm` 。"
