#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:944
msgid "**Dual track (v0.1 top-level vs v1 ``policy:``).** A native v1 document (``version: \"1.0\"``) puts the same knobs under a top-level ``policy:`` block using :class:`~habit.spec.RunPolicy` field names (``workers``, ``subject_timeout_sec``, ``parallel_mode``, …). A v0.1 document keeps the ``individual_*`` / ``processes`` names at the top level; the CLI and :func:`~habit.recipes.run_from_yaml` translate them into ``policy`` via :class:`~habit.spec.legacy.LegacyConfigAdapter` before building the backend. Full rename table and defaults: :doc:`../api/spec` (``RunPolicy`` YAML mapping) and :doc:`../api/execution`. Annotated v1 example: ``config/habitat/config_habitat_two_step_v1.yaml``."
msgstr "**双轨（v0.1 顶层 vs v1 ``policy:`` ）。** 原生 v1 文档（ ``version: \"1.0\"`` ）把相同旋钮放在顶层 ``policy:`` 块下，字段名采用 :class:`~habit.spec.RunPolicy` （ ``workers`` 、 ``subject_timeout_sec`` 、 ``parallel_mode`` 等）。v0.1 文档则在顶层保留 ``individual_*`` / ``processes`` 名称；CLI 与 :func:`~habit.recipes.run_from_yaml` 在构建后端前经 :class:`~habit.spec.legacy.LegacyConfigAdapter` 将其译入 ``policy`` 。完整重命名表与默认值： :doc:`../api/spec` （ ``RunPolicy`` YAML 映射）与 :doc:`../api/execution` 。带注释的 v1 示例： ``config/habitat/config_habitat_two_step_v1.yaml`` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:955
msgid "**v1 backend selection (CLI / recipe reality).** After translation, ``cmd_habitat`` / ``yaml_runner`` call :func:`~habit.execution.backend_from_policy`:"
msgstr ""
"**v1 后端选择（CLI / 配方实况）。** 转换后 ``cmd_habitat`` / ``yaml_runner`` 调用 :func:`~habit.execution.backend_from_policy` ："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:959
msgid "``backend == \"process\"`` → :class:`~habit.execution.ProcessPoolBackend`"
msgstr ""
"``backend == \"process\"`` → :class:`~habit.execution.ProcessPoolBackend` （进程后端）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:961
msgid "**or** ``workers > 1`` / ``processes > 1`` → ProcessPoolBackend"
msgstr "**或** ``workers > 1`` / ``processes > 1`` → ProcessPoolBackend"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:964
msgid "otherwise → :class:`~habit.execution.SerialBackend`"
msgstr "否则 → :class:`~habit.execution.SerialBackend`"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:966
msgid "A positive ``subject_timeout_sec`` alone does **not** force spawn (the library default is ``900``; coupling it would erase the serial path). Timeout / OOM / ``auto_retry_rounds`` apply only under ProcessPoolBackend."
msgstr ""
"仅 ``subject_timeout_sec`` 为正 **不会** 强制 spawn（库默认 ``900`` ；绑定会抹掉串行路径）。Timeout / OOM / ``auto_retry_rounds`` 仅在 ProcessPoolBackend 下生效。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:972
msgid "On :class:`~habit.execution.SerialBackend`, timeout / OOM / ``parallel_mode`` / ``auto_retry_rounds`` knobs do not apply. Serial still honours ``on_subject_failure``, ``resume``, ``retry_failed_subjects``, ``force_rerun_subjects``, and ``clear_checkpoint_on_success``. For per-subject timeout isolation set ``backend: process`` (or ``parallel_mode: isolated``)."
msgstr ""
"在 :class:`~habit.execution.SerialBackend` 上，timeout / OOM / ``parallel_mode`` / ``auto_retry_rounds`` 旋钮不适用。Serial 仍遵守 ``on_subject_failure`` 、 ``resume`` 、 ``retry_failed_subjects`` 、 ``force_rerun_subjects`` 、 ``clear_checkpoint_on_success`` 。逐受试者 timeout 隔离请设 ``backend: process`` （或 ``parallel_mode: isolated`` ）。"
