msgstr "默认 ``<out_dir>/.habitat_checkpoint`` （由 CLI/配方解析，非 ``from_policy`` ）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1039
msgid "list[str]"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1042
msgid "Subject IDs to force rerun on resume"
msgstr "恢复时强制重跑的受试者 ID"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1047
msgid "On **next** ``resume``, rerun all ``failed_subjects`` in the store"
msgstr "在 **下一次** ``resume`` 时重跑存储中全部 ``failed_subjects``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1052
msgid "In-run Stage 1 auto-retry rounds; ``0`` disables. ProcessPoolBackend only"
msgstr "运行中 Stage 1 自动重试轮数； ``0`` 禁用。仅 ProcessPoolBackend"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1055
msgid "``persistent``"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1057
msgid "``persistent`` long-lived workers; ``isolated`` spawn per subject. ProcessPoolBackend only"
msgstr ""
"``persistent`` 长寿命 worker； ``isolated`` 每受试者 spawn。仅 ProcessPoolBackend"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1062
msgid "→ ``RunPolicy``; restart persistent worker after N consecutive fatal failures"
msgstr "→ ``RunPolicy`` ；N 次连续致命失败后重启 persistent worker"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1067
msgid "→ ``RunPolicy``; restart persistent worker after N successes (``0`` disables)"
msgstr "→ ``RunPolicy`` ；在 N 次成功后重启持久化工作器（ ``0`` 禁用）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1072
msgid "Delete checkpoint dir after full train success"
msgstr "完整 train 成功后删除检查点目录"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1077
msgid "``true`` raises ``CompatibilityError`` on fingerprint / legacy-layout mismatch"
msgstr "为 ``true`` 时，在指纹 / 旧版布局不匹配时抛出 ``CompatibilityError``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1079
msgid "**processes** (habitat analysis top level): Parallel workers for per-subject steps"
msgstr "**processes** （生境分析顶层）：逐受试者步骤的并行 worker"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1082
msgid "**Default**: ``2`` (must be ``> 0``)"
msgstr "**Default** ： ``2`` （须 ``> 0`` ）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1083
msgid "**Description**: See table above; interacts with ``cap_processes_to_gpu_pool`` and ``torch_gpus`` in ``feature_construction.*.params``."
msgstr ""
"**说明** ：见上表；与 ``cap_processes_to_gpu_pool`` 中 ``torch_gpus`` 、 ``feature_construction.*.params`` 交互。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1085
msgid "**cap_processes_to_gpu_pool** (habitat analysis top level): Cap Stage 1 workers to GPU pool size"
msgstr "**cap_processes_to_gpu_pool** （生境分析顶层）：将 Stage 1 worker 上限设为 GPU 池大小"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1088
msgid "**Default**: ``false`` (schema ``HabitatAnalysisConfig`` and ``RunPolicy.cap_workers_to_gpu_pool``)"
msgstr ""
"**Default** ： ``false`` （schema ``HabitatAnalysisConfig`` 与 ``RunPolicy.cap_workers_to_gpu_pool`` ）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1089
msgid "**Description**: When ``use_torch_radiomics`` uses CUDA (``true`` or ``auto`` with CUDA detected):"
msgstr ""
"**说明** ： When ``use_torch_radiomics`` uses CUDA (``true`` or ``auto`` with CUDA detected):"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1091
msgid "``true``: effective workers ``min(processes, len(torch_gpus))``, one GPU per slot (``gpu_slot_index``), less VRAM contention;"
msgstr ""
"``true`` ：有效 worker ``min(processes, len(torch_gpus))`` ，每槽一 GPU（ ``gpu_slot_index`` ），减少 VRAM 争用；"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1092
msgid "``false`` (default): full ``processes``; workers share GPUs via ``gpu_slot_index % len(torch_gpus)``—good for \"single GPU, many CPU\" parallel non-GPU steps, but GPU radiomics may OOM on same card."
msgstr "``false`` （默认）：完整 ``processes`` ；工作进程通过 ``gpu_slot_index % len(torch_gpus)`` 共享 GPU——适合「单 GPU、多 CPU」的并行非 GPU 步骤，但同卡上的 GPU 放射组学可能 OOM。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1094
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1157
msgid "**Not in config_hash**; may change on resume."
msgstr "**Not in config_hash** ；恢复时可改。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1095
msgid "**No effect** on CPU-only (``use_torch_radiomics: false`` or no CUDA), or when the v1 path selects :class:`~habit.execution.SerialBackend`."
msgstr ""
"**无效果** 于纯 CPU（ ``use_torch_radiomics: false`` 或无 CUDA），或 v1 路径选择 :class:`~habit.execution.SerialBackend` 时。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1097
msgid "**individual_subject_timeout_sec** (habitat analysis top level): Per-subject wall-clock cap in parallel Stage 1"
msgstr "**individual_subject_timeout_sec** （生境分析顶层）：并行 Stage 1 单受试者墙钟上限"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1099
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1111
msgid "**Type**: float / int (seconds) or ``null``"
msgstr "**类型** ：float / int（秒）或 ``null``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1100
msgid "**Default**: ``900`` (15 minutes); omit in YAML to use default."
msgstr "**Default** ： ``900`` （15 分钟）；YAML 省略即用默认。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1101
msgid "**Description**: On timeout, skip subject (record failure) and continue; ``null`` disables per-subject timeout. Child processes may still run in background until they exit. **v1 path**: only applied when ``ProcessPoolBackend`` is selected (``processes > 1`` and translated ``backend: process``); ignored under ``SerialBackend``."
msgstr "**说明** ：超时时跳过该受试者（记录失败）并继续； ``null`` 禁用每受试者超时。子进程可能仍在后台运行直至退出。 **v1 路径** ：仅在选用 ``ProcessPoolBackend`` 时生效（ ``processes > 1`` 且已翻译为 ``backend: process`` ）；在 ``SerialBackend`` 下忽略。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1103
msgid "**individual_subject_graceful_shutdown_sec** (habitat analysis top level): Grace period after timeout before kill"
msgstr "**individual_subject_graceful_shutdown_sec** （生境分析顶层）：超时后 kill 前的宽限期"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1105
msgid "**Type**: float (seconds)"
msgstr "**Type** ：float（秒）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1106
msgid "**Default**: ``15``"
msgstr "**默认** ： ``15``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1107
msgid "**Description**: After ``individual_subject_timeout_sec``, parent calls ``terminate()``, waits this many seconds, then ``kill()`` on the child. ProcessPoolBackend only (ignored on SerialBackend)."
msgstr ""
"**说明** ： ``individual_subject_timeout_sec`` 后父进程调用 ``terminate()`` ，等待若干秒后对子进程 ``kill()`` 。仅 ProcessPoolBackend（SerialBackend 忽略）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1109
msgid "**individual_subject_spawn_timeout_sec** (habitat analysis top level): Spawn-phase wall-clock cap"
msgstr "**individual_subject_spawn_timeout_sec** （生境分析顶层）：Spawn 阶段墙钟上限"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1112
msgid "**Default**: ``120``"
msgstr "**默认** ： ``120``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1113
msgid "**Description**: Cap from dispatch to subject processing start; on timeout, mark subject failed and continue—avoids parent blocked forever on spawn/import. ``null`` = no spawn time limit. ProcessPoolBackend only (ignored on SerialBackend)."
msgstr ""
"**Description** ：从派发到受试者处理开始的 cap；超时则标记失败并继续—避免父进程在 spawn/import 上永久阻塞。 ``null`` = 无 spawn 时限。仅 ProcessPoolBackend（SerialBackend 忽略）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1115
msgid "**on_subject_failure** (habitat analysis top level): Failure policy for parallel per-subject Stage 1"
msgstr "**on_subject_failure** （生境分析顶层）：并行逐受试者 Stage 1 失败策略"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1118
msgid "**Default**: ``continue``"
msgstr "**Default** ： ``continue``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1121
msgid "``continue``: record failed subjects; continue to Stage 2 if any succeeded"
msgstr "``continue`` ：记录失败受试者；若有成功则继续 Stage 2"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1122
msgid "``fail_fast``: abort entire run on first failure or timeout"
msgstr "``fail_fast`` ：首次失败或超时即中止整次运行"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1124
msgid "Python API twin: :class:`~habit.spec.RunPolicy` / :doc:`../api/execution`. Soft-failure patterns (geometry, batch ``fail_fast``, ``Cohort.map`` aggregation): :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends`."
msgstr "Python API 对应： :class:`~habit.spec.RunPolicy` / :doc:`../api/execution` 。软失败模式（几何、批量 ``fail_fast`` 、 ``Cohort.map`` 聚合）： :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1128
msgid "**oom_backoff** (habitat analysis top level): Reduce parallelism after memory errors"
msgstr "**oom_backoff** （栖息地分析顶层）：在内存错误后减少并行性"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1131
msgid "**Default**: ``true`` (built-in default); repo ``config/habitat/*.yaml`` examples often use ``false``—tune for your RAM"
msgstr "**默认** ： ``true`` （内置默认）；仓库 ``config/habitat/*.yaml`` 示例常用 ``false`` ——请按内存调整"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1132
msgid "**Description**: When ``true``, isolated child ``MemoryError`` reduces worker count for pending subjects by ``oom_reduce_workers_by`` (minimum 1). **Does not handle** native crashes (e.g. Windows exit ``3221225477`` / ``0xC0000005``). ProcessPoolBackend only (ignored on SerialBackend)."
msgstr ""
"**Description** ： ``true`` 时，孤立子进程 ``MemoryError`` 将待处理受试者 worker 数减 ``oom_reduce_workers_by`` （最少 1）。 **不处理** 原生崩溃（如 Windows 退出 ``3221225477`` / ``0xC0000005`` ）。仅 ProcessPoolBackend（SerialBackend 忽略）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1134
msgid "**oom_reduce_workers_by** (habitat analysis top level): Workers removed per OOM"
msgstr "**oom_reduce_workers_by** （生境分析顶层）：每次 OOM 移除的 worker 数"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1137
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1201
msgid "**Default**: ``1``"
msgstr "**默认** ： ``1``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1138
msgid "**Description**: Only when ``oom_backoff: true`` and ProcessPoolBackend is active."
msgstr "**Description** ：仅当 ``oom_backoff: true`` 且 ProcessPoolBackend 激活时。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1140
msgid "**resume** (habitat analysis top level): Stage 1 checkpoint resume"
msgstr "**resume** （生境分析顶层）：Stage 1 检查点 resume"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1144
msgid "**Description**: When ``true``, reuse checkpointed subject successes. On the **v1** CLI/recipe path the store is :class:`~habit.execution.CheckpointStore` under ``checkpoint_dir`` (default ``<out_dir>/.habitat_checkpoint`` for train, ``<out_dir>/.habitat_predict_checkpoint`` for predict); cache keys embed the spec fingerprint. Subjects recorded as failed are **not auto-retried on next** ``resume`` unless ``retry_failed_subjects: true`` or listed in ``force_rerun_subjects``. **Within the same** ProcessPool run, ``individual_subject_auto_retry_rounds`` retries failures by default. Applies to both ``train`` and ``predict``."
msgstr "**说明** ：为 ``true`` 时，复用已检查点记录的受试者成功结果。在 **v1** CLI/配方路径上，存储为 ``checkpoint_dir`` 下的 :class:`~habit.execution.CheckpointStore` （训练默认 ``<out_dir>/.habitat_checkpoint`` ，预测默认 ``<out_dir>/.habitat_predict_checkpoint`` ）；缓存键嵌入 spec 指纹。记为失败的受试者在下次 ``resume`` 时 **不会自动重试** ，除非 ``retry_failed_subjects: true`` 或列在 ``force_rerun_subjects`` 中。 **同一次** ProcessPool 运行内， ``individual_subject_auto_retry_rounds`` 默认会重试失败。适用于 ``train`` 与 ``predict`` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1145
msgid "**CLI**: ``habit get-habitat --resume`` equivalent to ``resume: true``."
msgstr "**CLI** ： ``habit get-habitat --resume`` 等价 ``resume: true`` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1146
msgid "**See also**: checkpoint / ``resume`` fields on this page; :doc:`../api/execution`."
msgstr "**另见** ：本页 checkpoint / ``resume`` 字段； :doc:`../api/execution` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1148
msgid "**strict_checkpoint_hash** (habitat analysis top level): Checkpoint hash mismatch policy"
msgstr "**strict_checkpoint_hash** （生境分析顶层）：检查点 hash 不匹配策略"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1154
msgid "**v0.1 Stage-1 engine** (legacy): with ``resume: true``, ``true`` raises ``CheckpointConfigHashError`` on ``manifest.json`` ``config_hash`` / ``run_mode`` mismatch; ``false`` warns and discards the checkpoint for a fresh run. Legacy Stage-2-only hash migration may still resume."
msgstr ""
"**v0.1 Stage-1 引擎** （遗留）： ``resume: true`` 时， ``true`` 在 ``CheckpointConfigHashError`` ``manifest.json`` / ``config_hash`` 不匹配时抛 ``run_mode`` ； ``false`` 警告并丢弃检查点重新运行。仅 Stage-2 哈希迁移的遗留场景仍可能 resume。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1155
msgid "**v1 CLI / recipe path** (``cmd_habitat`` / ``yaml_runner``): a legacy v0.1 ``manifest.json`` / ``subjects/`` tree is auto-migrated on open (see below), then resume continues. ``strict_checkpoint_hash=True`` raises :class:`~habit.exceptions.CompatibilityError` when the on-disk ``run_fingerprint.json`` mismatches the current spec fingerprint, or when the legacy manifest is corrupt/unreadable. With ``strict=False``, fingerprint mismatches are warned and left unreachable (cache keys also embed the fingerprint)."
msgstr ""
"**v1 CLI / recipe 路径** （ ``cmd_habitat`` / ``yaml_runner`` ）：旧 v0.1 ``manifest.json`` / ``subjects/`` 树打开时自动迁移（见下），然后 resume 继续。 ``strict_checkpoint_hash=True`` 时磁盘 ``run_fingerprint.json`` 与当前 spec 指纹不符或 legacy manifest 损坏/不可读则抛 :class:`~habit.exceptions.CompatibilityError` 。 ``strict=False`` 时指纹不符仅警告且不可达（缓存键亦嵌入指纹）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1159
msgid "**checkpoint_dir** (habitat analysis top level): Checkpoint root directory"
msgstr "**checkpoint_dir** （生境分析顶层）：检查点根目录"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1161
msgid "**Type**: string or ``null``"
msgstr "**Type** ：string 或 ``null``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1162
msgid "**Default**: ``null`` (``train`` → ``<out_dir>/.habitat_checkpoint``; ``predict`` → ``<out_dir>/.habitat_predict_checkpoint``)"
msgstr ""
"**Default** ： ``null`` （ ``train`` → ``<out_dir>/.habitat_checkpoint`` ； ``predict`` → ``<out_dir>/.habitat_predict_checkpoint`` ）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1163
msgid "**Description**: Must match previous run for resume; may differ from ``out_dir`` when set explicitly."
msgstr "**说明** ：为支持 resume，必须与上次运行一致；显式设置时可以与 ``out_dir`` 不同。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1165
msgid "**force_rerun_subjects** (habitat analysis top level): Subject IDs to force rerun"
msgstr "**force_rerun_subjects** （生境分析顶层）：强制重跑的受试者 ID"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1167
msgid "**Type**: list of strings"
msgstr "**Type** ：字符串列表"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1169
msgid "**Description**: With ``resume: true``, still reprocess listed subjects (removed from completed/failed and rerun)."
msgstr ""
"**Description** ： ``resume: true`` 时仍重处理列表内受试者（从 completed/failed 移除并重跑）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1171
msgid "**retry_failed_subjects** (habitat analysis top level): Rerun all failed subjects from checkpoint"
msgstr "**retry_failed_subjects** （生境分析顶层）：从检查点重跑全部失败受试者"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1175
msgid "**Description**: With ``resume: true``, enqueue all ``failed_subjects`` from ``manifest.json`` for Stage 1 rerun. Successful subjects still skipped unless also in ``force_rerun_subjects``."
msgstr ""
"**Description** ： ``resume: true`` 时将 ``failed_subjects`` 中全部 ``manifest.json`` 入队 Stage 1 重跑。成功受试者仍跳过，除非也在 ``force_rerun_subjects`` 中。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1177
msgid "**individual_subject_auto_retry_rounds** (habitat analysis top level): In-run auto-retry for failed subjects"
msgstr "**individual_subject_auto_retry_rounds** （生境分析顶层）：运行内对失败受试者自动重试轮数"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1181
msgid "**Description**: After first Stage 1 parallel pass, if failed subjects remain, rerun up to this many rounds in the same process (failed only). ``0`` disables. Unlike ``retry_failed_subjects`` (next **resume** only), this applies in the **current** ``get-habitat`` call when ProcessPoolBackend is active. With ``on_subject_failure: fail_fast``, error only after all retry rounds exhausted. **Ignored** under SerialBackend (``processes <= 1`` on the v1 path)."
msgstr "**说明** ：在第一轮 Stage 1 并行通过后，若仍有失败受试者，则在同一进程中最多再跑这么多轮（仅失败者）。 ``0`` 表示禁用。与 ``retry_failed_subjects`` （仅下一轮 **resume** ）不同，当 ProcessPoolBackend 激活时，它作用于 **当前** ``get-habitat`` 调用。若 ``on_subject_failure: fail_fast`` ，仅在所有重试轮次用尽后才报错。在 SerialBackend 下 **被忽略** （v1 路径上 ``processes <= 1`` ）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1183
msgid "**individual_subject_parallel_mode** (habitat analysis top level): Stage 1 parallel execution strategy"
msgstr "**individual_subject_parallel_mode** （生境分析顶层）：Stage 1 并行执行策略"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1186
msgid "**Default**: ``persistent``"
msgstr "**Default** ： ``persistent``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1187
msgid "**Allowed values**: ``isolated``, ``persistent``"
msgstr "**Allowed values** ： ``isolated`` 、 ``persistent``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1188
msgid "**Description**: ``persistent`` (default): one long-lived child per worker slot, reused within the same run (including auto-retry rounds), amortizing import/spawn. ``isolated``: spawn per subject (stronger isolation; unpickleable pipeline or spawn debugging). Single GPU persistent is still serial—main benefit is startup cost. Used in both ``train`` and ``predict`` individual-level stages when ProcessPoolBackend is selected."
msgstr ""
"**Description** ： ``persistent`` （默认）：每个 worker 槽一个长寿命子进程，同次运行内复用（含自动重试轮），摊销 import/spawn。 ``isolated`` ：每受试者 spawn（更强隔离；不可 pickle 的 pipeline 或 spawn 调试）。单 GPU persistent 仍串行——主要收益是启动成本。ProcessPoolBackend 选中时用于 ``train`` 与 ``predict`` 个体级阶段。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1192
msgid "On the **v1** CLI/recipe path, ``workers == 1`` with ``backend: serial`` stays in-process even when ``subject_timeout_sec`` / ``individual_subject_timeout_sec`` is the default ``900``. Per-subject timeout isolation requires ``backend: process`` or ``parallel_mode: isolated``."
msgstr ""
"在 **v1** CLI/配方路径上， ``workers == 1`` 且 ``backend: serial`` 即使 ``subject_timeout_sec`` / ``individual_subject_timeout_sec`` 为默认 ``900`` 也保持进程内。逐受试者 timeout 隔离需要 ``backend: process`` 或 ``parallel_mode: isolated`` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1198
msgid "**persistent_worker_max_consecutive_failures** (habitat analysis top level): Persistent worker restart threshold"
msgstr "**persistent_worker_max_consecutive_failures** （生境分析顶层）：持久 worker 重启阈值"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1202
msgid "**Description**: Maps to ``RunPolicy.persistent_worker_max_consecutive_failures``. Under ``parallel_mode: persistent``, restart a worker slot after this many consecutive fatal-class failures."
msgstr ""
"**Description** ：映射到 ``RunPolicy.persistent_worker_max_consecutive_failures`` 。 ``parallel_mode: persistent`` 下，连续致命类失败达此次数后重启 worker 槽。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1204
msgid "**persistent_worker_recycle_after_tasks** (habitat analysis top level): Periodic persistent worker recycle"
msgstr "**persistent_worker_recycle_after_tasks** （生境分析顶层）：周期性持久 worker 回收"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1207
msgid "**Default**: ``0``"
msgstr "**默认** ： ``0``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1208
msgid "**Description**: Maps to ``RunPolicy.persistent_worker_recycle_after_tasks``. Under ``parallel_mode: persistent``, restart a worker after this many successful tasks (``0`` disables)."
msgstr ""
"**Description** ：映射 ``RunPolicy.persistent_worker_recycle_after_tasks`` 。 ``parallel_mode: persistent`` 下，成功任务达此数后重启 worker（ ``0`` 禁用）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1210
msgid "**clear_checkpoint_on_success** (habitat analysis top level): Delete checkpoint after successful train"
msgstr "**clear_checkpoint_on_success** （生境分析顶层）：train 成功后删除检查点"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1214
msgid "**Description**: When ``true``, deletes entire checkpoint directory after Stage 1 + Stage 2 complete successfully."
msgstr "**Description** ： ``true`` 时在 Stage 1 + Stage 2 全部成功后删除整个检查点目录。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1216
msgid "**config_hash and resume compatibility**"
msgstr "**config_hash 与恢复兼容性**"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1218
msgid "**v1 path**: :class:`~habit.execution.CheckpointStore` keys embed the :class:`~habit.spec.HabitatSpec` fingerprint, and the store writes ``run_fingerprint.json``. Changing scientific knobs yields new keys. With ``strict_checkpoint_hash: true``, an incompatible fingerprint raises :class:`~habit.exceptions.CompatibilityError`. A readable v0.1 layout is migrated automatically (not refused). Scheduling-only knobs (``processes``, timeouts, OOM, …) are outside the fingerprint."
msgstr "**v1 path** ： :class:`~habit.execution.CheckpointStore` 键嵌入 :class:`~habit.spec.HabitatSpec` 指纹，存储写入 ``run_fingerprint.json`` 。更改科学旋钮产生新键。 ``strict_checkpoint_hash: true`` 时不兼容指纹抛出 :class:`~habit.exceptions.CompatibilityError` 。可读 v0.1 布局自动迁移（不拒绝）。仅调度旋钮（ ``processes`` 、timeouts、OOM 等）在指纹外。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1225
msgid "**v0.1 Stage-1 engine** (legacy ``manifest.json`` layout):"
msgstr "**v0.1 Stage-1 engine** （旧 ``manifest.json`` 布局）："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1227
msgid "**In hash** (Stage 1 per-subject; change clears checkpoint): ``data_dir``, ``feature_construction.voxel_level`` / ``preprocessing_for_subject_level`` / ``supervoxel_level``, ``habitat_segmentation.clustering_mode``, per-subject clustering block (``two_step`` → ``supervoxel``; ``one_step`` → ``supervoxel`` + ``habitat``)."
msgstr ""
"**In hash** （阶段 1 每受试者；变更清检查点）： ``data_dir`` 、 ``feature_construction.voxel_level`` / ``preprocessing_for_subject_level`` / ``supervoxel_level`` 、 ``habitat_segmentation.clustering_mode`` 、每受试者聚类块（ ``two_step`` → ``supervoxel`` ； ``one_step`` → ``supervoxel`` + ``habitat`` ）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1232
msgid "**Not in hash** (may ``resume: true``): ``preprocessing_for_group_level``, group ``habitat.*`` for ``two_step``/``direct_pooling``, ``processes``, ``cap_processes_to_gpu_pool``, ``strict_checkpoint_hash``, timeout / OOM / retry / parallel-mode knobs, ``persistent_worker_*``, ``force_rerun_subjects``, ``out_dir``, plot/save switches, etc."
msgstr "**不参与哈希** （可 ``resume: true`` ）： ``preprocessing_for_group_level`` 、 ``two_step``/``direct_pooling`` 的 group ``habitat.*`` 、 ``processes`` 、 ``cap_processes_to_gpu_pool`` 、 ``strict_checkpoint_hash`` 、超时 / OOM / 重试 / 并行模式旋钮、 ``persistent_worker_*`` 、 ``force_rerun_subjects`` 、 ``out_dir`` 、绘图/保存开关等。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1237
msgid "``manifest.json`` also stores ``individual_config_hash``; legacy full-hash-only manifests migrate hash on Stage-2-only changes and keep pkls."
msgstr ""
"``manifest.json`` 还存 ``individual_config_hash`` ；仅全哈希的遗留 manifest 在仅 Stage-2 变更时迁移哈希并保留 pkls。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1239
msgid "On ``resume: true`` startup with hash mismatch: default (``strict_checkpoint_hash: false``) warns and deletes checkpoint; ``true`` raises ``CheckpointConfigHashError``."
msgstr ""
"``resume: true`` 启动且 hash 不匹配：默认（ ``strict_checkpoint_hash: false`` ）警告并删检查点； ``true`` 抛 ``CheckpointConfigHashError`` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1243
msgid "**Checkpoint directory layout**"
msgstr "**检查点目录布局**"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1245
msgid "v0.1 Stage-1 layout (legacy). On the v1 CLI/recipe path these markers trigger an automatic migration (:func:`~habit.execution.migrate_v01_checkpoint_if_needed`) that writes v1 store entries, archives the tree under ``.v01_legacy_archive/``, and logs what could / could not be scientifically reused::"
msgstr "v0.1 Stage-1 布局（遗留）。v1 CLI/配方路径上这些标记触发自动迁移（ :func:`~habit.execution.migrate_v01_checkpoint_if_needed` ），写入 v1 存储项、将树归档到 ``.v01_legacy_archive/`` 并记录科学上可/不可复用内容::"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1256
msgid "v1 :class:`~habit.execution.CheckpointStore` uses its own per-key files under the same ``checkpoint_dir`` root (see :doc:`../api/execution`)."
msgstr ""
"v1 :class:`~habit.execution.CheckpointStore` 在同一 ``checkpoint_dir`` 根下使用逐键文件（见 :doc:`../api/execution` ）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1259
msgid "**Checkpoint boundaries by clustering_mode**"
msgstr "**按 clustering_mode 的 checkpoint 边界**"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1261
msgid "``two_step`` / ``one_step``: saved after ``merge_supervoxel_features`` (``supervoxel_df``)"
msgstr ""
"``two_step`` / ``one_step`` ：在 ``merge_supervoxel_features`` （ ``supervoxel_df`` ）后保存"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1262
msgid "``direct_pooling``: saved after ``individual_preprocessing`` (voxel-level ``features``; larger pkls)"
msgstr ""
"``direct_pooling``: saved after ``individual_preprocessing`` (体素-level ``features``; larger pkls)"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1263
msgid "Stage 2 (combine / concat / group clustering) has **no** checkpoint"
msgstr "Stage 2（combine / concat / group 聚类） **无** checkpoint"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1265
msgid "**save_results_csv**: Save habitat results table"
msgstr "**save_results_csv** ：保存生境结果表"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1269
msgid "**Description**: When ``true``, writes ``habitats.parquet`` (default) or ``habitats.csv`` per ``habitats_results_format``."
msgstr "**说明** ：为 ``true`` 时，按 ``habitats_results_format`` 写入 ``habitats.parquet`` （默认）或 ``habitats.csv`` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1271
msgid "**habitats_results_format**: Habitat results table file format"
msgstr "**生境_results_format**: 生境 results table file format"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1274
msgid "**Default**: ``parquet``"
msgstr "**Default** ： ``parquet``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1275
msgid "**Allowed values**: ``parquet``, ``csv``"
msgstr "**允许值** ： ``parquet`` 、 ``csv``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1276
msgid "**Description**: ``parquet`` smaller and faster—good for large ``direct_pooling`` voxel tables; ``csv`` opens in Excel. Output filename is ``habitats.parquet`` or ``habitats.csv``."
msgstr "**说明** ： ``parquet`` 更小更快——适合大型 ``direct_pooling`` 体素表； ``csv`` 可在 Excel 中打开。输出文件名为 ``habitats.parquet`` 或 ``habitats.csv`` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1284
msgid "**random_state** (habitat analysis top level)"
msgstr "**random_state** （生境分析顶层）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1287
msgid "**Default**: ``42``"
msgstr "**默认** ： ``42``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1289
msgid "**on_geometry_mismatch** (habitat analysis top level, optional)"
msgstr "**on_geometry_mismatch** （生境分析顶层，可选）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1292
msgid "**Default**: ``resample_mask``"
msgstr "**默认** ： ``resample_mask``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1293
msgid "**Allowed values**: ``resample_mask``, ``strict``"
msgstr "**允许值** ： ``resample_mask`` 、 ``strict``"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1294
msgid "**Description**: When an ROI mask and the reference image disagree on voxel-grid metadata (origin / direction / spacing / size), HABIT by default aligns the mask onto the image grid before Stage-1: same-shaped arrays keep voxels and adopt the image header; different shapes use nearest-neighbour resampling. Set ``strict`` to raise ``GeometryError`` instead (opt-in). On a native v1 document the same key may sit under ``spec:`` as ``HabitatSpec.on_geometry_mismatch``."
msgstr ""
"**说明** ：当 ROI 掩膜与参考图像在体素网格元数据（origin / direction / spacing / size）上不一致时，HABIT 默认在 Stage-1 前将掩膜对齐到图像网格：同 shape 数组保留体素并采用图像头；不同 shape 用最近邻重采样。设 ``strict`` 则抛 ``GeometryError`` （可选）。原生 v1 文档中同一键可在 ``spec:`` 下作为 ``HabitatSpec.on_geometry_mismatch`` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1307
msgid "**debug** (habitat analysis top level)"
msgstr "**调试** （栖息地分析顶层）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1312
msgid "**habitat_pipeline.pkl** (training artifact at ``<out_dir>/habitat_pipeline.pkl``)"
msgstr "**habitat_pipeline.pkl** （训练产物于 ``<out_dir>/habitat_pipeline.pkl`` ）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1314
msgid "**Contents**: joblib-serialized fitted ``HabitatPipeline`` (group clustering model, ``PreprocessingState``, config, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"**Contents** ：joblib 序列化的已拟合 ``HabitatPipeline`` （group 聚类模型、 ``PreprocessingState`` 、config 等）。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1315
msgid "**Auto slimming on save** (``HabitatPipeline.save()`` calls ``prepare_pipeline_for_save``):"
msgstr ""
"**Auto slimming on save** （ ``HabitatPipeline.save()`` 调用 ``prepare_pipeline_for_save`` ）："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1317
msgid "Removes training ``labels_`` (prediction needs centers/model params only)"
msgstr "移除训练用的 ``labels_`` （预测只需中心点/模型参数）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1318
msgid "**Does not write** ``mask_info_cache`` (NRRD write loads mask from ``data_dir`` on demand via ``FeatureService.load_mask_info``)"
msgstr ""
"**Does not write** ``mask_info_cache`` (NRRD write loads 掩膜 from ``data_dir`` on demand via ``FeatureService.load_mask_info``)"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1319
msgid "Does not write ``_train_checkpoint`` (checkpoints remain in ``checkpoint_dir``)"
msgstr "不写 ``_train_checkpoint`` （检查点仍在 ``checkpoint_dir`` ）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1321
msgid "**Size**:"
msgstr "**大小** ："
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1323
msgid "No longer inflated by ``save_images: true``: mask volume decoupled from pkl; ``direct_pooling`` large queues typically **tens to hundreds of MB** (mainly feature dimension and model params vs subject count)"
msgstr ""
"不再因 ``save_images: true`` 膨胀：掩膜体与 pkl 解耦； ``direct_pooling`` 大队列通常 **数十至数百 MB** （主要随特征维与模型参数而非受试者数）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1324
msgid "Legacy pkls embedding ``mask_array`` need **re-train and save** to shrink"
msgstr "嵌入 ``mask_array`` 的旧 pkls 需 **重新训练并保存** 以缩小"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1326
msgid "**save_images**: Save image outputs from the run (``*_habitats.nrrd``, etc.)"
msgstr "**save_images** ：保存本次运行的图像输出（ ``*_habitats.nrrd`` 等）"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1330
msgid "**Description**: Maps to ``HabitatAnalysisConfig.save_images``. When ``true``, train/predict write habitat label maps; masks load from ``config.data_dir`` at write time—**not** stored in ``habitat_pipeline.pkl``. When ``false``, downstream analysis via ``habitats.parquet`` / ``habitats.csv`` without NRRD output."
msgstr "**说明** ：映射到 ``HabitatAnalysisConfig.save_images`` 。为 ``true`` 时，train/predict 写出生境标签图；掩膜在写出时从 ``config.data_dir`` 加载——**不会** 存入 ``habitat_pipeline.pkl`` 。为 ``false`` 时，下游分析经由 ``habitats.parquet`` / ``habitats.csv`` ，无 NRRD 输出。"
#: ../../source/configuration/habitat.rst:1332
msgid "**verbose**: Verbose run logging"
msgstr "**verbose** ：详细运行日志"
#: ../../source/configuration/index.rst:2
msgid "CLI and YAML"
msgstr "CLI 与 YAML"
#: ../../source/configuration/index.rst:4
msgid "The ``habit`` command line and the YAML files are a shell over the Python API: every command runs the same analysis as the Python pages. YAML templates and ``habit`` commands live only in this section, not in the Habitat Guide."
msgstr ""
"``habit`` 命令行与 YAML 文件是 Python API 的外壳：每条命令与 Python 页运行相同分析。YAML 模板与 ``habit`` 命令仅在本节，不在生境指南中。"
#: ../../source/configuration/index.rst:9
msgid "Two subpages:"
msgstr "两个子页："
#: ../../source/configuration/index.rst:11
msgid ":doc:`../reference/cli` -- every ``habit`` subcommand, what it does, and where its options are explained."
msgstr ":doc:`../reference/cli` —— 每个 ``habit`` 子命令、作用及选项说明位置。"
#: ../../source/configuration/index.rst:13
msgid ":doc:`recipe_catalog` -- the YAML templates under ``config/`` and the field reference for each workflow. Copy a file, edit the ★ fields (usually data and output paths), and run the matching command."
msgstr ":doc:`recipe_catalog` —— ``config/`` 下的 YAML 模板及各工作流的字段说明。复制一份文件，编辑 ★ 字段（通常是数据与输出路径），再运行对应命令。"
#: ../../source/configuration/index.rst:26
msgid "These are not Habitat Guide pages. Templates live under ``config/``."
msgstr "非 Habitat Guide 页。模板在 ``config/`` 下。"
#: ../../source/configuration/index.rst:28
msgid "Image preprocessing (N4, resample, registration): :doc:`preprocessing`"
msgstr "图像预处理（N4，重采样，配准）： :doc:`preprocessing`"
#: ../../source/configuration/index.rst:29
msgid "DICOM sort / rename: :doc:`dicom_sort`"
msgstr "DICOM 排序/重命名： :doc:`dicom_sort`"
#: ../../source/configuration/index.rst:30
msgid "Dice, ICC, merge-csv, and other utilities: :doc:`auxiliary`"
msgstr "Dice、ICC、merge-csv 等工具： :doc:`auxiliary`"
#: ../../source/configuration/index.rst:31
msgid "Whole-ROI radiomics CLI: :doc:`radiomics`"
msgstr "Whole-ROI 放射组学 CLI: :doc:`radiomics`"
#: ../../source/configuration/preprocessing.rst:2
msgid "Preprocessing Configuration"
msgstr "预处理配置"
#: ../../source/configuration/preprocessing.rst:5
msgid "Preprocessing configuration parameters"
msgstr "预处理配置参数"
#: ../../source/configuration/preprocessing.rst:7
msgid "This section documents **preprocessing** configuration (``PreprocessingConfig``). Top-level key ``preprocessing`` holds step blocks; keys must match names registered in ``PreprocessorFactory``; YAML order is execution order."
msgstr ""
"本节记录 **预处理** 配置（ ``PreprocessingConfig`` ）。顶层键 ``preprocessing`` 持有步骤块；键须匹配 ``PreprocessorFactory`` 注册名；YAML 顺序即执行顺序。"
#: ../../source/configuration/preprocessing.rst:9
msgid "DICOM **sort-only** uses ``habit sort-dicom`` with a separate config; see :doc:`dicom_sort`. Operations: :doc:`../how_to/preprocess`."
msgstr "DICOM **仅排序** 使用 ``habit sort-dicom`` 以及一个单独的配置；请参见 :doc:`dicom_sort` 。操作： :doc:`../how_to/preprocess` 。"
#: ../../source/configuration/preprocessing.rst:66
msgid "**Top level (``PreprocessingConfig``)**"
msgstr "**顶层（ ``PreprocessingConfig`` ）**"
#: ../../source/configuration/preprocessing.rst:75
msgid "``data_dir`` / ``out_dir``"
msgstr "``data_dir`` / ``out_dir``"
#: ../../source/configuration/preprocessing.rst:77
msgid "Relative paths are resolved against the directory containing this YAML"
msgstr "相对路径相对含本 YAML 的目录解析"
#: ../../source/configuration/preprocessing.rst:78
msgid "``preprocessing``"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/configuration/preprocessing.rst:79
msgid "``{}``"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/configuration/preprocessing.rst:80
msgid "Step name → config dict; keys must be registered preprocessor names"
msgstr "步骤名 → 配置 dict；键须为已注册预处理器名"
#: ../../source/configuration/preprocessing.rst:83
msgid "Must be ``>= 1``; effective parallelism is ``min(config, CPU cores - 2)``, at least 1"
msgstr "须 ``>= 1`` ；有效并行 ``min(config, CPU cores - 2)`` ，至少 1"
#: ../../source/configuration/preprocessing.rst:84
msgid "``random_state``"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/configuration/preprocessing.rst:85
msgid "``42``"
