#: ../../source/customization/index.rst:168
msgid "Extension principles"
msgstr "扩展原则"
#: ../../source/customization/index.rst:170
msgid "**Follow the protocol.** Custom habitat components carry a ``spec`` and accept the typed contract for that domain (``Subject``, feature field, habitat map, …). Do not add I/O inside L0–L3 plugins."
msgstr ""
"**遵循协议。** 自定义生境组件携带 ``spec`` 并接受该域的类型化契约（ ``Subject`` 、特征场、生境图等）。L0–L3 插件内勿加 I/O。"
#: ../../source/customization/index.rst:174
msgid "**Register a stable name.** Use a descriptive snake_case name (``dce_hemodynamics``, not ``dcehemo``). Keep it unique in that domain."
msgstr ""
"**注册稳定名称。** 使用描述性 snake_case（ ``dce_hemodynamics`` ，非 ``dcehemo`` ）。在该域内保持唯一。"
#: ../../source/customization/index.rst:177
