msgstr "**如何共享自定义组件？** 发布带 ``habit.<domain>`` entry point 的小包，或上游贡献并附测试。"
#: ../../source/customization/index.rst:205
msgid "**How do I handle extra dependencies?** Document them; put non-core stacks in your plugin's extras, not in HABIT's required dependencies."
msgstr "**如何处理额外依赖？** 文档说明；非核心栈放在插件 extras，而非 HABIT 必需依赖。"
