#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:2
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:4
msgid "Since v1.0.0 HABIT is **API-first**: the Python API is the product, and the CLI and YAML configs are thin shells over it. The codebase is organized as six layers, L0 at the bottom to L5 at the top. A layer may only import from the layers below it, which keeps the numeric core free of I/O and keeps configuration parsing out of the algorithms."
msgstr ""
"自 v1.0.0 起 HABIT 为 **API-first** ：Python API 即产品，CLI 与 YAML 配置为其薄壳。代码库组织为六层，L0 底至 L5 顶。层只能向下 import，使数值核心无 I/O、配置解析不进算法。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:10
msgid "Read the public Developer docs in this order:"
msgstr "按以下顺序阅读公开的开发者文档："
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:12
msgid "**This page** — layers, public API boundary, invariants."
msgstr "**本页** — 分层、公开 API 边界、不变量。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:13
msgid ":doc:`contributing` — environment, tests, and pull requests."
msgstr ":doc:`contributing` — 环境、测试与拉取请求。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:14
msgid ":doc:`../customization/index` — registry and entry-point plugins."
msgstr ":doc:`../customization/index` — 注册表和入口点插件。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:17
msgid "Design principles"
msgstr "设计原则"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:19
msgid "**API first**: every study is a :class:`~habit.recipes.Study` (``result = recipes.Study(spec=spec).fit_predict(cohort)`` with ``HabitatSpec.stages``); YAML and the CLI are projections of the same call. Habitat factories (``two_step_habitat`` / ``one_step_habitat`` / ``direct_pooling_habitat``) return a Study with a declared design."
msgstr ""
"**API first** ：每项研究为 :class:`~habit.recipes.Study` （ ``result = recipes.Study(spec=spec).fit_predict(cohort)`` 且 ``HabitatSpec.stages`` ）；YAML 与 CLI 为同一调用的投影。生境工厂（ ``two_step_habitat`` / ``one_step_habitat`` / ``direct_pooling_habitat`` ）返回带声明设计的 Study。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:24
msgid "**Typed specifications**: analyses are declared as immutable, fingerprinted spec objects (:class:`~habit.spec.HabitatSpec`, :class:`~habit.spec.MLSpec`) rather than loosely structured dictionaries."
msgstr "**Typed specifications** ：分析声明为不可变、带指纹的 spec 对象（ :class:`~habit.spec.HabitatSpec` 、 :class:`~habit.spec.MLSpec` ），而非松散字典。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:27
msgid "**Registry pattern**: algorithms are registered by name instead of being hard-coded into workflow logic."
msgstr "**注册表模式** ：算法按名称注册，而非硬编码进工作流逻辑。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:29
msgid "**Unified contracts**: data travels between layers as typed contracts (:class:`~habit.contracts.Subject`, :class:`~habit.contracts.FeatureTable`, :class:`~habit.contracts.HabitatModel`, ...)."
msgstr "**Unified contracts** ：数据以类型化契约在层间传递（ :class:`~habit.contracts.Subject` 、 :class:`~habit.contracts.FeatureTable` 、 :class:`~habit.contracts.HabitatModel` 等）。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:32
msgid "**Lazy imports**: optional and heavy dependencies load only when needed."
msgstr "**惰性导入** ：可选且体积大的依赖仅在需要时加载。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:35
msgid "The six layers"
msgstr "六层架构"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:56
msgid "Supporting packages beside the stack: ``habit/spec/`` (spec objects and the v0.1 → v1 translator), ``habit/execution/`` (parallel backends and checkpoints), ``habit/datasets/`` (synthetic data), ``habit/plugins/`` (component discovery), ``habit/schemas/`` (v0.1 YAML schemas), and ``habit/compat/`` (the v0.1 engines, kept for YAML parity and legacy files)."
msgstr ""
"栈旁支持包： ``habit/spec/`` （spec 对象与 v0.1→v1 转换器）、 ``habit/execution/`` （并行后端与检查点）、 ``habit/datasets/`` （合成数据）、 ``habit/plugins/`` （组件发现）、 ``habit/schemas/`` （v0.1 YAML schema）、 ``habit/compat/`` （v0.1 引擎，保留 YAML parity 与旧文件）。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:62
msgid "Public Python symbols are listed under :doc:`../api/index`. A third party should be able to call ``op(subject)`` or ``Study(spec).fit_predict(cohort)`` without HABIT's directory layout. If ``habit/cli.py`` and ``habit/commands/`` were deleted, the scientific capability would still be callable."
msgstr "公开 Python 符号列于 :doc:`../api/index` 。第三方应能调用 ``op(subject)`` 或 ``Study(spec).fit_predict(cohort)`` ，而无须接受 HABIT 的目录布局。即便删除 ``habit/cli.py`` 与 ``habit/commands/`` ，科学能力仍可调用。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:68
msgid "Two execution paths"
msgstr "两条执行路径"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:70
msgid "**The v1 path (specs and recipes).** Python callers build a spec, assemble a cohort or feature table through the contracts/adapters, and call a recipe. The recipe wires domain components from the L3 registries into a pipeline, runs it through an execution backend, and returns a typed result with a :class:`~habit.contracts.RunManifest` for provenance:"
msgstr "**v1 路径（specs 与 recipes）。** Python 调用方构建 spec，经 contracts/adapters 组装队列或特征表，再调用 recipe。recipe 从 L3 注册表接线领域组件为流水线，经执行后端运行，并返回带 :class:`~habit.contracts.RunManifest` 溯源的类型化结果："
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:85
msgid "**The v0.1 path (YAML schemas and configurators).** The CLI still accepts v0.1 YAML. Commands validate it against the Pydantic schemas in ``habit/schemas/``, translate it with :class:`~habit.spec.legacy.LegacyConfigAdapter`, and then call the **same** v1 recipes. The classic schema → configurator → orchestrator chain survives only inside ``habit/compat/engines/``, which a few workflows (feature extraction, traditional radiomics, legacy pickle prediction) still route through:"
msgstr ""
"**v0.1 路径（YAML schema 与配置器）。** CLI 仍接受 v0.1 YAML。命令对照 ``habit/schemas/`` 中 Pydantic schema 校验，用 :class:`~habit.spec.legacy.LegacyConfigAdapter` 转换，再调用 **相同** v1 配方。经典 schema → 配置器 → 编排器链仅存于 ``habit/compat/engines/`` ，少数工作流（特征提取、传统放射组学、旧 pickle 预测）仍经此路由："
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:103
msgid "Maintainer notes for the YAML loader, PathResolver, and compat engine tours live in the repository at ``developer/sphinx_archive/`` (``configuration_system.rst``, ``request_lifecycle.rst``, ``subsystems.rst``)."
msgstr "YAML 加载器、PathResolver 与 compat 引擎导览的维护者说明位于仓库 ``developer/sphinx_archive/`` （ ``configuration_system.rst`` 、 ``request_lifecycle.rst`` 、 ``subsystems.rst`` ）。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:109
msgid "Key components"
msgstr "关键组件"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:111
msgid "**Specs** (``habit/spec/``) declare an analysis as data. A spec is immutable, serializable, and fingerprinted, so a saved model always knows exactly which analysis produced it."
msgstr ""
"**Specs** （ ``habit/spec/`` ）将分析声明为数据。spec 不可变、可序列化、可指纹化，保存的模型始终知道产生它的分析。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:114
msgid "**Recipes** (``habit/recipes/``) are the standard study designs. They are the only orchestration most users and all entry points need."
msgstr ""
"**Recipes** （ ``habit/recipes/`` ）是标准研究设计。是多数用户与全部 entry point 唯一需要的编排。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:116
msgid "**Contracts** (``habit/contracts/``) are the typed data model; every layer speaks in these objects."
msgstr "**Contracts** （ ``habit/contracts/`` ）是带类型的数据模型；每一层都用这些对象交流。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:118
msgid "**Domain registries** (``habit/domain/``) map ``Spec(\"kmeans\", {...})`` component references to implementations."
msgstr ""
"**Domain registries** （ ``habit/domain/`` ）将 ``Spec(\"kmeans\", {...})`` 组件引用映射到实现。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:120
msgid "**Execution backends** (``habit/execution/``) run subject-parallel work and provide checkpointing for interrupted cohorts."
msgstr "**Execution backends** （ ``habit/execution/`` ）运行受试者并行工作并为中断队列提供检查点。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:122
msgid "**Compat engines** (``habit/compat/engines/``) are the pre-v1 implementations (``BatchProcessor``, ``HabitatAnalysis``, ``HoldoutWorkflow``/``KFoldWorkflow``). They remain fully supported for YAML-parity workflows but are no longer the architecture's center of gravity."
msgstr ""
"**Compat engines** （ ``habit/compat/engines/`` ）是 v1 前实现（ ``BatchProcessor`` 、 ``HabitatAnalysis`` 、 ``HoldoutWorkflow``/``KFoldWorkflow`` ）。YAML  parity 工作流仍完全支持，但不再是架构重心。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:129
msgid "Subsystems"
msgstr "子系统"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:131
msgid "**Habitat analysis** supports three strategies — ``two_step``, ``one_step``, and ``direct_pooling`` — implemented as v1 recipes over the same domain components. Fitted state is persisted as a self-describing ``.habitatmodel`` archive for reproducible prediction."
msgstr ""
"**Habitat analysis** 支持三种策略 — ``two_step`` 、 ``one_step`` 、 ``direct_pooling`` — 作为同一领域组件上的 v1 配方实现。拟合状态以自描述 ``.habitatmodel`` 归档持久化以供可复现预测。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:136
msgid "**Preprocessing** and **tabular machine learning** are supporting shells: ``habit preprocess`` calls :func:`habit.recipes.preprocess_images`; :func:`~habit.recipes.train_model` / :func:`~habit.recipes.cross_validate` / :func:`~habit.recipes.predict_model` run a :class:`~habit.pipeline.TablePipeline`. Compat engines under ``habit/compat/engines/`` remain for YAML parity. Those trees are frozen for product work; habitat analysis is the extension surface."
msgstr "**预处理** 与 **表格机器学习** 是支撑外壳： ``habit preprocess`` 调用 :func:`habit.recipes.preprocess_images` ； :func:`~habit.recipes.train_model` / :func:`~habit.recipes.cross_validate` / :func:`~habit.recipes.predict_model` 运行 :class:`~habit.pipeline.TablePipeline` 。 ``habit/compat/engines/`` 下的兼容引擎仍服务于 YAML 对等。这些树在产品工作上已冻结；生境分析才是扩展面。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:145
msgid "CLI-to-core mapping"
msgstr "CLI 到核心映射"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:147
msgid "Every CLI command is L5 wiring: parse and validate YAML, translate if needed, call a recipe, write outputs. No algorithms live in the command layer."
msgstr "每条 CLI 命令为 L5 装配：解析验证 YAML、必要时转换、调用 recipe、写输出。命令层无算法。"
