msgstr "``VoxelFeatureExtractorRegistry``, ``ComponentRegistry``"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:268
msgid "On the v0.1 YAML path, a **Configurator** assembles and an **Orchestrator** executes; a **Factory** resolves names. Those roles still describe ``habit/compat/engines/``. On the v1 path the recipe plays all three, driven by a spec."
msgstr ""
"v0.1 YAML 路径上 **Configurator** 组装、 **Orchestrator** 执行、 **Factory** 解析名称。这些角色仍描述 ``habit/compat/engines/`` 。v1 路径上 recipe 兼三职，由 spec 驱动。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:274
msgid "Invariants"
msgstr "不变量"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:276
msgid "These rules must not be broken. Most are checked by ``tests/test_architecture_contracts.py``."
msgstr "这些规则不可违反。多数由 ``tests/test_architecture_contracts.py`` 检查。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:281
msgid "Run the architecture contract tests before submitting changes::"
msgstr "提交变更前运行架构契约测试::"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:285
msgid "**Scientific correctness**"
msgstr "**科学正确性**"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:291
msgid "Invariant"
msgstr "不变量"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:292
msgid "Rationale"
msgstr "设计理由"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:293
msgid "**Prevent data leakage**"
msgstr "**防止数据泄露**"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:294
msgid "Feature selection, scaling, and resampling must be inside one sklearn Pipeline and fitted only on training folds."
msgstr "特征选择、缩放与重采样必须放在同一个 sklearn Pipeline 内，且仅在训练折上拟合。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:296
msgid "**Train/predict symmetry**"
msgstr "**训练/预测对称性**"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:297
msgid "Predict must reuse the clustering centers, scaler parameters, selected features, and other state learned by fit."
msgstr "predict 须复用 fit 学到的聚类中心、缩放参数、所选特征等状态。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:299
msgid "**Controlled randomness**"
msgstr "**受控随机性**"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:300
msgid "Every stochastic step must accept and propagate a random seed so the same configuration can be reproduced."
msgstr "每一个随机步骤都必须接受并传递一个随机种子，以便可以重现相同的配置。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:303
msgid "**Configuration**"
msgstr "**配置**"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:305
msgid "Root configuration models use ``extra='forbid'`` where strict validation is required. New fields must be declared in the schema."
msgstr "根配置模型在需严格验证处用 ``extra='forbid'`` 。新字段须在 schema 中声明。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:307
msgid "``habit/schemas/`` is the source of truth for schema definitions. Compatibility modules may re-export schemas but must not define duplicates."
msgstr "``habit/schemas/`` 是 schema 定义的真相源。兼容模块可再导出 schema 但不得定义重复。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:309
msgid "A component with configurable ``params`` must define and register a Pydantic parameter model (v0.1 YAML) or expose them on the component constructor (v1 ``Registry.create``)."
msgstr ""
"可配置 ``params`` 的组件须定义并注册 Pydantic 参数模型（v0.1 YAML）或在组件构造函数上暴露（v1 ``Registry.create`` ）。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:312
msgid "v1 spec objects (``habit/spec/``) are immutable and fingerprinted; a fitted model must always be traceable to the exact spec that produced it."
msgstr "v1 的 spec 对象（ ``habit/spec/`` ）不可变且带指纹；拟合得到的模型必须始终能追溯到产生它的那份精确 spec。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:315
msgid "**Registry contracts**"
msgstr "**注册表契约**"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:317
msgid "All registries must:"
msgstr "所有注册表必须："
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:319
msgid "inherit from the appropriate ``_BaseRegistry`` subclass;"
msgstr "继承相应 ``_BaseRegistry`` 子类；"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:320
msgid "expose ``register``, ``get``, ``available``, ``register_params_model``, and ``get_params_model``;"
msgstr ""
"暴露 ``register`` 、 ``get`` 、 ``available`` 、 ``register_params_model`` 、 ``get_params_model`` ；"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:322
msgid "keep an independent ``_registry`` dictionary;"
msgstr "保留独立 ``_registry`` 字典；"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:323
msgid "return a list from ``available()``."
msgstr "从 ``available()`` 返回一个列表。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:325
msgid "Class factories additionally provide ``create()``. Callable registries provide their callable-entry accessors."
msgstr "类工厂另提供 ``create()`` 。可调用注册表提供其可调用入口访问器。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:328
msgid "**Orchestrator contracts**"
msgstr "**编排器契约**"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:330
msgid "Every top-level orchestrator must expose the terminal methods declared in ``ORCHESTRATOR_CONTRACT``. Batch processors and workflows normally expose ``run()``; habitat analysis exposes ``fit()`` and ``predict()``."
msgstr ""
"每个顶层编排器须暴露 ``ORCHESTRATOR_CONTRACT`` 声明的终端方法。批处理器与工作流通常暴露 ``run()`` ；生境分析暴露 ``fit()`` 与 ``predict()`` 。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:334
msgid "**Engineering conventions**"
msgstr "**工程惯例**"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:336
msgid "Use ``habit/utils/progress_utils.py`` for all progress bars."
msgstr "所有进度条统一使用 ``habit/utils/progress_utils.py`` 。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:337
msgid "Put reusable cross-subsystem utilities in ``habit/utils/``."
msgstr "可复用跨子系统工具放在 ``habit/utils/`` 。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:338
msgid "Text generated inside plots must be English."
msgstr "图内生成的文字必须为英文。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:339
msgid "Import heavy optional dependencies lazily inside command or factory methods."
msgstr "在命令或工厂方法内部懒加载导入重量级可选依赖。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:340
msgid "Keep business logic out of the command layer: commands are L5 wiring that delegate to ``habit/recipes/``; v0.1 engine logic lives in ``compat/engines/*/run.py``."
msgstr "不要把业务逻辑放进命令层：命令是委托给 ``habit/recipes/`` 的 L5 接线；v0.1 引擎逻辑位于 ``compat/engines/*/run.py`` 。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:343
msgid "Respect the layer direction: L0 kernels stay pure (no I/O, state, or logging) and no layer imports from a layer above it."
msgstr "遵守层方向：L0 kernel 保持纯函数（无 I/O、状态、日志），且不得向上 import。"
#: ../../source/development/architecture.rst:345
msgid "Annotate function inputs and outputs explicitly, and write code comments in English."
msgstr "显式标注函数输入输出，代码注释用英文。"
