msgstr "**两步法与 direct-pooling。** 标记受试者 → 队列分水岭。仅一个内置名。"
#: ../../source/how_to/habitat_components.rst:453
msgid "6. Fit habitats"
msgstr "6. 适合的栖息地"
#: ../../source/how_to/habitat_components.rst:455
msgid "**Required.** Built-in names: ``kmeans``, ``gmm``, and ``consensus``. Learns centroids (cohort-level when ``pool`` is present; per-subject otherwise)."
msgstr ""
"**Required.** 内置名： ``kmeans`` 、 ``gmm`` 、 ``consensus`` 。学习质心（有 ``pool`` 为队列级；否则逐受试者）。"
#: ../../source/how_to/habitat_components.rst:459
msgid "``consensus`` runs the vendored InMoose / Sajovic consensus clustering (**GPL-3.0-or-later**, not Apache-2.0; see ``NOTICE`` and ``habit/third_party/inmoose/LICENSE``) on the pooled items, then stores the mean feature vector of each consensus group as a centroid. It is for supervoxels or subjects, not a voxel-level matrix. Worked figures: :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering`. Parameters: ``n_habitats``, ``min_habitats``, ``max_habitats``, ``n_resamples`` (default 50), ``resample_proportion`` (default 0.5), ``inner`` (``kmeans`` or ``agglomerative``), ``n_init``, ``max_iter``, ``max_items``. ``bestK`` follows the vendored CDF-area rule and is never ``max_habitats`` itself."
msgstr "``consensus`` 运行销售的 InMoose / Sajovic 共识聚类 (**GPL-3.0 或更高版本** ，而非 Apache-2.0；参见 ``NOTICE`` 和 ``habit/third_party/inmoose/LICENSE``) 对合并的条目进行处理，然后将每个共识组的特征向量均值存储为质心。它适用于超级体素或受试者，而非体素级矩阵。已验证的图形： :doc:`/auto_examples/03_clustering/plot_04_consensus_clustering` 。参数： ``n_habitats`` 、 ``min_habitats`` 、 ``max_habitats`` 、 ``n_resamples`` （默认 50）、 ``resample_proportion`` （默认 0.5）、 ``inner`` （ ``kmeans`` 或 ``agglomerative`` ）、 ``n_init`` 、 ``max_iter`` 、 ``max_items`` 。 ``bestK`` 遵循销售的 CDF 面积规则，从不自行成为 ``max_habitats`` 。"
#: ../../source/how_to/habitat_components.rst:471
msgid "Shared parameters of ``kmeans`` and ``gmm``: ``n_habitats``, ``min_habitats``, ``max_habitats``, ``validation``, ``n_init``, ``max_iter``. ``gmm`` also takes ``covariance_type`` (``full`` / ``tied`` / ``diag`` / ``spherical``). ``consensus`` does not take ``validation``; it selects K with the vendored delta(k) rule."
msgstr ""
"``kmeans`` 与 ``gmm`` 共享参数： ``n_habitats`` 、 ``min_habitats`` 、 ``max_habitats`` 、 ``validation`` 、 ``n_init`` 、 ``max_iter`` 。 ``gmm`` 另有 ``covariance_type`` （ ``full`` / ``tied`` / ``diag`` / ``spherical`` ）。 ``consensus`` 无 ``validation`` ；用 vendored delta(k) 规则选 K。"
#: ../../source/how_to/habitat_components.rst:477
msgid "Omit ``n_habitats`` (or pass ``None``) to select K over ``min_habitats..max_habitats`` by ``validation``. There is no string ``\"auto\"``."
msgstr ""
"省略 ``n_habitats`` （或传 ``None`` ）以在 ``min_habitats..max_habitats`` 上由 ``validation`` 选 K。无 ``\"auto\"`` 字符串。"
#: ../../source/how_to/habitat_components.rst:481
msgid "Allowed ``validation`` values:"
msgstr "允许的 ``validation`` 值："
#: ../../source/how_to/habitat_components.rst:483
msgid "**kmeans** — ``elbow`` (default; alias of ``kneedle``), ``kneedle``, ``inertia``, ``silhouette``, ``calinski_harabasz``, ``davies_bouldin``, ``gap``. A list of these casts one vote each. HABIT ``elbow`` / ``kneedle`` is Kneedle on inertia (Satopaa et al., 2011), not the informal literature elbow (Thorndike, 1953) and not the pre-v1.0 discrete-curvature second-difference rule — see :doc:`/user_guide/building_habitat_maps`."
msgstr ""
"**kmeans** — ``elbow`` （默认； ``kneedle`` 别名）、 ``kneedle`` 、 ``inertia`` 、 ``silhouette`` 、 ``calinski_harabasz`` 、 ``davies_bouldin`` 、 ``gap`` 。列表中每项投一票。HABIT ``elbow`` / ``kneedle`` 为 inertia 上 Kneedle（Satopaa 等，2011），非文献非正式 elbow（Thorndike，1953）亦非 pre-v1.0 离散曲率二阶差规则 — 见 :doc:`/user_guide/building_habitat_maps` 。"
#: ../../source/how_to/habitat_components.rst:490
msgid "**gmm** — ``bic`` (default), ``aic``, ``davies_bouldin`` (minimise); ``silhouette``, ``calinski_harabasz``, ``gap`` (maximise); ``bic_elbow`` (Prior 2024 BIC-slope rule)."
msgstr ""
"**gmm** — ``bic`` （默认）、 ``aic`` 、 ``davies_bouldin`` （最小化）； ``silhouette`` 、 ``calinski_harabasz`` 、 ``gap`` （最大化）； ``bic_elbow`` （Prior 2024 BIC 斜率规则）。"
