#: ../../source/how_to/voxel_texture.rst:165
msgid "Texture C+Torch / HABIT CUDA vs PyRadiomics is NumPy vs torch formula order, not a matrix mismatch. HABIT CUDA vs C+Torch sits at machine epsilon because integer count matrices are bit-identical (``tests/kernels/test_*_gpu_parity.py``, 81 cases). First-order is looser (:math:`10^{-8}`) because percentiles use different quantile algorithms. Force the matrix backend with ``use_gpu_matrices: true`` / ``false`` on the ``voxel_radiomics`` Spec."
msgstr "纹理 C+Torch / HABIT CUDA 相对 PyRadiomics 的差异来自 NumPy 与 torch 的公式求值顺序，而非矩阵不匹配。HABIT CUDA 相对 C+Torch 处于机器精度，因为整数计数矩阵按位相同（ ``tests/kernels/test_*_gpu_parity.py`` ，81 例）。一阶更松一些（ :math:`10^{-8}` ），因为百分位数使用不同的分位数算法。可在 ``voxel_radiomics`` Spec 上用 ``use_gpu_matrices: true`` / ``false`` 强制矩阵后端。"
#: ../../source/how_to/voxel_texture.rst:174
msgid "Clinical large-tumor three-way benchmark"
msgstr "临床大肿瘤三方基准"
#: ../../source/how_to/voxel_texture.rst:176
msgid "On small synthetic toys (e.g. 4,096 voxels above), kernel launch overhead and CUDA driver latency dilute the full power of GPU acceleration. In realistic clinical imaging, however, tumors often comprise tens of thousands of voxels. Under these large workloads, the performance bottleneck shifts completely:"
msgstr ""
"在小合成玩具（如上 4,096 体素）上，核 launch 开销与 CUDA 驱动延迟稀释 GPU 加速全力。真实临床成像中肿瘤常含数万体素。大负载下性能瓶颈完全转移："
#: ../../source/how_to/voxel_texture.rst:181
msgid "**Pure PyRadiomics (CPU)**: The single-threaded C extension (``cMatrices``) must iterate voxel-by-voxel across millions of potential neighbor pairs. On large volumes, calculation times skyrocket into several minutes per subject."
msgstr ""
"**纯 PyRadiomics (CPU)** ：单线程 C 扩展（ ``cMatrices`` ）须对数百万潜在邻对逐体素迭代。大体上每受试者需数分钟。"
#: ../../source/how_to/voxel_texture.rst:184
msgid "**C matrices + TorchRadiomics (GPU)**: Offloading feature formulas to PyTorch helps, but the texture matrix construction remains pinned to the single-threaded CPU loop. Furthermore, large matrices must undergo costly host-to-device (H2D) memory transfer."
msgstr ""
"**C matrices + TorchRadiomics (GPU)** ：将特征公式卸载到 PyTorch 有帮助，但纹理矩阵构造仍钉在单线程 CPU 循环。大矩阵还须代价高的主机到设备（H2D）传输。"
#: ../../source/how_to/voxel_texture.rst:188
msgid "**HABIT Built-in GPU**: Both matrix construction (``gpumatrices``) and feature evaluations execute entirely within GPU VRAM with zero host-to-device intermediate copy, yielding dramatic speedups on large clinical lesions."
msgstr "**HABIT 内置 GPU** ：矩阵构建（ ``gpumatrices`` ）与特征计算全程在 GPU 显存中完成，中间无主机到设备的拷贝，因而在大型临床病灶上可获得显著加速。"
#: ../../source/how_to/voxel_texture.rst:192
msgid "The benchmark below evaluates these three runtimes on clinical liver lesion cases from the HABIT demo cohort (hardware: NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 Laptop GPU, ``binWidth=25``, ``kernelRadius=1``):"
msgstr ""
"下面的基准测试评估了这三种运行时在来自 HABIT 演示队列的临床肝脏病变病例上的表现（硬件：NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 笔记本 GPU， ``binWidth=25`` ， ``kernelRadius=1`` ）："
