msgid "**HABIT** turns medical images plus an ROI into tumour **habitat maps**, quantifies them (volume fractions, MSI, ITH, radiomics, and HABIT's own **habitat graph-network features**), and saves a reusable ``.habitatmodel`` so new patients can be labelled without refitting."
