#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:9
msgid "``graph`` is a **built-in** light habitat feature family (registered as ``habitat_feature_extractor`` name ``graph``). Prefer the domain / public API path; the former ``habit.compat.graph_plugin`` shim was removed in v2.0.0."
msgstr ""
"``graph`` 为 **内置** 轻量生境特征族（ ``habitat_feature_extractor`` 名 ``graph`` ）。优先域/公开 API；旧 ``habit.compat.graph_plugin`` shim 于 v2.0.0 移除。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:13
msgid "Numeric definitions live in L0 :mod:`habit.kernels.habitat_graph` and are identical for the domain extractor, the kernel helper :func:`~habit.kernels.extract_graph_features`, and the optional :mod:`habit.viz` graph figures (same node / edge construction). This page matches that source. It does not invent a second theory. The metric family is adapted from PathPrism (Liang et al., *Cancer Cell* 2026), a histopathology tissue-graph method; HABIT applies it to 2-D / 3-D habitat maps with the voxel-index and VOI refinements documented below."
msgstr ""
"数值定义在 L0 :mod:`habit.kernels.habitat_graph` ，对领域提取器、核 helper :func:`~habit.kernels.extract_graph_features` 与可选 :mod:`habit.viz` 图（相同节点/边构造）一致。本页与该源码一致，不另造理论。该指标族改编自 PathPrism（Liang et al., *Cancer Cell* 2026）组织病理 tissue-graph 方法；HABIT 将其用于 2-D / 3-D 生境图并文档化下文体素索引与 VOI 细化。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:23
msgid "Notation and domains"
msgstr "符号与域"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:25
msgid "Let :math:`L:\\Omega\\to\\{0,1,\\ldots,K\\}` be an integer habitat label map on a 2-D or 3-D voxel lattice :math:`\\Omega\\subset\\mathbb{Z}^{d}` with :math:`d\\in\\{2,3\\}`."
msgstr "设 :math:`L:Omega\to{0,1,ldots,K}` 为 2-D 或 3-D 体素格 :math:`Omegasubsetmathbb{Z}^{d}` （ :math:`din{2,3}` ）上的整数生境标签图。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:29
msgid "**Background.** Label :math:`0` is background and is **excluded** from node extraction, graph construction, and the tumour VOI measure :math:`V` below. It is not a graph node."
msgstr ""
"**背景。** 标签 :math:`0` 为背景，在节点提取、图构建及下述肿瘤 VOI 测度 :math:`V` 中 **排除** 。非图节点。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:32
msgid "**Habitat labels.** :math:`\\mathcal{H}=\\{k\\in\\mathbb{Z}:k>0,\\; \\exists\\mathbf{x}\\in\\Omega,\\; L(\\mathbf{x})=k\\}`. When the caller supplies ``expected_labels``, every listed id still emits columns even if it is absent from this map (empty graph → all metrics ``0``), so cohort tables keep a stable schema (same contract as :doc:`ith_score`)."
msgstr "**生境标签。** :math:`\\mathcal{H}=\\{k\\in\\mathbb{Z}:k>0,\\; \\exists\\mathbf{x}\\in\\Omega,\\; L(\\mathbf{x})=k\\}` 。当调用方提供 ``expected_labels`` 时，所列每个 id 即使在本图中缺失仍会输出列（空图 → 全部指标为 ``0`` ），从而使队列表保持稳定 schema（与 :doc:`ith_score` 相同约定）。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:37
msgid "**Coordinates.** Centroids and distances are in **index / voxel units**, not millimetres. Spacing is not applied inside the kernel. The size companions below are physically comparable across subjects only after all label maps have been resampled to the same isotropic spacing. They do not correct a change of acquisition resolution."
msgstr ""
"**坐标。** 质心与距离为 **索引/体素单位** ，非毫米。内核内不应用 spacing。下列尺寸伴生量仅在所有标签图重采样到相同各向同性 spacing 后跨受试者物理可比。不校正采集分辨率变化。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:42
msgid "**Undefined arithmetic.** Empty sequences, zero denominators, non-finite NetworkX outputs, and graphs below a metric's minimum size return ``0.0`` (never NaN in the exported table)."
msgstr ""
"**未定义算术。** 空序列、零分母、非有限 NetworkX 输出，以及低于指标最小尺寸的图表将返回 ``0.0`` （导出表中永远不会是 NaN）。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:46
msgid "Tumour VOI (used only for size-normalized companions):"
msgstr "肿瘤 VOI（仅用于尺寸归一化伴随量）："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:48
msgid "V = \\#\\{\\mathbf{x}\\in\\Omega: L(\\mathbf{x})\\ne 0\\},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\delta_{\\mathrm{bbox}}\n"
"= \\bigl\\|(\\mathbf{u}_{\\max}-\\mathbf{u}_{\\min}+\\mathbf{1})\\bigr\\|_{2}"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:55
msgid "where :math:`\\mathbf{u}_{\\min},\\mathbf{u}_{\\max}` are the inclusive index bounds of non-background voxels. If :math:`V=0`, no ``*_norm`` companions are written."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`mathbf{u}_{min},mathbf{u}_{max}` 为非背景体素的 inclusive 索引界。若 :math:`V=0` ，不写 ``*_norm`` 伴随列。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:60
msgid "Graph construction"
msgstr "图构建"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:63
msgid "Nodes (connected regions)"
msgstr "节点（连通区域）"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:65
msgid "For each habitat :math:`k\\in\\mathcal{H}`:"
msgstr "对每个生境 :math:`kinmathcal{H}` ："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:67
msgid "Build the binary mask :math:`M_k=\\mathbf{1}[L=k]`."
msgstr "构建二值掩膜 :math:`M_k=mathbf{1}[L=k]` 。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:68
msgid "If ``erosion_radius`` :math:`r\\ge 1`, replace :math:`M_k` by :math:`r` iterations of binary erosion with structuring element :math:`S` and ``border_value=0``. Default in :class:`~habit.kernels.HabitatGraphFeatureOptions` is :math:`r=0` (off): adjacency and contact are measured on the habitat labels as drawn. Pass a positive :math:`r` to shrink each habitat before labeling and edges."
msgstr "若 ``erosion_radius`` :math:`rge 1` ，用结构元 :math:`M_k` 对 :math:`r` 做 :math:`S` 次二值腐蚀， ``border_value=0`` 。 :class:`~habit.kernels.HabitatGraphFeatureOptions` 默认 :math:`r=0` （关）：邻接与接触按绘制标签测量。正 :math:`r` 可在标注与连边前收缩各生境。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:75
msgid "Label connected components of the (possibly eroded) mask with ``scipy.ndimage.label`` and structure :math:`S`:"
msgstr "用 ``scipy.ndimage.label`` 与结构 :math:`S` 标记（可能腐蚀后）掩膜的连通分量："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:78
msgid "``connectivity='full'`` (default): diagonal-inclusive 8-neighbourhood in 2-D / 26-neighbourhood in 3-D (``generate_binary_structure(rank=d, connectivity=d)``);"
msgstr ""
"``connectivity='full'`` （默认）：二维中的对角线包含的8邻域 / 三维中的26邻域（ ``generate_binary_structure(rank=d, connectivity=d)`` ）；"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:81
msgid "``connectivity='face'``: 4-neighbourhood in 2-D / 6-neighbourhood in 3-D (``generate_binary_structure(rank=d, connectivity=1)``). Face remains available when 4/6-connectivity is required."
msgstr ""
"``connectivity='face'`` ：2-D 4 邻 / 3-D 6 邻（ ``generate_binary_structure(rank=d, connectivity=1)`` ）。需要 4/6 连通时仍可用 face。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:84
msgid "Drop a component :math:`C` if :math:`|C| <` ``min_region_voxels`` (default ``1``)."
msgstr "若连通分量 :math:`C` 满足 :math:`|C| <` ``min_region_voxels`` （默认 ``1`` ），则丢弃该分量。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:86
msgid "**Default** ``node_method='uniform_grid'`` skips per-component splitting. Instead the whole tumour VOI is painted with a **global** axis-aligned lattice of cubes of edge ``block_size`` :math:`b` (default :math:`b=8` **voxels**, not millimetres) whose origin is the VOI bounding-box minimum. A cube is kept when its occupied fraction exceeds ``block_min_coverage`` (default ``0.2``; cell-level filter). Inside each kept cube, every connected component of every habitat becomes its own node at that subregion's voxel-index centroid, so one cube may contribute several nodes. In-cell fragments smaller than ``min_region_voxels`` are dropped. Pass ``node_method='component'`` for the older rule: if ``subdivide_region_voxels`` :math:`s>0` and :math:`|C|>s`, split :math:`C` into axis-aligned grid blocks of edge :math:`b` (default :math:`s=1000`). A block with voxel set :math:`B` is **kept** only when"
msgstr ""
"**Default** ``node_method='uniform_grid'`` 跳过按分量拆分。整个肿瘤 VOI 涂上边 ``block_size`` :math:`b` （默认 :math:`b=8` **体素** ，非毫米）的 **全局** 轴对齐立方格子，原点为 VOI 包围盒最小值。立方体占用比例超过 ``block_min_coverage`` （默认 ``0.2`` ；格级过滤）时保留。每个保留立方体内，每个生境的每个连通分量在该子区域体素索引质心处成为独立节点，故一立方体可贡献多节点。小于 ``min_region_voxels`` 的格内片段丢弃。 ``node_method='component'`` 为旧规则：若 ``subdivide_region_voxels`` :math:`s>0` 且 :math:`|C|>s` ，将 :math:`C` 拆为边 :math:`b` 的轴对齐网格块（默认 :math:`s=1000` ）。体素集 :math:`B` 的块 **保留** 仅当"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:102
msgid "|B| / b^{d} \\;>\\; \\mathrm{block\\_min\\_coverage}"
msgstr "|B| / b^{d} ;>; mathrm{block_min_coverage}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:106
msgid "(strict inequality; default coverage ``0.2``). Each kept block becomes its own node. If no block passes, or subdivision is off, the whole component is one node."
msgstr "（严格不等式；默认覆盖率 ``0.2`` ）。每个保留的块成为各自的节点。若无块通过，或未开启细分，则整个连通分量作为一个节点。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:110
msgid "Each kept region (component or block) is a node"
msgstr "每个保留的区域（组件或模块）都是一个节点"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:112
msgid "v=(k,\\;\\mathrm{id},\\;\\mathbf{c}_{v},\\;n_{v},\\;\\mathrm{bbox}_{v})"
msgstr "v=(k,;mathrm{id},;mathbf{c}_{v},;n_{v},;mathrm{bbox}_{v})"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:116
msgid "with centroid :math:`\\mathbf{c}_{v}` = mean of the region's voxel **indices** (float), :math:`n_{v}=|B|` or :math:`|C|`, and a half-open bounding box. Node ids are stable strings ``h{k}_c{id}``."
msgstr "质心 :math:`mathbf{c}_{v}` = 区域体素 **索引** 均值（float）， :math:`n_{v}=|B| ` 或 :math:`|C| ` ，及半开包围盒。节点 id 为稳定字符串 ``h{k}_c{id}`` 。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:121
msgid "Edges: centroid distance"
msgstr "边：质心距离"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:123
msgid "``edge_method='centroid_distance'`` (opt-in). Let :math:`\\tau=` ``distance_threshold`` (default ``5.0`` voxel units). An undirected edge exists between distinct nodes :math:`u,v` when"
msgstr ""
"``edge_method='centroid_distance'`` （可选）。设 :math:`\tau=` ``distance_threshold`` （默认 ``5.0`` 体素单位）。不同节点 :math:`u,v` 间存在无向边当"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:127
msgid "d(u,v)=\\|\\mathbf{c}_{u}-\\mathbf{c}_{v}\\|_{2} \\le \\tau"
msgstr "距离约束：$d(u,v)=|mathbf{c}_{u}-mathbf{c}_{v}|_{2} le \tau$"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:131
msgid "Implemented with a KD-tree (``scipy.spatial.cKDTree.query_pairs`` / ``query_ball_point``)."
msgstr ""
"使用 KD 树实现 (``scipy.spatial.cKDTree.query_pairs`` / ``query_ball_point``)。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:134
msgid "**Single-habitat graph** for label :math:`k`: nodes of habitat :math:`k` only; every pair with :math:`d\\le\\tau` is an edge of type ``centroid_distance``."
msgstr "标签 :math:`k` 的 **单生境图** ：仅含生境 :math:`k` 的节点；凡满足 :math:`d\\le\\tau` 的点对形成类型为 ``centroid_distance`` 的边。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:137
msgid "**Pairwise graph** for unordered labels :math:`(a,b)`, :math:`a<b`: **inter** edges between a node of :math:`a` and a node of :math:`b` with :math:`d\\le\\tau`. If ``pairwise_include_intra_edges`` is true (default), **intra** edges are also added within each label under the same :math:`\\tau`. Interface metrics below use **inter-class neighbors only** (isolated ratio, R21/R12, pair degree family); whole-graph metrics (modularity, assortativity, betweenness, components, extended efficiency) use this pair's full two-label graph (inter + optional intra), not an all-habitat union graph. They are not interface-only scores."
msgstr "**成对图** 针对无序标签 :math:`(a,b)` 、 :math:`a<b` ： :math:`a` 节点与 :math:`b` 节点在 :math:`dle\tau` 下的 **inter** 边。若 ``pairwise_include_intra_edges`` 为 true（默认），同 :math:`\tau` 下各标签内也加 **intra** 边。下方界面指标仅用 **类间邻居** （isolated ratio、R21/R12、pair degree 族）；全图指标（modularity、assortativity、betweenness、components、extended efficiency）用该对的完整双标签图（inter + 可选 intra），非全生境并图。它们不是纯界面分数。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:148
msgid "Edge weight ``w`` from ``edge_weight``:"
msgstr "来自 ``w`` 的边权重 ``edge_weight`` ："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:150
msgid "w =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"1 & \\text{if none (default)} \\\\\n"
"d(u,v) & \\text{if distance} \\\\\n"
"1/(d(u,v)+10^{-6}) & \\text{if inverse-distance}\n"
"\\end{cases}"
msgstr "w =\n\\begin{cases}\n1 & \\text{若为 none（默认）} \\\\\nd(u,v) & \\text{若为 distance} \\\\\n1/(d(u,v)+10^{-6}) & \\text{若为 inverse-distance}\n\\end{cases}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:159
msgid "``contact_voxels`` is unused for this method (stored as missing)."
msgstr "此方法不使用 ``contact_voxels`` （存为缺失）。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:162
msgid "Edges: minimum voxel distance"
msgstr "边：最小体素距离"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:164
msgid "``edge_method='min_distance'`` (**default**). Reuses ``distance_threshold`` :math:`\\tau` (default ``5.0`` voxel-index units). With the default 8-voxel cubes, face-adjacent cubes connect (closest voxels are one hop apart). One empty lattice cell between cubes is closest-voxel distance about 8, which is greater than :math:`\\tau=5`, so those stay disconnected. An undirected edge exists between distinct nodes :math:`u,v` when the closest-voxel (set-separation) distance between their voxels satisfies"
msgstr ""
"``edge_method='min_distance'`` （ **默认** ）。复用 ``distance_threshold`` :math:`\tau` （默认 ``5.0`` 体素索引单位）。默认 8 体素立方时，面邻立方相连（最近体素相距一跳）。立方间空一格最近体素距离约 8，大于 :math:`\tau=5` ，故不连。当两节点 :math:`u,v` 体素集分离的最近体素距离满足条件时存在无向边"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:173
msgid "d_{\\min}(u,v)=\\min_{p\\in B_{u},\\,q\\in B_{v}}\\|p-q\\|_{2} \\le \\tau"
msgstr "d_{min}(u,v)=min_{pin B_{u},,qin B_{v}}|p-q|_{2} le \tau"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:177
msgid "This is the minimum pairwise distance between the two voxel sets, **not** the Hausdorff distance (which is a max-of-mins) and **not** centroid distance: two large regions can have nearby boundaries while their centroids are far apart. Implemented with a KD-tree over voxel indices (``scipy.spatial.cKDTree``). Single-habitat and pairwise (inter / optional intra) graphs follow the same structure as ``centroid_distance``. The stored edge ``distance`` is this :math:`d_{\\min}` (so ``avg_edge_distance`` / ``std_edge_distance`` summarize closest-voxel length, not centroid length). Edge weight uses :math:`d_{\\min}` when ``edge_weight`` is ``distance`` or ``inverse_distance``. ``contact_voxels`` is unused (stored as missing)."
msgstr ""
"这是两体素集间的最小 pairwise 距离， **非** Hausdorff 距离（max-of-mins）， **非** 质心距离：两大连通区边界可很近而质心很远。用体素索引 KD 树实现（ ``scipy.spatial.cKDTree`` ）。单生境与 pairwise（inter / 可选 intra）图结构与 ``centroid_distance`` 相同。存储边 ``distance`` 即此 :math:`d_{min}` （故 ``avg_edge_distance`` / ``std_edge_distance`` 概括最近体素长度，非质心长度）。 ``edge_weight`` 为 ``distance`` 或 ``inverse_distance`` 时用 :math:`d_{min}` 。 ``contact_voxels`` 未用（存为缺失）。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:190
msgid "Edges: voxel adjacency (opt-in)"
msgstr "边：体素邻接（可选）"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:192
msgid "``edge_method='adjacency'`` (opt-in). Paint every node onto an integer id array (background and non-requested labels stay ``0``). For each unique neighbour offset in a **half-space** (first non-zero component :math:`=+1`, so each unordered voxel pair is counted once):"
msgstr ""
"``edge_method='adjacency'`` （可选）。将每节点绘制到整数 id 数组（背景与未请求标签保持 ``0`` ）。对 **半空间** 中每个唯一邻接偏移（第一个非零分量 :math:`=+1` ，故每个无序体素对只计一次）："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:197
msgid "``corner`` (default): up to :math:`d` non-zero offsets (8-conn in 2-D, 26-conn in 3-D). In 2-D, ``edge`` and ``corner`` coincide;"
msgstr ""
"``corner`` （默认）：最多 :math:`d` 个非零偏移（2-D 8 连通，3-D 26 连通）。2-D 中 ``edge`` 与 ``corner`` 一致；"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:199
msgid "``edge``: up to two non-zero offsets (8-conn / 18-conn);"
msgstr "``edge`` ：最多两个非零偏移（8 连通 / 18 连通）；"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:200
msgid "``face``: one non-zero offset (4-conn / 6-conn). Face remains available when 4/6-connectivity is required."
msgstr "``face`` ：一个非零偏移量（4-连通 / 6-连通）。在需要4/6连通性时，面保持可用。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:203
msgid "Let :math:`N_{\\mathrm{adj}}(u,v)` be the number of neighbouring voxel pairs whose ids are :math:`(u,v)`. An edge exists iff"
msgstr "令 :math:`N_{\\mathrm{adj}}(u,v)` 为标识为 :math:`(u,v)` 的相邻体素对数。边存在当且仅当"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:206
msgid "N_{\\mathrm{adj}}(u,v) \\ge \\mathrm{adjacency\\_min\\_voxels}"
msgstr "N_{mathrm{adj}}(u,v) ge mathrm{adjacency_min_voxels}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:210
msgid "(default ``10``). An edge exists when two regions are adjacent and the contact (shared-boundary) voxel count is >= 10, measured on the (possibly eroded) masks. Default ``erosion_radius=0`` means the habitat labels as drawn. ``contact_voxels`` :math:`=N_{\\mathrm{adj}}`. Distance on the edge is still the centroid Euclidean distance (used by distance summaries). Weight is ``1`` unless ``edge_weight='contact_voxels'``, in which case :math:`w=N_{\\mathrm{adj}}`. Pairwise intra / inter filtering matches the centroid-distance case."
msgstr "（默认 ``10`` ）。当两个区域相邻且接触（共享边界）体素数 >= 10 时存在边，在（可能已腐蚀的）掩膜上测量。默认 ``erosion_radius=0`` 表示按绘制的生境标签。 ``contact_voxels`` :math:`=N_{\\mathrm{adj}}` 。边上的距离仍是质心欧氏距离（供距离汇总使用）。除非 ``edge_weight='contact_voxels'`` （此时 :math:`w=N_{\\mathrm{adj}}` ），权重为 ``1`` 。成对的 intra / inter 过滤与质心距离情形一致。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:221
msgid "Single-habitat metrics"
msgstr "单生境指标"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:223
msgid "Prefix ``single_h{k}_``. Let :math:`G=(V_G,E_G)` be the undirected NetworkX graph of habitat :math:`k`, with :math:`n=|V_G|` and :math:`m=|E_G|`. Degree :math:`\\deg(v)` is unweighted. Let :math:`G_{\\mathrm{LCC}}` be the largest connected component (by node count), :math:`n_{\\mathrm{LCC}}=|V(G_{\\mathrm{LCC}})|`. Population standard deviation :math:`\\mathrm{sd}` is ``numpy.std`` (``ddof=0``). Empty / undefined cases return :math:`0`."
msgstr "前缀 ``single_h{k}_`` 。设 :math:`G=(V_G,E_G)` 为生境 :math:`k` 的无向 NetworkX 图， :math:`n=|V_G| ` 、 :math:`m=|E_G| ` 。度 :math:`deg(v)` 为非加权。 :math:`G_{mathrm{LCC}}` 为最大连通分量（按节点数）， :math:`n_{mathrm{LCC}}=|V(G_{mathrm{LCC}})|` 。总体标准差 :math:`mathrm{sd}` 为 ``numpy.std`` （ ``ddof=0`` ）。空/未定义返回 :math:`0` 。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:231
msgid "Size and components:"
msgstr "规模与分量："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:233
msgid "\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathrm{n\\_nodes} &= n \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{n\\_edges} &= m \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{edge\\_density} &=\n"
"   \\begin{cases}\n"
"   m\\big/\\binom{n}{2} & n\\ge 2 \\\\\n"
"   0 & n<2\n"
"   \\end{cases} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{connected\\_components} &=\n"
"   \\begin{cases}\n"
"   c(G) & n>0 \\\\\n"
"   0 & n=0\n"
"   \\end{cases} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{connected\\_components\\_ratio} &=\n"
"   \\begin{cases}\n"
"   c(G)/n & n>0 \\\\\n"
"   0 & n=0\n"
"   \\end{cases} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{largest\\_component\\_ratio} &=\n"
"   \\begin{cases}\n"
"   n_{\\mathrm{LCC}}/n & n>0 \\\\\n"
"   0 & n=0\n"
"   \\end{cases}\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"begin{alignedmathrm{n_nodes} &= n \\mathrm{n_edges} &= m \\mathrm{edge_density} &   begin{cases   mbig/binom{n}{2} & nge 2 \\   0 & n<   end{cases} \\mathrm{connected_components} &   begin{cases   c(G) & n>0 \\   0 & n=   end{cases} \\mathrm{connected_components_ratio} &   begin{cases   c(G)/n & n>0 \\   0 & n=   end{cases} \\mathrm{largest_component_ratio} &   begin{cases   n_{mathrm{LCC}}/n & n>0 \\   0 & n=   end{casesend{aligned}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:260
msgid "Degree statistics. Let :math:`\\{\\deg(v)\\}_{v\\in V_G}` be empty when :math:`n=0`. Hop-normalized companions divide by :math:`n-1` (:math:`0` if :math:`n\\le 1`). ``degree_cv`` is :math:`0` if :math:`\\overline{\\deg}<10^{-12}`:"
msgstr "度统计。 :math:`{deg(v)}_{vin V_G}` 时 :math:`n=0` 为空。跳数归一化伴生量除以 :math:`n-1` （ :math:`0` 时为 :math:`nle 1` ）。 :math:`0` 时 ``degree_cv`` 为 :math:`overline{deg}<10^{-12}` ："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:265
msgid "\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathrm{avg\\_degree} &= \\overline{\\deg} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{max\\_degree} &= \\max_v \\deg(v) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{min\\_degree} &= \\min_v \\deg(v) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{avg\\_degree\\_norm} &= \\overline{\\deg}/(n-1) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{max\\_degree\\_norm} &= \\max_v \\deg(v)/(n-1) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{min\\_degree\\_norm} &= \\min_v \\deg(v)/(n-1) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{degree\\_cv} &= \\mathrm{sd}(\\deg)/\\overline{\\deg} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{degree\\_entropy}\n"
"&= -\\sum_{t} p_{t}\\log_{2}(p_{t}+10^{-12}),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"p_{t}=\\#\\{v:\\deg(v)=t\\}/n\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"begin{alignedmathrm{avg_degree} &= overline{deg} \\mathrm{max_degree} &= max_v deg(v) \\mathrm{min_degree} &= min_v deg(v) \\mathrm{avg_degree_norm} &= overline{deg}/(n-1) \\mathrm{max_degree_norm} &= max_v deg(v)/(n-1) \\mathrm{min_degree_norm} &= min_v deg(v)/(n-1) \\mathrm{degree_cv} &= mathrm{sd}(deg)/overline{deg} \\mathrm{degree_entropy&= -sum_{t} p_{t}log_{2}(p_{t}+10^{-12})qquap_{t}=#{v:deg(v)=t}/end{aligned}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:281
msgid "Edge length uses the stored edge ``distance`` :math:`d_e` on **all** edges of :math:`G` (:math:`0` if :math:`m=0`). Default ``min_distance`` stores closest-voxel :math:`d_{\\min}`; ``centroid_distance`` and ``adjacency`` store centroid Euclidean distance. Node size uses voxel counts :math:`\\{n_v\\}`:"
msgstr "边长使用 :math:`d_e` **全部** 边上存储的边 ``distance`` :math:`G` （ :math:`0` 时为 :math:`m=0` ）。默认 ``min_distance`` 存最近体素 :math:`d_{min}` ； ``centroid_distance`` 与 ``adjacency`` 存质心欧氏距离。节点大小用体素计数 :math:`{n_v}` ："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:287
msgid "\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathrm{avg\\_edge\\_distance} &= \\overline{\\{d_e:e\\in E_G\\}} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{std\\_edge\\_distance} &= \\mathrm{sd}(\\{d_e:e\\in E_G\\}) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{avg\\_node\\_voxels} &= \\overline{\\{n_v:v\\in V_G\\}} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{std\\_node\\_voxels} &= \\mathrm{sd}(\\{n_v:v\\in V_G\\}) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{node\\_voxels\\_cv} &= \\mathrm{sd}(\\{n_v\\})/\\overline{\\{n_v\\}}\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"begin{alignedmathrm{avg_edge_distance} &= overline{{d_e:ein E_G}} \\mathrm{std_edge_distance} &= mathrm{sd}({d_e:ein E_G}) \\mathrm{avg_node_voxels} &= overline{{n_v:vin V_G}} \\mathrm{std_node_voxels} &= mathrm{sd}({n_v:vin V_G}) \\mathrm{node_voxels_cv} &= mathrm{sd}({n_v})/overline{{n_v}end{aligned}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:297
msgid "Spatial dispersion is the mean per-axis standard deviation of centroids (:math:`0` if :math:`n<2`):"
msgstr "空间离散度为质心各轴标准差的均值（ :math:`0` 时为 :math:`n<2` ）："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:300
msgid "\\mathrm{spatial\\_dispersion}\n"
"= \\frac{1}{d}\\sum_{\\alpha=1}^{d}\n"
"  \\mathrm{sd}\\bigl(\\{c_{v,\\alpha}\\}_{v\\in V_G}\\bigr)"
msgstr ""
"mathrm{spatial_dispersion= frac{1}{d}sum_{alpha=1}^{d  mathrm{sd}bigl({c_{v,alpha}}_{vin V_G}bigr)"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:306
msgid "Nearest-neighbour ratio (Clark–Evans :math:`R`). Let :math:`d_{\\mathrm{NN}}` be the mean Euclidean distance from each centroid to its nearest **other** centroid (KD-tree, :math:`k=2`). The study-region measure is :math:`A=\\sum_{v}n_{v}` (occupied voxel count, not the centroid bounding box; absolute values are **not** comparable to PathPrism's 2-D bounding-box form). Density :math:`\\rho=n/A`. Returns :math:`0` if :math:`n<2` or :math:`A\\le 0`:"
msgstr "最近邻比值（Clark–Evans :math:`R` ）。令 :math:`d_{\\mathrm{NN}}` 为每个质心到其最近 **另一** 质心的平均欧氏距离（KD-tree， :math:`k=2` ）。研究区域测度取 :math:`A=\\sum_{v}n_{v}` （占据体素数，而非质心包围盒；绝对值 **不可** 与 PathPrism 的二维包围盒形式直接比较）。密度 :math:`\\rho=n/A` 。若 :math:`n<2` 或 :math:`A\\le 0` 则返回 :math:`0` ："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:314
msgid "\\begin{aligned}\n"
"d_{\\mathrm{CSR}} &=\n"
"   \\begin{cases}\n"
"   1\\big/(2\\sqrt{\\rho}) & d=2 \\\\\n"
"   \\Gamma(4/3)\\big/(4\\pi/3)^{1/3}\\,\\rho^{-1/3}\n"
"      = 0.5539602785\\,\\rho^{-1/3} & d=3\n"
"   \\end{cases} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{nearest\\_neighbor\\_ratio}\n"
"&= R = d_{\\mathrm{NN}}/d_{\\mathrm{CSR}}\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"begin{alignedd_{mathrm{CSR}} &   begin{cases   1big/(2sqrt{
ho}) & d=2 \\   Gamma(4/3)big/(4pi/3)^{1/3},
ho^{-1/3      = 0.5539602785,
ho^{-1/3} & d=   end{cases} \\mathrm{nearest_neighbor_ratio&= R = d_{mathrm{NN}}/d_{mathrm{CSR}end{aligned}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:327
msgid ":math:`R<1` clustering, :math:`R=1` CSR, :math:`R>1` regularity."
msgstr ":math:`R<1` 聚类， :math:`R=1` CSR， :math:`R>1` 规则性。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:329
msgid "Average clustering is the Watts–Strogatz [Watts1998]_ mean of local clustering coefficients (:math:`0` if :math:`n=0`; a node with :math:`\\deg(v)<2` contributes :math:`0`):"
msgstr "平均聚类系数为 Watts–Strogatz [Watts1998]_ 局部聚类系数均值（ :math:`0` 时为 :math:`n=0` ； :math:`deg(v)<2` 的节点贡献 :math:`0` ）："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:333
msgid "\\mathrm{avg\\_clustering}\n"
"= \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{v\\in V_G}\n"
"  \\frac{2\\,t_v}{\\deg(v)\\,(\\deg(v)-1)}"
msgstr "mathrm{avg_聚类= frac{1}{n}sum_{vin V_G  frac{2，t_v}{deg（v），（deg（v）-1）}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:339
msgid "where :math:`t_v` is the number of triangles through :math:`v`."
msgstr "其中 :math:`t_v` 为经过 :math:`v` 的三角形数量。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:341
msgid "Path metrics use **hop counts** on :math:`G_{\\mathrm{LCC}}` only, and only when :math:`n_{\\mathrm{LCC}}\\ge 2` (else :math:`0`):"
msgstr ""
"路径指标仅用 :math:`G_{mathrm{LCC}}` 上 **跳数** ，且仅当 :math:`n_{mathrm{LCC}}ge 2` （否则 :math:`0` ）："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:344
msgid "\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathrm{avg\\_path\\_length}\n"
"&= \\frac{1}{n_{\\mathrm{LCC}}(n_{\\mathrm{LCC}}-1)}\n"
"   \\sum_{s\\neq t} d_G(s,t)\n"
"   \\quad\\text{on }G_{\\mathrm{LCC}} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{diameter}\n"
"&= \\max_{s,t} d_G(s,t)\n"
"   \\quad\\text{on }G_{\\mathrm{LCC}} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{avg\\_path\\_length\\_norm}\n"
"&= \\mathrm{avg\\_path\\_length}/(n_{\\mathrm{LCC}}-1) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{diameter\\_norm}\n"
"&= \\mathrm{diameter}/(n_{\\mathrm{LCC}}-1)\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"begin{alignedmathrm{avg_path_length&= frac{1}{n_{mathrm{LCC}}(n_{mathrm{LCC}}-1)   sum_{s\n"
"eq t} d_G(s,t   quad\text{在 }G_{mathrm{LCC}}\text{ 上} \\mathrm{diameter&= max_{s,t} d_G(s,t   quad\text{在 }G_{mathrm{LCC}}\text{ 上} \\mathrm{avg_path_length_norm&= mathrm{avg_path_length}/(n_{mathrm{LCC}}-1) \\mathrm{diameter_norm&= mathrm{diameter}/(n_{mathrm{LCC}}-1end{aligned}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:360
msgid "Centrality on the same LCC (:math:`n_{\\mathrm{LCC}}>1`). Betweenness uses NetworkX ``normalized=True`` (already divided by the undirected maximum :math:`(n_{\\mathrm{LCC}}-1)(n_{\\mathrm{LCC}}-2)/2`). Closeness uses the connected-graph form:"
msgstr "同一 LCC 上的中心性（ :math:`n_{mathrm{LCC}}>1` ）。Betweenness 用 NetworkX ``normalized=True`` （已除以无向最大 :math:`(n_{mathrm{LCC}}-1)(n_{mathrm{LCC}}-2)/2` ）。Closeness 用连通图形式："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:365
msgid "\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathrm{BC}(v)\n"
"&= \\frac{2}{(n_{\\mathrm{LCC}}-1)(n_{\\mathrm{LCC}}-2)}\n"
"   \\sum_{s\\neq v\\neq t}\n"
"   \\frac{\\sigma_{st}(v)}{\\sigma_{st}} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{CC}(v)\n"
"&= (n_{\\mathrm{LCC}}-1)\\Big/\\sum_{u\\neq v} d_G(v,u) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{avg\\_betweenness}\n"
"&= \\overline{\\{\\mathrm{BC}(v):v\\in V(G_{\\mathrm{LCC}})\\}} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{avg\\_closeness}\n"
"&= \\overline{\\{\\mathrm{CC}(v):v\\in V(G_{\\mathrm{LCC}})\\}}\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"图论中心性（公式同英文原文）begin{alignedmathrm{BC}(v&= frac{2}{(n_{mathrm{LCC}}-1)(n_{mathrm{LCC}}-2)   sum_{s\n"
"eq v\n"
"eq t   frac{sigma_{st}(v)}{sigma_{st}} \\mathrm{CC}(v&= (n_{mathrm{LCC}}-1)Big/sum_{u\n"
"eq v} d_G(v,u) \\mathrm{avg_betweenness&= overline{{mathrm{BC}(v):vin V(G_{mathrm{LCC}})}} \\mathrm{avg_closeness&= overline{{mathrm{CC}(v):vin V(G_{mathrm{LCC}})}end{aligned}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:380
msgid "Degree assortativity is Newman's degree–degree Pearson correlation on :math:`G` (unweighted). Non-finite values and exceptions become :math:`0`:"
msgstr "度同配性是 Newman 在 :math:`G` （无权）上的度–度 Pearson 相关。非有限值与异常结果记为 :math:`0` ："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:384
msgid "\\mathrm{degree\\_assortativity}\n"
"= r_{\\deg}(G)"
msgstr "mathrm{degree_assortativity= r_{deg}(G)"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:389
msgid "Modularity uses Louvain communities (``louvain_communities(G, weight='weight', seed=0)``) then Newman–Girvan :math:`Q`. If :math:`m=0`, :math:`Q=0`. Typical range roughly :math:`[-0.5,1]`:"
msgstr "模块度使用 Louvain 社区（ ``louvain_communities(G, weight='weight', seed=0)`` ）再 Newman–Girvan :math:`Q` 。 :math:`m=0` 则 :math:`Q=0` 。典型范围约 :math:`[-0.5,1]` ："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:394
msgid "\\mathrm{modularity}\n"
"= Q\n"
"= \\frac{1}{2W}\\sum_{i,j}\n"
"  \\left(A_{ij}-\\frac{k_i k_j}{2W}\\right)\\delta(c_i,c_j)"
msgstr ""
"mathrm{modularity= = frac{1}{2W}sum_{i,j  left(A_{ij}-frac{k_i k_j}{2W}
ight)delta(c_i,c_j)"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:401
msgid "where :math:`W` is the total edge-weight sum, :math:`k_i` is the weighted degree, and :math:`c_i` is the Louvain community of node :math:`i`. With default ``edge_weight='none'``, every :math:`A_{ij}` is :math:`0` or :math:`1`."
msgstr "其中 :math:`W` 为边权总和， :math:`k_i` 为加权度， :math:`c_i` 为节点 :math:`i` 的 Louvain 社区。默认 ``edge_weight='none'`` 时，每个 :math:`A_{ij}` 为 :math:`0` 或 :math:`1` 。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:407
msgid "Pairwise metrics"
msgstr "成对指标"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:409
msgid "Prefix ``pair_h{a}_h{b}_`` with :math:`a<b`. This graph contains **only** nodes of habitats :math:`a` and :math:`b`. It is **not** a union of all habitats in the map: ``pair_h1_h2_modularity`` does not see H3, and there is no default all-habitat mega-graph. ``single_h{k}_*`` is the one-habitat graph for label :math:`k` only."
msgstr "前缀 ``pair_h{a}_h{b}_`` ，其中 :math:`a<b` 。该图 **仅** 含生境 :math:`a` 与 :math:`b` 的节点。它 **不是** 图中所有生境的并： ``pair_h1_h2_modularity`` 看不到 H3，且默认没有全生境巨型图。 ``single_h{k}_*`` 是仅标签 :math:`k` 的单生境图。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:415
msgid "Let :math:`V_a,V_b` be the node sets of the two labels, :math:`n_1=|V_a|`, :math:`n_2=|V_b|`, :math:`N=n_1+n_2`, and :math:`E_{\\mathrm{inter}}` the inter-class edges only (``edge_type != 'intra'``). Interface metrics below use cross-class neighbors / :math:`E_{\\mathrm{inter}}` only (isolated ratio, R21/R12, ``degree_cv``, ``degree_entropy``, ``degree_skewness``). \"Whole-graph\" below means the **full two-label pair graph** (inter + optional intra inside this pair), not the whole-tumour habitat map. Those pair topology columns (components, modularity, assortativity, betweenness, extended efficiency) are therefore **not** interface-only scores."
msgstr "令 :math:`V_a,V_b` 为两个标签的节点集， :math:`n_1=|V_a|` ， :math:`n_2=|V_b|` ， :math:`N=n_1+n_2` ， :math:`E_{\\mathrm{inter}}` 仅为跨类边（ ``edge_type != 'intra'`` ）。下方界面指标仅使用跨类邻居 / :math:`E_{\\mathrm{inter}}` （孤立比例、R21/R12、 ``degree_cv`` 、 ``degree_entropy`` 、 ``degree_skewness`` ）。下文“全图”指 **完整的双标签配对图** （本配对内的 inter + 可选 intra），而非全肿瘤生境图。因此那些配对拓扑列（连通分量、模块度、同配性、介数、扩展效率） **不是** 仅界面分数。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:426
msgid "\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathrm{n\\_nodes\\_1} &= n_1 \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{n\\_nodes\\_2} &= n_2 \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{n\\_edges} &= |E_{\\mathrm{inter}}| \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{edge\\_density} &=\n"
"   \\begin{cases}\n"
"   |E_{\\mathrm{inter}}|/(n_1 n_2) & n_1 n_2>0 \\\\\n"
"   0 & n_1 n_2=0\n"
"   \\end{cases}\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"begin{alignedmathrm{n_nodes_1} &= n_1 \\mathrm{n_nodes_2} &= n_2 \\mathrm{n_edges} &= |E_{mathrm{inter}}| \\mathrm{edge_density} &   begin{cases   |E_{mathrm{inter}}|/(n_1 n_2) & n_1 n_2>0 \\   0 & n_1 n_2=   end{casesend{aligned}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:439
msgid "Distance summaries use the stored ``distance`` :math:`d_e` on :math:`E_{\\mathrm{inter}}` only (closest-voxel :math:`d_{\\min}` for default ``min_distance``; centroid Euclidean for ``centroid_distance`` / ``adjacency``):"
msgstr ""
"距离摘要仅使用 :math:`d_e` 上存储的 ``distance`` :math:`E_{mathrm{inter}}` （默认 ``min_distance`` 的最近体素 :math:`d_{min}` ； ``centroid_distance`` / ``adjacency`` 为质心欧氏距离）："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:444
msgid "\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathrm{avg\\_edge\\_distance}\n"
"&= \\overline{\\{d_e:e\\in E_{\\mathrm{inter}}\\}} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{std\\_edge\\_distance}\n"
"&= \\mathrm{sd}(\\{d_e:e\\in E_{\\mathrm{inter}}\\})\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"边距离汇总（公式同英文原文）begin{alignedmathrm{avg_edge_distance&= overline{{d_e:ein E_{mathrm{inter}}}} \\mathrm{std_edge_distance&= mathrm{sd}({d_e:ein E_{mathrm{inter}}}end{aligned}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:453
msgid "Contact voxels (adjacency method; :math:`0` unless ``edge_method='adjacency'``). :math:`N_{\\mathrm{adj}}(e)` is the adjacent voxel-**pair** count on edge :math:`e`:"
msgstr "接触体素（adjacency 方法；除非 ``edge_method='adjacency'`` 否则 :math:`0` ）。 :math:`N_{mathrm{adj}}(e)` 为边 :math:`e` 上相邻体素 **对** 计数："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:457
msgid "\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathrm{contact\\_voxels\\_sum}\n"
"&= \\sum_{e\\in E_{\\mathrm{inter}}} N_{\\mathrm{adj}}(e) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{contact\\_voxels\\_mean}\n"
"&= \\overline{\\{N_{\\mathrm{adj}}(e)\\}} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{contact\\_voxels\\_max}\n"
"&= \\max_e N_{\\mathrm{adj}}(e)\n"
"   \\quad\\text{(0 if no inter edges)}\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"begin{alignedmathrm{contact_体素_sum&= sum_{ein E_{mathrm{inter}}} N_{mathrm{adj}}(e) \\mathrm{contact_体素_mean&= overline{{N_{mathrm{adj}}(e)}} \\mathrm{contact_体素_max&= max_e N_{mathrm{adj}}(e   quad\text{(0 if no inter edges)end{aligned}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:469
msgid "Cross degree of :math:`v\\in V_a` counts neighbours in :math:`V_b` only. Isolated ratio, R21 / R12, ``degree_cv``, and ``degree_entropy`` all use this count. Pair ``avg_degree_*`` is not exported: it would duplicate ``avg_h{b}_per_h{a}``. Within-habitat mean degree is ``single_h{k}_avg_degree``."
msgstr ""
":math:`vin V_a` 的交叉度仅统计 :math:`V_b` 中邻居。孤立比、R21 / R12、 ``degree_cv`` 与 ``degree_entropy`` 均用此计数。不导出 pair ``avg_degree_*`` ：会与 ``avg_h{b}_per_h{a}`` 重复。生境内平均度为 ``single_h{k}_avg_degree`` 。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:475
msgid "\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\deg_{\\mathrm{cross}}(v)\n"
"&= \\#\\{u\\sim v:\\text{label}(u)\\neq\\text{label}(v)\\} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{isolated\\_ratio\\_1}\n"
"&= \\#\\{v\\in V_a:\\deg_{\\mathrm{cross}}(v)=0\\}/n_1 \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{isolated\\_ratio\\_2}\n"
"&= \\#\\{v\\in V_b:\\deg_{\\mathrm{cross}}(v)=0\\}/n_2 \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{avg\\_h\\{b\\}\\_per\\_h\\{a\\}}\n"
"&= \\overline{\\deg_{\\mathrm{cross}}}(V_a) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{avg\\_h\\{b\\}\\_per\\_h\\{a\\}\\_norm}\n"
"&= \\overline{\\deg_{\\mathrm{cross}}}(V_a)/n_2 \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{avg\\_h\\{a\\}\\_per\\_h\\{b\\}}\n"
"&= \\overline{\\deg_{\\mathrm{cross}}}(V_b) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{avg\\_h\\{a\\}\\_per\\_h\\{b\\}\\_norm}\n"
"&= \\overline{\\deg_{\\mathrm{cross}}}(V_b)/n_1 \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{degree\\_cv\\_1}\n"
"&= \\mathrm{sd}(\\deg_{\\mathrm{cross}}|_{V_a})/\n"
"   \\overline{\\deg_{\\mathrm{cross}}|_{V_a}} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{degree\\_cv\\_2}\n"
"&= \\mathrm{sd}(\\deg_{\\mathrm{cross}}|_{V_b})/\n"
"   \\overline{\\deg_{\\mathrm{cross}}|_{V_b}} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{degree\\_entropy\\_1}\n"
"&= H(\\{\\deg_{\\mathrm{cross}}(v):v\\in V_a\\}) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{degree\\_entropy\\_2}\n"
"&= H(\\{\\deg_{\\mathrm{cross}}(v):v\\in V_b\\})\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"begin{aligneddeg_{mathrm{cross}}(v&= #{usim v:\text{label}(u)\n"
"eq\text{label}(v)} \\mathrm{isolated_ratio_1&= #{vin V_a:deg_{mathrm{cross}}(v)=0}/n_1 \\mathrm{isolated_ratio_2&= #{vin V_b:deg_{mathrm{cross}}(v)=0}/n_2 \\mathrm{avg_h{b}_per_h{a}&= overline{deg_{mathrm{cross}}}(V_a) \\mathrm{avg_h{b}_per_h{a}_norm&= overline{deg_{mathrm{cross}}}(V_a)/n_2 \\mathrm{avg_h{a}_per_h{b}&= overline{deg_{mathrm{cross}}}(V_b) \\mathrm{avg_h{a}_per_h{b}_norm&= overline{deg_{mathrm{cross}}}(V_b)/n_1 \\mathrm{degree_cv_1&= mathrm{sd}(deg_{mathrm{cross}}|_{V_a})   overline{deg_{mathrm{cross}}|_{V_a}} \\mathrm{degree_cv_2&= mathrm{sd}(deg_{mathrm{cross}}|_{V_b})   overline{deg_{mathrm{cross}}|_{V_b}} \\mathrm{degree_entropy_1&= H({deg_{mathrm{cross}}(v):vin V_a}) \\mathrm{degree_entropy_2&= H({deg_{mathrm{cross}}(v):vin V_b}end{aligned}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:504
msgid "where :math:`H` is the same Shannon entropy as ``degree_entropy`` above."
msgstr "其中 :math:`H` 与上文 ``degree_entropy`` 相同的 Shannon 熵。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:507
msgid "Connected components and modularity use the **full two-label** pair graph :math:`G` (habitats :math:`a` and :math:`b` only):"
msgstr "连通分量与模块度使用 **完整双标签** 对图 :math:`G` （仅生境 :math:`a` 与 :math:`b` ）："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:510
msgid "\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathrm{connected\\_components} &= c(G) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{connected\\_components\\_norm} &= c(G)/N \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{modularity} &= Q(G)\n"
"   \\quad\\text{(same Louvain }Q\\text{ as single-habitat)}\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"begin{alignedmathrm{connected_components} &= c(G) \\mathrm{connected_components_norm} &= c(G)/N \\mathrm{modularity} &= Q(G   quad\text{(same Louvain }Q\text{ as single-habitat)end{aligned}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:519
msgid "Mean betweenness is NetworkX-normalized BC on the **full** graph (intra + inter paths), averaged per class (:math:`0` if :math:`N\\le 1` or :math:`m_{\\mathrm{full}}=0`). It is not an interface-only brokerage score. Habitat-label assortativity is Newman's attribute assortativity on ``habitat_label`` (same definedness gate); it needs intra edges to be non-trivial (an inter-only graph is perfectly disassortative):"
msgstr "平均 betweenness 为 NetworkX 归一化 BC，在 **完整** 图（intra + inter 路径）上按类平均（ :math:`0` 或 :math:`Nle 1` 时为 :math:`m_{mathrm{full}}=0` ）。它不是仅界面的 brokerage 分数。生境标签 assortativity 为 ``habitat_label`` 上 Newman 属性 assortativity（相同可定义性门控）；需要 intra 边非平凡（仅 inter 图完全 disassortative）："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:527
msgid "\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathrm{betweenness\\_mean\\_1}\n"
"&= \\overline{\\{\\mathrm{BC}(v):v\\in V_a\\}} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{betweenness\\_mean\\_2}\n"
"&= \\overline{\\{\\mathrm{BC}(v):v\\in V_b\\}} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{habitat\\_assortativity}\n"
"&= r_{\\mathrm{label}}(G)\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"begin{alignedmathrm{betweenness_mean_1&= overline{{mathrm{BC}(v):vin V_a}} \\mathrm{betweenness_mean_2&= overline{{mathrm{BC}(v):vin V_b}} \\mathrm{生境_assortativity&= r_{mathrm{label}}(Gend{aligned}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:539
msgid "Extended metrics"
msgstr "扩展指标"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:541
msgid "Enabled by ``include_extended_metrics`` (default ``true``; pass ``false`` to omit). Small-world uses the Humphries analytic ER :math:`S` unless ``graph_null_sampler`` is ``config`` or ``rewire``. Let :math:`G^{\\star}` be the **analysis subgraph**: the input graph if it is connected and has edges; otherwise its largest connected component (empty / edgeless graphs stay as they are). Write :math:`n^{\\star}=|V(G^{\\star})|`. Integration metrics below are :math:`0` when :math:`n^{\\star}<2` or :math:`G^{\\star}` has no edges."
msgstr "由 ``include_extended_metrics`` 启用（默认 ``true`` ；传 ``false`` 省略）。小世界用 Humphries 解析 ER :math:`S` ，除非 ``graph_null_sampler`` 为 ``config`` 或 ``rewire`` 。 :math:`G^{star}` 为 **分析子图** ：输入图连通且有边则用输入图；否则用最大连通分量（空/无边图保持原样）。 :math:`n^{star}=|V(G^{star})|` 。 :math:`0` 或 :math:`n^{star}<2` 无边时下列整合指标为 :math:`G^{star}` 。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:550
msgid "Global / local efficiency (Latora–Marchiori [Latora2001]_; hop distances, unweighted):"
msgstr "全局 / 局部效率（Latora–Marchiori [Latora2001]_；跳数距离，无权）："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:552
msgid "\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathrm{global\\_efficiency}\n"
"&= \\frac{1}{n^{\\star}(n^{\\star}-1)}\n"
"   \\sum_{i\\neq j}\\frac{1}{d_{ij}} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{local\\_efficiency}\n"
"&= \\frac{1}{n^{\\star}}\\sum_{v}\n"
"   E_{\\mathrm{glob}}\\bigl(G^{\\star}[N(v)]\\bigr)\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"begin{alignedmathrm{global_efficiency&= frac{1}{n^{star}(n^{star}-1)   sum_{i\n"
"eq j}frac{1}{d_{ij}} \\mathrm{local_efficiency&= frac{1}{n^{star}}sum_{v   E_{mathrm{glob}}bigl(G^{star}[N(v)]bigrend{aligned}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:563
msgid "where :math:`G^{\\star}[N(v)]` is the subgraph induced by the neighbours of :math:`v`, and a node with fewer than two neighbours (or no edges among them) contributes :math:`0`."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`G^{star}[N(v)]` 是由 :math:`v` 的邻居诱导的子图，而邻居少于两个的节点（或它们之间没有边的节点）贡献 :math:`0` 。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:568
msgid "Small-worldness and random-graph nulls"
msgstr "小世界性与随机图零模型"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:570
msgid "Watts and Strogatz [Watts1998]_ called a network small-world when it has lattice-like clustering and random-graph path lengths. Humphries and Gurney [Humphries2006]_ [Humphries2008]_ turned that into one ratio :math:`\\sigma=(C/C_{\\mathrm{rand}})/(L/L_{\\mathrm{rand}})`, with :math:`\\sigma>1` commonly read as small-world. HABIT uses that ratio. :math:`C` is **transitivity** (global clustering, not the mean of local coefficients) and :math:`L` is mean shortest-path length on :math:`G^{\\star}`, matching NetworkX ``sigma``. The exported value is **0** unless :math:`n^{\\star}\\ge` ``extended_min_nodes`` (default ``10``), :math:`G^{\\star}` is connected, and it has at least one edge. This is a **descriptor**, not a hypothesis test."
msgstr "Watts 与 Strogatz [Watts1998]_ 称网络为小世界，当它具有类似晶格的聚类与类似随机图的路径长度。Humphries 与 Gurney [Humphries2006]_ [Humphries2008]_ 将其变为比值 :math:`\\sigma=(C/C_{\\mathrm{rand}})/(L/L_{\\mathrm{rand}})` ，通常将 :math:`\\sigma>1` 解读为小世界。HABIT 使用该比值。 :math:`C` 是 **传递性** （全局聚类，而非局部系数均值）， :math:`L` 是 :math:`G^{\\star}` 上的平均最短路径长度，与 NetworkX ``sigma`` 一致。除非 :math:`n^{\\star}\\ge` ``extended_min_nodes`` （默认 ``10`` ）、 :math:`G^{\\star}` 连通且至少有一条边，导出值为 **0** 。这是 **描述量** ，不是假设检验。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:582
msgid "HABIT writes **one** column ``small_world_sigma``. The three ``graph_null_sampler`` values are mutually exclusive **null models** for :math:`C_{\\mathrm{rand}}` and :math:`L_{\\mathrm{rand}}`. They are not three different observed-graph metrics. Do not treat them as interchangeable, and do not invent a fourth sampler."
msgstr ""
"HABIT 写入 **一** 列 ``small_world_sigma`` 。三个 ``graph_null_sampler`` 值为 :math:`C_{mathrm{rand}}` 与 :math:`L_{mathrm{rand}}` 的互斥 **零模型** 。非三种不同观测图指标。勿当作可互换，勿发明第四种 sampler。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:588
msgid "**analytic (default) — Erdős–Rényi (ER).** Humphries' original null is an ER random graph [ErdosRenyi1959]_ with the same node count :math:`n` and edge count :math:`m`. HABIT uses the analytic approximations in [Humphries2008]_: :math:`C_{\\mathrm{rand}}\\approx\\langle k\\rangle/n` and :math:`L_{\\mathrm{rand}}\\approx\\ln n/\\ln\\langle k\\rangle` (:math:`\\langle k\\rangle=2m/n`). Humphries drew **1000** ER graphs only when testing borderline :math:`1\\le S\\le 3`; the default point estimate does **not** sample graphs. This null does **not** preserve the degree sequence."
msgstr "**analytic（默认）— Erdős–Rényi（ER）。** Humphries 原始零模型是具有相同节点数 :math:`n` 与边数 :math:`m` 的 ER 随机图 [ErdosRenyi1959]_。HABIT 使用 [Humphries2008]_ 中的解析近似： :math:`C_{\\mathrm{rand}}\\approx\\langle k\\rangle/n` 与 :math:`L_{\\mathrm{rand}}\\approx\\ln n/\\ln\\langle k\\rangle` （ :math:`\\langle k\\rangle=2m/n` ）。Humphries 仅在检验边界情形 :math:`1\\le S\\le 3` 时抽取 **1000** 张 ER 图；默认点估计 **并不** 采样图。该零模型 **不** 保度序列。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:599
msgid "**config — configuration model.** Stub-matching random graphs that keep the observed degree sequence [Newman2001]_ [Milo2004]_. :math:`C_{\\mathrm{rand}}` and :math:`L_{\\mathrm{rand}}` are means over ``small_world_nrand`` accepted simple connected graphs (default ``100``). A realization is rejected if pairing fails or the finished graph is disconnected. If the fast sampler cannot fill the ensemble, HABIT falls back to Maslov–Sneppen mixing of the observed graph so ``nrand`` is not silently shrunk."
msgstr "**config — configuration model.** 保持观测度序列的 stub-matching 随机图 [Newman2001]_ [Milo2004]_。 :math:`C_{mathrm{rand}}` 与 :math:`L_{mathrm{rand}}` 为 ``small_world_nrand`` 接受简单连通图均值（默认 ``100`` ）。配对失败或图不连通则拒绝。快速采样无法填满 ensemble 时，HABIT 回退 Maslov–Sneppen 混合观测图， ``nrand`` 不静默缩小。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:609
msgid "**rewire — Maslov–Sneppen.** Start from a copy of the observed graph and apply double-edge swaps (about ``small_world_niter`` swaps per edge, default ``100``) [Maslov2002]_. Every node's degree stays exactly the same; who is connected is mixed. This is what NetworkX ``smallworld.sigma`` / ``random_reference`` implements (NetworkX default ensemble is only ``nrand=10``; HABIT uses ``100``). Rubinov and Sporns [Rubinov2010]_ review the same degree-preserving idea for brain graphs."
msgstr ""
"**rewire — Maslov–Sneppen。** 从观测图副本出发做双边交换（约每条边 ``small_world_niter`` 次交换，默认 ``100`` ）[Maslov2002]_。每个节点度保持不变；连接关系被混合。NetworkX ``smallworld.sigma`` / ``random_reference`` 即此实现（NetworkX 默认 ensemble 仅 ``nrand=10`` ；HABIT 用 ``100`` ）。Rubinov 与 Sporns [Rubinov2010]_ 综述了脑图的同一保度思想。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:619
msgid "Choose the sampler to match the citation, not to \"improve\" :math:`\\sigma`:"
msgstr "选择采样器以匹配引用，而不是为了“改进” :math:`sigma` ："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:621
msgid "Report Humphries *S* as in the 2008 paper → ``analytic``."
msgstr "按 2008 论文报告 Humphries *S* → ``analytic`` 。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:622
msgid "Match NetworkX ``sigma`` → ``rewire``."
msgstr "将 NetworkX ``sigma`` → ``rewire`` 。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:623
msgid "Textbook configuration-model ensemble → ``config``."
msgstr "教科书配置-模型集成 → ``config`` 。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:625
msgid "Never write \"rewire\" in a manuscript if the run used ``analytic`` or ``config``."
msgstr "若运行使用 ``analytic`` 或 ``config`` ，稿件中勿写 \"rewire\"。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:628
msgid "Habitat graphs are **spatial**. None of the three nulls constrain voxel coordinates or contact geometry, so a lattice-like map can inflate :math:`C` relative to any of them. That is a known limit of classical small-world tests on imaging graphs [Rubinov2010]_, not a reason to replace these nulls with an ad-hoc generator."
msgstr ""
"生境图是 **空间** 的。三种 null 均不约束体素坐标或接触几何，故 lattice-like 图相对任一 null 都可能 inflate :math:`C` 。这是成像图上经典小世界检验的已知局限 [Rubinov2010]_，非用随意生成器替换这些 null 的理由。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:635
msgid "Clustering, mean path length, and local/global efficiency use the same unweighted hop distances as NetworkX. An ensemble, when requested, is a stacked adjacency batch (Numba on CPU when installed; otherwise NumPy; one PyTorch CUDA Floyd–Warshall launch when ``graph_null_device='auto'`` and the work is large enough)."
msgstr ""
"聚类、平均路径长度以及局部/全局效率使用与 NetworkX 相同的无权跳数距离。根据请求，集合是堆叠的邻接批次（如果安装了 Numba 则在 CPU 上运行；否则使用 NumPy；当满足 ``graph_null_device='auto'`` 且任务足够大时，使用一次 PyTorch CUDA Floyd–Warshall 启动）。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:641
msgid "A paper that needs a *p*-value for :math:`\\sigma>1` or :math:`\\phi_{\\mathrm{norm}}>1` should call :func:`habit.kernels.compare_graph_to_degree_preserving_null` (typically **100–1000** graphs [VandenHeuvel2011]_)."
msgstr ""
"需要 :math:`sigma>1` 或 :math:`phi_{mathrm{norm}}>1` 的 *p* 值的论文应调用 :func:`habit.kernels.compare_graph_to_degree_preserving_null` （通常 **100–1000** 张图 [VandenHeuvel2011]_）。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:646
msgid "Rich-club [Colizza2006]_ [McAuley2007]_: HABIT stores the mean of the **finite** :math:`\\phi_{\\mathrm{norm}}(k)`. Under the analytic default, :math:`\\phi_{\\mathrm{rand}}(k)` comes from **one** configuration-model graph (NetworkX / Milo point estimate [Milo2004]_). ``config`` / ``rewire`` reuse the sigma ensemble."
msgstr ""
"Rich-club [Colizza2006]_ [McAuley2007]_：HABIT 存储 **有限** :math:`phi_{mathrm{norm}}(k)` 的均值。analytic 默认下 :math:`phi_{mathrm{rand}}(k)` 来自 **一个** 配置模型图（NetworkX / Milo 点估计 [Milo2004]_）。 ``config`` / ``rewire`` 复用 sigma ensemble。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:652
msgid "\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathrm{small\\_world\\_sigma}\n"
"&= \\frac{C/C_{\\mathrm{rand}}}{L/L_{\\mathrm{rand}}} \\\\\n"
"\\phi(k)\n"
"&= \\frac{2 E_{>k}}{n_{>k}(n_{>k}-1)} \\\\\n"
"\\phi_{\\mathrm{norm}}(k)\n"
"&= \\phi(k)/\\phi_{\\mathrm{rand}}(k) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{rich\\_club\\_coefficient}\n"
"&= \\overline{\\{\\phi_{\\mathrm{norm}}(k):\\phi_{\\mathrm{norm}}(k)\\text{ finite}\\}}\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:665
msgid "Betweenness distribution on :math:`G^{\\star}` uses the same NetworkX-normalized :math:`\\mathrm{BC}(v)\\in[0,1]` as above. The ``*_norm`` companions **copy** those values when :math:`n^{\\star}\\ge 3` (betweenness defined); they are **not** divided by :math:`(n^{\\star}-1)(n^{\\star}-2)/2` a second time:"
msgstr ":math:`G^{star}` 上 betweenness 分布与上文相同 NetworkX 归一化 :math:`mathrm{BC}(v)in[0,1]` 。 :math:`n^{star}ge 3` （betweenness 有定义）时 ``*_norm`` 伴生量 **复制** 这些值； **不再** 除以 :math:`(n^{star}-1)(n^{star}-2)/2` ："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:671
msgid "\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathrm{betweenness\\_max}\n"
"&= \\max_v \\mathrm{BC}(v) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{betweenness\\_std}\n"
"&= \\mathrm{sd}(\\{\\mathrm{BC}(v)\\}) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{betweenness\\_max\\_norm}\n"
"&=\n"
"   \\begin{cases}\n"
"   \\mathrm{betweenness\\_max} & n^{\\star}\\ge 3 \\\\\n"
"   0 & n^{\\star}<3\n"
"   \\end{cases} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{betweenness\\_std\\_norm}\n"
"&=\n"
"   \\begin{cases}\n"
"   \\mathrm{betweenness\\_std} & n^{\\star}\\ge 3 \\\\\n"
"   0 & n^{\\star}<3\n"
"   \\end{cases}\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"begin{alignedmathrm{betweenness_max&= max_v mathrm{BC}(v) \\mathrm{betweenness_std&= mathrm{sd}({mathrm{BC}(v)}) \\mathrm{betweenness_max_norm&   begin{cases   mathrm{betweenness_max} & n^{star}ge 3 \\   0 & n^{star}<   end{cases} \\mathrm{betweenness_std_norm&   begin{cases   mathrm{betweenness_std} & n^{star}ge 3 \\   0 & n^{star}<   end{casesend{aligned}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:692
msgid "Degree skewness is the unbiased sample skewness (``scipy.stats.skew(..., bias=False)``) of degrees on :math:`G^{\\star}` (:math:`0` if :math:`n^{\\star}<3`). Pairwise graphs replace the single value by per-class ``degree_skewness_1`` / ``degree_skewness_2`` of **cross-class** degree (same neighbor counts as pair ``avg_h*_per_h*`` / ``degree_cv``):"
msgstr "度偏度为 :math:`G^{star}` 上度数的无偏样本偏度（ ``scipy.stats.skew(..., bias=False)`` ）（ :math:`0` 时为 :math:`n^{star}<3` ）。成对图以各类 ``degree_skewness_1`` / ``degree_skewness_2`` 的 **跨类** 度（与 pair ``avg_h*_per_h*`` / ``degree_cv`` 相同邻居计数）替代单值："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:699
msgid "\\mathrm{degree\\_skewness}\n"
"= g_1\\bigl(\\{\\deg(v):v\\in V(G^{\\star})\\}\\bigr)"
msgstr "mathrm{degree_skewness= g_1bigl（{deg（v）：vin V（G^{star}）}bigr）"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:704
msgid "Per-node local efficiency is :math:`E_{\\mathrm{glob}}` of the neighbour-induced subgraph (same :math:`0` rules as above):"
msgstr ""
"Per-node local efficiency is :math:`E_{mathrm{glob}}` of the neighbour-induced subgraph (same :math:`0` rules as above):"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:707
msgid "\\begin{aligned}\n"
"E_{\\mathrm{loc}}(v)\n"
"&= E_{\\mathrm{glob}}\\bigl(G^{\\star}[N(v)]\\bigr) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{node\\_local\\_efficiency\\_min}\n"
"&= \\min_v E_{\\mathrm{loc}}(v) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{node\\_local\\_efficiency\\_std}\n"
"&= \\mathrm{sd}(\\{E_{\\mathrm{loc}}(v)\\})\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"begin{alignedE_{mathrm{loc}}(v&= E_{mathrm{glob}}bigl(G^{star}[N(v)]bigr) \\mathrm{node_local_efficiency_min&= min_v E_{mathrm{loc}}(v) \\mathrm{node_local_efficiency_std&= mathrm{sd}({E_{mathrm{loc}}(v)}end{aligned}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:718
msgid "Pairwise extended metrics reuse the whole-graph efficiency / small-world / rich-club / betweenness-distribution block on :math:`G^{\\star}`, then add per-class maxima of NetworkX-normalized BC computed on the **full** pairwise graph (normalized by that graph's :math:`N`). The ``*_norm`` companions copy those values when :math:`N\\ge 3`:"
msgstr "成对扩展指标在 :math:`G^{star}` 上复用整图 efficiency / small-world / rich-club / betweenness 分布块，再在 **完整** 成对图上加 NetworkX 归一化 BC 的逐类最大值（按该图 :math:`N` 归一化）。 :math:`Nge 3` 时 ``*_norm`` 伴生值复制上述值："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:725
msgid "\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathrm{betweenness\\_max\\_1}\n"
"&= \\max_{v\\in V_a}\\mathrm{BC}(v) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{betweenness\\_max\\_2}\n"
"&= \\max_{v\\in V_b}\\mathrm{BC}(v) \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{betweenness\\_max\\_1\\_norm}\n"
"&=\n"
"   \\begin{cases}\n"
"   \\mathrm{betweenness\\_max\\_1} & N\\ge 3 \\\\\n"
"   0 & N<3\n"
"   \\end{cases}\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"介数极大值（公式同英文原文）begin{alignedmathrm{betweenness_max_1&= max_{vin V_a}mathrm{BC}(v) \\mathrm{betweenness_max_2&= max_{vin V_b}mathrm{BC}(v) \\mathrm{betweenness_max_1_norm&   begin{cases   mathrm{betweenness_max_1} & Nge 3 \\   0 & N<   end{casesend{aligned}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:741
msgid "VOI-normalized companions"
msgstr "VOI 归一化伴随列"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:743
msgid "After base metrics, size-dependent keys receive extra columns. Original keys are **kept**. Let :math:`V` and :math:`\\delta_{\\mathrm{bbox}}` be as above, and :math:`V_k=\\#\\{\\mathbf{x}:L(\\mathbf{x})=k\\}`."
msgstr "基础指标之后，尺寸相关键获得额外列。原始键 **保留** 。设 :math:`V` 与 :math:`delta_{mathrm{bbox}}` 同上， :math:`V_k=#{mathbf{x}:L(mathbf{x})=k}` 。"
