msgid "``*_norm`` :math:`= x\\big/V^{(d-1)/d}` (whole-VOI interface density)"
msgstr "``*_norm`` :math:`= xbig/V^{(d-1)/d}` (whole-VOI interface density)"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:757
msgid "``*_contact_voxels_mean``, ``*_contact_voxels_max``"
msgstr "``*_contact_voxels_mean`` 、 ``*_contact_voxels_max``"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:758
msgid "``*_norm`` uses each contact edge's local area scale, not global :math:`V`. For edge :math:`e=(i,j)`, let :math:`s_e=\\min(n_i,n_j)^{(d-1)/d}`; the companions are respectively :math:`\\operatorname{mean}_e(c_e/s_e)` and :math:`\\max_e(c_e/s_e)`. They can exceed 1 for thin nodes or diagonal adjacency."
msgstr ""
"``*_norm`` 用各接触边的局部面积尺度，非全局 :math:`V` 。对边 :math:`e=(i,j)` ，设 :math:`s_e=min(n_i,n_j)^{(d-1)/d}` ；伴生列分别为 :math:`operatorname{mean}_e(c_e/s_e)` 与 :math:`max_e(c_e/s_e)` 。薄节点或对角邻接时可超过 1。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:764
msgid "``*_avg_node_voxels``, ``*_std_node_voxels``"
msgstr "``*_avg_node_voxels`` 、 ``*_std_node_voxels``"
