msgstr ""
"``*_per_pair_area_scale`` :math:`= x/(V_a+V_b)^{(d-1)/d}` ；与 ``*_norm`` 不同，该对之外标签不稀释分母"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:786
msgid "``pair_*_n_nodes_1`` / ``_n_nodes_2``"
msgstr "``pair_*_n_nodes_1`` / ``_n_nodes_2`` （成对节点计数）"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:787
msgid "``*_per_habitat_volume`` using :math:`V_a` or :math:`V_b`"
msgstr "``*_per_habitat_volume`` 使用 :math:`V_a` 或 :math:`V_b`"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:789
msgid "Hop-normalized path / degree companions (``*_avg_path_length_norm``, ``*_diameter_norm``, ``*_avg_degree_norm``, …) are **already** scaled by graph size and are **not** divided by :math:`V`."
msgstr ""
"跳数归一化路径/度伴随量（ ``*_avg_path_length_norm`` 、 ``*_diameter_norm`` 、 ``*_avg_degree_norm`` 等） **已** 按图规模缩放， **不再** 除以 :math:`V` 。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:793
msgid "``*_norm`` does not always mean “a nuisance-free feature”. In particular, ``avg_node_voxels_norm`` and ``*_fraction`` express a node's share of the whole VOI or habitat; under the default fixed 8-voxel lattice they still depend on ``block_size`` and ``block_min_coverage``. Similarly, ``*_avg_edge_distance_norm`` is a local edge length relative to the whole ROI extent: with the default fixed 5-voxel distance threshold it may decrease as an otherwise similar tumour becomes larger. Report the raw construction parameters with either companion."
msgstr ""
"``*_norm`` 并不总是意味着“无干扰特性”。尤其是， ``avg_node_voxels_norm`` 和 ``*_fraction`` 表示某节点在整个 VOI 或栖息地中的份额；在默认固定的 8 个体素格点下，它们仍然依赖于 ``block_size`` 和 ``block_min_coverage`` 。同样， ``*_avg_edge_distance_norm`` 是相对于整个 ROI 范围的局部边长：在默认固定的 5 个体素距离阈值下，随着其他条件相似的肿瘤变大，它可能会减小。请报告任何一个伴随项的原始构建参数。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:803
msgid "Null-model comparisons for topology"
msgstr "拓扑的零模型比较"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:805
msgid "Some graph quantities are dimensionless but still vary systematically with node count, edge count, degree sequence, or the statistical behavior of a maximum/minimum. Dividing them by VOI volume is not a valid correction. For a hypothesis about organization **beyond the degree sequence**, compare the observed value against degree-preserving random graphs instead."
msgstr "某些图指标虽无量纲，但仍会随节点数、边数、度序列，或最大值/最小值的统计行为而系统性变化。用 VOI 体积去除它们并不是有效校正。若假设关注的是 **超出度序列之外** 的组织结构，应将观测值与保度随机图对照，而不是做体积归一化。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:811
msgid "This is appropriate for ``avg_clustering``, ``avg_path_length``, ``diameter``, ``global_efficiency``, ``local_efficiency``, ``modularity``, ``degree_assortativity``, raw betweenness maxima/standard deviations, ``node_local_efficiency_min/std``, and pairwise ``habitat_assortativity``. ``degree_entropy`` and degree summaries are fixed by a degree-preserving null and therefore need sample-size-aware estimation rather than this null model. Default ``small_world_sigma`` uses an analytic Erdős–Rényi null [Humphries2008]_. ``rich_club_coefficient`` uses one degree-preserving graph (or the opt-in ensemble). Report ``graph_null_sampler`` and do not treat these as volume-normalized quantities."
msgstr ""
"适用于 ``avg_clustering`` 、 ``avg_path_length`` 、 ``diameter`` 、 ``global_efficiency`` 、 ``local_efficiency`` 、 ``modularity`` 、 ``degree_assortativity`` 、原始 betweenness 最大/标准差、 ``node_local_efficiency_min/std`` 及 pairwise ``habitat_assortativity`` 。 ``degree_entropy`` 与度摘要由保度 null 固定，需考虑样本量的估计而非此 null。默认 ``small_world_sigma`` 用解析 Erdős–Rényi null [Humphries2008]_。 ``rich_club_coefficient`` 用一张保度图（或可选 ensemble）。报告 ``graph_null_sampler`` ，勿将这些当作体积归一化量。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:824
msgid ":func:`habit.kernels.compare_graph_to_degree_preserving_null` is an explicit, opt-in API. It preserves every node's degree, node count, and edge count, but intentionally does **not** preserve connected components, spatial coordinates, edge distances, contact area, or habitat labels. It must not be used to normalize ``contact_voxels_*``, edge-distance, spatial-dispersion, or node-volume features. Check its ``is_valid`` result: a zero Z score for an invalid result is a sentinel, not evidence of no difference."
msgstr ":func:`habit.kernels.compare_graph_to_degree_preserving_null` 是显式、需主动选用的 API。它保留每个节点的度、节点数与边数，但有意 **不** 保留连通分量、空间坐标、边距离、接触面积或生境标签。不得用它归一化 ``contact_voxels_*`` 、边距离、空间离散度或节点体积特征。请检查其 ``is_valid`` 结果：无效结果上的零 Z 分数是哨兵值，并非“无差异”的证据。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:832
msgid "Subject-level extras (always written; independent of ``expected_labels``):"
msgstr "受试者级附加项（始终写入；与 ``expected_labels`` 无关）："
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:835
msgid "\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\mathrm{graph\\_num\\_habitats}\n"
"&= |\\mathcal{H}|\n"
"   \\quad\\text{(labels actually present in this map)} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{graph\\_num\\_nodes\\_total}\n"
"&= \\sum_{k\\in\\mathcal{H}} n^{(k)}\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"begin{alignedmathrm{graph_num_habitats&= |mathcal{H}   quad\text{(labels actually present in this map)} \\mathrm{graph_num_nodes_total&= sum_{kinmathcal{H}} n^{(k)end{aligned}"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:845
msgid "where :math:`n^{(k)}` is ``single_h{k}_n_nodes`` for habitats present in the map."
msgstr "其中 :math:`n^{(k)}` 为图中存在生境的 ``single_h{k}_n_nodes`` 。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:849
msgid "Construction options"
msgstr "构建选项"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:851
msgid "These fields are shared by the YAML ``graph:`` block (:class:`~habit.schemas.workflows.habitat.GraphFeatureBlock`), domain constructor (:class:`~habit.habitat_features.GraphHabitatFeatures`), and kernel options (:class:`~habit.kernels.HabitatGraphFeatureOptions`). Defaults below match the kernel dataclass."
msgstr "这些字段由 YAML ``graph:`` 块（ :class:`~habit.schemas.workflows.habitat.GraphFeatureBlock` ）、domain 构造器（ :class:`~habit.habitat_features.GraphHabitatFeatures` ）与核选项（ :class:`~habit.kernels.HabitatGraphFeatureOptions` ）共享。下列默认与 kernel dataclass 一致。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:861
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:915
msgid "Option"
msgstr "选项"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:862
msgid "Meaning (defaults match source)"
msgstr "含义（默认与源码一致）"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:864
msgid "Within-habitat region graphs (default ``true``)"
msgstr "生境内区域图（默认 ``true`` ）"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:866
msgid "Pairwise inter-habitat graphs (default ``true``)"
msgstr "成对生境间图（默认 ``true`` ）"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:868
msgid "``min_distance`` (default), ``adjacency``, or ``centroid_distance``"
msgstr "``min_distance`` （默认）、 ``adjacency`` 或 ``centroid_distance``"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:870
msgid "Distance threshold in **voxel-index** units (default ``5.0``). Used by ``centroid_distance`` (centroid-to-centroid) and ``min_distance`` (closest-voxel)."
msgstr ""
"距离阈值， **体素索引** 单位（默认 ``5.0`` ）。用于 ``centroid_distance`` （质心到质心）与 ``min_distance`` （最近体素）。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:872
msgid "For ``adjacency``: default ``corner`` (8-conn in 2-D / 26-conn in 3-D); ``edge`` (8/18); ``face`` (4/6) remains available"
msgstr ""
"``adjacency`` ：默认 ``corner`` （2-D 8 / 3-D 26 连通）； ``edge`` （8/18）； ``face`` （4/6）仍可用"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:874
msgid "Minimum adjacent voxel-pair count to create an adjacency edge (default ``10``). An edge exists when two regions are adjacent and the contact voxel count is >= 10."
msgstr "创建邻接边的最小相邻体素对计数（默认 ``10`` ）。两区域相邻且接触体素数 >= 10 时有边。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:876
msgid "``none`` (default), ``distance``, ``inverse_distance``, or ``contact_voxels``"
msgstr ""
"``none`` （默认）、 ``distance`` 、 ``inverse_distance`` 或 ``contact_voxels``"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:878
msgid "Drop connected regions smaller than this (default ``1``)"
msgstr "丢弃小于此值的连通区域（默认 ``1`` ）"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:880
msgid "Connected-component rule: default ``full`` (8-conn in 2-D / 26-conn in 3-D); ``face`` (4/6) remains available"
msgstr "连通分量规则：默认 ``full`` （2-D 8 / 3-D 26）； ``face`` （4/6）仍可用"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:882
msgid "Binary erosion iterations before labeling (default ``0`` / off; set ``>= 1`` to shrink habitats before edges)"
msgstr "标记前二值腐蚀迭代次数（默认 ``0`` / 关；设 ``>= 1`` 在连边前收缩生境）"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:884
msgid "``uniform_grid`` (default: global VOI lattice; one node per in-cell subregion centroid) or ``component``"
msgstr "``uniform_grid`` （默认：全局 VOI 格子；每格亚区质心一节点）或 ``component``"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:886
msgid "In ``component`` mode, split components larger than this (default ``1000``; ``0`` disables)"
msgstr "在 ``component`` 模式下，拆分大于该值的连通分量（默认 ``1000`` ； ``0`` 表示禁用）"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:888
