#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:892
msgid "Add same-habitat proximity edges in that pair's two-label graph (default ``true``). Interface metrics still use inter-class neighbors only. Pair modularity / betweenness / components are this pair's full graph, not an all-habitat union."
