"在该对双标签图中添加同生境邻近边（默认 ``true`` ）。界面指标仍仅用类间邻居。成对 modularity / betweenness / components 为该对完整图，非全生境并图。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:894
msgid "Efficiency, one small-world :math:`\\sigma`, rich-club, node-distribution summaries (default ``true``; set ``false`` to omit)"
