msgstr "计算任一种小世界 sigma 时，分析子图的最少节点数（默认 ``10`` ；更小的图返回 ``0`` ）"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:898
msgid "Ensemble size when ``graph_null_sampler`` is ``config`` or ``rewire`` (default ``100``). Ignored by analytic Humphries *S*."
