#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:937
msgid "What this family does not claim"
msgstr "本特征族不声称的内容"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:939
msgid "Distances are **voxel-index units**, not physical millimetres. ``avg_edge_distance`` follows the edge method: closest-voxel :math:`d_{\\min}` for default ``min_distance``, centroid Euclidean for ``centroid_distance`` / ``adjacency``. Do not interpret it as a millimetre length unless the map is isotropic with 1 mm spacing."
msgstr ""
"距离为 **体素索引单位** ，非物理毫米。 ``avg_edge_distance`` 随边方法：默认 ``min_distance`` 为最近体素 :math:`d_{min}` ， ``centroid_distance`` / ``adjacency`` 为质心欧氏。除非各向同性 1 mm 间距，勿当作毫米长度。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:944
msgid "Small-world :math:`\\sigma` is Humphries' ratio on a possibly tiny habitat graph. The default ``analytic`` sampler is the closed-form ER approximation, not a NetworkX Monte-Carlo draw. ``config`` / ``rewire`` are degree-preserving ensembles. None of these is Watts–Strogatz inference for a brain connectome, and the value is forced to ``0`` below ``extended_min_nodes``."
msgstr "小世界指标 :math:`\\sigma` 是 Humphries 比值，作用在可能很小的生境图上。默认 ``analytic`` 采样器是闭式 ER 近似，而非 NetworkX 蒙特卡洛抽样。 ``config`` / ``rewire`` 为保度 ensemble。这些都不是脑连接组意义上的 Watts–Strogatz 推断；当节点数低于 ``extended_min_nodes`` 时，该值会被强制为 ``0`` 。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:950
msgid "Empty or missing habitats emit **zeros**, not missing values. A cohort mean of a ``single_h3_*`` column therefore mixes true structure with absent-label zeros unless you filter on ``graph_num_habitats`` / presence."
msgstr "空缺或缺失的生境输出 **零** ，而非缺失值。因此对 ``single_h3_*`` 列求队列均值会把真实结构与缺标签零混在一起，除非你按 ``graph_num_habitats`` / 是否存在做过滤。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/graph.rst:953
msgid "Graph features describe the **partition geometry**. They do not identify a biological cell type or prove that a habitat is a clonal region."
msgstr "图特征描述 **划分几何** 。它们不标识生物细胞类型，也不证明生境为克隆区域。"
