#: ../../source/reference/features/msi.rst:2
msgid "MSI Features"
msgstr "MSI 特征"
#: ../../source/reference/features/msi.rst:12
msgid "**Multiregional spatial interaction (MSI)** matrix derived from the habitat label map (intratumor partition map). On the basis of the multiregion map, the MSI matrix characterizes and quantifies **intratumoral spatial heterogeneity** (Wu et al., *Radiology* 2018). For each voxel in the ROI bounding box (padded by one zero-voxel border), face-connected neighbors are probed and the resulting label pair is added to :math:`M`. Surrounding tissue is included as one distinct region (row/column 0 = background). Diagonal elements of :math:`M` represent the connected size of individual subregions, whereas off-diagonal elements relate to the size of borders where different subregions meet. Matrix size is :math:`(K{+}1)\\times(K{+}1)` where *K* = ``n_habitats`` from config (not per-map auto count). First-order features are raw or normalized counts from :math:`M`; four second-order statistical features (``contrast``, ``homogeneity``, ``correlation``, ``energy``) are computed on the normalized matrix :math:`P`."
msgstr "**多区域空间相互作用（MSI）** 矩阵由生境标签图（瘤内分区图）导出。基于多区域图，MSI 矩阵刻画并量化 **瘤内空间异质性** （Wu 等， *Radiology* 2018）。对 ROI 包围盒（外扩一圈零体素边界）内每个体素探测面邻接邻居并将标签对加入 :math:`M` 。周围组织作为独立区域（行/列 0 = 背景）。 :math:`M` 对角元为各子区连通规模，非对角元为不同子区交界规模。矩阵尺寸 :math:`(K{+}1)\times(K{+}1)` ， *K* = 配置 ``n_habitats`` （非每图自动计数）。一阶特征为 :math:`M` 的原始或归一化计数；四个二阶统计特征（ ``contrast`` 、 ``homogeneity`` 、 ``correlation`` 、 ``energy`` ）在归一化矩阵 :math:`P` 上计算。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/msi.rst:30
msgid "HABIT uses 6-connectivity (face-adjacent neighbors only). The loop covers every voxel inside the padded bounding box (including background voxels within the box). For each voxel :math:`\\mathbf{x}` and face-neighbor :math:`\\mathbf{x}'`:"
msgstr "HABIT 使用 6-连通（仅面邻接邻居）。循环覆盖填充包围盒内的每一个体素（包括盒内的背景体素）。对每个体素 :math:`\\mathbf{x}` 及其面邻居 :math:`\\mathbf{x}'` ："
#: ../../source/reference/features/msi.rst:34
msgid "M_{i,j} \\mathrel{+}= 1 \\quad \\text{when } L(\\mathbf{x})=i,\\ L(\\mathbf{x}')=j"
msgstr "M_{i,j} \\mathrel{+}= 1 \\quad \\text{当 } L(\\mathbf{x})=i,\\ L(\\mathbf{x}')=j"
#: ../../source/reference/features/msi.rst:38
msgid ":math:`M` has size :math:`(K{+}1)\\times(K{+}1)` (row/column 0 = background). Normalization:"
msgstr ":math:`M` 尺寸为 :math:`(K{+}1)\times(K{+}1)` （行/列 0 = 背景）。归一化："
#: ../../source/reference/features/msi.rst:40
msgid "D = \\sum_{i \\ge 1} \\sum_{j \\le i} M_{ij}, \\quad P = M / D"
msgstr "D = sum_{i ge 1} sum_{j le i} M_{ij}, quad P = M / D"
#: ../../source/reference/features/msi.rst:44
msgid "Second-order features on :math:`P` (indices :math:`i,j = 0,\\ldots,K`):"
msgstr ":math:`P` 上二阶特征（指标 :math:`i,j = 0,ldots,K` ）："
#: ../../source/reference/features/msi.rst:46
msgid "\\mathrm{contrast} &= \\sum_{i,j} (i-j)^2 P_{ij} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{homogeneity} &= \\sum_{i,j} \\frac{P_{ij}}{1+(i-j)^2} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{energy} &= \\sum_{i,j} P_{ij}^2 \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{correlation} &= \\frac{\\sum_{i,j} i j P_{ij} - \\mu_x \\mu_y}{\\sigma_x \\sigma_y}"
msgstr ""
#: ../../source/reference/features/msi.rst:53
msgid "If :math:`\\sigma_x` or :math:`\\sigma_y` is zero, ``correlation`` is set to ``1.0``. If :math:`D=0` (no countable pairs after excluding background row/column from the denominator), :math:`P` is all zeros and second-order features are zero."
msgstr "若 :math:`\\sigma_x` 或 :math:`\\sigma_y` 为零，则 ``correlation`` 设为 ``1.0`` 。若 :math:`D=0` （从分母排除背景行/列后无可计数的对），则 :math:`P` 全为零，二阶特征亦为零。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/msi.rst:64
#: ../../source/reference/features/traditional.rst:32
#: ../../source/reference/features/whole_each_habitat.rst:33
#: ../../source/reference/features/whole_each_habitat.rst:80
msgid "Column pattern"
msgstr "列模式"
