#: ../../source/reference/features/traditional.rst:40
msgid "Feature definitions"
msgstr "特征定义"
#: ../../source/reference/features/traditional.rst:42
msgid "HABIT extracts first-order, GLCM, GLRLM, GLSZM, GLDM (IBSI NGLDM), NGTDM, and 3-D shape features using the PyRadiomics 3.1 formulas, which follow the Image Biomarker Standardisation Initiative (IBSI; `Zwanenburg et al., Radiology 2020 <https://doi.org/10.1148/radiol.2020191145>`_). Texture aggregation is IBSI **3-D averaged** (mean over the 13 unique 3-D angles), not 3-D merged. The same definitions are used by ``habit radiomics``, ``traditional`` / ``each_habitat`` / ``whole_habitat`` feature types, ``supervoxel_radiomics``, ``voxel_radiomics``, and the native C path."
msgstr ""
"HABIT 用 PyRadiomics 3.1 公式（遵循 IBSI；`Zwanenburg et al., Radiology 2020 <https://doi.org/10.1148/radiol.2020191145>`_）提取一阶、GLCM、GLRLM、GLSZM、GLDM（IBSI NGLDM）、NGTDM 与 3-D 形状特征。纹理聚合为 IBSI **3-D averaged** （13 个唯一 3-D 角度均值），非 3-D merged。 ``habit radiomics`` 、 ``traditional`` / ``each_habitat`` / ``whole_habitat`` 特征类型、 ``supervoxel_radiomics`` 、 ``voxel_radiomics`` 与 native C 路径使用相同定义。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/traditional.rst:53
msgid "PyRadiomics alignment"
msgstr "PyRadiomics 对齐"
#: ../../source/reference/features/traditional.rst:55
msgid "**ROI-level radiomics, voxel-level radiomics, and 3-D shape all match PyRadiomics 3.1** ``FeatureExtractor.execute()`` on the same image, mask, label, and settings (``binWidth``, ``voxelArrayShift``, distances, …)."
msgstr ""
"**ROI 级放射组学、体素级放射组学与 3-D shape 均与 PyRadiomics 3.1** ``FeatureExtractor.execute()`` 在相同图像、掩膜、标签与设置（ ``binWidth`` 、 ``voxelArrayShift`` 、distances 等）上一致。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/traditional.rst:59
msgid "**ROI-level** (``habit radiomics`` / ``traditional``, ``each_habitat``, ``whole_habitat``, ``supervoxel_radiomics`` with default ``union_bin=false``): first-order, GLCM, GLRLM, GLSZM, GLDM, NGTDM. ``traditional`` / ``whole_habitat`` call ``execute()`` directly. ``each_habitat`` and default ``supervoxel_radiomics`` use the native C path with per-label bins; vs ``execute()`` they agree to about ``1e-10`` relative (Energy / TotalEnergy at floating-point ULP)."
msgstr "**ROI 级** （ ``habit radiomics`` / ``traditional`` 、 ``each_habitat`` 、 ``whole_habitat`` 、默认 ``union_bin=false`` 的 ``supervoxel_radiomics`` ）：一阶、GLCM、GLRLM、GLSZM、GLDM、NGTDM。 ``traditional`` / ``whole_habitat`` 直接调用 ``execute()`` 。 ``each_habitat`` 与默认 ``supervoxel_radiomics`` 使用按标签分箱的原生 C 路径；相对 ``execute()`` 约在相对误差 ``1e-10`` 内一致（Energy / TotalEnergy 在浮点 ULP 量级）。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/traditional.rst:67
msgid "**Shape** (ROI only): ``original_shape_*`` from PyRadiomics ``execute()`` / ``computeShape``. Shape is a whole-ROI mesh quantity; there is no per-voxel shape map."
msgstr ""
"**Shape** （仅 ROI）：PyRadiomics ``original_shape_*`` / ``execute()`` 的 ``computeShape`` 。Shape 为整 ROI 网格量；无逐体素 shape 图。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/traditional.rst:71
msgid "**Voxel-level** (``voxel_radiomics``): first-order and texture via ``execute(..., voxelBased=True)``. The CPU path **is** that extractor (pre-crop does not change values). Torch / CUDA uses the same formulas; texture vs CPU sits at about :math:`10^{-15}`, first-order percentiles at about :math:`10^{-8}` (quantile algorithm). Set ``torch_dtype: float64`` for the closest CPU match."
msgstr "**体素级** （ ``voxel_radiomics`` ）：经 ``execute(..., voxelBased=True)`` 计算一阶与纹理。CPU 路径 **就是** 该提取器（预裁剪不改变数值）。Torch / CUDA 使用相同公式；纹理相对 CPU 约在 :math:`10^{-15}` ，一阶百分位数约在 :math:`10^{-8}` （分位数算法差异）。设 ``torch_dtype: float64`` 可最接近 CPU 结果。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/traditional.rst:78
msgid "Gates: ``tests/kernels/test_supervoxel_native_parity.py``, ``tests/kernels/test_ibsi_digital_phantom.py``, ``tests/kernels/test_*_gpu_parity.py``."
msgstr "门禁： ``tests/kernels/test_supervoxel_native_parity.py`` 、 ``tests/kernels/test_ibsi_digital_phantom.py`` 、 ``tests/kernels/test_*_gpu_parity.py`` 。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/traditional.rst:82
msgid "These are **not** PyRadiomics and must not be compared to ``execute()``: ``graph``, ``msi``, ``ith_score``, ``volume``, ``local_entropy``, and supervoxel ``mean`` / ``std`` / ``percentile``."
msgstr "以下 **不是** PyRadiomics，且不得与 ``execute()`` 对照： ``graph`` 、 ``msi`` 、 ``ith_score`` 、 ``volume`` 、 ``local_entropy`` ，以及超体素 ``mean`` / ``std`` / ``percentile`` 。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/traditional.rst:86
msgid "``supervoxel_radiomics`` with ``union_bin=true`` is a different discretization (one shared gray scale on the union mask). ``JointAverage`` / ``Autocorrelation`` / ``HighGrayLevel*`` will not match per-ROI ``execute()``; that is intended, not a formula bug."
msgstr ""
"``supervoxel_radiomics`` 与 ``union_bin=true`` 是不同离散化（union 掩膜上单一共享灰度）。 ``JointAverage`` / ``Autocorrelation`` / ``HighGrayLevel*`` 不会与逐 ROI ``execute()`` 一致；此为预期，非公式 bug。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/traditional.rst:91
msgid "Two conventions must be read with the IBSI manual, not against it:"
msgstr "两种约定须与 IBSI 手册对照阅读，而非与之对立："
#: ../../source/reference/features/traditional.rst:93
msgid "**Kurtosis** is Pearson kurtosis. IBSI reports *excess* kurtosis (Fisher, normal distribution = 0). HABIT / PyRadiomics = IBSI + 3."
msgstr ""
"**Kurtosis** 为 Pearson 峰度。IBSI 报告 *超额* 峰度（Fisher，正态 = 0）。HABIT / PyRadiomics = IBSI + 3。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/traditional.rst:95
msgid "HABIT does **not** extract IBSI families it does not implement: GLDZM, local-intensity peak, intensity-volume histogram, Moran's I, or Geary's C. Deprecated PyRadiomics shape names (Compactness 1/2, Spherical disproportion) are not computed."
msgstr "HABIT **不会** 提取其未实现的 IBSI 族：GLDZM、局部强度峰、强度-体积直方图、Moran's I 或 Geary's C。已弃用的 PyRadiomics 形状名称（Compactness 1/2、Spherical disproportion）也不计算。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/traditional.rst:101
msgid "IBSI-1 Phase 1 digital phantom"
msgstr "IBSI-1 Phase 1 数字体膜"
#: ../../source/reference/features/traditional.rst:103
msgid "The table uses the official IBSI digital phantom (5×4×4 voxels, 2 mm isotropic, 74-voxel ROI; intensities include 1, 3, 4, 6, 9) from `theibsi/data_sets <https://github.com/theibsi/data_sets/tree/master/ibsi_1_digital_phantom>`_ (CC-BY-4.0) and the published **dig. phantom / 3-D averaged** (or **3-D** for GLSZM / NGTDM / NGLDM) reference values in the IBSI reference manual (`Image features <https://ibsi.readthedocs.io/en/latest/03_Image_features.html>`_). Settings match Phase 1: no interpolation, ``binWidth=1``, ``symmetricalGLCM=True``, ``distances=[1]``, NGLDM coarseness :math:`\\alpha=0`, ``voxelArrayShift=0``."
msgstr ""
"表用官方 IBSI 数字体膜（5×4×4 体素，2 mm 各向同性，74 体素 ROI；强度含 1、3、4、6、9）来自 `theibsi/data_sets <https://github.com/theibsi/data_sets/tree/master/ibsi_1_digital_phantom>`_（CC-BY-4.0）及 IBSI 手册 **dig. phantom / 3-D averaged** 参考值（`Image features <https://ibsi.readthedocs.io/en/latest/03_Image_features.html>`_）。设置对齐 Phase 1：无插值， ``binWidth=1`` ， ``symmetricalGLCM=True`` ， ``distances=[1]`` ，NGLDM :math:`alpha=0` ， ``voxelArrayShift=0`` 。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/traditional.rst:113
msgid "``HABIT`` is the native C + CPU-formula value when that family is in the fast path; shape is the PyRadiomics ``execute`` value used by ``traditional_radiomics``. HABIT and PyRadiomics columns match. Remaining gaps versus the published IBSI figures are the Kurtosis convention (above) or the few significant digits in the IBSI manual (for example ``556`` vs ``556.333``). A regression test loads the same NIfTI pair: ``tests/kernels/test_ibsi_digital_phantom.py``."
msgstr "``HABIT`` 是该特征族走快速路径时的原生 C + CPU 公式值；形状特征是 ``traditional_radiomics`` 所用的 PyRadiomics ``execute`` 值。HABIT 与 PyRadiomics 列一致。相对已发表 IBSI 数值的剩余差距来自 Kurtosis 约定（见上）或 IBSI 手册中的有效位数（例如 ``556`` 对 ``556.333`` ）。回归测试加载同一对 NIfTI： ``tests/kernels/test_ibsi_digital_phantom.py`` 。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/traditional.rst:121
msgid "IBSI-1 Phase 1 digital phantom (3-D averaged texture)"
msgstr "IBSI-1 Phase 1 数字体膜（3-D averaged 纹理）"
