#: ../../source/reference/features/whole_each_habitat.rst:110
msgid "The wide ``each_habitat`` table is one row per subject. To argue that habitats are distinct -- the figure a reviewer expects -- melt it and contrast habitats **across the cohort** (paired Cliff's delta + BH-FDR). The same objects also describe one subject (differences without p-values)."
msgstr "宽表 ``each_habitat`` 每名受试者一行。要论证生境彼此有别——审稿人期望的那种图——请将其熔成长表，并在 **整个队列** 上对比各生境（配对 Cliff's delta + BH-FDR）。同一对象也可描述单个受试者（差异但不带 p 值）。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/whole_each_habitat.rst:115
msgid "Tens-to-hundreds of texture features: draw a habitat x feature heatmap and the default **features x pair** Cliff's :math:`\\delta` heatmap (top-k by max :math:`|\\delta|` when the bank is large). Pass ``pair=(a, b)`` for the single-pair lollipop. If that heatmap would be too tall, :func:`~habit.viz.plot_habitat_feature_components` shows the same contrast on a few CVA/PCA component scores (not a 2-D embedding). Violins / bars are for a shortlist, not the full bank. Bars are **one panel per feature** (independent y-axis) so Energy and ``volume_fraction`` are not forced onto one linear scale."
msgstr "数十到数百个纹理特征：可绘制生境 × 特征热图，以及默认的 **特征 × 配对** Cliff's :math:`\\delta` 热图（特征库较大时按最大 :math:`|\\delta|` 取 top-k）。传入 ``pair=(a, b)`` 可得到单配对棒棒糖图。若该热图过高， :func:`~habit.viz.plot_habitat_feature_components` 会在少数 CVA/PCA 成分分数上展示相同对比（不是二维嵌入）。小提琴图/柱状图适合短名单，不适合完整特征库。柱状图为 **每个特征一个面板** （独立 y 轴），因此 Energy 与 ``volume_fraction`` 不会被强制到同一线性尺度。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/whole_each_habitat.rst:125
