msgstr "可运行 gallery（合成占位表；将 ``table`` 换为您的 ``each_habitat`` 提取）::"
#: ../../source/reference/features/whole_each_habitat.rst:152
msgid "``compare_habitat_features(..., subject_id=...)`` restricts the panel first. Pairwise ``p_value`` / ``q_value`` are NaN when only one subject remains."
msgstr ""
"``compare_habitat_features(..., subject_id=...)`` 先限制 panel。仅余一名受试者时 pairwise ``p_value`` / ``q_value`` 为 NaN。"
#: ../../source/reference/features/whole_each_habitat.rst:156
msgid "Runnable gallery (synthetic stand-in table; swap ``table`` for your extract): :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/index`. Graph topology columns (``single_h*`` / ``pair_h*_h*``) can share the joined table but do not melt through this API."
msgstr "可运行 gallery（合成占位表；将 ``table`` 换为你的 extract）： :doc:`/auto_examples/04_quantifying_habitats/index` 。图拓扑列（ ``single_h*`` / ``pair_h*_h*`` ）可共用合并表但不经本 API melt。"
