#: ../../source/troubleshooting/faq.rst:60
msgid "**Why is my habitat map one big block?** Usually the features were clustered across patients without subject-level normalization. MR intensities are arbitrary units, so a patient whose scan is globally darker or brighter than the training patients falls almost entirely into the darkest or brightest centroid. Put subject-level preprocessing before ``pool`` -- for example ``Spec(\"winsorize\", {\"winsor_limits\": [0.05, 0.05]})`` then ``Spec(\"minmax\")`` -- as in :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec`. The reason, and what cohort-level preprocessing does and does not fix, is on :doc:`/tutorial/concepts`. Other causes: too few habitats (``fit`` chose 2), or a very small ROI."
msgstr ""
"**为何我的生境图是一整块？** 通常因在患者间聚类特征而未做受试者级归一化。MR 强度为任意单位，扫描整体比训练更暗/更亮的新患者几乎全落入最暗或最亮质心。在 ``pool`` 前做受试者级预处理——例如 ``Spec(\"winsorize\", {\"winsor_limits\": [0.05, 0.05]})`` 再 ``Spec(\"minmax\")`` ——如 :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 。原因及队列级预处理能/不能修复什么见 :doc:`/tutorial/concepts` 。其他原因：生境过少（ ``fit`` 选 2）或 ROI 很小。"
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/faq.rst:72
msgid "**Why do two runs or two pages give different habitat maps?** Two cases. (1) The same regions with different numbers: clustering numbers its habitats in arbitrary order, so \"habitat 2\" of one fit can be \"habitat 3\" of another. The maps agree after matching the labels (Hungarian prototype matching): :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_02_match_same_subject`, :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_03_match_two_subjects`, or :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_04_match_group`. Two-step and pooled-voxel fits already share one model and do not need matching. (2) Genuinely different regions: the two runs used a different definition (other stages, preprocessing, number of supervoxels, seed) or a different training cohort. Compare the two stage lists and the ``cohort digest`` in ``model.summary()``. With the same spec, seed and training cohort, HABIT gives identical labels voxel by voxel, whatever the backend."
msgstr "**为何两次运行或两页得到不同生境图？** 两种情况。(1) 相同区域、不同编号：聚类按任意顺序编号生境，故一次拟合的「生境 2」可以是另一次的「生境 3」。匈牙利原型匹配后图一致： :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_02_match_same_subject` 、 :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_03_match_two_subjects` 或 :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_04_match_group` 。两步法与池化体素拟合已共享一模型，无需匹配。(2) 真正不同区域：两次运行用了不同定义（其他阶段、预处理、超体素数、种子）或不同训练队列。比较两阶段列表与 ``cohort digest`` 中的 ``model.summary()`` 。相同 spec、种子与训练队列时，HABIT 逐体素给出相同标签，与后端无关。"
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/faq.rst:88
msgid "**Can HABIT analyse a peritumoral region?** Yes, if you supply the peritumoral mask yourself; HABIT has no peritumoral-ring generator. Masks are looked up by name: a :class:`~habit.contracts.Subject` holds ``masks`` (ROI name to mask), and ``subject.mask(roi_name)`` returns one. Save your ring as another ROI folder, for example ``masks/<subject>/peritumoral/<file>``, load it with ``cohort_from_directory(DATA, modalities=MODALITIES, roi=\"peritumoral\")``, and name the same ROI in the extract stage (``Spec(\"raw\", {\"modalities\": [...], \"roi\": \"peritumoral\"})``). Keep the ring and the tumour as separate analyses unless you merge the masks yourself. Loading routes: :doc:`/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/index`."
msgstr "**HABIT 能否分析瘤周区域？** 可以，若自备瘤周掩膜；HABIT 无瘤周环生成器。掩膜按名查找： :class:`~habit.contracts.Subject` 持 ``masks`` （ROI 名到掩膜）， ``subject.mask(roi_name)`` 返回一个。将环存为另一 ROI 文件夹如 ``masks/<subject>/peritumoral/<file>`` ，用 ``cohort_from_directory(DATA, modalities=MODALITIES, roi=\"peritumoral\")`` 加载，extract 阶段同名 ROI（ ``Spec(\"raw\", {\"modalities\": [...], \"roi\": \"peritumoral\"})`` ）。环与瘤分开分析，除非自行合并掩膜。加载路径： :doc:`/auto_examples/06_manipulating_images/index` 。"
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/faq.rst:100
msgid "Support: |link_github_issues| · lichao19870617@163.com"
msgstr "支持： |link_github_issues| · lichao19870617@163.com"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:2
msgid "Concepts"
msgstr "概念"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:4
msgid "**Background.** Habitat analysis has its own small vocabulary. The Guide pages use these words without re-defining them at length, so this page collects them in one place."
msgstr "**背景。** 生境分析有独立的小型术语表。指南页面会使用这些词而不再长篇定义，故本页集中收录。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:8
msgid "**Purpose.** After reading it you should be able to read any stage list (:class:`~habit.spec.HabitatSpec`) and say what each stage does, which statistics are learned from which patients, and what a saved model contains."
msgstr "**目的。** 读完后应能读任意阶段列表（ :class:`~habit.spec.HabitatSpec` ）并说明各阶段做什么、哪些统计从哪些患者学习、保存模型含什么。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:13
msgid "**When to use.** Read it once before :doc:`/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/index`, and come back when a Guide page links a term here."
msgstr "**适用场景。** 在阅读 :doc:`/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/index` 之前先通读一遍，之后若某篇指南链到此处术语再回来查阅。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:17
msgid "Images and regions"
msgstr "图像与区域"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:19
msgid "**Voxel.** One 3-D pixel of an image. HABIT only analyses voxels inside the ROI."
msgstr "**体素。** 图像的三维像素。HABIT 仅分析 ROI 内体素。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:22
msgid "**ROI / mask.** The region of interest, usually the whole tumour, stored as an integer mask on the same grid as the images (0 = background). In the demo the mask is keyed ``LAP``, the series it was drawn on."
msgstr "**ROI / 掩膜。** 感兴趣区，通常为整瘤，与图像同网格的整数掩膜（0 = 背景）。演示中掩膜键为 ``LAP`` ，即勾画所用序列。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:26
msgid "**Modality / series.** One input image of a subject, for example a DCE phase (``pre_contrast``, ``LAP``, ``PVP``, ``delay_3min``). All series of a subject must share one voxel grid with the mask; that is image preprocessing (:doc:`/how_to/preprocess`), which happens before habitat analysis."
msgstr "**模态 / 序列。** 受试者的一幅输入图像，例如一个 DCE 期相（ ``pre_contrast`` 、 ``LAP`` 、 ``PVP`` 、 ``delay_3min`` ）。同一受试者的所有序列必须与掩膜共享同一体素网格；这属于图像预处理（ :doc:`/how_to/preprocess` ），发生在生境分析之前。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:33
msgid "Features, supervoxels, habitats"
msgstr "特征、超体素、生境"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:35
msgid "**Voxel feature.** The numbers that describe one voxel: its intensity in each series (``raw``), or a local texture value computed around it (``voxel_radiomics``). The ``extract`` stage produces one row per ROI voxel and one column per feature."
msgstr ""
"**体素特征。** 描述单个体素的数值：各序列强度（ ``raw`` ），或其周围局部纹理（ ``voxel_radiomics`` ）。 ``extract`` 阶段每个 ROI 体素一行、每个特征一列。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:40
msgid "**Supervoxel.** A small patch of neighbouring voxels with similar features, found inside one subject by the ``partition`` stage (k-means or SLIC). Its feature vector is the mean of its voxels. Clustering tens of supervoxels per subject is faster and less noisy than clustering every voxel."
msgstr ""
"**超体素。** 受试者内由 ``partition`` 阶段（k-means 或 SLIC）划分出的、特征相近的邻近体素小块；其特征向量为所含体素的均值。对每个受试者聚类数十个超体素比聚类每个体素更快、噪声更低。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:46
msgid "**Habitat.** A group of voxels (or supervoxels) whose features are alike. The ``fit`` stage learns the habitat definition (for k-means: the number of habitats and one centroid per habitat); ``assign`` gives every voxel the id of its nearest centroid. The result is a habitat map: every ROI voxel painted with a habitat id 1, 2, 3, ..."
msgstr ""
"**生境。** 特征相似的体素（或超体素）组。 ``fit`` 阶段学习生境定义（k-means：生境数与每生境一质心）； ``assign`` 给每体素最近质心 id。结果为生境图：每 ROI 体素涂生境 id 1、2、3、…"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:52
msgid "**Habitat features.** Numbers computed from a habitat map, one row per patient: volume fractions, MSI (how habitats touch each other), ITH score (how fragmented the tumour is), graph metrics, radiomics per habitat. Definitions: :doc:`/reference/features/index`."
msgstr "**生境特征。** 从生境图计算的数值，每名患者一行：体积分数、MSI（生境如何接触）、ITH 分数（肿瘤碎片化程度）、图指标、逐生境放射组学。定义： :doc:`/reference/features/index` 。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:58
msgid "Subject-level and cohort-level"
msgstr "受试者级与队列级"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:60
msgid "Every step is either **subject-level** (it sees one patient at a time) or **cohort-level** (it sees the pooled rows of all training patients). The ``pool`` stage is the boundary."
msgstr "每一步要么是 **受试者级** （一次只看一名患者），要么是 **队列级** （看到全部训练患者池化行）。 ``pool`` 阶段为分界。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:64
msgid "**Subject-level** stages run before ``pool``: ``extract``, a ``preprocess`` stage placed before ``pool``, and ``partition``. They use only that patient's own data, store no state, and cannot leak information from one patient into another. A new patient goes through them exactly like a training patient."
msgstr "**受试者级** 阶段在 ``pool`` 之前运行： ``extract`` 、置于 ``pool`` 之前的 ``preprocess`` 阶段，以及 ``partition`` 。它们仅使用该患者自身数据、不存储状态，且不会把一名患者的信息泄漏到另一名。新患者经历它们的方式与训练患者完全相同。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:69
msgid "**Cohort-level** stages run after ``pool``: a ``preprocess`` stage placed after ``pool``, and ``fit``. They are learned once on the training patients. Their state (for example bin edges, and the centroids) is saved inside the model and reused **unchanged** on new patients; it is never refitted on a new patient."
msgstr ""
"在 ``pool`` 之后运行 **队列级** 阶段： ``preprocess`` 之后的 ``pool`` 与 ``fit`` 。它们在训练患者上学习一次；其状态（例如分箱边界与质心）保存在模型内，并在新患者上 **原样** 复用，从不在新患者上重新拟合。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:75
msgid "The same component name can sit on either side. Its position in the stage list decides which one it is."
msgstr "同一组件名可在两侧。阶段列表中的位置决定是哪一个。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:79
msgid "Why preprocessing matters"
msgstr "为何预处理重要"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:81
msgid "MR intensities are arbitrary units: two scanners, or two sessions on one scanner, can give the same tissue very different grey values. Clustering raw intensities across patients then groups patients by overall brightness instead of by the pattern inside each tumour."
msgstr "MR 强度为任意单位：两台扫描仪或同机两次会话可对相同组织给出很不同灰度。跨患者聚类原始强度会把患者按整体亮度而非瘤内模式分组。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:86
msgid "The demo shows it. Fit on two patients with raw intensities, and a third patient whose scan is globally darker (ROI median 545 in the arterial phase versus 864 and 976 for the training patients) gets about 85 % of its voxels in the darkest habitat -- one big block. Cohort-level preprocessing alone does not fix this (the largest habitat still covers 52-67 %). Subject-level normalization does: winsorize each feature to the patient's own 5th-95th percentile, then min-max it to 0..1, and the new patient shows all four habitats (fractions 0.09 to 0.40). That is the definition used in :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` and the quickstart."
msgstr ""
"演示说明：两患者 raw 强度拟合，第三患者扫描整体更暗（动脉期 ROI 中位 545 对训练 864 与 976）约 85% 体素在最暗生境 — 一大块。仅队列预处理不能修复（最大生境仍占 52–67%）。受试者级归一化可以：winsorize 至各患者 5–95 分位，再 min-max 到 0..1，新患者显示四生境（分数 0.09–0.40）。即 :doc:`/auto_examples/01_building_habitat_maps/plot_01_two_step_spec` 与 quickstart 所用定义。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:97
msgid "The trade-off: per-subject min-max removes the absolute whole-tumour enhancement level. Habitats then describe the pattern inside each tumour, not how bright the tumour is overall. If absolute level matters for your question, report it as a separate whole-ROI feature."
msgstr "权衡：每受试者 min-max 去掉绝对全瘤增强水平。生境则描述瘤内模式而非瘤整体亮度。若绝对水平对问题重要，作为单独全 ROI 特征报告。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:103
msgid "Three habitat designs"
msgstr "三种生境设计"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:105
msgid "The stage list decides the design (:doc:`/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/index`):"
msgstr "阶段列表决定设计（ :doc:`/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/index` ）："
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:107
msgid "**Two-step** -- ``partition`` then ``pool`` then ``fit``. Supervoxels per patient, one model for the cohort. Habitat ids mean the same thing in every patient. This is the default."
msgstr ""
"**两步法** —— ``partition`` 再 ``pool`` 再 ``fit`` 。每患者超体素，队列一个模型。生境 id 在各患者中含义相同。此为默认。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:110
msgid "**One-step** -- no ``pool``: each patient is clustered on its own. Habitat ids are not comparable across patients; use label-free summaries (ITH score, number of habitats) or match labels first (:doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_02_match_same_subject`)."
msgstr "**一步法** ——无 ``pool`` ：各患者单独聚类。生境 id 不可跨患者比较；使用无标签摘要（ITH 分数、生境数）或先匹配标签（ :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_02_match_same_subject` ）。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:114
msgid "**Direct pooling** -- ``pool`` then ``fit`` with no ``partition``: every voxel of every patient is clustered together. Shared ids, but the matrix grows with every voxel."
msgstr "**直接池化** —— 先 ``pool`` 再 ``fit`` ，无 ``partition`` ：所有患者的所有体素一起聚类。编号共享，但矩阵随每个体素增长。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:119
msgid "Declaring an analysis"
msgstr "声明一项分析"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:121
msgid "**Spec.** A registered component name plus its parameters, for example ``Spec(\"kmeans\", {\"n_supervoxels\": 30})``. It round-trips to YAML and has a fingerprint, so a result can say exactly what produced it."
msgstr ""
"**Spec。** 注册组件名加其参数，例如 ``Spec(\"kmeans\", {\"n_supervoxels\": 30})`` 。可往返 YAML 并有指纹，结果可精确说明由何产生。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:125
msgid "**Stage.** One step of the analysis: ``Stage(\"partition\", Spec(...))``. The first argument is a label you choose; HABIT infers the role (extract, preprocess, partition, pool, fit, assign, quantify) from the component and its position."
msgstr ""
"**阶段。** 分析中的一步： ``Stage(\"partition\", Spec(...))`` 。第一个参数是您选择的标签；HABIT 根据组件及其位置推断角色（extract、preprocess、partition、pool、fit、assign、quantify）。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:130
msgid "**HabitatSpec.** The ordered list of stages plus ``random_seed``: the whole study definition. :class:`~habit.recipes.Study` runs it (``fit_predict`` on a training cohort, ``predict`` on new patients). A YAML file's ``spec:`` block is the same object."
msgstr "**HabitatSpec。** 阶段有序列表加 ``random_seed`` ：整项研究定义。 :class:`~habit.recipes.Study` 运行它（训练队列 ``fit_predict`` ，新患者 ``predict`` ）。YAML 的 ``spec:`` 块是同一对象。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:135
msgid "**.habitatmodel.** The saved habitat definition: centroids, the fitted cohort-level preprocessing state, the full stage list, the defining cohort's fingerprint and software versions. :meth:`HabitatModel.load() <habit.contracts.HabitatModel.load>` reads it back and labels new patients without refitting (:doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict`)."
msgstr "**.habitatmodel.** 已保存的生境定义：质心、拟合的队列级预处理状态、完整阶段列表、定义队列的指纹与软件版本。 :meth:`HabitatModel.load() <habit.contracts.HabitatModel.load>` 读回并为新患者贴标签而不重拟合（ :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict` ）。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:142
msgid "**Methods paragraph.** ``result.manifest.describe_methods()`` drafts a manuscript methods paragraph from what actually ran (:doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict`)."
msgstr "**Methods 段落。** ``result.manifest.describe_methods()`` 根据实际运行起草稿件 methods 段（ :doc:`/auto_examples/05_validation_and_reuse/plot_01_train_save_predict` ）。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:147
msgid "Running a cohort"
msgstr "运行队列"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:149
msgid "**Backend.** What schedules the subjects: serial (one after another in this process) or a pool of worker processes. Changing the backend changes speed, never the habitat labels."
msgstr "**后端。** 如何调度受试者：串行（在本进程中逐个）或工作进程池。更换后端只改变速度，不会改变生境标签。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:153
msgid "**RunPolicy.** The settings of a run: backend, workers, what to do when one subject fails (``on_subject_failure``), per-subject timeout."
msgstr ""
"**RunPolicy。** 一次运行的设置：backend、workers、单受试者失败时行为（ ``on_subject_failure`` ）、单受试者超时。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:156
msgid "**Checkpoint.** Finished subject results written to disk (:class:`~habit.execution.CheckpointStore`), so an interrupted run resumes without recomputing them."
msgstr "**检查点。** 已完成受试者结果写盘（ :class:`~habit.execution.CheckpointStore` ），中断运行可恢复而无需重算。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:160
msgid "Examples: :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends` and :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends`."
msgstr "示例： :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends` 与 :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends` 。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/concepts.rst:166
msgid ":doc:`/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python`, then :doc:`/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/index`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`/auto_quickstart/plot_quickstart_python` ，然后 :doc:`/auto_examples/00_introductory_tutorials/index` 。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/execution.rst:4
msgid "Parallel execution and fault tolerance"
msgstr "并行执行与容错"
#: ../../source/tutorial/execution.rst:6
msgid ":class:`~habit.spec.HabitatSpec` declares **what** to compute. :class:`~habit.spec.RunPolicy` (and an execution backend) declare **how** to schedule subjects. Scientific numbers do not change when you switch serial ↔ process pool if ``random_seed`` is fixed."
msgstr ":class:`~habit.spec.HabitatSpec` 声明 **算什么** 。 :class:`~habit.spec.RunPolicy` （及执行后端）声明 **如何** 调度受试者。若 ``random_seed`` 固定，串行 ↔ 进程池切换不会改变科学数值。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/execution.rst:11
msgid "This page is the integrator chapter. Knob-by-knob reference: :doc:`../api/execution`. Runnable demos: :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends`."
msgstr "本页为集成章。逐旋钮参考： :doc:`../api/execution` 。可运行演示： :doc:`/auto_examples/07_advanced/plot_08_backends` 。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/execution.rst:15
msgid "Beginners can ignore this page until a cohort is slow or one subject crashes the run. The quickstarts use a small process pool already (``workers=2``)."
msgstr "初学者可在队列变慢或单受试者导致运行崩溃前忽略本页。快速开始已用小进程池（ ``workers=2`` ）。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/execution.rst:20
msgid "Pick a backend"
msgstr "选择后端"
#: ../../source/tutorial/execution.rst:22
msgid ":func:`~habit.execution.backend_from_policy` chooses:"
msgstr ":func:`~habit.execution.backend_from_policy` 选择："
#: ../../source/tutorial/execution.rst:24
msgid ":class:`~habit.execution.ProcessPoolBackend` when ``policy.backend == \"process\"``, **or** ``workers > 1``, **or** ``parallel_mode == \"isolated\"``"
msgstr ""
"``policy.backend == \"process\"`` **或** ``workers > 1`` **或** ``parallel_mode == \"isolated\"`` 时用 :class:`~habit.execution.ProcessPoolBackend`"
#: ../../source/tutorial/execution.rst:27
msgid ":class:`~habit.execution.SerialBackend` otherwise"
msgstr "否则 :class:`~habit.execution.SerialBackend`"
#: ../../source/tutorial/execution.rst:29
msgid "A positive ``subject_timeout_sec`` alone does **not** force spawn (the default is ``900.0``). Timeout isolation still needs ``backend=\"process\"`` or ``parallel_mode=\"isolated\"``."
msgstr "仅设置正的 ``subject_timeout_sec`` **并不会** 强制 spawn（默认为 ``900.0`` ）。超时隔离仍需 ``backend=\"process\"`` 或 ``parallel_mode=\"isolated\"`` 。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/execution.rst:39
msgid "Debug one subject / notebook"
msgstr "调试单受试者 / notebook"
#: ../../source/tutorial/execution.rst:40
msgid "``RunPolicy(workers=1, backend=\"serial\")``"
msgstr "``RunPolicy(workers=1, backend=\"serial\")``"
#: ../../source/tutorial/execution.rst:41
msgid "Cohort, default isolation"
msgstr "队列，默认隔离"
#: ../../source/tutorial/execution.rst:42
msgid "``RunPolicy(workers=2, backend=\"process\", subject_timeout_sec=900.0)``"
msgstr ""
"``RunPolicy(workers=2, backend=\"process\", subject_timeout_sec=900.0)``"
#: ../../source/tutorial/execution.rst:43
msgid "Fresh process per subject"
msgstr "每受试者新进程"
#: ../../source/tutorial/execution.rst:44
msgid "same, plus ``parallel_mode=\"isolated\"`` (higher spawn cost)"
msgstr "同上，另加 ``parallel_mode=\"isolated\"`` （更高 spawn 成本）"
#: ../../source/tutorial/execution.rst:48
msgid "Pass the backend into a recipe or into :meth:`~habit.contracts.Cohort.map`::"
msgstr "将 backend 传入 recipe 或 :meth:`~habit.contracts.Cohort.map`::"
#: ../../source/tutorial/execution.rst:74
msgid "Atomic path (no ``Study``): extract texture, preprocess, fit in this process, then ``backend.map`` the assigner on units already in memory. Subject versus cohort preprocessing of that texture, and the equivalent ``HabitatSpec``, is :doc:`/auto_examples/02_features/plot_02_texture_feature_maps`. Serial versus pooled runs of one study, with timings, are on the first gallery page."
msgstr ""
"原子路径（无 ``Study`` ）：本进程 extract 纹理、预处理、拟合，再 ``backend.map`` assigner 于已在内存的单元。该纹理的受试者 vs 队列预处理及等价 ``HabitatSpec`` 见 :doc:`/auto_examples/02_features/plot_02_texture_feature_maps` 。同一 study 串行 vs 池化及时序见首 gallery 页。"
#: ../../source/tutorial/execution.rst:86
msgid "Failure policy"
