msgid ":meth:`~habit.contracts.Cohort.map` still raises :class:`~habit.exceptions.ProcessingError` when any slot failed, **even if** the backend used ``continue``. Recipes / CLI pass ``raise_on_failure=False`` so a partial cohort can finish. Calling ``backend.map`` directly leaves the exception on ``slot.error``."
